var e={selector:{label:`Dooro luuqadda`},verdict:{headline:`Alberta waxay dib u sawiraysaa khariidaddeeda doorashada.`,p_what:`Mar mar gobolku wuxuu dib u sawiraa riding-yadiisa — aagagga maxalliga ah ee mid kastaa doorto hal MLA. Halka khadadku ku dhacaan ayaa go'aamiya cidda aad la codeyso, iyo cidda kaaga matala golaha sharci dejinta.`,p_split:`Markan, guddida dib-u-sawirka samaynaysay way kala qaybsantay. Waxay soo saartay laba khariidadood oo iska tartamaya — hubintaniyuna labadaba way tijaabinaysaa.`,p_question:`Labada khariidadood waxaynu u tijaabinnay hal su'aal: mid kasta ma loo qaabeeyey si xisbi loo doorbido — xitaa haddii aanay qofna ula jeedin inuu sidaas sameeyo?`,p_answer:`Labada midkood waa sidaas. Kan kale wuxuu u eg yahay mid caadi ah.`,p_howfar:`Kombuyuutar ayaa si bakhtiyaanasiib ah u sawiray 1.01 milyan oo nooc oo sharci ah oo khariidadda ah. Labada khariidadood ee dhabta ah midkood ayaa hal dhinac uga janjeedha dhammaantood marka laga reebo qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000, xagga UCP. Tan kale waxay ku jirtaa xadka caadiga ah.`,aside_pre:`Waxaad odhan kartaa khariidad sidaas u eg `,aside_post:`. Ereygaasi macno sharci ma laha Kanada, sidaa darteed uma isticmaalno sidii gunaanad. Waxaynu ku tusaynaa waxa khariidaddu sameyso; adiga ayaa xukma. Lakabyada qoto dheer — waxa sharcigu dhab ahaan rabo, iyo si sax ah sida aan tijaabada u sameynay — eeg `,box_heading:`Waxa aan dhihi karno iyo waxa aan dhihi karin`,box_can_1:`Khariidadda inta yar waxay ka baxsan tahay waxa 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah soo saaraan, jihada UCP loo doorbidayo.`,box_can_2:`Afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda xisbiyeed oo dhammu waxay tilmaamayaan isla jihada.`,box_cant_1:`In mid ka mid ah la-taliyayaasha uu tan ula jeeday — hubintu waxay akhridaa natiijooyinka, ma aha niyadda.`,box_cant_2:`In khariidaddu "tahay" qaybsi siyaasadeed — taasi maaha qayb uu sharciga Kanada aqoonsado.`,box_cant_3:`Sida maxkamadi u xukumi lahayd, ama waxa guddiga MLA-yadu dooran doono.`,law_link:`Sharci`,methods_link:`Hababka`},why_redrawn:{heading:`Sababta tani u dhacdo — iyo sababta ay kuu taabato`,p1:`Alberta waxa loo qaybiyey 87 riding. Mid kastaa wuxuu doortaa hal MLA oo aada golaha sharci dejinta. Riding-kaagu wuxuu go'aamiyaa cidda qofkaasi yahay, xaafadaha lagugu daro, iyo cidda welwelkooda MLA-gaagu marka hore maqlo.`,p2:`Khadadku meel go'an kuma sii jiraan. Markii ay dadku guuraan oo magaalooyinku koraan, riding-yada qaarkood waxay ku dhammaadaan codbixiyayaal aad uga badan kuwa kale, sidaa darteed gobolku wuxuu khariidadda dib u sawiraa dhowr sano kasta si ay u ahaadaan kuwo qiyaas ahaan isku dhow. Guddi la-taliyeyaal ah ayaa sawira, iyagoo ka shaqeeya xeerar sharcigu dejiyay: degmooyinku waa inay tirada dadka isugu dhow yihiin, ay ahaadaan hal cad oo aan kala go'nayn, oo ay bulshooyinka dhabta ah isku hayaan meesha ay awoodaan.`,p3:`Kaasi waa habraaca caadiga ah. Markan wuu jabay. Xubnaha guddidu ma heshiin karin, waxayna u kala qaybsameen laba kooxood, mid kastaa wuxuu lahaa khariidaddiisa. Markaas Golaha Sharci-dejintu labadaba khariidadood dhinac ayuu iska dhigay oo shaqada u wareejiyay guddi MLA-yo ah, kaas oo kormeeray guddi talo-bixineed oo sawiray khariidad cusub oo ka sii weyn. In khariidadaha guddi sidaas dhinac loo iska dhigo waa wax naadir ah.`,p4:`Khad ku yaal khariidad wuxuu go'aamiyaa cidda codkeedu wax u taro. Wuxuu codbixiyayaasha bulsho wadajir u hayn karaa, ama ku kala firdhin karaa dhowr degmo halka tiradoodu aanay wax badan ku darin. Wuxuu tartan qaar dhow ka dhigi karaa qaar kalena ka fogeyn karaa gacanta. Midna kuma muuqato dusha sare; waxa go'aamiya halka xudduuduhu ku dhacaan.`},two_maps:{heading:`Laba khariidadood — iyo cidda sawiratay`,p1:`Markii guddidu kala qaybsantay, ma aysan soo saarin hal khariidad oo lagu lifaaqay diidmo. Waxay soo saartay laba khariidadood oo dhammaystiran oo iska tartamaya. Labaduba waa sharci. Kaliya waxay khadadka si kala duwan u sawiraan.`,p2:`Guddida xudduuduhu wuxuu leeyahay shan xubnood. Golaha Wasiirradu wuxuu magacaabaa guddoomiyaha — kursiga dhexdhexaadka ah, oo halkan uu hayo Garsoore Dallas K. Miller, garsoore supernumerary ah oo ka tirsan Court of King's Bench. Xisbiga xukunka hayaa wuxuu magacaabaa laba xubnood; mucaaridkuna wuxuu magacaabaa laba.`,p3:`Guddidan waxay u kala qaybsantay saddex iyo laba. Guddoomiyaha iyo labada xubnood ee mucaaridku magacaabay ayaa taageeray hal khariidad — warbixinta inta badan, maxaa yeelay inta badan guddidu way saxiixday. Labada xubnood ee dawladdu magacaabay ayaa taageeray kan kale — warbixinta inta yar.`,p4:`Khariidadda hubintu calaamadeyso inay tahay tan ugu sii jihaysan waa warbixinta inta yar — tan ay sawireen labada xubnood ee dawladdu magacaabay. Hubintu ma muujin karto inay sidaas ula jeedeen, mana isku daydo. Waxay muujisaa waxa khariidaddu sameyso.`,p5:`Khariidadda jaldiga ee bogga sare waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad adiga is barbar dhigto. Iska beddel labada soo jeedin iyo khariidadda maanta, hel riding-kaaga, oo daawo xaafadaha la isugu daro ama la kala qaybiyo.`,p6:`Golaha Sharci-dejinta ayaa tan iyo markaas labada khariidadood dhinac iska dhigay. Guddi talo-bixineed oo uu kormeeray guddi MLA-yo ah ayaa sawiray khariidad 91-kursi ah, taas oo Golaha loo diray 2 Noofembar 2026 — tallaabo uu bogganu ku eegayo bogga Sharciga. Labadan waxay sii ahaanayaan kiiska tijaabada ee ugu cad ee hubinta, khariidadda guddida talo-bixintana waxa lagu hubiyay bogga ugu weyn.`},disclaimer:{text:`AI ayaa turjumay boggan. Qaar ka mid ah ayaa weli ku soo bixi kara Ingiriisi inta turjumaadduhu socdaan. Haddii aad aragto khalad ama aad jeclaan lahayd inaad ka caawiso turjumaadda mashruucan, fadlan %s.`,link_label:`nala soo xidhiidh`,word_count:`Si aad u qiyaasto cabbirka: qoraalka Ingiriisiga ahi waa qiyaastii {count} eray. Waad qaadan kartaa dhammaantii ama qayb keliya. Inta badan shaqadu waa saxidda khaladaad yaryar oo mashiinku sameeyay, ma aha turjumaad eber laga bilaabo.`},epigraph:{heading:`Sida loo akhriyo khariidaddan`,reader:`Dhulku ma codeeyo. Midabaynta khariidadda sidan oo kale waxay kaliya ka dhigaysaa Alberta miyiga inay u muuqato mid ka weyn inta ay dhab ahaantii tahay. Dhulka madhan ka tag isagoo madhan.`,reader_label:`akhriste`,author_p1:`Waa run — taasina waa si sax ah waxa khariidaddu sameyso. Waxaa laga dhisay joomatari iyo tirooyin ay Elections Alberta iyadu leedahay, oo ah heerka kaliya ee ay hayaan: imisa qof ayaa ka codeeyay aag kasta oo codbixin, iyo sida ay u codeeyeen. Midabku wuxuu ku socdaa heer u dhexeeya labada xisbi, qoto-dheeridiisuna waxay raacaysaa tirada dadka — taasina waa sababta magaalooyinku u dhalaalaan, miyiga furanna u ahaado mid midab khafiif ah.`,author_p2:`Dhulka galbeed ka xiga Ponoka waa caddaan saafi ah: ma jiro xarun codbixin, ma jiro qof la diiwaangeliyay inuu halkaas ku noolyahay ama ka codeeyay. Wuxuu u madhan yahay si sax ah sababta oo ah dhulku ma codeeyo. Ujeeddadu ma aha in la fasiro xogta, ee kaliya in loo daayo inay ku hadasho heerka lagu duubay — iyo in lagaaga tago mid wax yar ka caqli badan intii aad u timid.`,author_label:`qoraaga`,ethic:`Taasi waa ballanqaadka ka dambeeya hubinta oo dhan: khariidee nidaamka, oo u daa xogta inay isu hadasho — wax ka badan inta ay ogolaato maaha.`},opener:{heading:`Yaa loogu talagalay?`,body:`Innaga. Innaga oo dhan. Dadka miyiga ah, dadka magaalada, kuwa xiisaynaya, khabiirada siyaasadda, saxafiyiinta, qareennada, cilmibaadhayaasha, siyaasiyiinta — innaga oo dhan. Maxaa yeelay waxay saameysaa innaga oo dhan. Haddii aad jeceshahay xisbiga xukunka haya iyo haddii kaleba, waxa ay guddida kala qaybsantay soo saartay marna hore looma samayn. Waxayna ina siisay fursad aan ku eegno gudaha mishiinka si aynaan hore u awoodin. Hadda waxaynu dejin karnaa heer aasaasi ah — silsilad imtixaanno ah, oo wax kasta oo xiga lagu qiimeyn karo. Aan ku tuso waxa aan helay.`},stakes:{q1:{heading:`Khariidadda la soo jeediyay ma waa qaybsi siyaasadeed (gerrymander)?`,body:`"Gerrymander" ma aha erey ay maxkamadaha Kanada isticmaalaan, hubintanina uma adeegsato sidii xukun. Waxa hubintu sheegi karto waa mid ka cidhiidhi badan oo xaqiiqo ah: afar ka mid ah shanta imtixaan ee qaab-dhismeedka ee ay socodsiiso ayaa calaamadeeya <em>soo jeedinta inta yar</em>, midna ma calaamadayso beddelka kale (<em>soo jeedinta inta badan</em>); imtixaanka shanaad waa dhexdhexaad labadaba. In qaabkaasi gaadho heerka waxa dadku si aan rasmi ahayn ugu jeedaan "gerrymander" waa go'aan ay hubintu uga tagto akhristaha.`,footnote:`Magacyada "inta badan" iyo "inta yar" waxay ka yimaadeen kala qaybsanaan 3–2 oo ka dhex dhacday Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada (oo uu guddoominayay Garsoore Miller), oo soo saartay laba soo jeedin oo iska soo horjeeda halkii ay ka soo bixi lahayd talo keliya. Golaha Sharci dejinta ayaa tan iyo markaas labadaba dhinac iska dhigay oo dib-u-qaybinta u gudbiyay guddi ka kooban lix xubnood oo MLA ah (xubnaha golaha sharci dejinta gobolka) oo uu guddoominayo Brandon Lunty (MLA UCP ah); guddiga waxa uu kormeerayaa Guddi Madax-bannaan oo Talo-bixin ah oo ka kooban shan xubnood — guddoomiye, Brian O'Ferrall, garsoore hawlgab ah oo ka tirsanaa Maxkamadda Rafcaanka, iyo laba uu magacaabay Ra'iisul Wasaaraha (Sharafta leh Monte Solberg iyo Darwin Durnie) iyo laba uu magacaabay Hogaamiyaha Mucaaridka (Dr. Gerard Kennedy iyo Brent Robinson) — oo loo xilsaaray inay soo saaraan soo jeedin xudduudeed cusub oo 91 kursi ah ka hor xilliga kama-dambaysta ah ee Noofembar 2026.`},q2:{heading:`Muxuu "gerrymander" ka dhigan yahay sharciga Kanada?`,body:`Macno gaar ah uma jiro. Imtixaanka Kanada waa kala duwan yahay: in xudduudaha siiyaan codbixiyayaasha <em>matalaad waxtar leh</em> sida ku cad qaybta 3 ee Axdiga Xuquuqda. Soo jeedinta inta yar waxay kor u qaaddaa su'aalo dhab ah oo ku saabsan halbeegga matalaadda waxtarka leh; kaliya garsoore ayaa si gunaanad ah uga jawaabi kara, weligiina ma jiro mid waydiiyay.`},q3:{heading:`Maxaa khatar ah ee ku saabsan dadka Alberta?`,body:`Marka codka gobolka uu yahay 50/50, cabbirrada hubintu waxay soo jeedinta inta yar dhigaan meel qaab-dhismeed ahaan xad-dhaaf ah: in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1.01 milyan ee khariidadood ee dhexdhexaadka ah ee isbarbardhigga ayaa soo saara isku-dheelitir-la'aan kursiyo oo noocaas oo kale ah. Isku-dheelitir-la'aantaasi waxay muhiim u tahay maxaa yeelay aqlabiyad 60-ka-89 ah waxay ka tagtaa mucaarid astaan keliya ah, xaqiiqo ahaanna waxay ka dhowrsan tahay is-khilaafka gudaha — ma aha sababtoo ah ay ka gudbayso heer gaar ah (Golaha Alberta ma laha xeer saddex-meelood-laba ah; isla awoodaha habraaca ayaa u furan aqlabiyad fudud). In jiidashada soo jeedinta inta yar ay ku filan tahay inay xisbi ka gudbiso heerka 60-ka kursi marka qaybaha codku <em>aanay ahayn</em> 50/50 waa su'aal aanay hubintani weli tijaabin. In isku-dheelitir-la'aantaasi la aqbali karo waa su'aal loogu talagalay dadka Alberta, ma aha hubintan.`},cta_law:`Akhri macnaha sharciga →`,cta_methods:`Eeg sida aan u tijaabinnay →`,scorecard_h:`Kaarka buundooyinka`,scorecard_fig_alt:`Jaantus kala firidsan. Dhinaca: farqiga waxtarka. Kor: tirada imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedka ee calaamadeeyay. Khariidadda 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee guddida waxay wada fadhiyaan geeska hoose ee bidix. Khariidadda inta yar ee guddida keligeed ayay fadhidaa geeska sare ee midig, xariiqda afar-ka-mid-ah-shan dushiisa, waxyar ka hor xariiqda go'go'an ee farqiga waxtarka oo qiyaastii ah 4.1%. Khariidadda 2019 waxa lagu calaamadeeyay 0 ka mid ah 4 la socodsiiyay.`,scorecard_fig_caption:`Labada waddo hal sawir. Jiif: inta ay tirada caddaaladda xisbiyeed u janjeedho (midig = UCP aad loo doorbiday). Taag: shanta imtixaan ee caddaaladda qaab-dhismeedka intee ayay khariidaddu ku dhacdaa. Hoose-bidix waa geeska ammaanka ah ee habraacyada dhexdhexaadka ahi si joogto ah ugu dhacaan; sare-midig waa gobolka qiimaha ka baxsan. Khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 iyo inta badan ee 2026 waxay ku jiraan geeska ammaanka ah (khariidadda 2019 waxa lagu qiimeeyay afar ka mid ah imtixaannada; imtixaanka aagga Calgary marna laguma samayn). Inta yar ee 2026 keligeed ayay ku jirtaa gobolka qiimaha ka baxsan.`,scorecard_intro:`Laba cabbir oo madax-bannaan ayaa lagu dabaqay labada khariidadood iyadoo la isticmaalayo isla xadadka horay loo diiwaan-geliyay. Qaab-dhismeedku wuxuu adeegsadaa kaliya qaabka khadadka — natiijo doorasho ma jirto. Tirooyinku waxay tijaabiyaan sida khadadku codadka ugu beddelaan kursiyo. Labada waddo waxay gaaraan isla gunaanad.`,scorecard_close:`Laba cabbir oo madax-bannaan, hal jawaab. Isuduwistaani waa calaamadda keligeed ugu xooggan ee hubinta.`},top_callouts:{gerrymander_lead:`Khariidadda inta yar ma waa qaybsi siyaasadeed?`,gerrymander_body:`Dhibcaha wadajirka ah ee eexda xisbiyeed ee hubinta, khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu waxay ku jirtaa dabada aadka u fog ee 1,010,000 khariidadood oo isbarbardhig dhexdhexaad ah oo xisaab-hab (algorithm) lagu sawiray — qiyaastii 69 ka mid ah ayaa gaadha saamigeeda kursiyada marka codku siman yahay, moodel tirakoobna wuxuu suurtagalnimada muuqaalkeeda guud ee sawir dhexdhexaad ah ku qiyaasaa qiyaastii 1&nbsp;ka&nbsp;mid&nbsp;ah&nbsp;568,000. Khariidadda inta badan si fiican ayay ugu jirtaa xadka caadiga ah.`,tldr_label:`Soo koobid`,tldr_p1:`Guddida Alberta way kala qaybsantay, dawladdu sawirka khariidadda ayay la wareegtay, guddi ka kooban lix MLA (guddiga Lunty) ayaa warbixintiisa soo gudbin doona Noofembar 2026. Labada khariidadood ee guddida midkoodna sharci ma aha.`,tldr_p2:`Hubintani labada khariidadood ee guddida si isku mid ah ayay u tijaabisay, iyadoo la barbar dhigayo 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar ku sawiray faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta. Soo jeedinta inta badan waxay u egtahay khariidadaha uu sawir dhexdhexaad ahi si joogto ah u soo saaro — waxay ku gudubtaa imtixaan kasta oo hore loo diiwaangeliyay. Soo jeedinta inta yar waxay ku dhacdaa afar ka mid ah shan imtixaan oo qaab-dhismeed (xadka digniinta ayay ka gudubtaa), marka codku siman yahay 50/50-na qiyaastii 69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa siiya kursiyo le'eg kuwa ay siiso. Moodel tirakoob ayaa suurtagalnimada in habraac dhexdhexaad ahi soo saaro muuqaalkeeda caddaaladda guud ku qiyaasa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000 — qiyaas ka baxsan cidhifka khariidad kasta oo dhexdhexaad ah oo la sawiray, ma aha tirin; nooc ka taxaddar badan wuxuu bixiyaa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 450,000. Hal cabbir, farqiga waxtarka, wuxuu ku dhacay waxyar ka hooseeya xariiqda hubintu hore u dejisay; waxa loo soo sheegay sidii mid aan gaadhin.`,tldr_p3:`Hubinta waxay cabbirtaa natiijooyinka, ma aha niyadda. Marka guddiga Lunty uu sii daayo khariidadiisa, hubintani waxay ku dabaqi doontaa isla imtixaanada.`,tldr_footer:`Shuruudaha beeninta ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay (xaaladaha natiijada lagu beenin lahaa) iyo ballanqaadyada ka-noqoshada waxay ku jiraan %s.`,tldr_footer_link:`Ka-noqoshooyinka iyo Saxitaannada`},picture:{heading:`Sawirka, ka hor caddaynta`,lead:`Saddex khariidadood, laba hab oo wax lagu cabbiro. Hal dhibic kuma eka kuwa kale. Sawirkani waa kiiska hubinta oo dhan oo hal sawir ku jira — haddana hadda ma haysid hab aad ku xukunto inuu wax macno ah leeyahay iyo in kale. Khadadka ku yaal sharci ma aha. Geesku maxkamad ma aha. Dhammaadka boggan waxaad si sax ah u ogaan doontaa waxa sawirkani caddayn karo, iyo si sax ah waxa uusan caddayn karin. Diiwaanku dhammaadka ayuu dib ugu soo noqdaa.`},head:{title:`Khariidadda Doorashada Alberta, oo La Hubiyay`,meta_description:`Khariidad 91 riding ah oo Alberta loo soo jeediyay ayaa hor taal Golaha Sharci-dejinta. Waan hubiyay, iyo labada khariidadood ee guddida ee ka horreeyay, anigoo adeegsanaya imtixaanno horay loo qoray. Natiijooyinka ku-meel-gaadhka ah, khariidadda cusubi ma soo celiso janjeerka xagga UCP ee laga helay khariidadda inta yar ee guddida.`},nav:{skip_to_content:`U gudub waxa ku jira`,home_aria:`Ku noqo sare`,theme_aria:`Beddel qaab madow/iftiin`,theme_title:`Beddel qaabka madow`,nav_aria:`Fur tusmada`,drawer_top:`↑ Sare`,route_story:`Sheeko`,route_law:`Sharci`,route_methods:`Sida aan u hubiyay`,stakes:`Khataraha`,findings:`Natiijooyinka`,history:`Taariikhda`,reform:`Isbeddel`,group_overview:`Guud`,group_audit:`Hubinta`,group_context:`Macnaha`,group_forward:`Hore u socoshada`,group_apparatus:`Qalabka`,why:`Muxuu muhiim u yahay?`,map:`Khariidadda hal jaleeco`,split:`Sida guddidu u kala qaybsantay`,litmus:`Imtixaanka Caddaynta ee 1,010,000-Khariidadood`,crack_pack:`Jeexitaan, urursi, miirid`,for_you:`Maxay tani kaa la macno tahay`,impact:`Saamaynta dhabta ah`,gerrymanders:`Qaybsiyaal siyaasadeed oo cad`,history_full:`Taariikhda qaybsiga siyaasadeed`,canada:`Kanada way kala duwan tahay`,lunty:`Lunty`,suggestions:`Soo jeedinno isbeddel`,smoking_gun:`Caddayn, ma aha xaqiijin`,picture:`Sawirka`,act1:`Fasalka I: Khariidadda`,act2:`Fasalka II: Jilitaanka`,act3:`Fasalka III: Dhaqanka`,revisited:`Kaarka dhibcaha, mar kale`,explainers:`Sharraxaadyada A–N`,retractions:`Ka noqosho`,authors_view:`Aragtida qoraaga`,references:`Tixraacyo`,technical:`Khayraad farsamo`,feedback:`Dir jawaab-celin`,happened:`Labada khariidadood ee guddida`,does:`Waxa khariidaddu sameyso`,law:`Waxa sharcigu dalbado`,system:`Cidda sawirtay khariidadaha`,know:`Sida aan u hubiyay`,test:`Imtixaanka Noofembar`,november:`Khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, oo la hubiyay`,mind:`Waxa fikirkayga beddeli lahaa`,evidence:`Diiwaanka oo dhan`,fixes:`Hagaajinno mar dambe`,bar_aria:`Goobta`,bar_home:`Bogga hore`,bar_evidence:`Diiwaanka oo dhan`,bar_explorer:`Baadhaha khariidadda`,bar_norms:`Heerarka`,bar_explainers:`Sharraxaadyo`,bar_fixes:`Hagaajinno`,bar_feedback:`Jawaab-celin`,group_this_page:`Boggan`,group_pages:`Bogag`,answer:`Jawaabta gaaban`},hero:{h1:`Sharciyo, Caadooyin, iyo Tirakoob: Hubinta Warbixinnada Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta ee 2026`,subtitle:`Guddida Alberta waxay 2026 soo saartay laba khariidadood oo riding ah oo isku tartamaya. Isla imtixaannada ayaan labadaba ku sameeyay, waxaanan weydiiyay hal su'aal: ma u dhaqmaan codbixiyayaasha si isku mid ah?`,badge:`Jaldiga: khariidadda inta yar ee guddida (warbixinta kama-dambaysta, Maarso 2026)`,cover_note:`Guji khariidadda si aad u weynayso. Ku kala beddel labada khariidadood ee guddida iyo khariidadda 2019, tan maanta la isticmaalo. Xidh muuqaalka oo dhexdooda ku kala wareeg. Khadadku way dhaqaaqaan. Codbixiyayaashu meeshooda ayay joogaan. Khariidadda cusub ee guddida talo-bixintu weli kuma jirto baadhaha.`,cover_note_1:`Khariidaddani waa albaabka ugu fiican. Guji si aad u weyneyso oo aad u baadho. Badhamada sare waxay kala beddelaan khariidadda inta yar, khariidadda inta badan iyo xudduudaha la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019, ama waxay saddexda isku dul saaraan si aad si sax ah u aragto halka ay ku kala tagaan. <strong>Detail</strong> wuxuu aag codbixin kasta ku midabeeyaa sida dadku u codeeyeen 2023. <strong>Trend</strong> wuxuu ku daraa hadh xisbiyeed degmo kasta (buluug UCP, oranji NDP). <strong>Lines</strong> wuxuu shidaa oo damiyaa xudduudaha. <strong>Find</strong> wuxuu kuu geeyaa riding kasta adigoo magaciisa qoraya.`,cover_note_2:`Muuqaalka xidh oo khariidadaha kala beddel. Daawo xuduud dhaqaaqaysa, iyadoo codbixiyayaasha hoosteeda ku jira ay meeshooda joogaan. Su'aasha oo dhan, hal dhaqdhaqaaq.`,cover_note_3:`Markaad dhammayso baadhista, hoos u dhaadhac si aad u aragto soo koobidda. Falanqaynta farsameed ee dhammaystiran waxay ku jirtaa qaybta Khayraadka. Dhammaan xogtu waxay ka timid faylasha khariidadaha (shapefiles) rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta iyo diiwaanno kale oo dawladeed iyo kuwo il-furan ah.`,image_alt:`Khariidadda degmooyinka doorashada Alberta — soo jeedinta inta yar ee guddida, oo lagu midabeeyay codkii 2023`,map_hint:`Guji si aad si is dhexgal ah u baadho`,btn_title:`Guji si aad u furto khariidadda is dhexgalka ah`,btn_aria:`Guji si aad si is dhexgal ah u baadho`},boundary:{heading:`Waxa hubintani ku sheegi karto iyo waxa aysan kuu sheegi karin`,can_1:`Joomatariga khariidadda inta yar waxa uu dhaafaa 4 ka mid ah 5-ta xad ee qaab-dhismeedka ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay <em>iyada oo aan la isticmaalin xog doorasho gabi ahaanba</em>. Shanaad (xajinta) waa dhexdhexaad. Khariidadda inta badan waxay dhaaftaa 0 ka mid ah 4-ta xad ee digniinta bixiyay. Imtixaanadaasi waxay cabbiraan sifooyinka khadadka xudduudaha laftooda — qaabka degmada, xajinta dawladda hoose, faafinta dadka — oo waxay gaaraan gunaanadka ka hor inta aan cod la tirin.`,can_2:`Si gaar ah, marka xogta doorashada la keeno, khariidadda inta yar waxay ku jirtaa centile-ka 99.99 ee 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo isbarbardhig ah oo xisaab-hab lagu sawiray, kuwaas oo lagu waafajiyay dheelitirka dadka iyo isku-xidhnaanta (tijaabadu waxay qasbaysaa labadaas shuruudood, ma aha shuruud kasta oo sharci ah sida danaha bulshada). Qiyaastii 69 ka mid ah 1.01 milyan ee khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa gaadha isla saamiga kursiyada marka codku siman yahay. Marka labada kanaal ee falanqaynta la wada tiriyo, moodel tirakoob ayaa suurtagalnimada muuqaalkan ee sawir dhexdhexaad ah ku qiyaasa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000. Laba qalab oo falanqayn — joomatari iyo tirakoob — ayaa gaadha isla gunaanadka, oo doorbida isla xisbiga; qiyaasta wadajirka ahi waa soo koobidda ku-tiirsanaanta tixgelisa ee isku-imaatinkaas, ma aha afar imtixaan oo madax-bannaan oo isku raacay.`,can_3:`Saddex ka mid ah qaababka ku jira soo jeedinta inta yar waxa qoraal ahaan calaamadeeyay inta badan ee guddida, guddoomiyuhu ku jiro, jawaabta warbixinta inta badan ay siisay inta yar (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, bogagga 62–63). Imtixaannada hubinta waxa la sameeyay iyadoo aan waxba laga ogeyn calaamadahaas, waxayna soo saaraan isla gobollada. Maadaama calaamaduhu ka yimaadeen warbixinta inta badan, kuwani waa dhaleeceynta inta badan laftooda — waxay xoojinayaan natiijada, ma aha qalab saddexaad oo si buuxda u madax-bannaan — hase yeeshee in imtixaannada indhaha la' ee hubintu ay ku dhacaan isla gobollada weli waa wax la yaab leh.`,cant_1:`Hubintu <strong>ma caddeyso</strong> in mid ka mid ah la-taliyayaasha uu ula jeeday saamaynta xisbiyeed ee ay cabbirayso. Joomatariga xudduudu ma muujin karo niyad.`,cant_2:`Hubintu <strong>ma saadaaliso</strong> waxa guddiga Lunty dooran doono, waxa ay noqon doonto codbixinta Noofembar 2026, ama sida dadka Alberta uga falcelin doonaan.`,cant_3:`Hubintu <strong>ma saadaaliso</strong> sida maxkamadi ugu xukumi laheyd haddii doodda Axdiga lagu soo qaado mid kasta oo soo jeedinta ah.`,cant_4:`Hubintu <strong>ma</strong> sheegto in qiyaasta moodelka ee qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000 (p&nbsp;=&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>) uu yahay suurtagalnimada in qaybsi siyaasadeed (gerrymander) dhacay. Tiradaasi waa suurtagalnimada dabada ee joomatariga inta yar marka loo eego male-awaal dhexdhexaad ah oo xisaab-hab ah. Waa caddayn muujinaysa in male-awaalka dhexdhexaadka ahi aanu macquul ahayn. Ma aha suurtagalnimo dambe (posterior) oo ku saabsan ujeeddo xisbiyeed — su'aashaasi waxay u baahan tahay caddayn uu joomatarigu bixin karin.`,cant_5:`Hubintu <strong>uma sheegto</strong> codbixiye kasta oo gaar ah qaabka uu qaadan lahaa ama waxa uu xogtan ka qaban lahaa. Doorashada waa adiga.`},editorial_intro:{heading:`Waa maxay dib-u-qaybinta, oo maxay muhiim u tahay`,p1:`Codbixiye kasta oo Alberta ku nool wuxuu ku nool yahay <em>degmo doorasho</em> — qayb ka mid ah gobolka oo dooran hal qof oo aada golaha sharci dejinta. Waxa jira 87 degmo. Degmo kasta waxay dooratta hal MLA. Marka aad doorasho gobol ku codeyso, waxaad doorato MLA-ga degmadaada. Dadka badan ee Alberta, kaasi waa xidhiidhka oo dhan ee golaha sharci dejinta: hal MLA, hal degmo, hal cod.`,p2:`Khadadka degmadaasi ma joogto. Dadku way guuraan, xaafadaha way koraan, aagagga miyiga way yaraadaan, magaalooyinku way fidaan. Sideed ilaa toban sano kasta, Alberta waa in ay dib u sawirto khadadka si degmo kasta ay u noqoto cabbir saxda ah oo ay ka tarjun karto sida dadka Alberta hadda u nool yihiin. Hay'adda samaysa dib-u-sawirka waa <em>Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> — guddi madax bannaan oo ka kooban garsoorayaal, qareeno, iyo xubno dadweyne ah, ma aha siyaasiyiin.`,p3:`Tani waa habraaca caadiga ah. Markan, habraaca caadigu wuxuu soo saaray wax aan caadi ahayn. Shanta xubnood ee guddidu waxay u kala qaybsameen 3–2 oo ku saabsan sida ay khariidaddu u ekaan lahayd, oo halkii ay ku heshiin lahaayeen hal talo waxay soo saareen laba: <em>soo jeedinta inta badan</em> (oo ay taageereen saddex la-taliye) iyo <em>soo jeedinta inta yar</em> (oo ay taageereen laba). Labaduba waxay yaalliin miiska. 21 Abriil 2026 Golaha Sharci dejintu wuxuu ansixiyay Mooshinka Dawladda 37, oo labadaba dhinac iska dhigay oo dib-u-qaybinta u gudbiyay Guddiga Gaarka ah ee Xulan oo ka kooban lix MLA oo uu guddoominayo Brandon Lunty (MLA UCP ah). Guddigu wuxuu kormeeraa Guddi Madax-bannaan oo Talo-bixin ah oo gaar ah oo afar qof ah, oo lagu aasaasay isla mooshinkaas, oo loo xilsaaray inay soo saaraan khariidad cusub oo 91 kursi ah; guddigu waa inuu warbixintiisa u gudbiyaa golaha sharci dejinta ugu dambayn 2 Noofembar 2026.`,p4:`Sababta ay kuugu muhiim u tahay: khadadku waxay go'aamiyaan cidda MLA-gaaga noqonayso. Waxay go'aamiyaan xaafadaha, magaalooyinka, iyo welwelka la wada matalo. Haddii magaaladaadu u kala qaybsanto afar MLA halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd hal, ma jiro hal wakiil oo ka masuul ah magaalada oo dhan. Haddii bulshadaada danaha wadaagta — magaalo yar, gobol miyi ah, bartamaha magaalada — loo kala qaybiyo degmooyin, codkaaga ee go'aannada gobolka ayaa khafiifaya. Khariidaddu sidoo kale waxay qaabaysaa xisbiga dawlad samayn kara, iyo farqiga uu ku samayn karo. Natiijada gaarka ah ee hubinta (in soo jeedinta inta yar ay ku jirto heer qaab-dhismeed oo xad-dhaaf ah) waa sababta aad boggan u akhrinayso, laakiin su'aasha ballaaran way ka qadiimsan tahay oo waxay khusaysaa wareeg kasta oo dib-u-qaybin ah: khadadku ma waxay ka tarjumayaan sida dadka Alberta u nool yihiin, mise waxay qaabaynayaan siyaasadda soo socota?`,p5:`Inta bogga ka harsan waxay ku marto waxa labada khariidadood ee la soo jeediyay dhab ahaan sameeyaan.`,key_terms_lead:`Ereyo muhiim ah qaybtan — guji si aad u akhrido:`},editorial_reflect:{heading:`U dhexeyn: Waxa tani u tarayso adiga iyo bulshadaada`,intro_p1:`Diiwaanku halkan ayuu ku hakanayaa. Xisbiga kursiyo hela ama waaya waa dhibaatada golaha sharci-dejinta — ma aha meesha aad khariidadahan ku dareemayso. Waxaad ku dareemaysaa saddex su'aalood oo la taaban karo oo ku saabsan degmadaada:`,intro_q1:`Halkee MLA-gaagu degenyahay?`,intro_q2:`Ma maalgashan yahay bulshadaada?`,intro_q3:`Baahiyaha madaxa magaalada ee degmada ma ka adkaan doonaan dabaheeda miyiga?`,intro_p2:`Qaab kasta oo kale — faa'iido xisbiyeed, heer aqlabiyad weyn, heer tirakoob aan caadi ahayn — ugu dambeyntii waxay dib ugu tagaan saddexdaas. Shanta jaranjaroo hoose waxay ku marayaan sida khariidad kasta oo la soo jeediyay uga jawaabayso, shan heer.`,you_h:`Adiga.`,you_p:`Degmadaada doorashadu waxay go'aamisaa cidda kaa matasha golaha sharci-dejinta. Hadda waxaad ku nooshahay mid ka mid ah 87 degmo. Labada khariidadood ee la soo jeediyay hoostooda waxaa laga yaabaa inaad ku noolaato mid kale — laga yaabee MLA kale, laga yaabee mid ku xidhan bulshooyin deris ah oo kala duwan. Haddii aanad garanayn degmada aad hadda ku jirto, ama cidda MLA-gaagu yahay, kaligaa ma tihid: dadka Alberta intooda badani ma sheegi karaan magaca MLA-gooda. Laakiin khadadka xudduuduhu ma aha wax maskaxeed. Waxay go'aamiyaan lambarka taleefanka ee ku dheggan darbiga xafiiska wakiilkaaga maxalliga ah, codsiga xaafadeed ee magacaaga lagu daro, iyo walaaca uu MLA-gaagu marka hore maqlo. Sahamiyaha khariidadda ee boggan — bulshadaada magaceeda ku raadi — wuxuu muujinayaa degmada aad ku jirto soo jeedin kasta. Haddii degmadaadu isbeddesho, wakiilkaaguna wuu isbeddelaa — xidhiidhka wakiilkaaga iyo bulshadaaduna wuu la isbeddelaa.`,community_h:`Bulshadaada.`,community_p:`Bulshooyinkuna ma aha wax maskaxeed oo keliya. Aagga uu dugsi sare adeego, rugta ganacsiga, bulsho diimeed, urur xaafadeed — kuwani waa kooxo dad dhab ah oo wadaaga walaac maxalli ah. Marka xariiq xuduudeed dhex marto, ma jiro hal MLA oo mas'uul ka ah dhammaantood. Natiijada 1 waa kiiska ugu daran: Airdrie, hal magaalo oo afar qaybood loo kala gooyay, iyadoo aan jirin hal wakiil oo ka masuul ah. Isla arrintaas ayaa dhacda meel kasta oo magaalo yar, xaafad, ama bulsho dano wadaag ah oo la aqoonsan yahay la kala qaybiyo — inta kala-qaybintu weynaato, ayaa matalaaddu daciifaysaa. (Cabbirka ballaadhan ee sida aaminka ah ee khariidad kastaa guud ahaan u raacdo khadadka dawladda hoose, labada soo jeedinba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada — Natiijada 5 ayaa diiwaangelisa natiijadii baabba'day.)`,municipality_h:`Dawladda hoose ee magaaladaada.`,municipality_p:`Marka magaalo loo kala jejebiyo wakiillo badan, awoodda ay ku gorgortamayso go'aannada gobolku way daciiftaa. Golaha magaalada oo dalbanaya maalgelin gaadiidka dadweynaha, guddiga dugsiyada oo ka gorgortamaya dugsi cusub, duqa magaalada oo u ololaynaya ballaadhinta waddooyinka waaweyn — mid kastaa si fiican ayuu u socdaa marka magaaladu tilmaami karto dhowr MLA oo masuul ka ah magaalada oo dhan. Soo jeedinta inta yar waxay degmooyinka waqooyiga, bariga, iyo bartamaha Calgary u kala qaybisaa qaybo badan oo qaababka saamiga codkoodu ay tilmaamayaan <em>urursi</em> (codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi oo lagu uruuriyo kuraas yar oo farqi weyn lagu guuleysto) iyo weliba <em>jeexitaan</em> (codbixiyayaasha xisbiga kale oo lagu kala firdhiyo kuraas badan oo farqi yar lagu guuleysto). In qaabkani ula kac yahay waa su'aal aanay hubintu ka jawaabi karin — joomatariga xudduudu ma muujiyo niyad. Waxa ay sheegi kartaa waa in afarta cabbir ee tirakoobku ay calaamadeeyaan isla degmooyinka ay imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedku calaamadeeyaan, iyo in soo jeedinta kale aanay soo saarin isla farra-saxeexaas.`,region_h:`Gobolkaaga.`,region_p1:`Haddii aad ka baxsantahay magaalooyinka Alberta waxaad sida laga yaabo iska ogtahay in wadahadalada siyaasadeed ee ku saabsan xudduudaha had iyo jeer ay magaalooyinka udub-dhexaad ka dhigaan. Cabasho macquul ah, sidaas darteed aan si toos ah u sheegno waxa hubintani sheegayso iyo waxa aanay sheegayn ee ku saabsan Alberta miyiga ah.`,region_p2:`Waxa ay <strong>aysan sheegin</strong>: in Alberta miyiga ah ay leedahay kursiyo aad u badan. EBCA-du waxay u oggolaataa tirooyinka degmada inay ku kala duwanaadaan ilaa 25% si hal MLA miyi aanu ku matalin juquraafi le'eg koonfurta Faransiiska. Maxkamadaha Kanada waxay u arkaan kala-duwanaanshahan inuu sharci yahay. Labada khariidadood ee la soo jeediyay way ilaaliyaan. Waxba hubintani kama beddelayso.`,region_p3:`Waxa ay <strong>sheegayso</strong>: meelo dhowr ah oo soo jeedinta inta yar ka mid ah, bulshooyin miyi ah ayaa loogu xidhay sidii <em>dabada</em> degmo uu xarunta dadkeedu ku yaal magaalo. Mar kale eeg kala-qaybinta Airdrie ee Natiijada 1, markan dhinaca miyiga ka eeg: afarteeda degmo saddex ka mid ah waxay u fidaan dhul miyi oo kala duwan, mid kastana xarunta dadku waa qaybta magaalada, ma aha dabada miyiga. MLA laga doorto degmo noocaas ah waxay u badan tahay inuu ku noolaado, ka ololeeyo, oo mudnaanta siiyo meesha codadku joogaan — taas oo macnaheedu yahay in bulshooyinka miyiga ah ee hore u lahaa MLA miyi u gaar ah ay noqdaan qaybta dambe ee kursi ay magaalo hoggaamiso. Qaabkani wuxuu ku soo noqnoqdaa soo jeedinta inta yar siyaabo aanu ugu soo noqnoqon soo jeedinta inta badan.`,region_p4:`Hubintu ma soo jeedinayso in laga qaado kursiyo Alberta miyiga ah. Waxay weydiisaa in khadaduhu ay ixtiraamaan bulshooyinka miyiga ah ee kursiyadaasi loogu talagalay inay matalaan, mise juquraafiga miyigu waxa loo isticmaalayaa culayska codadka magaalada lagu nuuji lahaa degmooyin bartamuhu meel kale joogo. Haddii aad ku nooshahay mid ka mid ah dabaha miyiga, su'aasha ah midee khariidadood ah ayaa la dhaqan-geliyay waxay go'aamisaa in MLA-gaagu uu matalo bulshada miyiga ee aad dhab ahaan ku nooshahay, ama degmo magaaleed oo khadkeedu ay ku jirto dhulkaaga.`,province_h:`Gobolkaaga.`,province_p:`Golaha sharci-dejintu waa waxa aad hesho marka aad isku darto jawaabaha degmo kasta ee saddexda su'aalood ee kor ku xusan. Haddii degmooyinka badankoodu ku xidhan yihiin bulshooyin ay MLA-yadoodu dhab ahaan ku nool yihiin, goluhu wuxuu matalaa bulshooyinkaas. Haddii degmooyinka badankoodu leeyihiin dabo miyi ah oo ku xidhan madax magaalo, goluhu wuxuu matalaa madaxyada — dabaduna waxay helaan wixii dareen ah ee ka hadha. Su'aasha xisbiyeed — xisbiga aqlabiyadda hela — waxay ka dambaysaa taas. Su'aasha aqlabiyadda weyn — in xisbi dhaafo 60 ka mid ah 89 kursi, farqi ka dhigaya dawlad mid aan dhab ahaan wax ka gelin xildhibaanno dhinac u wareega, kana tagaya mucaarad aad u yar oo aan sii wadi karin la-xisaabtanka — waxay ka dambaysaa <em>taas</em>. Marka la qiyaaso kala-qaybsanaan gobol oo 50/50 ah, cabbirrada hubintu waxay soo jeedinta inta yar dhigayaan heer qaab-dhismeed oo daran: wax ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1.01 milyan ee khariidadaha isbarbardhigga dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa soo saara nooc isku-dheelitir-la'aan kursiyo oo kan oo kale ah. In isku-dheelitir-la'aantaasi xisbi u gudbiso 60 kursi saamiyada codka ee dadka Alberta dhab ahaan bixiyaan waa su'aal aanay hubintani weli si toos ah u tijaabin — meel bannaan oo daacad ah oo diiwaanka ku jirta. In jawaabta mid ka mid ah su'aalahan ay muhiim ku filan u tahay in wax laga qabto, mar kale, waa su'aal adiga kuu taal.`},editorial_history:{heading:`Macnaha: Taariikh kooban oo ku saabsan qaybsiga siyaasadeed`,p1:`Ereygu wuxuu ka yimid 1812. Guddoomiyaha Massachusetts, Elbridge Gerry, wuxuu ansixiyay khariidad golaha guurtida gobolka oo degmooyinkeedu aad ugu qalloocsanaayeen danta xisbigiisa, ilaa uu sawir-gacmeed reer Boston ahi mid ka mid ah u sawiray sidii salamander (xayawaan yar oo u eg mulac) — baalal, ciddiyo, iyo carrab laba-fargood ah. Ereyga kaftanka ah ee sawir-gacmeedka, <em>Gerry-mander</em>, ayaa hadhay. Qaabkuna wuu hadhay: laba qarni kadib, ereygu wuxuu weli ka dhigan yahay sawiridda khadadka doorashada si loo farsameeyo natiijo xisbiyeed.`,p2:`Ereygu wuu jiraa maxaa yeelay dhibaatadu way jirtaa. Meel kasta oo codbixiyayaashu ka soo doortaan matalayaal degmooyin juquraafi ah, qof baa khadadka sawirta, khadadkana waxa lagu sawiri karaa siyaalo badan. Dalal kala duwan ayaa gaaray jawaabo kala duwan oo ku saabsan cidda sawiri lahayd iyo waxa xaddidi laha.`,p3:`<strong>Mareykanka</strong> wuxuu qaybsiga siyaasadeed ee xisbiyeed u arkaa dhibaato aanay maxkamadaha federaalku inta badan xallin karin. Kiiska <em>Rucho v. Common Cause</em> (2019), Maxkamadda Sare ee Mareykanku waxay xukuntay in qaybsiyada siyaasadeed ee xisbiyeed yihiin "su'aalo siyaasadeed" oo aan maxkamad lagu xukumi karin, oo maxkamadaha federaalku aanay xallin doonin. Gobollada qaar (California, Michigan) waxay ka jawaabeen iyagoo abuuray guddiyo madax-bannaan oo muwaadiniin ka kooban si ay khadadkooda u sawiraan; kuwo kale (Texas, North Carolina) waxay sii wadeen sawiridda khariidado si cad xisbi ugu eexda, waxayna ku difaaceen in <em>Rucho</em> uu taas oggol yahay.`,p4:`<strong>Boqortooyada Midowday</strong> waxay isticmaashaa afar Guddiyo Xudduudo oo joogto ah — mid kasta England, Scotland, Wales, iyo Northern Ireland — oo ka kooban garsoorayaal iyo shaqaalaha sare ee dawladda. Waxa ay dib u sawiraan khadadka qiyaastii sideed sano kasta iyaga oo ku saleysan shuruucda go'an (sinaanta dadka, isku xidhnaanta juquraafi, ixtiraamka xudduudaha dawladda hoose). Tan iyo Sharciga Degmooyinka Baarlamaanka 2020 (Parliamentary Constituencies Act 2020), talooyinkooda kama-dambaysta ah waxay si toos ah u dhaqan-galaan iyada oo loo marayo Amar Golaha (Order in Council), iyada oo aan loo baahnayn cod baarlamaaneed — awooddii hore ee Baarlamaanku ku diidi jiray waa la qaaday.`,p5:`<strong>Australiya</strong> shaqada waxay u wakiishaa Guddida Doorashada Australia, hay'ad federaal ah oo madax-bannaan oo awood buuxda u leh maamulka doorashooyinka iyo xudduudahaba. Dib-u-qaybintu si toos ah ayay u dhacdaa marka tirada kursiyada gobol isbeddesho ama toddoba sano laga joogo tii ugu dambeysay. Go'aannada la-taliyayaasha dib ayaa loo eegi karaa sababo habraaceed, laakiin sababo xisbiyeed lagama eegi karo. Sida Boqortooyada Midowday oo kale, qaybsiga siyaasadeed sida Mareykanku u yaqaan ku dhowaad lama maqal.`,p6:`Saddexdan kiis waxay xadeeyaan labada geesood ee kala-duwanaanshaha: maxkamado iska fogeeya (Mareykanka), guddiyo madax-bannaan oo baarlamaanku si xooggan ugu hoggaansamo (Boqortooyada Midowday), iyo hay'ad madax-bannaan oo joogto ah oo leh awood buuxda (Australiya). Kanada waxay ku taallaa meel kale oo ka duwan — taas oo qaybta xigta ay ka hadlayso.`},glossary:{more_link:`Wax dheeraad ah baro →`,"electoral-district":{term:`Qaybta doorashada`,definition:`Magaca sharciga ah ee riding-ka, ee sharciyada Alberta. Boggani wuxuu u isticmaalaa oo keliya magacyada iyo xigashooyinka. Meelaha kale wuxuu yidhaahdaa riding.`},riding:{term:`Riding`,definition:`Aagga doorta hal MLA. Sharciyada Alberta waxay ugu yeedhaan qaybta doorashada. Boggani wuxuu yidhaahdaa riding, marka laga reebo magacyada iyo xigashooyinka.`},mla:{term:`MLA`,definition:`Xubinta Golaha Sharci-dejinta: qofka uu hal riding u doorto inuu matalo Golaha Sharci-dejinta ee Alberta.`},ucp:{term:`UCP`,definition:`United Conservative Party, xisbiga xukunka haya ee Alberta. Waxa la aasaasay 2017, markii Progressive Conservatives iyo Wildrose Party ay midoobeen, dawladdana wuu hayay tan iyo 2019.`},ndp:{term:`NDP`,definition:`New Democratic Party (Alberta NDP), mucaaradka rasmiga ah. Dawladda wuu hayay 2015 ilaa 2019.`},gerrymander:{term:`Gerrymandering`,definition:`Khadad loo sawiro si xisbi faa'iido loo siiyo. Ereygu wuxuu ka yimid khariidad 1812 ah oo Massachusetts ah. Sharciga Kanada ma laha dambi magacaas leh. Taasi waxay xaddidaa waxa maxkamaddu ugu yeedhi karto, ma aha inuu dhaco iyo in kale. Imtixaanka sharci ee ugu dhow waa matalaadda waxtarka leh ee qodobka 3 ee Charter-ka. Hubintu waxay cabbirtaa waxa khariidaddu sameyso. Ma sheegto in khariidad kasta ay tahay gerrymander.`},cracking:{term:`Jeexitaan (cracking)`,definition:`Koox codbixiyayaal ah oo lagu kala firdhiyo riding-yo badan si aanay marna inta badan uga noqon midkoodna. Tusaale ahaan, magaalo u qaybi afar riding, codbixiyayaasheeduna mid kasta way ku yaraan karaan.`},packing:{term:`Urursi (packing)`,definition:`Codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi oo lagu cufo riding-yo yar. Xisbigu riding-yadaas wuxuu ku guulaystaa farqi aad u weyn laakiin codad badan ayuu "khasaariyaa", codbixiyayaashiisa ka hadhayna way yaraadaan si ay meelo kale ugu tartamaan.`},draining:{term:`Miirid (draining)`,definition:`Erey aan anigu leeyahay, ma aha mid goobta ku xasilloon, oo loogu talagalay saamayn ka dhalata jeexitaan iyo urursi: codadka khasaaray ee ay abuuraan waxa loo riixaa meelo la doortay, halkaas oo ay ku beddelaan janjeerka riding-yada u dhow. Imtixaanka miirida deriska ayaa raadiya. Waxaan u arkaa sahamin, ma aha hab xasilloon.`},anchoring:{term:`Xajin (anchoring)`,definition:`Inta ay khadadka khariidaddu raacaan khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka jira. Khariidad si fiican u xidhani inta badan way raacdaa. Khariidadaha guddida ee 2026, imtixaankani ma kala saarin labada: labaduba waxay u dhow yihiin 75%-ka khariidadda 2019.`},"charter-s3":{term:`Qaybta 3 ee Axdiga`,definition:`Qaybta Charter-ka Kanada ee Xuquuqda iyo Xorriyaadka ee muwaadiniinta siisa xaqa codbixinta. Maxkamadaha Kanadu uma akhriyaan xeer adag oo ah "hal qof, hal cod" ee waxay u akhriyaan xaq loo leeyahay "matalaad waxtar leh".`},"effective-representation":{term:`Matalaad waxtar leh`,definition:`Heerka ay maxkamadaha Kanadu ku qiimeeyaan khariidadaha doorashada. Macnaheedu waa in codbixiye kastaa yeesho cod dhab ah. Riding-yo dad isku le'eg ahi qayb ka mid ah ayay yihiin. Sidoo kale xidhiidhka bulshada, juquraafiga iyo matalaadda dadka laga tirada badan yahay. Bayaanka ugu weyn waa Saskatchewan Reference ee Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada ee 1991.`},ebc:{term:`Guddida`,definition:`Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada ee madax-bannaan, oo sawirta riding-yada Alberta iyadoo raacaysa Sharciga. 2026 waxay lahayd guddoomiye, Garsoore Miller, iyo afar xubnood: laba uu soo jeediyay Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu iyo laba uu soo jeediyay Hoggaamiyaha Mucaaradku. Waxay dhegaysiyo ku qabatay lix iyo toban bulshadood, waxay daabacday khariidad qabyo ah Oktoobar 2025, warbixinteeda kama-dambaysta ahna waxay gudbisay 23 Maarso 2026. Waxay u kala qaybsantay 3 iyo 2, sidaa darteed waxay gudbisay laba khariidadood. Khariidadda inta badan waxa saxeexay guddoomiyaha iyo labada xubnood ee Mucaaradku soo jeediyay. Khariidadda inta yar waxa saxeexay labada xubnood ee Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu soo jeediyay. Qodobka s.9 ee Sharciga, warbixinta inta badan ayaa ah warbixinta guddida. Golaha ayaa labada khariidadoodba dhinac iska dhigay.`},"lunty-committee":{term:`Guddiga`,definition:`Guddiga Gaarka ah ee Xudduudaha Doorashada: lix MLA, afar UCP iyo laba NDP, oo uu guddoominayo MLA-ga UCP Brandon Lunty. Mooshinka Dawladda 37 ayaa abuuray ka dib markii Goluhu labada khariidadood ee guddida dhinac iska dhigay (ogeysiis la bixiyay 16 Abriil; la soo jeediyay, laga dooday oo la ansixiyay 21 Abriil 2026). Wuxuu magacaabay guddida talo-bixinta oo kormeeray shaqadeeda. 28 Oktoobar wuxuu u codeeyay 3 iyo 2 inuu dib-u-eegistiisa ku joojiyo faallo la'aan, warbixinta guddida talo-bixintana wuxuu u diray Golaha 2 Noofembar 2026. Ma jirin sharci ku waajibinayay inuu qabto dhegaysiyo dadweyne, midna ma qabanin.`},"advisory-panel":{term:`Guddida talo-bixinta`,definition:`Guddida Madax-bannaan ee Talo-bixinta ee guddigu ku magacaabay Mooshinka Dawladda 37 si ay u sawirto khariidad 91 riding ah. 2 Juun 2026, guddigu wuxuu guddoomiye u magacaabay garsoorihii hawlgabka ahaa ee Maxkamadda Rafcaanka Brian O'Ferrall, iyadoo Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu soo jeediyay. 9 Juun wuxuu magacaabay afar xubnood: Sharafta leh Monte Solberg iyo Darwin Durnie, oo uu soo jeediyay Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu, iyo Dr. Gerard Kennedy iyo Brent Robinson, oo uu soo jeediyay Hoggaamiyaha Mucaaradku (warbixinta guddiga, b. 9). Guddida talo-bixintu waxay warbixinteeda keentay 22 Oktoobar 2026. Iyaduna way kala qaybsantay: warbixinteedu waxay leedahay ra'yi inta yar ah oo wata khariidad beddel ah (faqradda 167). MLA-yada ayaa go'aamiya in khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu sharci noqoto.`},ebca:{term:`EBCA`,definition:`Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada, sharciga Alberta ee dejiya xeerarka ay khariidad cusubi raacayso. Riding wuxuu yeelan karaa ilaa 25% dad ka badan ama ka yar celceliska. Qodobka s.15(2), ilaa afar riding oo fog ayaa yeelan kara ilaa 50% dad ka yar, haddii mid kastaa buuxiyo ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah shan imtixaan oo Sharciga ku qoran.`},ensemble:{term:`Khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray`,definition:`1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah oo kombuyuutar ka sawiray isla 4,765-ta aag codbixineed, mid kastaa 87 riding. Riding kasta waxa lagu hayaa tiro dad isku dhow iyo hal xabbo, kombuyuutarkuna marna ma arko cod. Khariidaduhu waxay muujiyaan sida ay u eg yihiin khariidado aan ujeeddo lagu sawirin. Marka boggani ugu yeedho dhexdhexaad, taas oo keliya ayuu ula jeedaa. Khariidad dhab ahi waxay noqotaa mid aan caadi ahayn marka ay ka baxdo waxa ku dhowaad dhammaantood soo saaraan.`},efficiency_gap:{term:`Farqiga waxtarka`,definition:`Tiri codadka khasaaray ee xisbi kasta: codadka la siiyay qof guuldarraystay, iyo codadka guuleystaha ee ka badan intii uu u baahnaa. Kadib is barbar dhig labada xisbi. Farqi weyni wuxuu tilmaamaa khariidad hal dhinac u janjeerta. Boggan, farqi togan wuxuu doorbidaa UCP.`},mean_median:{term:`Farqiga dhexe-dhexdhexaadka`,definition:`Qaado saamiga codka xisbi riding kasta. Farqiga celceliska-dhexe waa fogaanta u dhexeysa celceliska saamiyadaas iyo kan dhexe. Farqi weyni wuxuu tusaa in codbixiyayaasha xisbigu u kala firdhiyeen si codad khasaariya.`},declination:{term:`Declination`,definition:`Cabbir muujiya inta ay guulaha xisbi kastaa hal dhinac u yihiin: guulo aad u ballaadhan ama kuwo cidhiidhi ah. Khariidadda inta yar ee guddida wuxuu u tilmaamaa isla jihada cabbirrada kale, xagga UCP.`},seats_5050:{term:`Imtixaanka 50-50 (kursiyada marka codku siman yahay)`,definition:`Codka riding kasta isla qadar u dhaqaaji ilaa gobolku si sax ah ugu kala qaybsamo 50-50, kadibna tiri kursiyada. Wuxuu dhinac iska dhigaa cidda dhab ahaan guulaysatay wuxuuna tijaabiyaa janjeerka ku dhisan khariidadda. Alberta, khariidad caadi ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray waxay UCP siisaa 44.8% kursiyada marka codku siman yahay, maxaa yeelay guulaha miyiga ee UCP way ka ballaadhan yihiin guulaha magaalada ee NDP.`},fsa:{term:`Aagga kala-soocida hore (FSA)`,definition:`Saddexda xaraf ee ugu horreeya koodhka boostada Kanada (xaraf, tiro, xaraf). Qiyaastii 150 FSA ayaa daboola Alberta.`},percentile:{term:`Boqolleyda`,definition:`Halka khariidad dhab ahi kaga jirto khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Boqolleyda 78aad waxay xagga UCP uga sii janjeertaa 78 ka mid ah 100 kasta. Ta 99.99aad waxay uga sii janjeertaa dhammaan marka laga reebo qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 10,000.`},hybrid:{term:`Riding isku-dhaf ah`,definition:`Riding ku xidha qayb magaalo ah iyo aagag miyi ah ama magaalooyin yaryar. Tirinta ka-gudubka xadka magaalada, riding wuxuu ka gudbaa xadka magaalada marka 5% ilaa 95% dadkiisu magaalada ku nool yihiin.`},election_day:{term:`Warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada`,definition:`Warqadaha codbixinta ee goob codbixineed lagu dhiibto maalinta doorashada. Elections Alberta waxay u soo sheegtaa aag codbixineed kasta, sidaa darteed hubintu way ogtahay halka laga dhiibtay.`},all_ballots:{term:`Dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta`,definition:`Warqad kasta oo codbixineed oo 2023, oo ay ku jiraan codadka hore: kuwa horay loo dhiibto, kuwa guurguura iyo kuwa gaarka ah, iyo Vote Anywhere. Qiyaastii kala badh lama dhiibin maalinta doorashada, kuwaasna waxa loo soo sheegaa oo keliya riding kasta oo hore. Sidaa darteed halka ay ka galaan riding cusub gudihiisa waa qiyaas. Xeerka la diiwaangeliyay wuxuu u kala firdhiyaa si la jaan qaadaysa codadka maalinta doorashada. Xeer cusub, xeerka P, oo aan weli la qaadan, wuxuu dhigaa oo keliya dadka aan codeynin maalinta doorashada dhexdooda, isagoo adeegsanaya xogta Alberta oo keliya. Tan iyo 7 Noofembar 2026, imtixaan kasta oo cod ku salaysan wuxuu adeegsadaa dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, natiijooyinka maalinta doorashadana dhinacooda ayaa lagu hayaa. Isbeddelkaas <strong>ma ahayn mid indha la'</strong>: waxa la sameeyay ka dib markii qaar ka mid ah natiijooyinka dhammaan warqadaha la arkay.`},reconstruction:{term:`Dib-u-dhis`,definition:`Khadadka khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, oo laga dib u dhisay bogagga warbixinteeda, maxaa yeelay faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidadda weli dadweynaha looma bandhigin. Labadeedii hubin ee saxnaanta ee ugu horreeyay way ku dhaceen: 49.0%, kadibna 13.8% aagagga codbixinta ayaa la geliyay riding khaldan, marka loo eego xad 10% ah. Hubintii saddexaad way gudubtay, laakiin oo keliya sidii socod dib-u-soo-celin ah oo lagu sameeyay bogag horay loo arkay, ma aha imtixaan cusub oo saxnaanta ah. Sidaa darteed natiijo kasta oo khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta ah waa <strong>ku-meel-gaadh</strong>: way isbeddeli kartaa marka faylasha rasmiga ah la soo saaro. Kursi waa <strong>mid aad u dhow oo aan la go'aamin karin</strong> marka farqiga guushiisu ka yar yahay codadka aagagga codbixinta ee uu khad kala duwani dhex maro.`}},home:{hero:{h1:`Khariidadda Doorashada Alberta, oo la Hubiyay`,subtitle:`Khariidad doorasho oo cusub oo Alberta loo soo jeediyay, oo leh 91 riding, ayaa hor taal Golaha Sharci-dejinta. Waan hubiyay, iyo labada khariidadood ee ka horreeyay, anigoo adeegsanaya imtixaanno aan horay u qoray.`,status:`Halka ay arrimuhu marayaan. Guddi talo-bixineed ayaa sawiray khariidadda cusub. Guddi ka kooban lix MLA ayaa u diray Golaha Sharci-dejinta Isniintii, 2 Noofembar 2026. Waxay sharci noqonaysaa oo keliya haddii MLA-yadu ansixiyaan hindise sharci. Natiijooyinkayga ku saabsan waa ku-meel-gaadh, maxaa yeelay faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidadda weli dadweynaha looma bandhigin. Faylashaas waan dhibcayn doonaa 72 saacadood gudahood marka la soo saaro.`,week:`<strong>Toddobaadkan.</strong> Xeerarka go'aaminaya xukunka Noofembar waxa qoraal lagu dejiyay Juun 2026, <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/preregistration/november_2026_scoring_spec.md" rel="noopener">taariikhdoodana waxaad ka arki kartaa kaydka mashruuca</a>. Saddex imtixaan oo dhinac ah iyo doorashada kooxda barbardhigga waxa lagu daray 29–31 Oktoobar, ka dib markii MLA-yada mucaaradku ay qaybo ka mid ah khariidadda ku sharraxeen kulan guddi. Toddoba wax-ka-beddel ayaa la raaciyay 2–7 Noofembar, ka dib markii warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta la soo bandhigay; saddexda ugu dambeeya waxa la qoray ka dib markii natiijooyinka la arkay. Dhibcaha ku-meel-gaadhka ahi waxay ku jiraan qaybta Noofembar ee hoose. Hubinta koowaad waa marka la barbar dhigo talada keliya ee dawladdu soo xigatay: <a href="#recommendation-5">Talada 5</a>.`},happened:{h:`Labada khariidadood ee guddida`,p1:`Alberta mar mar ayay dib u sawirtaa riding-yadeeda. Riding waa aagga doorta hal MLA. Halka khadadku ku dhacaan ayaa go'aamin kara cidda guulaysata. Saddex hay'adood ayaa gacanta ku hayay khariidadda cusub, sidan u kala horreysa: guddida, guddiga iyo guddida talo-bixinta.`,p2:`<strong>Guddida.</strong> Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada ee madax-bannaan waxay leedahay guddoomiye, oo garsoore ah, iyo afar xubnood: laba uu soo jeediyay Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu iyo laba uu soo jeediyay Mucaaradku. 23 Maarso 2026 waxay u kala qaybsantay 3 iyo 2. Guddoomiyaha iyo labada xubnood ee Mucaaradku soo jeediyay ayaa saxeexay khariidadda inta badan. Labada xubnood ee Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu soo jeediyay ayaa saxeexay khariidadda inta yar (<a href="https://www.assembly.ab.ca/about/news-and-announcements/2025/03/28/electoral-boundaries-commission-to-soon-begin-consultations" rel="noopener">Legislative Assembly of Alberta, 28 Maarso 2025</a>). Labada khariidadoodba waxay waafaqsan yihiin xeerarka tirada ee Sharciga. Inta badan waxay ku doodday in khariidadda inta yar ay u badan tahay inay ku dhacdo imtixaanka Charter-ka; maxkamadna weli go'aan kama gaadhin.`,p3:`Khariidadda inta badan waxay u eg tahay waxa sawir aan ujeeddo lahayni soo saaro. Cabbirrada codadka adeegsada, khariidadda inta yar sidaas uma eka. Labada qodob ee hore waxay khariidadaha isu barbar dhigaan; labada dambe waxay adeegsadaan codad.`,li1:`Khariidadda inta yar waxay Airdrie u qaybisaa afar. Airdrie East marka laga reebo, dadka Airdrie waa laga tiro badan yahay riding kasta oo ay ku dhacaan.`,li2:`Waxay weynaysaa riding-yada waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary, sidaa darteed cod kasta oo halkaas ahi wax yar ayuu ka miisaan yar yahay.`,li3:`Codka si sax ah 50-50 ugu kala qaybi, waxayna UCP siisaa 46 ka mid ah 89-keeda kursi (51.7%): inta badan kursiyada iyadoo aan la helin inta badan codadka. Oo keliya 69 ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray ayaa wax ka badan siiya, dhammaan 69-kuna waxay siiyaan 45 ka mid ah 87 (51.72%), waxyar ka sarreeya.`,li4:`Dib u ciyaar doorashadii 2023 adigoo adeegsanaya warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada, khariidadda inta yarna waxay UCP siisaa 60 ka mid ah 89 kursi; khariidadda inta badan, 55. Tiri dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, tirinta la diiwaangeliyayna waa 55 iyo 48. Hab cusub oo codadka hore lagu dhigo, xeerka P, wuxuu bixiyaa 57 iyo 48. Xeerka P weli lama qaadan, labada tirinoodba qayb ahaan waa qiyaas, maxaa yeelay codadka hore waa in la dhigaa riding-yada cusub gudahooda.`,p4:`<strong>Guddiga.</strong> Golaha Sharci-dejintu midna ma qaadan. Taa beddelkeeda shaqada wuxuu u dhiibay guddi MLA-yo ah.`,box_h:`Waxa aan dhihi karo, iyo waxa aanan dhihi karin`,can1:`Waxaan odhan karaa khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu aad bay uga fog tahay xadka khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Afar cabbir oo caddaalad oo la isku daray, midna 1,010,000-ka kama fogaado sidaas oo kale xagga UCP; nooc darajo ku salaysan, toddoba ayaa sidaas ah. Mid mid, saddex ka mid ah afarta ayaa dhiga cidhifka fog (warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada).`,can2:`Afartaas cabbir oo dhammu isla jihada ayay u janjeeraan, xagga UCP.`,cant1:`In mid ka mid ah xubnaha guddida uu ula jeeday inuu tan sameeyo. Imtixaannadaydu waxay cabbiraan waxa khariidaddu sameyso. Ma muujin karaan ujeeddo.`,cant2:`In dawladdu amartay xubnihii ay magacawday. Ma helin wax caddayn ah oo isku-dubbarid ah. Qof magacaabiddiisu caddayn uma aha.`,cant3:`In qaabkani soo laaban doono. Khariidadda leh marna lama dhaqan gelin, natiijooyinka ku-meel-gaadhka ahna khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu ma soo celiso.`,cant4:`Sida maxkamadi u xukumi lahayd, ama waxa Goluhu meel marin doono.`,p5:`<strong>Ku saabsan ereyga.</strong> Gerrymandering waa in khadad loo sawiro si xisbi faa'iido loo siiyo. Sharciga Kanada ma laha dambi magacaas leh, sidaa darteed maxkamadna go'aan kama gaadhayso gerrymandering sideeda. Taasi macnaheedu ma aha inaanay halkan ka dhici karin. Waxaan cabbiraa waxa khariidaduhu sameeyaan; midkoodna uguma yeedho gerrymander.`,p6:`<strong>Akhrinta khariidadda jaldiga.</strong> Mid kasta oo ka mid ah 4,765-ta aag codbixineed ee Alberta waxa loo midabeeyay codkiisii 2023: liin-dhanaan NDP, buluug UCP. Midabku wuu qotodheer yahay oo keliya meelaha dad badani ku nool yihiin, sidaa darteed aagagga ballaadhan ee madhan way cirro yihiin. Dhulka aan lahayn goob codbixineed iyo codbixiye la diiwaangeliyay waa cad. Khadadku waa 89-ka riding ee ay soo jeedisay inta yar ee guddidu. <a href="__BASE__/explorer">Fur baadhaha khariidadda</a> si aad khariidadaha u kala beddesho.`},does:{h:`Waxa khariidadda inta yar sameyso`,p1:`Labada khariidadood ee guddida waxay ku heshiiyaan Alberta badankeeda. Halka ay ku kala duwan yihiin, halkan waxa ku qoran waxa khariidadda inta yar dooratay, iyo waxa doorasho kastaa sameyso.`,h3_1:`Hal magaalo, afar degmo`,p2:`<strong>Airdrie.</strong> Airdrie waxay leedahay 85,805 qof (tirakoobka degmada 2024) iyo hal golaha magaalo. Sharcigu riding kasta wuxuu ku xaddidaa hal iyo rubuc jeer celceliska gobolka, sidaa darteed Airdrie waxay u baahan tahay ugu yaraan laba riding. Khariidadda inta badan waxay siisaa laba.`,p3:`Khariidadda inta yar waxay siisaa afar. Airdrie East waxay qaadataa in ka badan kala badh magaalada. Inta badan inta hadhay waxay u tagtaa laba riding oo Calgary lala wadaago, halkaas oo dadka Calgary ka tiro badan yihiin kuwa Airdrie; qiyaastii 350 qof waxay u tagaan riding miyi ah. In bulsho si khafiif ah loo kala jeexo ilaa aanay go'aamin karin wax kursi ah waxa loo yaqaan jeexitaan. Imtixaankayga jeexitaanka goor dambe ayaa lagu daray: xeerarkiisa waxaan ku qoray isla fadhigii aan markii ugu horreysay socodsiiyay. Wuxuu u baahan yahay in dadka Airdrie laga tiro badnaado qayb kasta. Airdrie East taas way ka dhacdaa, sidaa darteed xeerka imtixaanka laftiisa, tani ma aha jeexitaan. Kala-qaybinta labada-dhinac ee khariidadda inta badan sidoo kale ma aha jeexitaan.`,p4:`Khariidadda inta yar, imtixaanku ma calaamadeeyo magaalada oo dhan. Laakiin qaybta Airdrie ee ka baxsan Airdrie East, qiyaastii 45% magaalada, waa laga badan yahay degmo kasta oo ay ku dhacdo, taasina waa waxa jeexitaanku qeexo. Imtixaan la diiwaangeliyay midna ma qiimeeyo qaybtaas keligeed. Airdrie waxay yeelan lahayd afar MLA. Codbixiyayaasha dooranaya saddex ka mid ah badankoodu waxay ku nool yihiin meel ka baxsan Airdrie.`,h3_2:`Degmooyin ka weyn oo ku yaal waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary`,p5:`<strong>Waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary.</strong> Toddoba iyo tobanka riding ee khariidadda inta yar ee halkan celcelis ahaan waxay leeyihiin 11.5% dad ka badan celceliska gobolka; kuwa khariidadda inta badan, 2.8%. (Akhris erey-ereyeed ah oo ku saabsan sida aagga loo qeexay, 8.5% ilaa 8.9% marka loo eego 1.3% ilaa 1.6%. Liiska aagga markii hore waxa loo qoray riding-yo NDP ku tartami karto iyo kuwo UCP xukunto, markii dambena waxa lagu sharraxay juquraafi, isla riding-yadii.) Riding weyni wuxuu ka dhigan yahay in cod kastaa ka miisaan yar yahay. Codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi oo lagu cufo guulo yar oo hal dhinac u janjeedha waxa loo yaqaan urursi, laakiin imtixaankayga urursiga, oo isna lagu qoray isla fadhigii markii ugu horreysay la socodsiiyay, ma helo: NDP waxay ku guulaysataa siddeed ka mid ah toddoba iyo tobanka farqi ka hooseeya celceliska gobolka.`,h3_3:`Degmooyin ka sii fog cabbirka siman`,p6:`<strong>Kala firdhinta dadka.</strong> Tirada dadka oo isku le'eg ayaa ah qiimaha keliya ee sharcigu tiro ku dhejiyo. Shaxaha guddida laftooda, riding-yada khariidadda inta yar celcelis ahaan waxay ka maqan yihiin cabbirka ku habboon 4,707 qof, kuwa inta badanna 3,180. Tirooyinka tirakoobka 2021 celcelisyadu way isku dhow yihiin, laakiin riding-ka dhexe ee khariidadda inta yar weli wuu sii fog yahay (3,938 marka loo eego 2,827). Tirooyinka guddidu laftigeedu adeegsatay, difaaca ah in khadad aan caadi ahayn loo baahnaa si dadka loo isku dheellitiro halkan ma shaqeeyo.`,h3_4:`Dabo miyi ah oo ku xidhan degmooyin magaalo`,p7:`Si kastaba ha ahaatee, ma odhanayo Alberta miyiga ahi waxay leedahay kursiyo aad u badan. Sharcigu wuxuu u oggolaanayaa dadka degmooyinka inay ku kala duwanaadaan ilaa 25%, si aanu hal MLA oo miyi ahi u daboolin aag le'eg koonfurta Faransiiska. Labada khariidadoodba waxay isticmaalaan bannaankaas.`,p8:`<strong>Riding-yada isku-dhafka ah</strong> waxay ku xidhaan qayb magaalo ah aagag miyi ah. Haddii riding loo tiriyo isku-dhaf marka 5% ilaa 95% dadkiisu magaalada ku nool yihiin, khariidadda inta yar waxay ku leedahay lix xadka Calgary, khariidadda inta badanna midna.`,h3_5:`Saddex xudduudood oo inta badani tilmaantay`,p9:`Inta badan ee guddida, oo uu ku jiro guddoomiyuhu, waxay afar ka mid ah xudduudaha inta yar u calaamadeeyeen inay juquraafi ahaan yihiin kuwo aan caadi ahayn, oo ay ka mid yihiin saddexdan:`,li1:`fidinta Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park ee gelaysa dhul beer qaran oo aan cidi ku noolayn;`,li2:`marinka u qaabaysan xadhig-qabad ee Calgary-Nolan Hill–Cochrane;`,li3:`gaadhitaanka Olds–Three Hills–Didsbury ee gelaysa waqooyiga Airdrie.`,p10:`Calaamaduhu waxay ka yimaadeen jawaabta inta badani siisay inta yar, sidaa darteed waxaad filan lahayd inay dhaleeceeyaan inta yar oo keliya. Sidaa darteed afartaba laftayda ayaan ku hubiyay khariidadaha la daabacay, saddex ka mid ahna way adkaysteen.`,p11:`Inta badani fidinta beerta waxay ugu yeedhay "isku day niyad xun" oo lagu sheeganayo ilaalin dadeed, qaybta 15(2), oo loo qoray bulshooyin fog oo dad dhab ahi ku nool yihiin. Hubintaydu way wiiqaysaa eedeyntaas: qaybtu waxay u qalantaa s.15(2) xitaa iyadoon fidintu jirin. Magaalada Banff waa su'aal gaar ah: in lala dhigo Canmore macno ayay samaynaysaa sidii bulsho dan wadaagta, maxaa yeelay magaaladu waxay ku taal gudaha beer qaran oo aanay ku fidi karin. Diidmadeeda ku saabsan fidinta beerta madhan weli way taagan tahay. Meesha magaalada la dhigay wax saamayn ah kuma laha.`,h3_6:`Faa'iidada kursiyada`,p12:`Codka gobolka oo dhan si siman u kala qaybi, kanna waa saamiga kursiyada UCP ee khariidad kasta:`,li4:`khariidadda dhexdhexaadka ah ee dhexe (median) waxay siisaa 44.8%, wax ka yar qayb siman, sabab hoos lagu sharraxay;`,li5:`khariidadda inta badan waxay siisaa 46.1%, boqolleyda 78aad;`,li6:`khariidadda inta yar waxay siisaa 51.7% (46 ka mid ah 89), boqolleyda 99.99aad. 69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa ka badan, dhammaantoodna waxay leeyihiin 45 ka mid ah 87 kursi (51.72%), wax yar oo timo la eg ka sarreeya.`,p13:`<strong>Kursiyada.</strong> Warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023, iyadoo riding kasta isla qadar loo dhaqaajinayo, khariidadda inta yar waxay UCP ku haysaa 45-ka kursi ee ay inta badan ugu baahan tahay xitaa haddii saamigeeda codka UCP iyo NDP hoos ugu dhaco qiyaastii 49.2%. Khariidadda inta badan waxay u baahan lahayd inay codkaas ku guulaysato qiyaastii 9 dhibcood.`,p14:`Cabbirka inta badani ma muhiim baa? Warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023, khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu waxay UCP siisaa 60 ka mid ah 89 kursi, inta badan saddex-meelood-laba ah. Dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta ee 2023, tirinta la diiwaangeliyay waxay bixisaa 55, taas oo aan ahayn. Xeer cusub oo codadka hore lagu dhigo, oo aan weli la qaadan, wuxuu bixiyaa 57, oo isna ka gaaban saddex-meelood-laba. (Halka codadka hore ka galaan riding-yada cusub gudahooda waa qiyaas.) Alberta, saddex-meelood-laba ma furto awood gaar ah. Goluhu su'aal kasta wuxuu ku go'aamiyaa inta badan fudud ee codadka la dhiibtay. Inta badan fudud ayaa horeba u ansixin karta sharciyada iyo miisaaniyadaha. Waxay xad waqti saari kartaa doodda, beddeli kartaa xeerarka Golaha, oo dejin kartaa xubinnimada guddi kasta, taas oo xeerarku u hayaan si la jaan qaadaysa kursiyada. Caadooyinka, xeerarka aan qornayn ee siyaasadda, sidoo kale uma baahna inta badan weyn: inta badan fudud ayaa dhinac iska dhigtay dhaqankii ahaa in khariidadda loo daayo guddi madax-bannaan. Inta badan cabbirkaas leh waxay dawladda siin lahayd barkin. MLA-yo yar oo dhinaca kale u gudba ma khatarayn karaan. Mucaarad ka yarina wuxuu yeelan lahaa xubno ka yar oo ku sii wada shaqada guddiyada.`,p15:`Maxkamaduhu dib uma eegaan sharci inta la samaynayo. Marka khariidad cusubi sharci noqoto, qof ayaa maxkamad kaga hor iman kara. Waxay la kulmi lahayd isla imtixaanka khariidad kasta: matalaad waxtar leh, iyadoo farqi kasta oo dadka ah la caddeeyo. Sida aan sharciga u akhriyo, Kanada ma laha xeer ka dhan ah faa'iidada xisbiyeed sideeda. Su'aashu waa in codbixiyayaashu helaan matalaad waxtar leh. Khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu waxay muujisaa inta ay labadaasi kala fogaan karaan. Midna doorashooyinkeeda ma jebiyo xeerarka tirada ee Sharciga, Sharciguna wuu oggol yahay kala qaybinta magaalooyinka. Inta badan ee guddidu waxay ku doodday in khariidaddu u badan tahay inay ku dhacdo imtixaanka Charter-ka. Maxkamadna go'aan kama gaadhin.`},law:{h:`Waxa sharcigu dalbado, iyo waxa uusan dalban`,h3_1:`Sida khariidad loo sameeyo sidoo kale way muhiim noqon kartaa`,p1:`Qodobka 3 ee Charter-ka wuxuu muwaadin kasta siiyaa xaqa codbixinta. Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay u akhridaa xaq loo leeyahay matalaad waxtar leh: codad miisaan ahaan qiyaas ahaan isku le'eg, iyadoo meel loo dhaafayo sababo dhab ah sida juquraafiga ama bulshada, inta farqi kasta la caddeeyo. Sharciga Kanada ma laha xeer ka dhan ah faa'iidada xisbiyeed sideeda.`,p2:`Dawlad ma dami karto xaqan. Qodobka notwithstanding wuxuu golaha sharci-dejinta u oggolaadaa inuu xuquuqda Charter-ka qaar muddo dhinac iska dhigo. Kuma khusayso qodobka 3.`,p3:`Maxkamaduhu sidoo kale way eegeen sida khariidad loo sameeyo. 2017 Maxkamadda Rafcaanka ee Nova Scotia waxay ogaatay in khariidadda gobolku jebisay qodobka 3. Dawladdu waxay guddideeda madax-bannaan u sheegtay inay jihada beddesho, sidaa darteed khariidadda kama dambaysta ahi ma muujin aragtida guddida laftigeeda. Maxkamaddu waxay ku dartay in golaha sharci-dejintu weli laftiisu sawiri karo khariidad.`,p4:`2026 Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay buriisay sharci Quebec ah oo hakiyay guddida Quebec si loo ilaaliyo riding-yada Gaspésie (<em>Quebec (AG) v. Lalande</em>, 2026 SCC 13, go'aan 7 iyo 2 ah, sababaha 1 Maajo). Quebec waxay riding-yadaas ku ilaalin kartay hab ka cidhiidhi ah. Sharcigu wuxuu ku ansaxay cod aan cidi diidin. Taasi ma badbaadin. 12 Juun 2026, Golaha Qaranka ee Quebec wuxuu ansixiyay khariidaddiisa 127-kursi ah.`,h3_2:`Xeerarka si kooban`,p5:`Sharcigu xeerarkan ayuu u dejiyaa guddida:`,li1:`<strong>Cidda fadhida.</strong> Guddoomiye ay golaha wasiirradu ka doortaan liis doorar u qalma oo ay ku jiraan garsoorayaal. Afar xubnood oo aan MLA ahayn, oo uu magacaabo Guddoomiyaha Golaha: laba uu soo jeediyay Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu iyo laba uu soo jeediyay Mucaaradku.`,li2:`<strong>Dhageysiyo.</strong> Dhageysiyo dadweyne ka hor iyo ka dib khariidadda qabyada ah.`,li3:`<strong>Waqtiyada kama-dambaysta ah.</strong> Khariidad qabyo ah toddoba bilood gudahood, iyo warbixin kama dambays ah shan bilood gudahood intaas ka dib.`,li4:`<strong>Kursiyada.</strong> 91. Sharcigu wuxuu lahaa 89 markii guddidu sawirtay khariidadaheeda. Hindisaha Sharciga 32, oo la soo bandhigay 23 Abriil 2026, ayaa tirada u kordhiyay 91.`,li5:`<strong>Dadka.</strong> Riding kastaa wuxuu ku jiraa 25% celceliska. Ilaa afar riding oo fog ayaa hoos ugu dhici kara 50% ka hooseeya celceliska, haddii guddidu ogaato in ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah shan imtixaan la buuxiyay. Labada xeerba hoos ayaa lagu sharxay.`,li6:`<strong>Arrimaha.</strong> Guddidu waa inay tixgeliso matalaadda waxtarka leh. Waxay sidoo kale miisaami kartaa koritaanka, bulshooyinka danta wadaaga, juquraafiga iyo arrimo kale.`,p6:`Labada khariidadood ee guddidu waxay ku jiraan xeerarkan gudahooda. Laba ka mid ah xeerarka ayaa u baahan eegis dhow: xadka dadka, iyo ka-reebista riding-yada fog.`,h3_3:`Waxa aanu sharcigu u baahnayn`,p7:`Inta badan xeerarka Sharciga waxa loo jeediyay "Guddida". Si caadi ah haddii loo akhriyo, kuma xidhna Golaha Sharci-dejinta ama guddi MLA-yo ah. 21 Abriil 2026, Mooshinka Dawladda 37 ayaa labada khariidadood ee guddida dhinac iska dhigay. Shaqada wuxuu u dhiibay guddi ka kooban lix MLA, afar ka mid ah xisbiga xukunka haya, kaas oo ay ahayd inuu warbixin keeno 2 Noofembar 2026. Guddigu kadib wuxuu magacaabay guddi talo-bixineed si ay khariidadda u sawirto. Mooshinku wuxuu guddida talo-bixinta siiyay xeerarka dadka ee Sharciga iyo liiskiisa arrimaha, ku dhowaad erey-erey: xadka 25%, ka-reebista ilaa afar riding oo fog, iyo matalaadda waxtarka leh marka hore. Dhegaysiyada wuu ka tagay. Dib-u-eegistu waxay ahayd in la dedejiyo, taas oo macnaheedu yahay si degdeg ah loo sameeyo, iyadoo aan loo baahnayn in la qabto dhegaysiyo dadweyne (Votes and Proceedings, 21 Abriil 2026).`,li7:`Golaha Sharci-dejintu kuma qasbana inuu qaato khariidadda guddida. Khariidaddu waxay sharci noqotaa oo keliya haddii MLA-yadu ansixiyaan hindise sharci.`,li8:`Ma helin qodob ku waajibinaya guddi MLA-yo ah inuu qabto dhegaysiyo, noqdo madax-bannaan, daabaco qabyo, ama sharraxo doorashooyinkiisa.`,li9:`Talada 5, talada keliya ee dawladdu soo xigatay, cidna kuma xidhna.`,li10:`Elections Alberta waxay sheegtaa inay u baahan tahay ugu yaraan sannad iyo badh si ay ugu diyaargarowdo riding-yo cusub. Taasi waa baahi qorshayn. Ma jiro sharci ka dhigaya waqti kama dambays ah.`,li11:`Maxkamaduhu dib uma eegaan sharci inta la samaynayo. Dacwad waxay iman kartaa oo keliya ka dib marka sharci xudduudeed la meel mariyo.`,h3_4:`Waxa dhacay 1992`,p8:`1992 guddida Alberta way heshiin kari waysay. Warbixinteeda kama dambaysta ahi waxay ahayd shan warbixinood oo kala gooni ah, mid ka timid guddi-xubin kasta. Luulyo 1992 Goluhu wuxuu ansixiyay Mooshinka 24 oo shaqada u dhiibay Guddi Gaar ah oo MLA-yo ah oo uu guddoominayay Bob Bogle. Mucaaradku wuu diiday inuu xubno magacaabo, sidaa darteed afar MLA oo Progressive Conservative ah ayaa sawiray khariidadda. Alberta waxay ku codeysay doorashadii 1993. Guddidii 2026 kuma xayirmin. Inta badan ayaa saxeexday warbixinteeda, haddana warbixinta dhinac ayaa la iska dhigay.`,p9:`1994 Maxkamadda Rafcaanku waxay u oggolaatay khariidaddii 1992 inay sii jirto. Warbixinta guddidii 2026 waxay sheegtaa in maxkamaddu ogaatay in khariidaddu aanay gaadhin heerka cambaaraynta Charter-ka, laakiin ay ugu baaqday isbeddel “tartiib ah oo joogto ah” (warbixinta kama dambaysta, Lifaaqa D, b. 282). Xisaabaadyo kale oo la daabacay waxay ku daraan in maxkamaddu dhaleecaysay sida khariidadda loo sameeyay. Xubnaha guddigu ma sharxi karin dhowr ka mid ah xudduudaheeda. Mid ka mid ah riding-yada ugu yaryar wuxuu ahaa kii Bogle laftiisa. Dib-u-eegis habboonna waa loo baahnaa ka hor inta muddada Golaha Sharci-dejintu dhammaan. Go'aanka laftiisa ma akhrin. 1995 Golaha Sharci-dejintu wuxuu wax ka beddelay Sharciga oo beddelay sida guddiyada loo magacaabo. Alberta waxay habkaas isticmaashay tan iyo markaas ilaa 2026.`,h3_5:`Haddii khariidadda cusub laga hor yimaado`,p10:`Marka khariidad cusubi sharci noqoto, maxkamad ayaa lagaga hor iman karaa isla imtixaankaas: matalaad waxtar leh, iyadoo farqi kasta oo dadka ah la caddeeyo. Sababuhu way muhiim yihiin. Waxaan dhibceeyaa khariidadda iyo habraaca. In ay dastuuri tahay iyo in kale waxa sheegaya maxkamad.`},system:{h:`Cidda sawirtay khariidadaha`,p1:`Guddidu waxay ka shaqaysay si dadweyne ah. Waxay dhegaysiyo ku qabatay lix iyo toban bulshadood waxayna heshay 1,345 gudbin qoraal ah. Markii dad badani codsadeen (warbixinta inta yar waxay tirisaa ugu yaraan 56), waxay ka tagtay qorshaheedii ahaa in meesha laga saaro riding-ka Lesser Slave Lake.`,p2:`Afar toddobaad ka dib kala qaybsanaanta, Mooshinka Dawladda 37 (ogeysiis la bixiyay 16 Abriil; la soo jeediyay, laga dooday oo la ansixiyay 21 Abriil) ayaa abuuray Guddiga Gaarka ah ee Xudduudaha Doorashada, oo leh lix MLA:`,li1:`afar UCP: Brandon Lunty (guddoomiye), de Jonge, Sawyer iyo Wiebe;`,li2:`laba NDP: Ganley iyo Gray.`,p3:`<strong>Guddida talo-bixinta.</strong> Guddigu wuxuu magacaabay Guddi Madax-bannaan oo Talo-bixin ah si ay u sawirto khariidad 91-kursi ah. Guddoomiyaheedu waa garsoorihii hawlgabka ahaa ee Maxkamadda Rafcaanka Brian O'Ferrall, oo uu soo jeediyay Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu. Xubnaheedu waa Sharafta leh Monte Solberg iyo Darwin Durnie, oo uu soo jeediyay Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu, iyo Dr. Gerard Kennedy iyo Brent Robinson, oo uu soo jeediyay Mucaaradku (warbixinta guddiga, b. 9). Guddida talo-bixintu iyaduna way kala qaybsantay: inta yar ee ka mid ahi waxay soo bandhigtay khariidad beddel ah. Guddida talo-bixintu talo oo keliya ayay bixisaa. MLA-yada ayaa go'aamiya.`,p4:`Ka hor intaan guddoomiyaha guddida talo-bixinta la magacaabin, guddoomiyaha garsoorka ee ku-meel-gaadhka ah ee Alberta ayaa warqad u qortay guddiga, 6 Maajo 2026. Iyadoo la eegayo "habdhaqanka aan caadiga ahayn ee habraacan", ayay tidhi, maxkamaduhu ma faafin doonaan codsigiisa garsoore, mana bixin doonaan wax ra'yi ah oo ku saabsan doorashada guddoomiyaha. Waxay ku dartay in tani aanay xukun ku ahayn sharciga. Laanta Alberta ee Ururka Qareennada Kanada (Canadian Bar Association) ayaa kadib iyaduna diiday. Labada warqadoodba waxa lagu soo celiyay qaybta xubnaha Mucaaradka ee warbixinta guddiga (bb. 15–16). Guddida talo-bixintu talo oo keliya ayay bixisaa. MLA-yada guddigu waxay dib u eegaan warbixinteeda oo u diraan Golaha, halkaas oo MLA-yadu go'aamiyaan. Kulankii guddiga ee 28 Oktoobar, xubnihiisa UCP waxay u codeeyeen 3–2 in dib-u-eegista warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta la joojiyo ka hor inta aan mooshinnada NDP ee ku saabsan la tixgelin. Waxay sidoo kale u codeeyeen 3–2 ka soo horjeedka mooshin NDP oo ahaa in la shaaciyo waxa guddida talo-bixinta iyo la-taliyayaasheeda la siiyay (<a href="https://docs.assembly.ab.ca/LADDAR_files/docs/committees/ceb/legislature_31/session_2/20261028_1030_01_ceb.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">qoraalka kulanka guddiga</a>, bb. CEB-73 iyo CEB-74). Guddigu wuxuu diiday mooshin NDP oo ahaa in la daabaco cidda guddida talo-bixintu la tashatay. Xubin UCP ah ayaa soo xigatay talo sharci oo mudnaan leh iyo madax-bannaanida guddida talo-bixinta (b. CEB-75). Guddigu kulan kale ma qabanin. Waxay ahayd inuu warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta u diro Golaha ka hor 2 Noofembar.`,p5:`Maajo, Duane Bratt, Borofisar Cilmiga Siyaasadda ee Mount Royal University, wuxuu ii sheegay in habraacu aanu Kanada tusaale hore ku lahayn. Wuu saxsan yahay. Waxa dhacay 1992 ma aha isla arrintan.`,p6:`1992 guddidu way heshiin kari waysay. Shan xubnood ayaa gudbiyay shan warbixinood, midkoodna aqlabiyad ma lahayn. 2026 aqlabiyad ayaa saxeexday mid, Sharcigana warbixinta inta badan waa warbixinta guddida. Mooshinka Dawladda 37 si kastaba wuu dhinac iska dhigay. Taasi waa qaybta aan tusaale hore lahayn.`,p7:`Golaha dhexdiisa, dawladdu waxay jidkeeda u soo bandhigtay inuu raacayo guddida: "Waxaan qaadanaynaa talooyinka warbixinta" (Hoggaamiyaha Golaha ee Dawladda, Hansard, 16 Abriil 2026). Mucaaradku wuxuu ugu yeedhay "aargoosi ka dhan ah [Guddida Xudduudaha] Doorashada ee madax-bannaan." Warbixinta laftigeedu si buuxda uma taageerto sheegashada dawladda. Aqlabiyaddu way sheegtay in laba kursi oo dheeri ahi ay siin lahaayeen matalaad waxtar badan (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, b. 58), Talada 5 laftigeeduna waxay sheegaysaa in isbeddelkeeda “loo baahan doono inuu daraaso Guddi Gaar ah oo Xulan oo ay xisbiyada oo dhammi ku jiraan ama Guddi Sharci-dejin oo kale oo u dhigma” (b. 66). Laakiin aqlabiyaddu waxay Golaha Sharci-dejinta ka codsatay inuu qaato khariidaddeeda 89-ka kursi. Talada keliya ee soo jeedisay 91 kursi hadda waxay ka timid guddoomiyaha oo keliya.`,p8:`Sida aan Sharciga u akhriyo, waxba kuma jiraan oo mamnuucaya tallaabooyinkan, maxkamadna go'aan kama gaadhin. Laakiin markan MLA-yada kormeeraya khariidadda ayaa iyana ku tartami doona. Dawlad mustaqbalka ah oo xisbi kasta ahna tan waxay u tilmaami kartaa tusaale hore.`,h3_1:`Talada 5: tan ay dawladdu soo xigatay`,p9:`Si ay u caddayso in shaqada guddi loo dhiibo, dawladdu waxay soo xigatay hal talo oo ku jirta warbixinta guddida: Talada 5. Guddoomiyaha guddida, Garsoore Dallas Miller, keligiis ayaa qoray, isagoo ku daray lifaaq warbixinta inta badan. Wuxuu ahaa "si macquul ah u hubaal" in 91 kursi, riding ka baxsan Edmonton iyo Calgary aan la waayi doonin. Wuxuu ku daray: "Asxaabtayda inta badan igama oggola qodobkan. Taasi waa sababta aan keligay u ahay kan talada bixinaya" (warbixinta kama dambaysta, b. 66). Wuxuu sidoo kale sheegay sababta uu u qoray: waxay "loo diyaariyay ujeeddo cad oo ah in Golaha Sharci-dejinta laga reebo inuu aqbalo warbixinta inta yar." Sidaa darteed waxay ahayd waxa ugu horreeyay ee aan khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta ku hubiyay. Natiijada qayb kasta waa hoos.`,p10:`Waa beddel, oo cidhiidhi ah. Inta badan ee guddidu waxay meesha ka saartay laba riding oo ka baxsan Edmonton iyo Calgary. Haddii Golaha Sharci-dejintu aanu taas aqbalin, guddoomiyuhu wuxuu ka codsaday inuu <em>Electoral Divisions Act</em> ka beddelo 89 kursi una beddelo 91, soo celiyo labadaas riding, oo uu hayo "inta kale ee gobolka sida aan soo jeedinno" (khariidadda inta badan) "inta suurtagalka ah." Soo celinta labada riding waa inay:`,li3:`<strong>(a) Ka tagto Airdrie iyo koonfurta.</strong> Ha beddelin riding Airdrie ku jira, iyo mid leh dhul ka koonfureeya xadka koonfureed ee magaalada Airdrie, marka laga reebo Drumheller-Stettler. Khariidadda inta badan taasi waa 41 riding: labada kursi ee Airdrie, dhammaan 28-ka kursi ee Calgary, iyo 11-ka riding ee ku wareegsan iyo ka koonfureeya Calgary. <strong>Natiijada: lama buuxin.</strong> Khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay beddeshaa 10 ka mid ah 41. Magacyadooda khariidadda inta badan, waa Calgary-Bow, Calgary-West-Elbow Valley, Canmore-Banff, Cochrane-Springbank, High River-Vulcan-Siksika, Lethbridge-East, Lethbridge-West, Livingstone-Macleod, Okotoks-Diamond Valley iyo Taber-Cardston.`,li4:`<strong>(b) Ka tagto waqooyiga Edmonton.</strong> Ha beddelin riding Edmonton ah oo ka waqooyi xiga Webiga North Saskatchewan: 11 riding khariidadda inta badan. <strong>Natiijada: waa la buuxiyay.</strong> Dhammaan 11-ku isma beddelin.`,li5:`<strong>(c) Dib u celiso koonfurta Edmonton.</strong> Riding kasta oo Edmonton ah oo ka koonfureeya webiga wuxuu ku noqdaa khariidadda qabyada ah ee guddida ee Oktoobar 2025, tii ay u daabacday faallo ka hor kala qaybsanaanta kama dambaysta ah. Guddigu wuxuu Nisku ku dari karaa Edmonton-South East haddii uu rabo in Leduc iyo Beaumont dib hal riding ugu jiraan. Taasi waa 10 riding. <strong>Natiijada: lama dhibcayn.</strong> Hubintaydu waxay u baahan tahay khadadka khariidadda qabyada ah, faylna oo iyaga ah ma jiro. Shaxda dadka ee qabyadu waxay qof-qof ugu dhigantaa 9 ka mid ah 10, tobnaadkuna waa doorashada Nisku. Taasi waa caddayn xoog leh, ma aha caddayn go'an, in guddida talo-bixintu raacday.`,li6:`<strong>(d) Tixgeliso kursi Clearwater.</strong> Tixgeli soo celinta riding inta badan ka kooban Clearwater County iyo galbeedka Mountain View County, oo leh xaaladda s.15(2). Taasi waa ka-reebista Sharciga ee u oggolaanaysa ilaa afar riding oo fog inay yeeshaan ilaa 50% dad ka yar celceliska. Kani waa kursiga keliya ee la soo celiyay ee taladu meel u calaamadayso. Kan labaad meel uma magacaabto. <strong>Natiijada: waa la qaatay.</strong> Rocky Mountain House-Sundre wuxuu 61% dadkiisa ku leeyahay aaggaas.`,p11:`Marka la isku daro, shuruuduhu waxay daboolaan inta badan dhulka guddidu isku khilaaftay. Airdrie, Calgary, Cochrane iyo Chestermere dhammaantood waxay hoos yimaadaan shuruudda (a). Halkaas ayay inta yar ee guddidu Airdrie u qaybisay afar oo ay ku sawirtay riding-yo qaybo Calgary ah ku xidha baadiyaha. Red Deer iyo St. Albert waxa daboola oo keliya qodobka jilicsan, "inta suurtagalka ah." Khariidad dib u furta Airdrie ama Calgary weli way noqon kartaa mid sharci ah. Laakiin ma aha khariidadda ay Talada 5 sharraxdo. Mooshinka 37 laftiisu wuxuu guddida talo-bixinta u oggolaanayaa inay taladaas dabaqdo "iyadoo la raacayo wax-ka-beddel kasta oo guddida talo-bixinta madax-bannaani u aragto lagama maarmaan." Hubintayda, khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu ma buuxiso Talada 5, maxaa yeelay waxay ku dhacday shuruudda (a). Natiijooyinkani waa ku-meel-gaadh: faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidadda weli dadweynaha looma bandhigin, sidaa darteed khadadka guddida talo-bixinta waxaan ka dib u dhisay warbixinteeda. <a href="__BASE__/explorer">Baadhaha khariidadda</a> wuxuu xariiqaa aagga shuruud kasta oo ka mid ah afarta, biinka mid kastaana wuxuu sheegaa in Talada 5 beddesho iyo in ay ka tagto.`},know:{h:`Sida aan u hubiyay`,h3_1:`Khariidado uu kombuyuutar sawiray`,p1:`Kombuyuutar ayaa faylasha rasmiga ah ka sawiray 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah, mid kastaa 87 riding, tiradii 2019. Riding kastaa wuxuu ku dhow yahay isla tirada dadka wuxuuna yahay hal xabbo. Kombuyuutarku marna ma arko cod, sidaa darteed khariidadahani waxay muujiyaan sida ay u eg yihiin khadad aan ujeeddo lagu sawirin. Taas oo keliya ayay “dhexdhexaad” halkan ka tidhaahdaa. Khariidadaha lagu sawiray 89 riding waxay muujiyaan isla janjeerka; natiijooyinkaasi waa ku-meel-gaadh.`,p2:`Ballanqaadyadayda waxa lagu hayaa laba meelood. Inta badan waa commit-yo taariikhaysan oo ku jira kaydka dadweynaha ee mashruuca. Qaar waxa sidoo kale lagu diiwaangeliyay Open Science Framework (OSF), goob dadweyne oo qorshayaasha cilmi-baadhista waqti ku calaamadeysa. Diiwaangelintii ugu horreysay ee OSF waxa la gudbiyay 6 Maajo 2026, qiyaastii lix saacadood ka dib markii faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidaddu yimaadeen, diiwaannaduna waxay sheegaan kuwa ka dambeeyay.`,h3_2:`Sababta codka siman aanu u macnayn kala badh kursiyada`,p3:`Codbixiyayaasha UCP ee miyiga waxay riding-yadooda ku guulaystaan farqi ballaadhan, qiyaastii 70-30. Codbixiyayaasha NDP ee magaalada waxay ku guulaystaan farqi ka dhow, qiyaastii 60-40. Sidaa darteed marka codku 50-50 siman yahay, khariidadda caadiga ah ee kombuyuutarku sawiray waxay UCP siisaa oo keliya 44.8% kursiyada. Taasi waa barta laga bilaabo.`,h3_3:`Afar natiijo, dhinac-dhinac`,table1_h1:`Cabbirka`,table1_h2:`Khariidadda inta badan ee guddida`,table1_h3:`Khariidadda inta yar ee guddida`,table1_r1c1:`Waxay raacdaa khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka (khariidadda 2019: 75%)`,table1_r1c2:`80%`,table1_r1c3:`72%`,table1_r2c1:`Celceliska ka-maqnaanshaha cabbirka riding-ka ku habboon, dad ahaan (shaxaha guddida)`,table1_r2c2:`3,180`,table1_r2c3:`4,707: 48% ka weyn`,table1_r3c1:`Riding-yada waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary: dadka ka badan celceliska gobolka`,table1_r3c2:`2.8% (1.3% ilaa 1.6% akhris erey-ereyeed ah oo xeerka aagga)`,table1_r3c3:`11.5% (8.5% ilaa 8.9% akhris erey-ereyeed ah oo xeerka aagga)`,table1_r4c1:`Xudduudaha ay warbixinta inta badan ee guddidu u calaamadeysay kuwo aan caadi ahayn`,table1_r4c2:`0`,table1_r4c3:`4 (3 waxa xaqiijiyay hubintayda)`,table1_r5c1:`Qaybaha Airdrie (sharcigu wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan 2)`,table1_r5c2:`2 qaybood`,table1_r5c3:`4 dhul ahaan; 3 haddii la tiriyo oo keliya qaybaha leh ugu yaraan 2% dadkeeda`,table1_r6c1:`<strong>Soo koobidda qaab-dhismeedka</strong> (shan imtixaan oo taariikhaysan; afar ka mid ahi waxay khariidadda inta yar ku cabbiraan khariidadda inta badan, sidaa darteed inta badani kuma dhici karto kuwaas)`,table1_r6c2:`<strong>qiyaasta tixraaca</strong> afar ka mid ah shanta`,table1_r6c3:`<strong>waxay khariidadda inta badan kaga duwan tahay 4</strong> (kan shanaad, khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka, midna ma kala saaro)`,table1_r7c1:`Saamiga kursiyada UCP haddii codku 50-50 u kala qaybsamo (khariidad caadi ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray: 44.8%)`,table1_r7c2:`46.1% (boqolleyda 78aad)`,table1_r7c3:`51.7% (boqolleyda 99.99aad: oo keliya 69 ka mid ah 1,010,000 ayaa wax ka badan siiya)`,table1_r8c1:`Farqiga celceliska-dhexe (warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada)`,table1_r8c2:`Boqolleyda 1aad: aad u fog, laakiin xagga NDP, jihada khaldan ee lagu caawin lahaa UCP`,table1_r8c3:`ka fog 99.97% khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray, xagga UCP`,table1_r9c1:`Declination, cabbir kale oo guulaha hal dhinac u janjeera (warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada)`,table1_r9c2:`boqolleyda 22aad: gudaha xadka caadiga ah`,table1_r9c3:`ka fog 98.8%, xagga UCP`,table1_r10c1:`Farqiga waxtarka, tirinta codadka khasaaray (xariiq horay loo dejiyay: qiyaastii +4.1%)`,table1_r10c2:`+0.1% (boqolleyda 16.5aad)`,table1_r10c3:`+4.0% (boqolleyda 94.5aad): waxyar ka hooseeya xariiqda, sidaa darteed ma gaadhin`,table1_r11c1:`Kursiyada UCP ee codadka 2023 (warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada; dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta)`,table1_r11c2:`55 ka mid ah 89; 48 ka mid ah 89`,table1_r11c3:`60 ka mid ah 89; 55 ka mid ah 89 (tirinta dhammaan warqadaha waa qiyaas: 57 xeerka cusub ee P, oo aan weli la qaadan)`,table1_r12c1:`Inta ay khariidaddu dhif tahay afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda oo la wada eego`,table1_r12c2:`Ma aha wax aan caadi ahayn (qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 10; warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada)`,table1_r12c3:`Ka dhif 1 ka mid ah 10,000: qiyaas moodel, ma aha xad (warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada)`,p4:`Afar ka mid ah shanta waxaan qoray 24 Abriil 2026, ka dib markii aan labada khariidadood ku cabbiray xudduudo ku-meel-gaadh ah. Kala-qaybinta Airdrie, iyo xeerka ah in 4 ka mid ah 5 loo tiriyo is-waafaq, waxaan ku daray maalintii xigtay. Diiwaanku waa commit taariikhaysan oo ku jira kaydka mashruuca. Waxba OSF laguma diiwaangelin ilaa 6 Maajo. Saddex ka mid ah imtixaannada waxa si toos ah looga akhriyi karaa warbixinta guddida, sidaa darteed u qaado hubinno warbixinta, ma aha saadaal.`,fig_caption:`Bidix ilaa midig: inta ay khariidad kastaa xagga UCP ugu janjeerto farqiga waxtarka. Hoos ilaa kor: inta imtixaan qaab-dhismeed ee calaamadeeya. Khariidadda 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee guddida waxay fadhiyaan geeska hoose ee bidix. Khariidadda 2019 midna lagama calaamadeyn afarta imtixaan ee lagu socodsiiyay; imtixaanka aagga Calgary marna laguma socodsiin. Khariidadda inta yar keligeed ayay fadhidaa, xariiqda qaab-dhismeedka dusheeda, waxyar ka hor xariiqda farqiga waxtarka.`,h3_4:`Waxa ay suurtagalnimadu macnaheedu yahay`,p5:`Sawir aan marna codad arkin intee jeer ayuu soo saari lahaa isku-darka natiijooyinka khariidadda inta yar ee afarta cabbir oo dhan? Ka dhif 1 ka mid ah 10,000, hab kasta oo aan u xisaabiyay. Cabbirka la daabacay, khariidad kombuyuutar sawiray midna sidaas uma fog (nooc darajo ku salaysan, toddoba ayaa sidaas ah), sidaa darteed tiradu waxay ka timaadaa moodel tirakoob: qiyaas moodel, ma aha xad. Waxay adeegsataa warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada. Ma jiro nooc dhammaan warqadaha ah, maxaa yeelay dhibcaha dhammaan warqadaha ee khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray kuma jiraan kaydka.`,p6:`Tiradaasi ma aha fursadda in khariidadda lagu sawiray niyad wanaagsan. Khariidad intaas dhif ahi weli waxay ka iman kartaa doorashooyin aan caadi ahayn laakiin daacad ah. Sheegashadaydu way ka cidhiidhi tahay: sawir xeerarka raaca oo aan marna codad arkin ku dhowaad marna ma soo saaro.`,h3_5:`Ku hubin hab labaad`,p7:`Waxa saddexda hubin muujiyaan: ma helin calaamad muujinaysa in meesha fog ee khariidaddu ka timid qalabkayga, inkastoo beddelka matoorku aad u yaraa si uu go'aan ugu noqdo. Hubinnadu midna ma sheegaan sababta khariidadda loo sawiray sidii loo sawiray.`,h3_6:`Xadka khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray`,p8:`Khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray riding kasta waxay ku hayaan tiro dad isku dhow iyo hal xabbo. Ma raacaan xeer kasta oo guddidu miisaamtay: ka-reebista s.15(2), oo u oggolaanaysa ilaa afar riding oo fog inay aad u yaraadaan; bulshada danta wadaagta; iyo raacidda khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka. Sidaa darteed waa hubin dibadeed oo xoog leh, ma aha liis khariidad kasta oo guddi sharci ahi sawiri karto. Imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedku waxay sheegaan sida ay labada khariidadood ee guddidu u kala duwan yihiin. Khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray waxay sheegaan inta ay khariidad caadi ka tahay. Imtixaanka 50-50 isna xad buu leeyahay. Wuxuu muujiyaa waxa khariidaddu keligeed ku darto. Doorasho dhab ah, isbeddel cod oo weyn oo ku filan ayaa ka miisaan culayn kara janjeerka khariidad kasta.`,h3_7:`Waxa aan adkaysan`,p9:`Imtixaannada qaarkood waxay soo noqdeen kuwo ka soo horjeeda natiijooyinkayga. Boggan way ku sii jiraan.`,li1:`<strong>Imtixaanka raacidda khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka wuxuu soo baxay dhexdhexaad.</strong> Khariidadda inta yar waxay raacdaa 72% waqtiga, khariidadda inta badanna 80%. Khariidadda 2019, oo ay sawirtay guddidii u dambaysay, waxay dhalisaa 75%.`,li2:`<strong>Farqiga waxtarku ma gaadhin.</strong> Khariidadda inta yar waxay timid +4.0%, boqolleyda 94.5aad. Xariiqda horay loo dejiyay waxay ahayd boqolleyda 95aad, qiyaastii +4.1%, sidaa darteed waxaan u sheegaa mid aan gaadhin.`,li3:`<strong>Imtixaanka ah in qaababka aan caadiga ahayn ay keenaan faa'iidada kursiyada lama socodsiin karin.</strong> Khariidad kombuyuutar sawiray oo socodkeedii la qorsheeyay ku jirta midna ma gaadho kursiyada khariidadda inta yar, sidaa darteed waxba lama barbar dhigi karin. Xidhiidhka u dhexeeya qaababka iyo kursiyada lama tijaabin.`,li4:`<strong>Hal imtixaan oo khariidadda inta yar gudubtay.</strong> Imtixaanka miirida deriska wuxuu raadiyaa riding-yo la cufay oo ag fadhiya riding-yo lagu guulaystay farqi khafiif ah. Khariidadda inta yar waxay muujisaa 1 calaamad oo qaabkaas ah, marka loo eego 2 khariidadda inta badan iyo 5 khariidadda 2019. Waa imtixaanka keliya ee khariidadda inta yar ay ka fiicnaato khariidadda inta badan. Imtixaanku waa sahamin, gudbiddiisuna way daciif tahay: si bakhtiyaanasiib ah u isku qas calaamadaha riding-yada, natiijadii oo kalena waxay soo baxdaa qiyaastii 91% waqtiga. Saadaashiisa kale, in khariidaduhu u ekaan doonaan kuwo caadi ah, way ku dhacday: saddexdaba dhibco aan caadi ahayn oo hoose ayay keenaan. Gudbiddu waxay u taagan tahay gudbid.`,li5:`<strong>Tiro la isku daray oo aanan isticmaalin.</strong> Habka Fisher wuxuu hal tiro ku midayn lahaa imtixaanka doorashooyinka xudduudaha iyo imtixaanka ka dhanka ah khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Habkaasi wuxuu u qaataa in labada imtixaan ay madax-bannaan yihiin. Ma aha, sidaa darteed ma isticmaalo tirada la isku daray.`,h3_8:`Labada dhinacba waa la tijaabiyay`,p10:`Eedeymaha ugu muhiimsan ee la cabbiri karo ee dhinac kasta, iyo hal mala-awaal oo aniga ii gaar ah, waxaan mariyay isla imtixaannada. Hubinnadan midna horay looma dejin, sidaa darteed waa sahamin. Tiro kasta oo ka dambaysa waa dadweyne.`,table2_h1:`Eedeynta`,table2_h2:`Cidda sameysay`,table2_h3:`Waxa aan helay`,table2_r1c1:`Afar ka mid ah xudduudaha inta yar waa kuwo joomatari ahaan aan caadi ahayn`,table2_r1c2:`Inta badan (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, bb. 62–63)`,table2_r1c3:`Badi ahaan waa la xaqiijiyay: saddex ka mid ah afarta calaamadood ee joomatariga way adkaysanayaan marka lagu eego khariidadaha la daabacay; xidhiidhka marinka waddada weyn ee kan afraad waa la difaaci karaa`,table2_r2c1:`Isbeddellada inta yar ee shan meelood "ma lahayn taageero dadweyne"`,table2_r2c2:`Inta badan (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, bb. 59, 62)`,table2_r2c3:`Ku dhowaad sax. Sax Cochrane iyo St. Albert, halkaas oo aanu diiwaan ku codsanayn waxa inta yar sawirtay. Khalad hal ilaa saddex diiwaan meelaha kale: Airdrie 1 marka loo eego 10 habaynta inta badan, Red Deer 1 marka loo eego 20, Chestermere 3 marka loo eego 6. Gudbin kasta oo la dhigay iyo bandhig kasta oo dhegaysi si buuxda ayaa loo akhriyay; tirintu waa diiwaanno, ma aha dad.`,table2_r3c1:`Fidinta beerta waxay ahayd "isku day niyad xun" oo lagu sheeganayo ilaalinta s.15(2)`,table2_r3c2:`Inta badan (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, b. 10)`,table2_r3c3:`Waa la wiiqay: qaybtu waxay u qalantaa s.15(2) xitaa iyadoon fidinta la calaamadeeyay jirin`,table2_r4c1:`Inta badan "waxay tirtirtaa ama burburisaa qaybaha doorashada miyiga"`,table2_r4c2:`Inta yar (b. 356)`,table2_r4c3:`Waa lid: inta yar ayaa haysa qaybo ka yar oo miyi ku xajisan (23 iyo 28, marka loo eego 31-kii 2019) waxayna ku dartaa qaar ka badan degmooyin magaalo magacooda wata (7 iyo 3)`,table2_r5c1:`Inta badan "way diidday inay isticmaasho" dabacsanaanta ±25% ee Alberta miyiga`,table2_r5c2:`Inta yar (b. 356)`,table2_r5c3:`Waa la taageeray: qaybaha miyiga ee inta badan celcelis ahaan leexashadoodu waa −6.0% (4 ka hooseeya −10%); kuwa inta yar celcelis ahaan −12.2% (11 ka hooseeya −10%)`,table2_r6c1:`"Markhaati badan oo joogto ah" oo loogu talagalay degmooyinka isku-dhafka ah waa la iska indha tiray`,table2_r6c2:`Inta yar (b. 356)`,table2_r6c3:`Guud ahaan lama dhibcayn. Akhriska buuxa wuxuu tiriyay codsiyada meelo la magacaabay, ma aha marag guud oo ku saabsan riding-yada isku-dhafka ah ee magaalo iyo miyi. Lethbridge, 38 diiwaan ayaa codsada in magaalada lagu xidho baadiyaha ku wareegsan, sidii inta yar u sawirtay, 93-na laba riding oo magaalada gudaheeda ah, sidii inta badan u sawirtay.`,table2_r7c1:`Degmooyinka miyiga ee inta badan waa marinno go'doomin oo si ula kac ah loo qorsheeyay`,table2_r7c2:`Mala-awaalkayga lidka ah (T3.2)`,table2_r7c3:`Lama taageerin: sharraxaadda juquraafigu way adkaysatay, inta badanna way ka gudubtay`,p11:`Marka lagu hubiyo xogta dadweynaha, sababaha ay inta yar daabacday ee khadadkeeda lagu murmay si isku mid ah uma adkaystaan. Laba ka mid ah lixda waxay ku dhacaan xisaabta dadka, labana qayb ahaan keliya ayay adkaystaan. Badanaa sheegashada guud waa run, khadka gaarka ahina ma aha. Qiyaastii 71% kuwa Cochrane dibadda uga safra shaqo waxay ka shaqeeyaan meel ka mid ah Calgary (saddex meelood meel shaqaalaheeda oo dhan). Taasi waxba kama sheegto xaafadda Nolan Hill ee marinku gaadho. Inta badan ma daabicin liis noocaas ah, sidaa darteed hubintani hal jiho ayay u socotaa oo keliya. Wadajir, labada eedeyn ee miyiga ee inta yar ay u jeedisay inta badan waxay qeexayaan laba hab oo kala duwan. Qaybo miyi ah oo ka badan laakiin ka buuxa khariidadda inta badan. Kuwo ka yar laakiin ka fudud khariidadda inta yar.`,h3_9:`Cidda samaysay`,p12:`Waxaan ahay qoraaga keliya, arday is-maalgeliya oo ka tirsan Mount Royal University. Waxaan u codeeyay oo deeq siiyay xisbiyada gobolka ee muxaafidka iyo horusocodkaba. Natiijooyinka iga soo horjeeday diiwaanka ayay ku sii jiraan, tiro kastana waxa laga dib u dhisi karaa koodh dadweyne, xog iyo abuurro bakhtiyaanasiib oo la diiwaangeliyay.`,h3_10:`Diiwaanka oo dhan`,p13:`Dhammaan shan iyo tobanka natiijo waxay ku jiraan <a href="__BASE__/evidence">diiwaanka buuxa</a>, mid kastaa leh <a href="__BASE__/explainers">sharraxaad</a> gaaban.`},test:{h:`Imtixaannada khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta`,p1:`Guddiga waxa waajib ku ahayd inuu khariidadda 91-ka kursi ee guddida talo-bixinta u diro Golaha ugu dambayn 2 Noofembar 2026. Xeerarka go'aaminaya xukunka waxa qoraal lagu dejiyay Juun 2026; <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/preregistration/november_2026_scoring_spec.md" rel="noopener">xeerarka dhibcaynta</a> taariikhdoodu waxay ku qoran tahay kaydka mashruuca. Saddex imtixaan oo dheeri ah oo lala soo sheego, iyo doorashada kooxda barbardhigga, waxa lagu daray 29–31 Oktoobar, ka dib markii MLA-yada mucaaradku ay qaybo ka mid ah khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta ku sharraxeen kulankii guddiga ee 28 Oktoobar. Toddoba wax-ka-beddel ayaa la raaciyay 2–7 Noofembar, ka dib markii warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta la soo bandhigay (eeg qaybta Noofembar ee hoose). Dhibcaha faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidadda waan daabici doonaa 72 saacadood gudahood marka la sii daayo, jihaday doonaanba ha u tilmaameen.`,p2:`<strong>Habraaca.</strong> Ma la qabtay dhageysiyo dadweyne? Qabyo ma la sii daayay? Xubnaha guddida talo-bixinta iyo shuruudaha shaqadooda ma la daabacay? Diiwaanka ka dambeeya khariidadda ma dadweyne baa? Xubnaha NDP waxay sheegeen in guddida talo-bixintu aanay qaadan soo gudbinno dadweyne, guddiguna wuxuu diiday mooshin ahaa in la daabaco cidda ay guddida talo-bixintu la tashatay, sidaa darteed sababaha khadadka khariidadda waxaan ku qiimayn karaa oo keliya waxa warbixinta guddida talo-bixintu daabacdo. Habraacu wuxuu kaloo leeyahay kaar dhibco oo u gaar ah oo sagaal astaamood ah, oo lagu diiwaangeliyay OSF (u47bq) laguna muujiyay <a href="__BASE__/norms#measurable">bogga heerarka</a>.`,p3:`<strong>Talada 5.</strong> Imtixaan labaad, X1, ayaa khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta ku hubiyay afarta shuruudood ee Talada 5, taladii guddoomiyaha guddida ee ay dawladdu soo xigatay. Shuruud kasta si gooni ah ayaa loo dhibceeyay:`,li1:`(a), (b) iyo (c) way gudbaan haddii khariidaddu riding-yadaas uga tagto sida taladu sharraxdo. (a) way ku dhacday: 41-ka riding ee Airdrie iyo koonfurteeda, khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay beddeshaa 10. (b) way gudubtay, 11 ka mid ah 11. (c) lama dhibcayn, maxaa yeelay khariidadda qabyada ah ee guddida ee Oktoobar 2025 kuma jirto faylasha mashruuca.`,li2:`(d) waxay codsataa oo keliya in kursi Clearwater la tixgeliyo. Way gudubtaa haddii khariidaddu leedahay riding-kaas, ama haddii warbixinta la daabacay ee guddiga ama guddida talo-bixintu magacaabto doorashadaas oo ay bixiso sabab, oo ku xidhan arrimaha Sharciga, oo ah qaadashadeeda ama diidmadeeda. Iyadoo aanu jirin diiwaan dadweyne oo kale oo ku saabsan sida khariidadda loo sameeyay, warbixinnadaasi waa diiwaanka keliya ee tirsan. Aamusnaan ama qoraal guud way ku dhacaan. (d) way gudubtay: khariidaddu waxay leedahay kursiga. Rocky Mountain House-Sundre wuxuu 61% dadkiisa ku leeyahay aagga Clearwater County iyo galbeedka Mountain View County.`,p4:`X1 wuxuu gudbaa oo keliya haddii afarta shuruudoodba gudbaan. Maxaa yeelay (a) way ku dhacday, X1 lama buuxin, wax kasta oo (c) muujin lahayd. Talada 5 cidna sharci ahaan kuma xidhna. Waxa X1 tijaabiyaa waa in khariidaddu keento waxa ay dawladdu soo xigatay.`,p5:`<strong>Khariidadda.</strong> Halkee ayay uga dhacdaa cabbir kasta oo boggan ku jira, marka loo eego isla qaybinta malyuunka khariidadood iyo xadadka horay loo diiwaangeliyay (marka la eego dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, Wax-ka-beddelka 12 wuxuu mar cusub dejiyay laba ka mid ah xariiqyadaas)?`,p6:`<strong>Imtixaanka ugu weyn.</strong> Juun 2026, ka hor intaan khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta la shaacin, waxaan qoray sida aan u hubin lahaa (<a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/preregistration/november_2026_scoring_spec.md" rel="noopener">xeerarka dhibcaynta</a>). Imtixaanku wuxuu weydiiyay in khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu soo celiso qaabka ku jira khariidadda inta yar ee guddida, laba qaybood. Khadadka, 3 ama ka badan oo ka mid ah 5 calaamadood oo qaab-dhismeed ayaa loo tirin lahaa is-waafaq. Codadka, 2 ama ka badan oo ka mid ah 4 calaamadood oo caddaalad oo jihada UCP ah ayaa la tirin lahaa. Hubin dambe, oo aan horay loo dejin, ayaa ogaatay in qaybta qaab-dhismeedku keligeed wax yar ku darto. Khariidadaha 91-riding ee kombuyuutarku sawiray ee lagu dheellitiray oo keliya xadka ±25% ee Sharciga, 93.5% waxay la mid yihiin qaabka qaab-dhismeedka ee inta yar. Heerkaas laguma cabbirin khariidado si ka adag loo dheellitiray; kooxda ugu weyn, oo lagu dheellitiray ±12.5%, imtixaanka ugu horreeya ee kuwaas keligiis wuxuu calaamadeeyaa 25.3%. Sidaa darteed qaybta codadka ayaa culayska qaada. Natiijada, warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023: 2 ka mid ah 5 iyo 1 ka mid ah 4. Labada qaybood midna isma waafaqo. Waa ku-meel-gaadh, maxaa yeelay waxay adeegsataa dib-u-dhiskayga khariidadda. Imtixaan kasta waxaan dib ugu socodsiin doonaa faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidadda 72 saacadood gudahood marka la soo saaro, natiijadana waan dhigi doonaa jihada ay tilmaanto kasta ha ahaatee.`},november:{h:`Noofembar: khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, oo la hubiyay`,note:`Natiijooyinkani waa ku-meel-gaadh. Faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidaddu dadweynaha looma bandhigin, sidaa darteed khadadka guddida talo-bixinta waxaan ka dib u dhisay warbixinteeda. Taas waxaan ugu yeedhaa dib-u-dhiskayga. Labadiisii hubin ee saxnaanta ee ugu horreeyay way ku dhaceen: 49.0%, kadibna 13.8%, aagagga codbixinta ayaa ku dhacay riding khaldan, marka loo eego xad 10% ah. Isbeddel xeer (Wax-ka-beddelka 10) ayaa oggolaaday isku-day saddexaad. Wuu gudbay, laakiin oo keliya sidii socod dib-u-soo-celin ah oo lagu sameeyay bogag horay loo arkay, ma aha imtixaan cusub. Wax walba waxaan dib ugu socodsiin doonaa faylasha rasmiga ah.`,p1:`<strong>Imtixaannada horay loo dejiyay (la socodsiiyay 4 Noofembar).</strong> Xeerarkooda waxa wax laga beddelay toddoba jeer 2 ilaa 7 Noofembar: afar jeer ka hor intaanan dhibcayn khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, saddex jeer ka dib markii aan natiijooyin arkay (<code>findings/pre_registration_amendment_log.md</code>).`,li1:`<strong>Sida khadadka loo sawiro:</strong> 2 ka mid ah 5 calaamadood. Is-waafaq lala yeesho khariidadda inta yar ee guddida wuxuu u baahnaa 3. Lama soo celin.`,li2:`<strong>Sida codadku ugu beddelmaan kursiyo:</strong> 1 ka mid ah 4 calaamadood. Is-waafaq wuxuu u baahnaa 2. Ma jiro. Calaamadda keliya waa imtixaanka 50-50, boqolleyda 98.8aad: ka sarreysa 98.8 ka mid ah 100 kasta oo khariidad kombuyuutar sawiray, warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada. Saddexda cabbir ee kale waxay ku jiraan xadka caadiga ah.`,li3:`<strong>Talada 5:</strong> guddida talo-bixintu waxay beddeshay 10 ka mid ah 41-ka riding ee taladu codsatay in laga tago, sidaa darteed khariidaddu ma raacdo imtixaankayga la diiwaangeliyay.`,p2:`Sidaa darteed, akhriskan ku-meel-gaadhka ah, khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu ma sido qaabka khariidadda inta yar ee guddida labada qaybood midkoodna.`,p3:`<strong>Warqadaha codbixinta ee la tiriyo (7 Noofembar).</strong> Warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada waxay ka tagaan qiyaastii kala badh warqadaha codbixinta ee 2023: kuwa hore, ee horay loo dhiibto, goob guurguurta, warqad gaar ah ama meel kasta. Elections Alberta waxay kuwaas u soo sheegtaa oo keliya riding kasta oo hore. Khariidadda 2019, warqadaha maalinta doorashada oo keliya waxay doortaan 57 xubnood oo UCP ah; natiijadii dhabta ahayd ee 2023 waxay ahayd 49. Codadka hore waxay 6.2 dhibcood uga sii janjeereen NDP warqadaha maalinta doorashada, waxayna NDP u sii janjeereen 83 ka mid ah 87 riding. Sidaa darteed xeerka waxaan beddelay ka dib markii aan natiijooyin qaar arkay (Wax-ka-beddelka 12): imtixaan kasta oo cod ku salaysan wuxuu adeegsadaa dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, natiijooyinka maalinta doorashadana dhinacooda ayaa lagu hayaa. Isbeddelkaasi ma ahayn mid indha la'. Halka codadka hore ka dhacaan riding cusub gudihiisa waa qiyaas. Xeer cusub, xeerka P, wuxuu dhigaa oo keliya dadka aan codeynin maalinta doorashada dhexdooda, isagoo adeegsanaya xogta Alberta oo keliya. Waxa loo qoray Wax-ka-beddelka 14 qabyada ah, oo aanan saxeexin. Waxa la doortay ka dib markii saamayntiisa khariidadaha la ogaaday, sidaa darteed waa sahamin, mana aha mid indha la'. Ilaa la saxeexo, tirinta la diiwaangeliyay ayaa taagan, kuwa xeerka P-na dhinacooda ayaa lagu bixiyaa.`,li4:`<strong>Khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu</strong> labada siyaaboodba waxay helaysaa isla tirooyinka: 2 ka mid ah 5 iyo 1 ka mid ah 4.`,li5:`<strong>Khariidadda inta yar ee guddida</strong> way dhaqaaqi lahayd: dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, farqigeeda waxtarku waa +2.55%, boqolleyda 98.8aad, oo ka sarreysa xariiqda cusub ee +1.39%, tirinteeda ku saabsan sida codadku ugu beddelmaan kursiyona waxay akhrin lahayd 4 ka mid ah 4 calaamadood, ma aha 3 ka mid ah 4. Taasi waxay ku xidhan tahay sida codadka hore loo dhigo. Xeerka cusub ee P, oo aan weli la qaadan, farqigeedu waa +5.64% kursiyadeeduna 57 iyo 32; weli boqolley looma xisaabin xeerka P. Tani dib uma furto <a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-7">natiijada 7</a>.`,li6:`<strong>Kooxaha barbardhigga oo dib loo socodsiiyay (8 Noofembar):</strong> kooxaha yaryar ee khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray ee leh 91 iyo 89 riding waxa dib loogu socodsiiyay dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta; 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee ugu weyn ma ahayn. Laba socod oo aan si sax ah isugu soo noqon ayaa la tuuray (Wax-ka-beddelka 13, oo isna la qoray ka dib markii natiijooyin la arkay). Akhrisku isma beddelin: calaamadda keliya weli waa imtixaanka magaalada-iyo-inta-kale ee kooxda ugu cidhiidhisan.`,p4:`<strong>Waxa hubinnada cusubi heleen.</strong> Hubinnadani waxay eegaan waxa isbeddellada guddida talo-bixintu sameeyaan. Dhammaantood waxay adeegsadaan dib-u-dhiskayga khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, oo laga dib u dhisay warbixinteeda maxaa yeelay faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidaddu weli dadweynaha looma bandhigin, sidaa darteed natiijo kasta oo halkan ah waa ku-meel-gaadh. Labadii hubin ee saxnaanta ee ugu horreeyay ee dib-u-dhisku way ku dhaceen (49.0%, kadibna 13.8% aagagga codbixinta ayaa si khaldan loo dhigay, marka loo eego xad 10% ah). Kii saddexaad wuxuu ku gudbay oo keliya sidii socod dib-u-soo-celin ah oo lagu sameeyay bogag horay loo arkay. Hubinnadan midna lama diiwaangelin, inta badankoodna waxa la qorsheeyay ka dib markii natiijooyin la xidhiidha la ogaaday. Mid kasta marka laga reebo tirinta ka-gudubka xadka magaalada, qorshe ayaa kaydka loo dhiibay iyadoo la socota natiijooyinka; in qorshaha marka hore la qoray waxay ku tiirsan tahay eraygayga. Buugga imtixaannadu wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa waxaas oo dhan (<code>findings/test_ledger/README.md</code>).`,li7:`<strong>Waxa isbeddellada guddida talo-bixintu ku sameeyaan kursiyada.</strong> Khariidadda beddelka ah ee inta yar ee guddida talo-bixinta (faqradda 167 ee warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta) waxay dib u celisaa isbeddellada koonfurta Airdrie. Marka la barbar dhigo, khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay NDP siisaa 2 kursi oo ka yar warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada. Dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, jawaabtu waxay ku xidhan tahay sida codadka hore, kuwa aan la dhiibin maalinta doorashada, loo dhigo riding kasta gudihiisa. Xeerka la diiwaangeliyay, khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay UCP siisaa 51 kursi khariidadda beddelka ahna 50, sidaa darteed NDP waxay leedahay 1 ka yar. Xeerka cusub ee P, oo aan weli la qaadan, labada khariidadoodba waxay bixiyaan 50, sidaa darteed farqi ma jiro: Banff-Canmore-Diamond Valley ee guddida talo-bixinta waxay u tagtaa NDP, farqi ah 1,276 cod oo la moodeelay. Kursi kasta oo kala duwan waa mid aad u dhow oo aan la go'aamin karin dib-u-dhiska: farqiga guushiisu wuu ka yar yahay codadka aagagga codbixinta ee uu khad kala duwani dhex maro. Jihadu waa isku mid doorashooyinkii 2015, 2019 iyo 2023, iyo inta badan isbeddel 10-dhibcood ah dhinac kasta (<code>findings/iap_para167/</code>, <code>findings/six_signals/</code>).`,li8:`<strong>Marka loo eego khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray,</strong> khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay u dhowdahay badhtamaha warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada: kursiyada UCP boqolleyda 43aad, farqiga waxtarkuna boqolleyda 48aad. Cabbirradaas, khariidadda beddelka ahi waxay u sii dhowdahay cidhifka. Imtixaanka 50-50, oo tiriya kursiyada marka codku si siman u kala qaybsamo, khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu way sii sarraysaa: boqolleyda 90aad ilaa 97aad marka loo eego khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray ee iyana leh 91 riding. Imtixaankaas, waa khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, ma aha tan beddelka ah, tan cidhifka u sii dhow.`,li9:`<strong>Lethbridge.</strong> Kombuyuutarka ayaan ka dhigay inuu gobolka dib u sawiro marar badan, codad la'aan iyo isagoo ixtiraamaya xadka magaalooyinka. Dib-u-sawirradaasi Lethbridge waxay u qaybiyeen laba 51% xaaladaha, saddex 48%, afarna 0.9%. Khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay u qaybisaa afar. Waxay 45% codbixiyayaasha NDP ee magaalada gelisaa kursiyo ay NDP ku waydo 10 dhibcood ama ka badan, kursigii labaad ee magaalada ee tartanka lahaana wuu baxay. Marka loo eego dib-u-sawirrada, taasi waxay ku jirtaa boqolleyda 93aad, waxyar gudaha xariiqda horay loo dejiyay (<code>findings/hybrid_regions/</code>). Inta ay dib-u-sawirradu si adag magaalooyinka u midaysaan way muhiim tahay. Khariidadihii hore ee guddiyadu waxay tilmaamayaan miisaan xadka magaalada oo u dhexeeya 0.52 iyo 0.66; dib-u-sawirrada kor ku xusan waxay adeegsadaan 0.5. 0.52, khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay joogtaa boqolleyda 93aad. 0.66, miisaanka u dhigma khariidadda inta badan ee guddidii 2026 laftigeeda, waxay joogtaa boqolleyda 97aad, oo dhaafsiisan xariiqda (<code>findings/city_weight/</code>). Miisaannadaas waxa lagu cabbiray dib-u-sawirro gobolka oo dhan. Waxa loo malaynayaa inay isku macne yihiin dib-u-sawir hal gobol ah, taasna lama hubin.`,li10:`<strong>Halka codbixiyayaasha la wareejiyay u tageen.</strong> Isbeddellada guddida talo-bixintu waxay codad NDP ah qaar u kala wareejiyaan riding-yada. Kuwaas, 14,199 waxay ka baxaan kursi ay NDP ku guulaysato ama ku dhowaad ku guulaysato, waxayna galaan mid ay ku waydo 10 dhibcood ama ka badan. 3,152 kale waxay u socdaan dhinaca kale. Inta badan, qiyaastii 10,000, waxay ka yimaadaan Lethbridge, qiyaastii 3,700-na waxay ka yimaadaan Edmonton-Beaumont oo galaan Leduc-Beaumont. Isbeddelka Banff wax yar ayuu ku daraa. Guddida talo-bixintu kama badin beddelidda kursiyada NDP haysato ama tartanka leh marka loo eego kuwa kale. Way ka yaraysay (<code>findings/local_targeting/</code>). Dib-u-sawirrada kombuyuutarka ee gobolka koonfurta iyo badhtamaha waxay ogaadeen in habaynta guddida talo-bixinta ee halkaas ay caadi tahay, tan inta badan ee guddiduna tahay tan aan caadiga ahayn, qayb ahaan sida dib-u-sawirrada loo dhisay darteed. Sidaa darteed inta badan socodkan waa ka-guurid barta bilowga ah ee aan caadiga ahayn.`,li11:`<strong>Xadka magaalooyinka ee khariidadihii hore.</strong> Halkan riding wuxuu u tirsan yahay ka-gudub xadka magaalada marka 5% ilaa 95% dadkiisu magaalada ku nool yihiin. Riding gaadha xadka wixii ka dambeeya laakiin haya ku dhowaad oo keliya dadka magaalada lama tiriyo. Xadka Calgary, khariidadaha 2010 iyo 2017 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee guddidu midna ma laha, khariidadda 2003-na waxay lahayd saddex. Khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay leedahay laba (riding-yada Springbank). Tan inta yar ee guddidu waxay lahayd lix. Xadka Edmonton, khariidadaha 2003, 2010 iyo 2017 midna ma lahayn. Khariidadda inta badan ee guddida iyo tan guddida talo-bixintu mid kastaa waxay leedahay laba, tan inta yarna saddex (<code>findings/city_weight/big_city_lines.json</code>).`,li12:`<strong>Codbixiyayaasha miyiga.</strong> Lethbridge County, tirada dadka miyiga ah ee la geliyay riding-yo inta badan magaalo ah waxay ka gudubtaa 0 khariidadda inta badan ee guddida una gudubtaa 8,138 tan guddida talo-bixinta. Rocky View County waxay ka gudubtaa 4 qaybood una gudubtaa 6. Cabbirka hubinta laftiisa, mid ka mid ah isbeddellada guddida talo-bixintu wuxuu ka horyimaadaa doorbidka miyiga ee codadka 2023: Edmonton-Nisku, oo haysa qiyaastii 7,000 qof oo miyi ah (<code>findings/rural_voice/</code>).`,li13:`<strong>Dadka ay barbardhiggu adeegsadaan.</strong> Khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray waxay dheellitiraan dadka tirakoobka 2021. Khariidadaha dhabta ah waxa lagu sawiray qiyaasaha 2024. Calgary iyo Edmonton si ka dhakhso badan ayay u koreen, sidaa darteed tirooyinka 2024 waxay hayaan dad u dhigma qiyaastii laba kursi oo ka badan (51.4 kursi, marka loo eego 49.5). Tirooyinka la daabacay ee khariidad kasta laftigeeda, riding-yada magaaladu waxay hayaan 9 ilaa 10 dhibcood dad ka badan inta kale, wixii ka dambeeya waxa tirooyinka 2021 muujiyaan. Khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, farqigu waa +13.4% tirooyinkeeda, marka loo eego +4.3% tirooyinka 2021. Taasi waxay xaddidaa barbardhig kasta oo magaalo ah ee diiwaankan. Dib-u-socodsiin khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray oo lagu sameeyo tirooyinka 2024 ayaa la soo jeediyay (<code>findings/population_basis/</code>).`,li13b:`<strong>Gobol kasta oo la beddelay.</strong> Koox kasta oo riding-yo ah oo ay guddida talo-bixintu beddeshay waxa dib loo sawiray marar badan iyadoo aan xisbi la tixraacin, iyadoo la adeegsanayo tirada kursiyada khariidad kasta. Habaynta guddida talo-bixintu waxay ku jirtaa xadka caadiga ah gobol kasta, cabbir kasta. Habaynta inta badan ee guddida ee gobolka koonfurta iyo badhtamaha ayaa ah tan aan caadiga ahayn. Waxay codad NDP oo ka badan dib-u-sawir kasta (50,000, oo labada habba lagu sawiray) ku cufaysaa guulo ballaadhan (Lethbridge-West iyo Canmore-Banff), waxayna gelisaa wax ka yar khasaarooyin hal dhinac u janjeedha. Qayb taas ka mid ah waa mid ku dhisan. Dib-u-sawirradu riding kasta waxay ku hayaan 25% gudahood celceliska gobolka, mana laha ka-reebis riding-yada fog, sidaa darteed midna ma hayn karo riding u yar sida Canmore-Banff ee inta badan ama Rocky Mountain House-Sundre ee guddida talo-bixinta. Xitaa Lethbridge-West keligeed waxay cufaysaa codad NDP oo ka badan inta 95% dib-u-sawirradu ku cufaan gobolka oo dhan, labada habba. Isbeddellada guddida talo-bixintu way dhimaan cufnaantaas (<code>findings/changed_districts/</code>).`,li14:`<strong>Dhammaan oo la isku daray.</strong> Hubinnada cusubi waxay sameeyeen 132 barbardhig boqolley, iyo 11 imtixaan oo kale. Barbardhiggaas, 12 waxay ka baxsan yihiin boqolleyda 5aad ama 95aad: 8 khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta iyo khariidadda beddelka ah, 4-na habaynta inta badan ee guddida ee koonfurta. Marka imtixaanno badan la socodsiiyo, qaar waxay cidhifka ku dhacaan nasiib. Ka dib marka la saxo tirada imtixaannada, 12-ka midna ma adkaysto.`,reasons:`<strong>Sababaha guddida talo-bixinta laftigeeda</strong> (<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-15">natiijada 15</a>). Meesha isbeddel aanu kursi dhaqaajin, inta badan way adkaystaan. Lethbridge iyo Banff ma adkaystaan. Guddida talo-bixintu waxay tidhi Lethbridge “horeba dad dheeraad ah ayay leedahay”, haddana waxay u qaybisay afar iyadoo Red Deer, oo qiyaastii isku cabbir ah, ay haysay laba riding oo magaalo ah. Riding-ka Banff wuxuu ugu badnaan ka gaabnaa qiyaastii 1,300 qof; guddida talo-bixintu waxay ku dartay 8,901. Marka loo eego khariidadda beddelka ah ee inta yar ee ka mid ah, khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay NDP siisaa 2 kursi oo ka yar warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada. Dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta waxay siisaa 1 ka yar tirinta la diiwaangeliyay, waxbana xeerka cusub ee P ee codadka hore, oo aan weli la qaadan. Kursi kasta oo kala duwan waa mid aad u dhow oo aan la go'aamin karin: farqigiisu wuu ka yar yahay codadka aagagga ay labada khad ku kala duwan yihiin.`,more:`<strong>Hubinnada cusub</strong>, oo la socodsiiyay 4 Noofembar ka dib oo aan horay loo dejin, waxay eegaan kursiyada, Lethbridge, xadka magaalooyinka iyo codbixiyayaasha miyiga. 132 barbardhig, 12 waxay ka baxsan yihiin xadka caadiga ah; midna ma adkaysto marka tirada imtixaannada la xisaabiyo. Waxay ku jiraan <a href="__BASE__/evidence#newer-checks">diiwaanka buuxa</a>, natiijada 15 ka dib.`},mind:{h:`Waxa fikirkayga beddeli lahaa`,p1:`Natiijo kasta oo weyn waxay leedahay shuruud qoran oo meesha ka saaraysa, inta badan waxa la dejiyay 24 Abriil 2026. Haddii mid la buuxiyo, dib-u-noqoshada waxaan daabici doonaa 48 saacadood gudahood marka aan ogaado, sida xeerka mashruucu sheegayo.`,li1:`<strong>Qof ayaa muujiya in is-dhaafsigu ahaa mid qasab ah.</strong> Haddii aanay jirin khariidad sharci ah oo buuxin karta sababaha inta yar sheegtay ee Airdrie, Cochrane, Nolan Hill iyo Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park iyadoo raacaysa khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka inta khariidadda inta badan raacdo, waan ka noqon doonaa natiijada ah in sababahaasi aanay sharxin khadadkaas. Caqabaddu way furan tahay <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/issues/14" rel="noopener">Arrinta #14</a>.`,li2:`<strong>Dukumeenti ayaa muujiya in sababuhu hore u yimaadeen.</strong> Haddii dukumeenti guddi oo gudaha ah, oo taariikhdiisu ka horreyso doorashooyinka kama dambaysta ah ee inta yar, uu muujiyo in doorashooyinkaas ay wadeen soo gudbinno bulsho oo aanan arag, waan ka noqon doonaa istidlaalka ah inay ahaayeen go'aanno qoris.`,li3:`<strong>Gudbitaanka neighbour-drain wuxuu noqdaa wax farsamo ka dhashay.</strong> Haddii nooca joogtada ah ee dhibcahaas uu ku dhaco dabada sare ee xad-dhaafka ah (p < 0.05) ee isbeddellada bakhtiyaanasiibka ah, waan ka laaban doonaa gudbitaanka inta yar.`,li4:`<strong>Doorasho ayaa ka hor timaada khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray.</strong> Haddii doorashada 2027, khariidad kasta oo sharci noqota, ay bixiso qaybsiga kursiyo ka hor imanaya waxa codadka 2023 ku saadaaliyaan khariidaddaas, dib ayaan u eegi doonaa natiijooyinka boqolleyda.`,li5:`<strong>Maxkamad ayaa <em>Lalande</em> kala saarta.</strong> Maxkamadda Sare waxay buriisay sharciga Quebec ee hakiyay guddideeda (<em>Quebec (AG) v. Lalande</em>, 2026 SCC 13). Haddii maxkamad ogaato in waddada Alberta sharci ahaan ka duwan tahay, waan ka noqon doonaa doodda <a href="__BASE__/norms">bogga caadooyinka</a> ee ah in labadoodu isku meel ka wada tirsan yihiin.`,p2:`Khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu way daciifin kartay gunaanadkayga. Natiijooyinka ku-meel-gaadhka ah ma soo celiso qaabka, sidaa darteed qaabku wuxuu sii ahaanayaa natiijo ku saabsan hal khariidad, oo marna aan la dhaqan gelin. Khaladaadka si dadweyne ah ayaan u saxaa mana tirtiro (<a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">warbixinta farsamada, Saxitaannada la Diiwaangeliyay</a>).`},authors:{h:`Aragtida qoraaga`,p1:`Wax kasta oo kor ku xusan waa hubinta. Qaybtani waa ra'yigayga. Tirtir, tiro boggan ku jirtana ma beddelmayso.`,p2:`Laba xaqiiqo ayaa adag in si dambi la'aan ah loo sharraxo. Xubnaha guddida ee dawladdu magacawday waxay sawireen khariidad uu sawirista dhexdhexaadka ahi ku dhawaad weligii soo saarin: wax ka yar boqol sawir malyuun dhexdood ayaa intaas u janjeedha. Markii guddidu kala qaybsantay halkii ay taageeri lahayd khariidaddaas, dawladdu shaqada waxay u wareejisay guddi ay MLA-yadeeda laftoodu maamulaan.`,p3:`Xaqiiqo kastaa, keligeed, waxay leedahay sharraxaad dambi la'aan ah. Xubin guddi ayaa noqon karta mid gaar ah oo niyad wanaagsan, gole sharci-dejinna dulqaadkiisa ayuu ku waayi karaa guddi kala qaybsan. Haddii labada xaqiiqo isku xigxig loo dhigo, se, sharraxaadaha dambi la'aanta ah way sii adkaadaan in la qabsado.`,p4:`Waxa i walwal geliya waa in aan sharci la jebin. Waan hubiyay, hubintaasina waa inta badan waxa hubintani tahay. Sharcigu warbixinta guddida wuxuu ka dhigaa talo. Ma dejiyo muddo ogeysiis ah, mana dalbo qabyo, dhageysiyo ama la-tashi ka hor intaan Golaha Sharci-dejintu tallaabo qaadin. Ilaalintu waxay ahayd caado, ma aha sharci, caadona waxay xidhaa oo keliya dawlad dooratay inay raacdo. 1995, ka dib guddigeedii 1992, Alberta waxay beddeshay sida guddiyada loo magacaabo.`,p5:`Guddiga beddelay guddida wuxuu leeyahay aqlabiyad dawladeed iyo guddoomiye dawladeed. Wuxuu leeyahay guddi talo-bixin ah, oo uu guddoomiyo garsoore hawlgab ah oo la magacaabay ka dib markii guddoomiyaha garsoorka ee ku-meel-gaadhka ah ee gobolku diiday inay ka caawiso helitaanka mid. Guddida talo-bixintu talo oo keliya ayay bixisaa. MLA-yada ayaa codeeya, waxayna ku tartami doonaan degmooyinka ay ansixiyaan. Khariidaddu ma yeelan doonto dhageysi dadweyne ka hor intaanay kama dambays noqon.`,p6:`Dawladdani hore ayay caado dhinac iska dhigtay. Sharcigeedii ugu horreeyay, sidii loo qoray, wuxuu golaha wasiirrada u oggolaan lahaa inay dib u qoraan sharciyo iyadoon Golaha Sharci-dejinta la marin, awooddaasna waxa la saaray oo keliya ka dib cabasho dadweyne. Guddoomiyaha anshaxa ee ay iyadu leedahay wuxuu ogaaday in Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu jebisay sharciga isku-dhaca danaha markii ay ku cadaadisay xeer-ilaaliyeheeda guud kiis dembi ku saabsan. Waxay meel marisay sharci u oggolaanaya golaha wasiirrada inay buriyaan xeerarka maxalliga ah oo ay bilaabaan xil ka qaadista xubno gole oo la doortay. Markii maxkamadi hakisay mid ka mid ah sharciyadeeda Juun 2025, waxay adeegsatay qodobka notwithstanding Diseembarkaas. Marka laga reebo jebinta anshaxa, tallaabooyinkaas mid kastaa wuxuu ahaa sharci, mid kastaana wuxuu dhinac iska dhigay caado si looga gudbo hubin madax-bannaan.`,p7:`Waxaan kaloo ka walwalaa waxa khariidaddu iibsato. Dib u ciyaar codkii maalinta doorashada 2023, khariidadda inta yar waxay UCP siinaysaa lixdan kursi oo ka mid ah sagaal iyo siddeetan. Lixdan kursi waxay dawlad ka ilaalin lahaayeen xubno dhinac u wareega, waxayna ka tagi lahaayeen xubno mucaarad oo ka yar oo sii wada kormeerka guddiyada. Taas waan ka walwali lahaa gacanta qof kasta oo ay ku jirto.`,p8:`Waan qaldami karaa, waxaanan dejiyay sida aad ku ogaan lahayd. Khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta waxa Golaha loo diray 2 Noofembar, xeerarka go'aaminaya xukunkeedana waxa la go'aamiyay Juun, ka hor intaan la shaacin. Haddii ay ku dhacdo gudaha xadka dhexdhexaadka ah, shakigaygu wuxuu qaatay dhaawac dhab ah, goobtanina way sheegi doontaa 72 saacadood gudahood ka dib markii la sii daayo. Taas waan u ballanqaaday ka hor intaanan jawaabta ogaan.`,signed:`— Will Conner`},fixes:{h:`Laba hagaajin oo mar dambe ah`,p1:`Laba dhibaato ayaa khariidadaha Alberta ka dhiga kuwo ay adag tahay in la hubiyo. Qiyaastii kala badh dhammaan codadka waxa la dhiibtaa ka hor maalinta doorashada, Elections Alberta-na waxay u soo sheegtaa oo keliya riding ahaan, sidaa darteed qiyaastii 810,000 cod oo UCP iyo NDP ah oo 2023 ah lama raadin karo ilaa aag codbixineed. Khariidaduhuna waxa laga sawiraa tirinno tirakoob oo sannado jir ah marka ay dhaqan galaan. <a href="__BASE__/fixes">Bogga hagaajinta</a> wuxuu muujiyaa sida labadaba loo hagaajiyo.`},answer:{h:`Jawaabta gaaban`,p1:`<strong>Khariidadda cusub.</strong> Imtixaannada aan horay u go'aamiyay, khariidadda 91-kursi ah ee guddida talo-bixintu ma soo celiso janjeerka xagga UCP ee aan ka helay mid ka mid ah khariidadaha guddida. Waxay kiciyaa 2 ka mid ah 5 calaamadood oo ku saabsan sida khadadkeeda loo sawiray, iyo 1 ka mid ah 4 oo ku saabsan sida ay codadka ugu beddesho kursiyo. Is-waafaq wuxuu u baahnaa 3 ka mid ah 5 iyo 2 ka mid ah 4. Natiijooyinkani waa ku-meel-gaadh: faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidaddu weli dadweynaha looma bandhigin, sidaa darteed khadadka waxaan ka dib u dhisay warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta.`,p2:`<strong>Saddex arrimood ayaa weli mudan in la eego.</strong> Marka hore, imtixaanka 50-50. Codka riding kasta isla qadar u dhaqaaji ilaa gobolku si sax ah badh ugu kala qaybsamo, kadibna tiri kursiyada. Khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay UCP siisaa 44 ka mid ah 91, ama 48.35%. Khariidadaha kombuyuutar sawiro isagoon cod arkin inta badan waxay UCP siiyaan wax ka yar kala badh kursiyada marka codku siman yahay (44.8% tan caadiga ah), maxaa yeelay guulaha UCP ee miyigu way ka ballaadhan yihiin guulaha NDP ee magaalada. 48.35% way ka badan tahay waxa 98.8 ka mid ah 100 kasta oo khariidadahaas ah bixiyaan, warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023. Marka loo eego khariidadaha leh isla 91 riding, way ka badan tahay 90 ilaa 97 ka mid ah 100. Marka labaad, Lethbridge iyo Banff sababaha dadka ee guddida talo-bixintu kuma habboona tirooyinkeeda laftigeeda. Marka loo eego khariidadda beddelka ah ee inta yar ee guddida talo-bixinta laftigeeda, isbeddelladaasi waxay NDP ka qaadaan laba kursi warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023. Haddii la tiriyo dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, tirinta la diiwaangeliyay waxay bixisaa hal, xeer cusub oo codadka hore lagu dhigo, oo aan weli la qaadan, waxba ma bixiyo. Mid kastaa waa mid aad u dhow oo aan la go'aamin karin: farqiga guushu wuu ka yar yahay codadka ku teedsan khadadka la eegayo. Marka saddexaad, Talada 5, talada keliya ee dawladdu soo xigatay, waxay codsatay in 41-ka riding ee Airdrie iyo koonfurteeda ay ahaadaan sidii ay inta badan ee guddidu u sawirtay. Khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay beddeshaa 10 ka mid ah.`,p3:`<strong>Khariidaddii arrintan bilowday.</strong> Maarso 2026 guddida madax-bannaan waxay u kala qaybsantay 3 iyo 2 waxayna gudbisay laba khariidadood. Labadaba waxaan barbar dhigay 1,010,000 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray isagoon cod arkin. Khariidadda inta badan way u eg tahay. Khariidadda inta yar waxay xagga UCP uga sii janjeertaa ku dhowaad dhammaantood. Codka 50-50 u kala qaybi, oo keliya 69 ka mid ah ayaa UCP siiya saami kursiyo oo ka weyn, oo keliya waxyar. Golaha Sharci-dejintu midna ma qaadan.`,p4:`<strong>Habraaca.</strong> Guddidu waxay qabatay dhegaysiyo dadweyne waxayna daabacday qabyo. Guddiga iyo guddidiisa talo-bixintu ma qabanin dhegaysiyo dadweyne oo ku saabsan khariidadda cusub mana soo saarin qabyo. Sida aan sharciga u akhriyo, waxba ma mamnuucayaan taas. Waxay se ka leexanaysaa dhaqan Kanadu dhistay qiyaastii lixdan sano: hay'ad madax-bannaan ayaa sawirta khariidadda, iyadoo ka fog MLA-yada ku tartami doona.`,next:`<strong>Waxa xiga.</strong> MLA-yada ayaa go'aamiya in khariidaddu sharci noqoto. Dacwad maxkamadeed waxay iman kartaa oo keliya marka sharci xudduudeed la ansixiyo. Marka faylasha rasmiga ah la soo saaro, imtixaan kasta waxaan dib u socodsiin doonaa 72 saacadood gudahood natiijadana halkan ayaan ku dhigi doonaa, jihada ay tilmaanto kasta ha ahaatee.`},bodies:{t1:`<strong>23 Maarso 2026.</strong> Guddidu waxay u kala qaybsantaa 3 iyo 2 waxayna gudbisaa laba khariidadood.`,t2:`<strong>21 Abriil.</strong> Mooshinka Dawladda 37 wuxuu labada khariidadood dhinac iska dhigaa wuxuuna abuuraa guddiga lixda MLA.`,t3:`<strong>2 iyo 9 Juun.</strong> Guddigu wuxuu magacaabaa guddida talo-bixinta: marka hore guddoomiyaheeda, kadibna afar xubnood.`,t4:`<strong>22 Oktoobar.</strong> Guddida talo-bixintu waxay soo bandhigtaa khariidaddeeda 91-kursi ah. 28 Oktoobar guddigu wuxuu u codeeyaa 3 iyo 2 inuu dib-u-eegistiisa joojiyo isagoon ku darin wax faallo ah oo isaga u gaar ah.`,t5:`<strong>2 Noofembar.</strong> Guddigu wuxuu warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta u diraa Golaha Sharci-dejinta. Marka xigta, MLA-yada ayaa go'aamiya in ay ansixiyaan hindise sharci.`}},fixes:{page_title:`Hagaajinno mar dambe · Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,h1:`Hagaajinno mar dambe`,meta:`Wehel luqad fudud · waxa ka dhigi lahaa khariidadda xigta mid ka fudud in la hubiyo`,back:`← Ku noqo hubinta`},evidence:{page_title:`Diiwaanka oo dhan · Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,h1:`Diiwaanka oo dhan`,meta:`Shan iyo tobanka natiijo oo buuxa, luuqad fudud`,intro:`Halkan waxa ku yaal natiijo kasta oo ka dambaysa bogga ugu weyn, si buuxda. Mid kastaa wuxuu sheegaa waxa aan helay, waxa ay tilmaami karto, waxa caadiga ka ah Kanada, iyo sababta aanay caddayn go'an u ahayn, oo ay ku jiraan waxa sharcigu ku sameeyo. Inta badankood waxay barbar dhigaan labada khariidadood ee ay guddidu gudbisay Maarso 2026. Guddidu waxay u kala qaybsantay 3 iyo 2, sidaa darteed inta badan iyo inta yar mid kastaa wuxuu gudbiyay khariidad. Natiijada 15 waxay hubisaa guddida talo-bixinta ee sawirtay khariidadda cusub ee 91-riding ah. (Riding waa aagga doorta hal MLA.) Bogga u akhri sidii diiwaan. Natiijooyinka ka soo horjeeda hubinta waxay fadhiyaan meel u dhow kuwa taageera.`,back:`← Ku noqo hubinta`,group_map:`Khadadka: waxa khariidad kastaa ka sameyso dhulka`,group_sim:`Marka loo eego khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray: inta ay khariidad kastaa caadi ka tahay`,group_conduct:`Dadka: waxa hay'ad kastaa samaysay oo tidhi`,beat_found:`Waxa aan helay`,beat_show:`Waxa ay tilmaami karto`,beat_context:`Waxa khubarradu yidhaahdaan`,beat_canada:`Waxa caadiga ka ah Kanada`,beat_law:`Sababta aanay caddayn go'an u ahayn`,explainer:`Sharraxaad`,e1:`Khariidadda inta yar waxay Airdrie, magaalo leh 85,805 qof, u qaybisaa afar riding`,e2:`Inta badan waxay afar ka mid ah xudduudaha inta yar u calaamadeysay kuwo aan caadi ahayn, imtixaannadayduna waxay xaqiijiyaan saddex`,e3:`Waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary, riding-yada khariidadda inta yar dad badan ayay hayaan`,e4:`Khariidadda inta yar way ka sinnaan yar tahay xagga dadka, waxa keliya ee sharcigu cabbiro`,e5:`Labada khariidadoodba waxay raacaan khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka qiyaastii inta khariidadda 2019 raacdo`,e6:`Codka 50-50 u kala qaybi, khariidadda inta yarna waxay UCP siisaa saami kursiyo oo ka weyn dhammaan marka laga reebo 69 ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray`,e7:`Hal cabbir oo caddaalad, farqiga waxtarka, ma gaadhin xariiqda aan horay u dejiyay`,e8:`Suurtagalnimada khariidad la mid ah tan inta yar: inta u dhexeysa 1 ka mid ah 20,000 iyo 1 ka mid ah 570,000, iyo waxa aanay tiradaasi ahayn`,e9:`Waxaan isku dayay inaan natiijadayda laftayda burburiyo: hal hubin way adkaysatay, mid aad bay u yarayd si ay go'aan u gaadho, midna lama socodsiin karin`,e10:`Saddex natiijo oo jihada kale tilmaamaya, oo diiwaanka lagu hayo`,e11:`Lix ka mid ah sababaha inta yar sheegtay, oo lagu hubiyay xog dadweyne`,e12:`Guddidu waxay u kala qaybsantay 3 iyo 2, eedaha dhinac kastaa u jeediyay kan kale oo la tijaabiyay`,e13:`Guddidu way u jawaabtay dadweynaha; habraacii beddelay dhegaysiyo ma qabanin`,e14:`Caadada ah in hay'ad madax-bannaan sawirto khariidadda, oo hal mooshin dhinac iska dhigay`,e15:`Lethbridge iyo Banff, sababaha guddida talo-bixinta ee aan hubin karay kuma adkaystaan tirooyinkeeda laftigeeda`,sides_h:`Waxa dhinac kastaa ku eedeeyay, oo la tijaabiyay`,newer_h:`Khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta: hubinnada cusub`},body:{section_link_aria:`Xiriiriye qaybta`,the_map:{heading:`1: Khariidadda`,heading2:`Khariidadda daboolka`,p1:`Khariidadda jaldiga waa sawirka keligiis ugu fiican ee hubintan. Halkan ka eeg sida loo akhriyo.`,p2:`Alberta waxa loo qaybiyey 4,765 Aag Codbixineed — aagag juquraafi oo yaryar oo Elections Alberta u isticmaasho tirinta warqadaha codbixinta ee xarumaha codbixinta. Mid kasta waxa lagu midabeeyay sida dadka ku nooli dhab ahaan u codeeyeen 2023: oranji meelaha codadka NDP ku urursan yihiin, buluug meelaha codadka UCP ku urursan yihiin. Laakiin midabku wuxuu noqdaa mid madow oo qoto dheer oo keliya meelaha dad badani ku nool yihiin. Aag Codbixineed oo daboola boqollaal kiiloomitir oo laba jibbaaran oo dhul daaq ah ama beero ah wuxuu ahaanayaa mid midab khafiif ah — ku dhowaad aan la arki karin. Khariidaddu way iftiimisaa meelaha dadku joogaan, wayna libdhaa meelaha aanay joogin.`,p3:`Tani aad bay uga duwantahay Alberta aad aragto habeenkii doorashada. Khariidadaha doorashada inta badani waxay si buuxda u midaystaan riding-yo dhammaystiran buluug ama oranje iyada oo ku saleysan cidda guulaysatay. Riding-yada miyiga ah waxay juquraafi ahaan u weyn yihiin UCP-na waxay ku guulaysataa inta badan, sidaa darteed habeenkii doorashada Alberta waxay u eeg tahay darbi buluug ah oo leh boorso oranje yaryar oo Edmonton iyo Calgary ku yaal. Khariidadda jaldigu waxay isticmaashaa isla codadka iyo isla juquraafiga — laakiin waxay tusinaysaa kuwo lagu miisaamay halka dadku dhab ahaan ku nool yihiin. Waxa muuqda waa gobol oo dadka inta badani ay ku urursan yihiin qaanso magaalo oo cufan, magaalooyinkaasi waxay si aad u kala duwan u codeeyaan khariidadda miyiga ah ee caadi ahaan u matasha.`,p4:`Khadadka xudduudaha ee midabka dushiisa lagu sawiray waa 89-ka degmo doorasho ee ay soo jeedisay inta yar ee guddida — khariidadda ay hubintani ugu dambayn dhaleecayso. Shaqada hubintu waa in la weydiiyo waxa khadadkaasi ku samaynayaan dadka hoostooda ku nool.`,p5:`Sawirkani ayaa khataraha caddeeya. Gobol u muuqda mid hal dhinac u codeeya khariidad caadi ah, dhab ahaan waa gobol ay dadkiisa intooda badani ku nool yihiin aagag dhinaca kale u codeeya. Marka dadka hoostooda lagu arko go'aannada xudduudaha, go'aannadaasi mar dambe uma muuqdaan kuwo nasiib ku yimid.`},preliminary:{badge:`BILOW AH`,heading:`Natiijooyin bilow ah — sugaya dib-u-eegis madax-bannaan oo khabiir ah`,body:`Khubaro madax-bannaan oo maaddada yaqaan ayaa dib u eegaya imtixaannada tirakoobka ee qaybtan ka hor daabacaadda kama dambaysta ah. Natiijooyinka oo dhammaystiran waa kuwan hoose, oo u furan baadhitaankaas.`},structural_results:{heading:`Natiijooyinka hubinta qaab-dhismeedka — ka hor wax tirakoob ah:`,body:`Khariidadda inta badan waxay dhaaftaa <strong>eber ka mid ah shan</strong> xad qaab-dhismeed oo hore loo diiwaangeliyay. Khariidadda inta yar waxay dhaaftaa <strong>afar ka mid ah shanta</strong>; tan shanaad (xajinta) waa dhexdhexaad — labada khariidadoodba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada ee 70–85%. Kuwani waa cabbirro joomatari ah — faafinta dadka, <button class="vocab-term" data-def="sida ay xudduudaha degmadu si dhow ugu raacaan xadadka magaalada iyo dawladda hoose ee hore u jiray, halkii ay dhex mari lahaayeen" aria-expanded="false">xajinta dawladda hoose</button>, tirada qaybaha Airdrie, dadka dheeraadka ah ee woqooyi-bari/bartamaha Calgary, iyo toddobada qaab xuduudeed ee Guddoomiyaha Guddida, Garsoore Miller, laftiisu qoraal ku calaamadeeyay (warbixinta inta badan, bogagga 59 iyo 62–63) — kuwaas oo aan u baahnayn xog doorasho iyo qalab muunad-qaadasho tirakoob midna. Qaybta xigta waxay labada khariidadood barbar dhigtaa 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray, waxayna gaadhaa isla gunaanadka iyadoo adeegsanaysa qalab gebi ahaanba ka duwan. Laba qalab oo madax-bannaan — joomatari iyo tirakoob — way isku yimaadaan, labaduba waxay ku dhacaan gobollada uu guddoomiyaha guddidu qoraal ku dhaleeceeyay.`},clean:{heading:`6: Marka khariidad u eg mid caddaalad ah ee aan ahayn`,legal_label:`OGEYSIIS KU SAABSAN ERAYBIXINTA SHARCIGA`,legal_body:`"Gerrymandering" ma laha qeexitaan sharci oo Kanada. Ereygu waxa loo isticmaalaa warbixintan oo dhan macnaheeda caadiga ah ee siyaasadda — wax-ka-beddelka xudduudaha doorashada faa'iido xisbiyeed. Imtixaanada sharci ee dhab ahaan ku shaqeeya Kanada waa kala duwan: in xudduuduhu bixiyaan "matalaad waxtar leh" sida ku cad qaybta 3 ee <em>Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha</em> (heerka dastuuriga ah ee Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada ay dejisay 1991-kii <em>Tixraaca Saskatchewan</em>), iyo in guddidu raacday shuruucda <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta. Natiijooyinka hubintu waa caddaymo la xidhiidha su'aalahaas sharciga. Ma aha caddayn khalad sharci ahaan la qeexay, warbixintanuna uma qeexdo sidaas.`,intro_p1:`Su'aasha keligeed ugu cad ee la weydiin karo khariidad kasta oo doorasho waa tan: haddii codka gobolku si sax ah u kala qaybsamo labada xisbi ee waaweyn, immisa kursi ayay khariidaddu soo saari lahayd? Tani waxay codbixiyayaasha hayaa joogto waxayna khariidadda keligeed weydiisaa waxa ay sameyso.`,intro_p2:`Si looga jawaabo tan, hubintu waxay samaysay 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray oo xisaab ahaan dhexdhexaad ah. Jilitaanku wuxuu adeegsaday faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta ee juquraafiga guddida, qorshe kastana wuxuu ku qabtay isla shuruudaha dheelitirka dadka (±25%) iyo isku-xidhnaanta — labada shuruudood ee algorithm-ku qasbo, ma aha qodob kasta oo sharci ah (tusaale ahaan, ma qasbo danaha bulshada), sidaa darteed kooxda isbarbardhigga waxa ugu habboon in loo akhriyo mid dhexdhexaad ah xagga dadka iyo isku-xidhnaanta, ma aha mid si buuxda sharciga u waafaqsan. Labada khariidadood ee guddida ee 2026 ayaa markaas la dhex dhigay qaybintaas si loo arko sida ay caadi u yihiin. Jilitaanku wuxuu ku socday afar silsilad oo madax-bannaan oo mid kastaa leedahay 252,500 tallaabo, iniinta saldhigga ahna waxa laga soo qaaday calaamadda Cloudflare drand, waxaana OSF lagu diiwaangeliyay ka hor inta aan la socodsiin.`,howmcmc_label:`SIDA UU JILITAANKU U SHAQEEYO`,howmcmc_mcmc:`Isku dar laba degmo oo is ag yaal, kadib bolla-urursigaas si nasiib ah ugu kala qaybi laba degmo oo cusub oo sharci ah, ku celi malyuun jeer, adigoo tallaabo kasta khariidadda kaydinaya. Taasi waa mashiinka oo dhan. Sharraxaadda tallaabo-tallaabada ah — iyo imtixaan kasta oo kale oo boggan ku jira, luuqad fudud — waxay ku jirtaa <a href="__BASE__/methods">bogga Hababka</a>.`,howmcmc_recom:`Algorithm-ka waxa la yidhaahdaa ReCom — qalabka caadiga ah ee cilmigan — wuxuuna qaab-dhismeed ahaan u ilaaliyaa labada xeer sharci ee adag (dheelitirka dadka, isku-xidhnaanta).`,prereg_label:`DIIWAAN-GELINTA HORE`,prereg_body:`Diiwaangelinta hore waxa loola jeedaa in imtixaannada, xadadka iyo jihooyinka la saadaaliyay lagu qoro diiwaan dadweyne oo waqti lagu dhejiyay ka hor inta aan xogta la eegin — si xad aan si qarsoodi ah loo dhaqaajin karin marka jawaabtu timaado ka dib. Ballamaha hubintan waxa lagu kaydiyay Open Science Framework, iniinyaheeda nasiibka ah waxa lagu xidhay calaamad dadweyne ka hor inta aanay faylasha khariidadaha rasmiga ahi jirin, natiijo kastana waxa loo calaamadeeyay mid hore loo diiwaangeliyay ama mid baadhitaan bilow ah. Xisaabta oo dhan ee midkee yahay kee waxay ku jirtaa <a href='__BASE__/methods'>bogga Hababka</a>.`,neutral_p:`Alberta, jawaabta dhexdhexaadka ahi ma aha 50/50. <em>1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta oo sharci ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray dhexdooda, khariidadda dhexe (median) waxay UCP siisaa 44.8% kursiyada oo keliya marka codku yahay 50/50</em> — khariidad caadi ah oo Alberta ah, marka codadku dhexdhexaad yihiin, waxay NDP siisaa aqlabiyad kursiyo oo yar. Tani waxay ka soo horjeedaa waxa la filan lahaa laakiin waa farsamo: codbixiyayaasha UCP ee miyigu waxay riding-yadooda ku guulaystaan farqi 60-40 ah (iyagoo khasaariya codad badan oo UCP oo "dheeraad" ah), halka codbixiyayaasha NDP ee magaaladu ay riding-yadooda ku guulaystaan farqi ka cidhiidhi badan oo 51-49 ah (iyagoo guul kasta ku khasaariya codad NDP oo ka yar). Marka la dhexdhexaad yahay, NDP ayaa ka horraysa waxtarka kursiyada.`,full_dist:`Qaybinta buuxda ee jilitaanka rasmiga ah ee 1,010,000-ka khariidadood:`,t1_col_a:`Halka khariidaddu joogto`,t1_col_b:`Kursiyo UCP codka 50/50`,t1_r1_a:`Khariidadda dhexe ee Alberta`,t1_r1_b:`44.8% — aqlabiyad yar oo kursiyo NDP`,t1_r2_a:`Khariidadda 95-aad centile`,t1_r2_b:`47.1%`,t1_r3_a:`Khariidadda 99-aad centile`,t1_r3_b:`48.4%`,t1_r4_a:`<strong>Heerka ugu sarreeya ee 1,010,000 khariidadood</strong>`,t1_r4_b:`<strong>51.72% (69 ka mid ah 1,010,000 qorshe ayaa ka sarreeya 51.69%-ka inta yar)</strong>`,seat_count_note:`Ogeysiis ku saabsan tirada kursiyada. Khariidadaha guddida ee 2026 mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay <strong>89</strong> degmo; jilitaanka kombuyuutarka ee hubintu wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa khariidadda 2019 ee <strong>87</strong>-ka degmo (saldhiggiisa bilowga); guddiga Lunty wuxuu Noofembar soo saari doonaa <strong>91</strong>. Dhammaan boqolleyda waa <em>saamiyo</em> kursiyo, oo la isbarbar dhigi karo inkastoo tirada guud ee kursiyadu kala duwan tahay. Jilitaanku wuxuu khariidadda 2019 u isticmaalaa barta bilowga maxaa yeelay algorithm-ka ReCom wuxuu u baahan yahay khariidad sharci ahaan la dhaqan geliyay si uu uga bilaabo isweydaarsiyada — khariidadda 2019 waa khariidaddii doorashada Alberta ee ugu dambaysay ee la dhaqan geliyay. In mid ka mid ah soo jeedinnada guddida saldhig loo isticmaalo waxay noqon lahayd wareeg: waxaynu cabbiri lahayn in khariidad xad-dhaaf tahay marka loo eego khariidado iyada laftigeeda laga soo saaray.`,pattern_intro:`Natiijooyinka — meelaynta saddexda khariidadood ee dhabta ah qaybintan dhexdeeda — waxay tilmaamayaan qaab gaar ah oo si sax ah loo beegsaday oo sawiridda xudduudaha ah.`,sub1_h:`Afarta cabbir ee tirakoobku isku mar ayay wada calaamad bixiyaan`,sub1_p:`Marka la isticmaalo faylasha khariidadaha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, khariidadda inta yar waa qiime tirakoob ahaan ka baxsan caadiga cabbir kasta oo caddaaladda xisbiyeed — ma aha oo keliya cabbirka heerka kala-soocida.`,t2_col_a:`Khariidad`,t2_col_b:`Farqiga waxtarka`,t2_col_c:`Dhexe-dhexdhexaad`,t2_col_d:`<a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener" title="Declination waxay cabbirtaa farqiga zaawiyad ee qalooca kursi-codka ee xisbi kasta. Qiimaha taban wuxuu ku doorbidayaa NDP; kuwa togan waxay doorbidayaan UCP.">Declination</a>`,t2_col_e:`Kursiyo 50/50`,t2_r1_a:`Inta badan 2026`,t2_r1_b:`+0.1% (p16.5)`,t2_r1_c:`−3.6% (p1)`,t2_r1_d:`−0.027 (p21.8)`,t2_r1_e:`46.1% (p78.5)`,t2_r2_a:`Inta yar 2026`,t2_r2_b:`<strong>+4.0% (p94.5)</strong>`,t2_r2_c:`<strong>+1.0% (p99.97)</strong>`,t2_r2_d:`<strong>+0.077 (p98.8)</strong>`,t2_r2_e:`<strong>51.7% (p99.99)</strong>`,sub1_close:`Khariidadda inta badan si raaxo leh ayay ugu jirtaa xadka caadiga ah saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir. Farqigeeda dhexe-dhexdhexaadku wuxuu ku jiraa p1 (= p0.99) jihada NDP u roon — natiijo aan caadi ahayn, laakiin u jeedda jihada aan UCP caawin. Sida dhow ee khariidadda inta badan u raacdo xudduudaha dawladda hoose waxay bartamaha magaalooyinka ee NDP ku badan tahay gelisaa degmooyin u gaar ah oo isku urursan, halkaas oo codadka NDP ku guuleystaan farqi waxtar leh, halka guulaha miyiga ee UCP ay u badan yihiin farqi ka weyn; faa'iidadan waxtar ee qaab-dhismeed ee yar ee NDP ayaa ka muuqata cabbirka dhexe-dhexdhexaadka. Khariidadda inta yar waxay ku jirtaa dabada afartaba, mid kastaa wuxuu u jeedaa isla jihada xisbiyeed.`,sub2_h:`Heerka kala-soocida 50/50: in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha`,sub2_p:`Cabbirka heerka kala-soocida ee kor lagu soo bandhigay — kursiyo UCP ee codka gobol ee 50/50 — waa habka ugu fudud ee loo barbar dhigi karo saddexda khariidadood.`,t3_col_a:`Khariidad`,t3_col_b:`Kursiyo UCP codka 50/50`,t3_col_c:`Halkay joogto`,t3_r1_a:`2019 la dejiyay`,t3_r1_b:`46.0%`,t3_r1_c:`78-aad centile — gudaha kala-duwanaanta caadiga ah`,t3_r2_a:`<strong>Inta badan 2026</strong>`,t3_r2_b:`<strong>46.1%</strong>`,t3_r2_c:`<strong>78-aad centile — si fiican gudaha xadadka</strong>`,t3_r3_a:`<strong>Inta yar 2026</strong>`,t3_r3_b:`<strong>51.7% (46 kursi)</strong>`,t3_r3_c:`<strong>99.99-aad centile — in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 sawir oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha</strong>`,sub2_close:`In ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar soo saaray ayaa soo saaray qiime <code>seats@50/50</code> oo la mid ah kan soo jeedinta inta yar ama ka sarreeya. Iyada oo ku saleysan qaababka codbixinta dhowaan ee dhabta ah, waxay UCP siinaysaa 60 kursi (marka loo eego 55 soo jeedinta inta badan). Soo jeedinta inta badan waa nooca khariidad ee habraac dhexdhexaad ahi caadi ahaan soo saaro. Soo jeedinta inta yar waa nooca khariidad ee ay tahay inaad si gaar ah u beegsato si aad u sawirto.`,sub3_h:`Macnaheedu maxay tahay luuqad cad`,sub3_p:`Soo jeedinta inta yar waxay ku jirtaa dabada aadka u fog ee 1,010,000-ka qorshe saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda xisbiyeed, tan afraadna (farqiga waxtarka, +4.0%) waxay ku jirtaa centile-ka 94.5 — <em>u dhow, laakiin ka hooseeya</em> xadka hubintu hore u diiwaangelisay ee Alberta loo habeeyay, kaas oo ah centile-ka 95. Labada kanaal ee imtixaanka wadajirka ahi waxay wadaagaan xog farqi-waxtar oo hoose, mana aha kuwo tirakoob ahaan madax-bannaan, sidaa darteed isku-darka qiimayaashooda p ee habka Fisher wuxuu buunbuuniyaa muhiimadda. Isku-dar u adkaysta ku-tiirsanaanta (Bonferroni) ayaa bixiya qiyaas moodel oo ah qiyaastii <strong>hal ka mid ah 568,000</strong> (p&nbsp;=&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>). Taasi weli waa natiijo aad u daran, oo si fog uga gudubta xadadka muhiimadda ee caadiga ah — laakiin waa qiyaas moodel, ma aha afar qalab oo madax-bannaan oo isku raacay.`,details_summary:`Macnaha qiimahan p — iyo waxa aanay ka dhignayn`,details_p1:`Qiimaha p wuxuu ka jawaabaa hal su'aal: haddii khariidadda uu sawiray habraac dhexdhexaad ah, intee jeer ayaan arki lahayn natiijo sidan u daran ama ka sii daran? Marka loo eego qiyaasta moodelka hubinta, p&nbsp;=&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>, jawaabtu waa qiyaastii hal mar 568,000 tijaabo.`,details_p2:`Tani waa tijaabo mala-awaal oo frequentist ah, ma aha cabbir niyad. Ma sheegayso in guddidu ay ula jeeday qaybsi siyaasadeed, mana cabbirayso sida khariidaddu aan caddaalad u ahayn macnaha wax-ku-oolka ah. Waxay sheegtaa in qaabka xudduudu yahay tirakoob ahaan aan la jaan-qaadayn qaybinta tixraaca ee sawir-dhexdhexaadka ah ee ReCom — hubin dibadeed oo xooggan, laakiin aan kaamil ahayn (ma dhaqan-geliyo shuruud kasta oo sharci oo guddidu ku hoos shaqaynaysay, tusaale, heerarka s.15(2) iyo xaddidaadaha danta bulsho).`,details_p3:`Guutada tijaabada qaab-dhismeed (dadka, kala-qaybinta, xajinta, isku-cufnaanta, saxeexyada) ayaa lagu diiwaan-geliyay calaamado wakhti ah ka hor dib-u-xisaabinta rasmiga ah (<a href="https://osf.io/w2s8k" rel="noopener">Diiwaangelinta OSF w2s8k</a>). Kanaalada eexda xisbiyeed (Mahalanobis isku-jirka ah, SZAT, isku-darka Fisher/Bonferroni) waxa loo calaamadeeyay "sahmin" macnaha hubinta lafteeda ee §4.3.1: oo lagu qoray kaydka, laakiin aan horay loo diiwaangelin ka hor xogta. Hubintu waxay kanaal kasta si gooni ah u soo sheegtaa waxayna isugu darsaa labanlaab Bonferroni halkii ay u soo bandhigi lahayd inay yihiin tijaabooyin xaqiijin oo si buuxda madax-bannaan.`,szat_label:`TIJAABADA QAYBINTA AAGAGGA ISBEDDELA (SWING-ZONE ALLOCATION TEST, SZAT)`,szat_body:`SZAT waxa loo naqshadeeyay kanaal falanqeyn oo labaad: halkii la weydiin lahaa "khariidaddani guud ahaan ma xad-dhaaf baa?" waxay weydiisaa "doorashooyinka khadadka gaarka ah ma yihiin kuwo xisbi-dhexdhexaad ah?" Waxay u shaqeysaa iyada oo gooni u soocaysa kaliya Aagagga Codbixinta halka khariidadda inta yar ay ka duwan tahay tan inta badan — dib-u-sawirka la murmay — oo tijaabinaysa in doorashooyinkaas gaarka ah, marka la isugu daro, ay waxtarka codka jiho hal xisbi ah u wareejiyaan. Maxaa yeelay waxay isbarbar dhigtaa kaliya meelaha ay ku kala tagaan, waxay si toos ah u xakameysaa wax kasta oo labada khariidadood wadaagaan: isla juquraafiga, bartilmaameedyada tirada dadka, iyo xeerarka sharciga. Tijaabo permutation caadi ah hoosteeda SZAT waxay soo celisay p=0.0024; male-awaal eber (null) oo block-permutation ah oo saxa autocorrelation-ka meeleed ee Aagagga Codbixinta isku xiga hoostiisa, waxay soo celisay p≈0.19 — ma aha mid muhiim ah (not significant). SZAT waxa loo hayaa macluumaad sahmin ah laakiin kuma badbaado kanaal xaqiijin ah. Cinwaanku wuxuu ku tiirsan yahay jilitaanka oo keliya. <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/szat_summary.json" rel="noopener">Faahfaahin farsamo →</a>`,two_q:`<strong>Natiijada SZAT.</strong> Jilitaanka 1,010,000-ka khariidadood wuxuu weydiiyaa: <em>khariidaddani ma aad bay u daran tahay marka loo eego khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ee lagu sawiray isla juquraafiga Alberta?</em> Imtixaan labaad — <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/szat_summary.json" rel="noopener">Swing-Zone Allocation Test</a> — wuxuu weydiiyay su'aal kale: <em>khadadka gaarka ah ee khariidadda ma yihiin kuwo xisbi-dhexdhexaad ah?</em> Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa isagoo eegaya oo keliya Aagagga Codbixinta (Voting Areas) ee inta yar si ka duwan inta badan u sawirtay, wuxuuna weydiiyaa in doorashooyinkaas gaarka ah, marka la isku daro, ay waxtarka codka u wareejiyeen jihada hal xisbi. Isbeddel-kala-hormarin (permutation) caadi ah hoostiisa wuxuu soo celiyay p=0.0024. Null isbeddel-baloog (block-permutation) ah hoostiisa — kaas oo saxa isku-ekaanshaha meelaha Aagagga Codbixinta ee is-ag yaal — wuxuu soo celiyay p≈0.19. Natiijada isbeddel-baloogga ma gaadho muhiimad. Sidaa darteed hubintu waxay natiijada jilitaanka oo keliya u soo sheegtaa sidii cinwaanka: qiyaas moodel oo Bonferroni lagu saxay oo ah <strong>1 ka mid ah 568,000</strong> (p&nbsp;=&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>), ma aha isku-darka Fisher ee laba kanaal oo madax-bannaan.`,super_lead:`Gole sharci-dejin oo 89 kursi ah, aqlabiyad saddex meelood laba meel ahi waxay u baahan tahay si sax ah 60 kursi. Saamiga kursiyada soo jeedinta inta yar marka codku siman yahay, 51.7% — heer ay gaadhaan 69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee dhexdhexaadka ah — wuxuu ku jiraa xaaladda uu aqlabiyadda weyn ee UCP tirakoob ahaan suurtagal ku noqonayso juquraafiga Alberta ee 2023. Laakiin jilitaanku ma qasbo shuruud kasta oo sharci ah oo guddidu ku shaqaynaysay, sidaa darteed tani waa hubin dibadeed oo xooggan, ma aha caddayn in aanay jirin khariidad Alberta oo sharciga waafaqsan oo gaadhi karta tiradan kursiyada. Caddaynta qaab-dhismeed ee Fasalka I, oo aan gabi ahaanba ku tiirsanayn jilitaanka, ayaa qaada miisaanka badankiisa; booska dabada ee codka simanku waa macnaha taageeraya.`,super_label:`SABABTA AQLABIYAD WEYN AY MUHIIM U TAHAY`,super_body:`Hoos nidaamka Westminster ee Kanada, Golaha Alberta ma laha heer saddex-meelood-laba ah oo furaya awoodo gaar ah: aqlabiyad xukun — xataa mid yar — waxay hadda ansixin kartaa shuruuc iyo miisaaniyado, ku dhawaaqi kartaa "xidhitaanka" (closure) si ay dooda u soo afjarto, beddeli kartaa xeerarka Golaha, oo dhigi kartaa xubinnimada guddi kasta. Waxa aqlabiyad aad u weyni beddesho waa farqi iyo waarid, ma aha liiska awoodaha. Dawlad haysata 60 ka mid ah 89 kursi waxay xaqiiqo ahaan ka dhowrsan tahay is-khilaafka gudaha — dhowr xubnood oo dhinaca kale u wareega ma hanjabi karaan — waxayna la kulantaa mucaarid aad u yar oo aan awoodin inuu ku qasbo codayn la diiwaangeliyo ama uu joogteeyo baadhitaanka guddiyada. Walaaca halkan jira waa urursanaanta kursiyada iyo yaraanta mucaaridka waxtarka leh, ma aha heer habraac oo la gudbay.`,super_close:`Qaabka isku-darka magaalada ee lagu aqoonsaday Fasalka I — codbixiyayaasha magaalada oo loo qaybiyay degmooyinka cidhifka miyiga ee ku wareegsan — wuxuu la jaanqaadayaa natiijada 60-ka kursi, inkastoo imtixaanka tooska ah ee hubintu ku eegtay in joomatarigaas uu yahay farsamada gaarka ah laguma socodsiin karin xogteeda kama dambaysta ah (Natiijada 9). Natiijooyinka qaab-dhismeedka iyo tirakoobku waxay isugu yimaadaan isla soo jeedinta iyo isla bulshooyinka — waxayna isku raacsan yihiin cidda ka faa'iidaysa.`,sub4_h:`Xaqiijinta tijaabada habraaca la beegsaday`,sub4_p:`Si loo hubiyo in tani aanay ahayn wax gaar ah oo ka dhashay doorbidka la yaqaan ee jilitaanka dhexdhexaadka ahi u leeyahay isku-cufnaanta (compactness), hubintu waxay socodsiisay habraac la beegsaday oo ah fuulista buurta (hill-climbing) (<a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">Cannon iyo kuwa kale 2022 — la tixraacay oo lagu sharaxay warbixinta farsamada</a>) labada jiho: kor u qaadista kursiyada UCP iyo kor u qaadista kursiyada NDP. Isla tirada tallaabooyinka (40,000) jiho kasta, isla xaddidaadaha sharciga, isla joomatariga gobolka.`,t4_col_a:`Habraac`,t4_col_b:`Qiimaha ugu sarreeya ee la gaaray`,t4_col_c:`Waxa uu naga sheegayo`,t4_r1_a:`MCMC dhexdhexaad, qiimaha ugu sarreeya ee la soo saaray`,t4_r1_b:`51.72% kursiyada UCP @ 50/50 (69 ka mid ah 1,010,000 qorshe ayaa ka sarreeya 51.69%-ka inta yar)`,t4_r1_c:`Saqafka dabiiciga ah ee sawir dhexdhexaad`,t4_r2_a:`MCMC dhexdhexaad, qiimaha ugu hooseeya ee la soo saaray`,t4_r2_b:`~39% kursiyada UCP @ 50/50`,t4_r2_c:`Sagxada dabiiciga ah ee sawir dhexdhexaad`,t4_r3_a:`Fuulida buurta la beegsaday, kor u qaadista UCP`,t4_r3_b:`<strong>52.9%</strong>`,t4_r3_c:`Waxa habraac si ula kac ah u doonayo faa'iidada UCP gaadhi karo`,t4_r4_a:`Fuulida buurta la beegsaday, kor u qaadista NDP`,t4_r4_b:`<strong>37.9%</strong>`,t4_r4_c:`Waxa habraac si ula kac ah u doonayo faa'iidada NDP gaadhi karo (ka hoos sagxadda dhexdhexaadka ah)`,sub4_close:`51.7%-ka khariidadda inta yar waxay saqafka UCP-ka la beegsaday (52.9%) uga dhowdahay median-ka khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah (44.8%). 46.1%-ka khariidadda inta badan aad bay ugu dhowdahay median-ka dhexdhexaadka ah, oo ah centile-ka 78. Khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 labaduba si raaxo leh ayay ugu jiraan waxa habraac dhexdhexaad ahi si joogto ah u soo saaro — saamiyo cod oo kala duwan, isla aag natiijooyin aan la yaab lahayn. Khariidadda inta badan waxay dhidibka caddaaladda xisbiyeed ku sii wadaa dhaqankii Alberta ee 2019, sida ay xajinta dawladda hoose ugu sii wadato dhaqankii 2019 (80.0%, marka loo eego 75.1% ee 2019). Laba khariidadood oo lagu sawiray isla xeerarka Alberta, ay sameeyeen isla shanta xubnood ee guddida, isla qolka: mid waxay ku dhacdaa meesha habraacyada dhexdhexaadka ahi si joogto ah u gaadhaan, tan kalena waxay ku dhacdaa meel aad si gaar ah u beegsato haddii aad rabto inaad gaadho.`,sub4_quote:`<em>Tani</em> waa qaabka natiijada, waana qaabka uu maxkamadu dhab ahaan adeegsado.`,sub5_h:`Diidmada sharaxaadaha kale`,sub5_p:`Marka la soo bandhigo qiime tirakoob ahaan ka baxsan oo cabbirkan le'eg, hubin adag waa inay tijaabisaa sharraxaadaha caadiga ah ee aan eedda lahayn ka hor intaanay qaabka u aqoonsan mid aan la sharrixi karin. Xogta qaab-dhismeedku (Waddada 2) waxay ka hor imanaysaa mid kasta oo ka mid ah sharraxaadaha kale ee caadiga ah:`,defense1:`<strong>Difaaca "Juquraafiga Siyaasadeed ee Dabiiciga ah":</strong> <em>("Codbixiyayaasha magaaladu si dabiici ah ayay u urursan yihiin; khariidaddu kaliya waxay tarjumeysaa juquraafiga Alberta.")</em> 1,010,000-ka jilitaan ayaa horay u tixgeliyay juquraafiga dabiiciga ah ee Alberta. Juquraafigu runtii wuxuu UCP siiyaa faa'iido waxtar oo aasaasi ah — laakiin labada khariidadood ee dhabta ah ee la barbardhigayo ayaa muujinaya halka ay faa'iidadaasi si dabiici ah ugu dhammaato: khariidaddii la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 labaduba waxay ku yaalliin 78-aad centile ee cabbirka barta rogitaanka, booska ugu sarreeya ee khariidadda 2019 ay ka gaadho cabbir kasta oo xisbiyeed waa wax yar ka sarreeya centile-ka 90 (declination, 91-aad centile). Khariidadda inta yar waxay ku taal 99.99-aad centile — qiime aad uga baxsan caadiga <em>xitaa marka loo eego saldhigga si dabiici ah u eexday ee Alberta</em>.`,defense2:`<strong>Difaaca "Bulshooyinka Danta Iska Leh":</strong> <em>("Qaababka cajiibka ah waxa loo sawiray si loo mideeyo bulshooyin gaar ah.")</em> Haddii aad isku dayayso inaad bulshooyin isku haysid, waxaad raacaysaa xudduudaha dawladda hoose. Khariidadda inta badan waxay raacday xadadka magaalada ee jira 80% wakhtiga. Khariidadda inta yar waxay raacday 72% wakhtiga — labadaba ku jira caadiga Kanada ee 70–85%. Waxa khariidadda inta yar si firfircoon u samayso waa kala-qaybinta magaalada midaysan ee Airdrie afar qaybood oo gooni ah, iyo dhigista saddex ka mid ah go'aannadeeda xudduudeed si sax ah aagagga cidhifka magaalada ee uu guddoomiyaha guddidu ku calaamadeeyay inay joomatari ahaan aan caadi ahayn — doorashooyin aan lagu sharrixi karin caqliga bulshooyinka danta iska leh.`,defense3:`<strong>Difaaca "Sinaanta Dadka":</strong> <em>("Waxay ku qasbanaayeen inay sawiraan xudduudo cajiib ah si ay u hubiyaan in degmo kastaa leedahay tiro dad oo isku mid ah.")</em> Marka loo eego shaxaha dadka ee guddida laftigeeda, khariidadda inta yar ayaa sinnaanta dadka <em>ka liidata</em>: Leexashadeeda Celceliska Buuxda ee Dadka (MAD) waxay ahayd 4,707, 48% ka ballaadhan 3,180-ka khariidadda inta badan. Tirooyinka tirakoobka 2021, celceliska leexashada labada khariidadood ku dhowaad waa isku mid, leexashada dhexe (median) ee inta yarna way ka ballaadhan tahay (3,938 marka loo eego 2,827). Kala-fidkaas dhexe wuxuu ku jiraa centile-ka 99 ee khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ee lagu dheellitiray ±12.5% gudihiis, laakiin wuxuu ku jiraa xagga hoose ee kala-duwanaanta marka khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ahi isticmaali karaan ±25%-ka buuxa ee sharcigu oggol yahay.`,defense4:`<strong>Difaaca "Karti-darro ama Nasiib-xumo":</strong> <em>("Waxay keliya sawireen khariidad aan taxaddar lahayn, tirooyinkuna nasiib xumo ayay u noqdeen.")</em> In la gaadho qaab aqlabiyad weyn oo 60 kursi ah, iyadoo isla markaas Airdrie loo kala qaybinayo afar qaybood, saddex xuduudna la dhigayo isla aagagga ay inta badan ee guddidu laftoodu ku calaamadeeyeen kuwo aan caadi ahayn, waxay u baahan tahay saxnaan. Moodel tirakoob ayaa ku qiyaasa suurtagalnimada in si shil ah loo sawiro khariidad sidan ugu daran labada kanaal ee falanqaynta, marka loo eego qaybinta tixraaca dhexdhexaadka ah ee ReCom, qiyaastii <strong>1 ka mid ah 568,000</strong> (p&nbsp;=&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>, Bonferroni lagu saxay). Taasi weli waa mid aad u daran — si fog uga gudba muhiimadda caadiga ah — laakiin waa qiyaas moodel, ma aha hal suurtagalnimo oo sax ah.`,sub5_close:`Waxa xogtu muujinayso waa in soo jeedinta inta yar ay sii xumaysay sinnaanta dadka iyo isku-xidhnaanta bulshadaba marka loo eego waxa isla shanta la-taliye ay isku mar ku soo saareen xeerar sharci oo isku mid ah. Hubintu ma go'aamiso waxa la-taliyayaasha inta yar ula jeedeen — joomatariga xudduudu ma muujin karo niyad — laakiin ka leexashada qaab-dhismeed ee ka timid labadaba urursiga khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah iyo wixii soo jeedinta inta badan soo saartay way taagan tahay, niyaddu wax kastaa ha ahaatee.`,sub6_h:`Ogeysiis ku saabsan xaqiijinta is-tixraaca ah ee R`,sub6_p1:`Nooc hore oo hubintan ah (oo isticmaalay faylal khariidadeed oo qiyaas ah halkii uu ka isticmaali lahaa kuwa rasmiga ah) ayaa urursiga khariidadaha Python ReCom isbarbar dhigay muunad-qaadaha Sequential Monte Carlo ee xidhmada R <code>redist</code>. Hubintaas isweydaarsiga ahi waxay soo saartay natiijooyin aan xasilloonayn: saddex socodsiin oo isla iniin magac ahaaneed leh, qaybta qorshayaasha gaadhay qiimihii hore ee inta yar (48.3% joomatariga qiyaasta ah) waxay ahayd 5.6%, kadib 28%, kadib 58% — guuldarro isu-imaatinka muunad-qaadaha ah, ma aha helitaan. Qoraalka oo dhammaystiran wuxuu yaal <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/redist_python_comparison.md" rel="noopener">findings/redist_python_comparison.md</a>.`,sub6_p2:`Iyadoo la isticmaalayo faylasha khariidadaha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, <code>seats@50/50</code> ee khariidadda inta yar wuxuu kor u kacayaa 51.7% — qiime ay gaadhaan in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 qorshe oo dhexdhexaad ah. Su'aasha hubinta isweydaarsiga ee R macno ma yeelanayso: eber qorshe oo ka yimid labada muunad-qaade midkood ayaa gaadha qiimaha rasmiga ah marka cabbirrada muunaduhu isku dhow yihiin.`,sub6_asymm:`<strong>Sinnaan-la'aanta agagaarka 50/50 ayaa ka cad tirada keligeed.</strong> Sahan saxan oo qalooca kursi-codka ah oo heer 0.01 dhibic-boqolley ah wuxuu helay in khariidadda inta yari UCP ku haysato heerka aqlabiyadda golaha ee 45 kursi ama ka sarreeya ilaa qiyaastii <strong>49.2%</strong> codka labada xisbi: UCP way ku waayi kartaa qiyaastii 1.6 dhibcood oo weli dawlad samayn kartaa. Khariidadda <strong>inta badan</strong>, UCP waxay u baahan lahayd inay <em>ku guulaysato</em> qiyaastii 9 dhibcood si ay u gaadho isla heerkaas. Labada khariidadoodba waxay wajahaan isla juquraafiga Alberta iyo isla xeerarka sharciga; farqiga u dhexeeyaa waa qaab-dhismeed, ma aha buuq.`,sub6_close:`Tani waa natiijada eexda qaab-dhismeed ee hubintu kalsooni ku qabto. Waa joomatari oo keliya; kuma xidhna natiijo doorasho; isma beddesho marka ra'yi-ururintu isbeddesho.`,sub6_caveat:`<strong>Digniin ay hubintu si dhab ah u qaadato.</strong> Codbixiyayaal dhab ahi ma aha 50/50 siman. Codbixiyayaashu way ka adkaan karaan janjeerka qaab-dhismeed ee khariidad kasta haddii isbeddel cod oo ku filan dhaco — codbixiyayaal si gaar ah u cadhaysan ama u dhiirran ayaa rogi doona natiijada si kastaba ha loo sawiro xudduudaha. Imtixaanka 50/50 wuxuu go'doomiyaa <em>waxa khariidaddu ku darsato natiijada</em>, ma aha natiijada laftigeeda. Waxa uu muujinayaa waa waxa khariidaddu samayso marka codbixiyayaashu aanay iyagu go'aamin.`,sub7_h:`Gunaanadka`,sub7_p1:`Natiijada udub-dhexaadka ah ee hubintu waa joomatari. <strong>Waddada 2 — kaadhka buundooyinka aan caadiga ahayn ee qaab-dhismeedku — waa aasaaska; Waddada 1 waa caddayn in joomatarigu shaqo xisbiyeed sameynayo.</strong>`,sub7_p2:`Sawirka hoosee wuxuu dhigayaa labada waddo sawir keliya. Toosanaha jiifa waa Waddada 1 (farqiga waxtarka caddaaladda xisbiyeed, oo midig u dheer macnaheedu yahay UCP loo doorbidaayo); toosanaha taagan waa Waddada 2 (tirada imtixaanada caddaaladda qaab-dhismeed ee soo jeedinta ay ku dhacdo, shanta laga bilaabo, oo sare u dheer macnaheedu yahay mashaakil qaab-dhismeed oo badan).`,stakes_fig_alt:`Shaxda dhibcaha kala firdhisan oo farqiga waxtarka ku leh dhidibka jiifa, tirada imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedka ee lagu dhacayna dhidibka taagan. Khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 waxay ku urursan yihiin geeska hoose-bidix ee ammaanka ah. Khariidadda inta yar ee 2026 waxay ka muuqataa gobolka qiimaha ka baxsan ee sare-midig. Khariidadda 2019 waxa lagu calaamadeeyay 0 ka mid ah 4 la sameeyay: imtixaanka aagga Calgary marna laguma samayn.`,stakes_fig_caption:`Labada hab ee lagu cabbiray labada soo jeedin ee guddida, oo hal meel lagu wada sawiray. Bidix ilaa midig: inta soo jeedintu u muuqato mid u janjeedha tirada caddaaladda xisbiyeed — inta ay midig u sii dheeraato, ayay UCP u sii doorbidaysaa. Hoose ilaa sare: shanta imtixaan ee caddaaladda qaab-dhismeedka intee ayay soo jeedintu ku dhacdaa — inta ay sare u sii kacdo, ayay u sii xumaanaysaa. Khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 waxay ku jirtaa geeska ammaanka ah: hoos labadaba (kuma dhacdo midna afarta imtixaan ee lagu sameeyay; imtixaanka aagga Calgary marna laguma samayn). Soo jeedinta inta badan ee 2026 waxay ku taagan tahay eber dhibaato qaab-dhismeed iyo u janjeedh xisbiyeed oo ku dhow eber (+0.1%). Soo jeedinta inta yar ee 2026 waa mid qaab-dhismeed ahaan ka baxsan imtixaan kasta oo labada khariidadood kala sooca (4 ka mid ah 5; tan shanaad, xajinta, waa dhexdhexaad labadaba); farqigeeda waxtarka (+4.0%) wuxuu ku jiraa waxyar ka hooseeya xariiqda xadka Alberta.`,stakes_table_intro:`Isla natiijooyinka qaab soo koobid oo cad, oo la bilaabay natiijada qaab-dhismeed maxaa yeelay caddaynta is-tixraaca ah ayaa ugu adag taageerto:`,t5_col_b:`Qaab-dhismeed — Fasalka I (joomatari keliya, codad ma jiraan; "Waddada 2" ee warbixinta cilmiyeed)`,t5_col_c:`Tirooyin — Fasalka II (ku xidhan codadka; "Waddada 1")`,t5_r1_a:`<strong>Inta badan 2026</strong>`,t5_r1_b:`nadiif — xad qaab-dhismeed <em>midna</em> ma dhaafto`,t5_r1_c:`gudaha xadka caadiga ah cabbir kasta (saamiga kursiyada marka codku siman yahay 46.1%, centile-ka 78; farqiga waxtarka +0.1%)`,t5_r2_a:`<strong>Inta yar 2026</strong>`,t5_r2_b:`<strong>waxay dhaaftaa 4 ka mid ah 5-ta xad ee qaab-dhismeedka</strong> farqi weyn (xajintu waa dhexdhexaad — labada khariidadoodba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada)`,t5_r2_c:`dabada aadka u fog saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda — saamiga kursiyada marka codku siman yahay 51.7% (69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha); laba cabbir oo kale waxay dhaafeen centile-ka 98.8 iyo 99.9; farqiga waxtarka +4.0% (<em>u dhow laakiin ka hooseeya</em> xariiqda hore loo dejiyay — mid aan gaadhin oo la soo sheegay); suurtagalnimada isku-darka ah ee sawir dhexdhexaad ah qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000`,details2_summary:`Sababta qaybta qaab-dhismeedku u tahay tiirka doodda — faahfaahin farsamo`,details2_p:`Hubintu waxay qoraal ku dejisay shan imtixaan oo qaab-dhismeedka aan caadiga ahayn Abriil 24, 2026, ka hor inta aan la isu keenin natiijooyinka kama dambaysta ah ee jilitaanka. Xajintu waa dhexdhexaad labada khariidadoodba; afarta hadhay, inta yar waxay dhaaftaa xadka mid kasta (waa ku dhacdaa dhammaantood), inta badanna midkoodna xadkiisa ma dhaafto. Cabbirradaasi waa joomatari — qalab muunad-qaadasho tirakoob ma jiro, xog cod ma jirto. <strong>Tani waa natiijada udub-dhexaadka ah.</strong> Jilitaanku wuu xoojiyaa: inta yar waxay ku jirtaa dabada aadka u fog saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda, tan afraad (farqiga waxtarka) waxyar ka hooseysa xariiqda hore loo dejiyay oo ah centile-ka 94.5, suurtagalnimada isku-darka ahna waa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000 sawir dhexdhexaad ah hoostiisa — qiyaas moodel, oo lagu sharxay Natiijada 8. Laba qoraal oo daacadnimo ayaa ku jira natiijooyinka: in qaababka xuduudaha la calaamadeeyay laftoodu yihiin farsamada tooska ah ee isbeddelka kursiyada weli lama tijaabin — imtixaankii la qorsheeyay laguma socodsiin karin xogta kama dambaysta ah (Natiijada 9; qoraalka dhammaystiran wuxuu ku yaal <a href='https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/redist_python_comparison.md' rel='noopener'>findings/redist_python_comparison.md</a>) — Swing-Zone Allocation Test-na kama badbaadin null-keedii la saxay, waana baadhitaan bilow ah oo keliya (Natiijada 10). Qaybta qaab-dhismeedka ayaa qaada kiiska; tirooyinku way xoojiyaan iyagoon qaadin.`},impact:{heading:`5: Saamaynta Matalaadda`,lanes_label:`WADDADA 1 IYO WADDADA 2`,lanes_body:`<strong>Waddada 1 (tirooyinka)</strong> waxay adeegsataa natiijooyinka doorashada si ay u tijaabiso in khariidaddu codadka si caddaalad ah ugu beddesho kursiyo: waxay eegtaa sida khariidaddu u shaqayso marka codadku si kala duwan u qaybsamaan. <strong>Waddada 2 (qaab-dhismeedka)</strong> waxay eegtaa khadadka la sawiray oo keliya — kala-qaybinta magaalooyinka, faafinta dadka, qaababka xudduudaha — mana adeegsato xog doorasho gabi ahaanba. Waddo kastaa waa madax-bannaan: khariidad waxay ku dhici kartaa mid, waxayna ku gudbi kartaa tan kale. Soo jeedinta inta yar labadaba way ku dhacdaa. Tan inta badan labadaba way ku gudubtaa.`,intro:`Waddada 1 waxay ku xidhan tahay natiijooyinka doorashada ee aad khariidadaha ku qiimeyso. Waddada 2 kuma xidhna. Caddaynteeda qaab-dhismeed waxay ku jirtaa khariidadaha laftooda: khadadka la sawiray, magaalooyinka la kala qaybiyay, iyo meelaha ay xudduuduhu raacaan, ama aanay raacin, khadad maamul oo u jira sababo kale. Imtixaannadan, labada khariidadood isuma dhowa.`,fig_alt:`Jaantus tiirar ah oo leh shan qaybood: afar imtixaan oo ku saabsan sida khadadka loo sawiro, iyo dhibco soo koobid ah. Tiirarka teal-ka ahi waa khariidadda inta badan, kuwa guduudka-buluugga ahina waa khariidadda inta yar. Saddex qaybood waxay leeyihiin xariiq cas oo go'go'an oo ku-dhac ah: cufnaanta waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary, xudduudaha ay inta badani calaamadeysay ee imtixaannadaydu xaqiijiyeen, iyo dhibcaha soo koobidda. Saddexdaba, tiirka guduudka-buluugga ah wuu ka gudbaa xariiqda, tiirka teal-kuna gudaha ayuu ku jiraa.`,fig_caption:`Afarta imtixaan ee ku saabsan sida khadadka loo sawiro, dhinac-dhinac, iyo dhibco soo koobid ah. Teal waa khariidadda inta badan; guduud-buluug waa khariidadda inta yar. Xariiq go'go'an ayaa calaamadeysa heer ku-dhac meesha imtixaanku leeyahay: cufnaanta waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary, xudduudaha ay inta badan ee guddidu calaamadeysay ee imtixaannadaydu xaqiijiyeen (saddex ka mid ah afarteeda), iyo dhibcaha soo koobidda. Tiirka inta yar wuu ka gudbaa xariiq kasta oo ku-dhac ah oo la muujiyay. Tiirka inta badan marna ma gudbo. Qaybaha kala firdhinta dadka iyo Airdrie ma laha xariiq ku-dhac ah. Kala firdhinta dadku waxay muujisaa inta badan 3,180 iyo inta yar 4,707 qof oo ka fog cabbirka riding-ka ku habboon. Imtixaan shanaad, inta jeer ee khadadku raacaan xadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka, lama sawirin. Labada khariidadoodba waxay u dhow yihiin 75%-ka khariidadda 2019, sidaa darteed waxa loo tiriyaa dhexdhexaad, soo koobidduna inta yar waxay siisaa 4 ka mid ah 5.`,table_intro:`Isla shanta imtixaan oo shax ah, xadka imtixaan kastaa wuxuu dhinac yaal natiijadiisa. Safka ugu hooseeya waa <em>soo koobidda</em> hubinta: imtixaannada shanta ah intee ayay khariidad kastaa ku dhacdaa.`,table_col_test:`Imtixaan`,table_col_majority:`Khariidadda inta badan`,table_col_minority:`Khariidadda inta yar`,table_col_direction:`Jiho / Ka faa'iidayste`,table_r1_a:`Xuduudku wuxuu raacaa khadadka dawladda hoose ee jira (caadiga Kanada 70–85%)`,table_r1_b:`80% — gudaha caadi`,table_r1_c:`72% — gudaha caadi`,table_r1_d:`M/J — labada ku jira caadiga Kanada`,table_r2_a:`Faafinta dadka (sii dhow ayay sii fiicantahay)`,table_r2_b:`3,180`,table_r2_c:`4,707 — 48% ka ballaadhan`,table_r2_d:`Qaab-dhismeed (Wuxuu yareeyaa sinaanta codka)`,table_r3_a:`Dheeraadka dadka woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary ee ka sarreeya celceliska`,table_r3_b:`2.8%`,table_r3_c:`11.5%`,table_r3_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu urursaa codadka NDP magaalada)`,table_r4_a:`Xudduudaha uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyaha guddida`,table_r4_b:`0`,table_r4_c:`4 (3 ay hubintu xaqiijisay)`,table_r4_d:`M/J`,table_r5_a:`Kala-qaybinta Airdrie (xaddidaada ugu yar: 2)`,table_r5_b:`2 qaybood`,table_r5_c:`4 dhul ahaan; 3 dad ahaan (≥2%)`,table_r5_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu jeexaa awooda magaalada/xaafadaha)`,table_r6_a:`<strong>Soo koobid horay loo diiwaan-geliyay</strong> (&ge; 4 ka mid ah 5 = qiime aan caadi ahayn)`,table_r6_b:`<strong>0 ka mid ah 5 ayaa digniin bixiyay</strong>`,table_r6_c:`<strong>4 ka mid ah 5 ayaa digniin bixiyay</strong> (imtixaanka xajintu waa dhexdhexaad — labada khariidadoodba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada; 4-ta imtixaan ee hadhay dhammaantood digniin ayay bixiyeen)`,table_r6_d:`<strong>UCP</strong>`,rationales_p:`Natiijo gaar ah, oo inta yar keliya ku saabsan: <strong>lixda sababood ee ay xubnaha inta yar ee guddidu daabaceen, shan ka mid ah way ku dhacaan hubin madax-bannaan</strong>. Imtixaanku wuxuu ku socdaa inta yar oo keliya, sababtoo ah inta badan ma daabicin liis sababo ah oo ku saabsan dib-u-sawiridda lagu murmay. Hubintu si siman uguma dabaqi karto labada khariidadood, sidaa darteed halkan waxa lagu soo sheegay sidii hal calaamad, ma aha safaf dheeraad ah oo lagu daro tirinta waxyaabaha qaab-dhismeedka ee aan caadiga ahayn.`,chair_appendix_p:`Hubintu waxay sidoo kale tijaabisay sheegasho guud oo gaar ah oo ku jirta warbixinta inta badan, oo guddoomiyuhu saxeexay: in isbeddellada inta yar ee shan meelood (Airdrie, Cochrane, Chestermere, Red Deer iyo St. Albert) aanay helin <strong>taageero dadweyne</strong> 1,345-ka soo gudbin dadweyne (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, bogagga 59 iyo 62). Raadin erey-fure ah oo lagu sameeyay kaydka soo gudbinnada oo dhan (93.4% mashiin ayaa akhriyay, 6.6% sawir keliya ah oo laga reebay; habka iyo caddaynta qaab kasta waxay ku jiraan <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/submission_search_findings.md" rel="noopener">findings/submission_search_findings.md</a>) waxay soo saartay sawir ka faahfaahsan sheegashada guud ee inta badan iyo diidmo guud oo lagu sameeyo labadaba. Inta badan way saxnayd saddex ka mid ah shanta: kala-qaybinta 4-geesoodka ah ee Airdrie, isku-darka Calgary–Nolan-Hill–Cochrane iyo beddelka inta yar ee St. Albert midkoodna ma laha taageero la diiwaangeliyay. Way khaldanayd Chestermere, oo heshay soo gudbinno badan oo diidan in lagu daro Calgary, kuwaas oo si la taaban karo ula jaanqaadaya ujeeddada inta yar. Qayb ahaanna way khaldanayd Red Deer: isku-darrada Red Deer waxay heleen soo jeedin isku-dar ah oo ku saabsan agagaarka Red Deer, oo ka timid xildhibaan golaha magaalada Red Deer hadda ka fadhiya, oo jihada la jaanqaadaya laakiin aan qaabka saxda ah la mid ahayn. Laba qaab oo inta badan ay sababo kale ku weerartay ayaa sidoo kale helay taageero: Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park waxay heshay soo jeedin cad oo faahfaahsan oo ka timid ugu yaraan hal soo gudbin oo aagga Clearwater ah, iyo dhowr kale oo la jaanqaadaya, dadka Beiseker-na qoraal ayay ku taageereen Olds–Three-Hills–Didsbury. Sidaa darteed sheegashada guud ee inta badan ee ah "taageero dadweyne ma jirto" si cad ayay u ballaadhan tahay, laakiin meel bannaan lagama soo saarin, maadaama saddex ka mid ah shanta ay run yihiin. <strong>Natiijadani waxay ka hor imanaysaa inta badan, ma aha inta yar.</strong>`,summary_p:`<strong>Waddada 2, khariidadda inta badan waxay dhaaftaa eber xad qaab-dhismeed. Inta yar waxay dhaaftaa afar ka mid ah shanta, farqi weyn.</strong> Tiradu waa tirin cayriin ah. Ma aha suurtagalnimo qoys-dhan ah oo la habeeyay. Miisaankeedu wuxuu ka yimaadaa isku-raacnaanta jihada — imtixaan kasta oo digniin bixiya wuxuu u jeedaa isla jihada — ma aha xisaab qaybin-null wadajir ah. Waddada tirakoobka (§3) ayaa bixisa suurtagalnimada wadajirka ah, iyadoo adeegsanaysa qalab kale.`},cpd:{heading:`4: Jeexitaan, Urursi, iyo Miirid`,vocab_label:`Saddex dhaqdhaqaaq, hal qorshe`,vocab_packing:`<strong>Urursi</strong> waxa loola jeedaa in codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi lagu cidhiidhiyo degmooyin uu xisbigu ku guuleysto farqi aad u weyn. Cod kasta oo la urursaday weli waa la tiriyaa, laakiin marka kursiga la helo waxba kuma darsado. Guulo waaweyn oo hal dhinac u janjeedha. Codad khasaaray.`,vocab_cracking:`<strong>Jeexitaan</strong> waxa loola jeedaa in bulsho loo kala qaybiyo degmooyin dhowr ah si aanay si toos ah ugu guuleysan midna. Magaalo awood u leh inay qaado laba kursi ayaa loo jeexaa afar, saddex ka mid ahna dadkeeda waa laga badan yahay. Codad la khafiifiyay. Hal kursi halkii laba ka heli lahaa.`,vocab_draining:`<strong>Miirid</strong> waa tallaabada la socota, oo khariidadda ka dhacda: degmooyinka la urursay iyo kuwa la jeexay waa is dhinac yaallaan, sidaa darteed taageerayaasha hal dhinac xad-dhaaf ugu urursan waxay awoodda codka ka "miiraan" degmooyinka la isku haysto ee ag yaal. Isku-dhowaanshahaas, sida degmooyinku isu taabanayaan, ayaa labada saamayn kordhiya. Urursiga iyo jeexitaanku way isku xoojiyaan iyagoo ka gudbaya khadadka degmooyinka.`,vocab_disclaimer:`Saddexdaba waxay dhici karaan iyadoo aan jirin ujeeddo xisbiyeed oo cad. Waxa hubintu cabbirto waa in qaabka, iyo cabbirkiisa tirakoob, uu la jaanqaadayo waxa habraac dhexdhexaad ah oo khariidad sawira uu soo saaro. <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md#5-results" rel="noopener">Habka oo dhammaystiran wuxuu ku jiraa §5 ee warbixinta farsamada.</a>`,fig_alt:`Laba tiir, oo cabbir ahaan sax ah, muujinaya sida khariidad kastaa u kala qaybiso dadka Airdrie. Inta badan: Airdrie-West waxay haysaa 50.6% magaalada, Airdrie-East-na 49.4%, labada riding-na inta badan waa Airdrie. Inta yar: Airdrie East waxay haysaa 54.7% magaalada waana 89.6% Airdrie; Calgary-Airdrie waxay haysaa 24.0% Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West-na 20.9%, labaduba inta badan waa Calgary; Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury waxay qaadataa qiyaastii 350 qof.`,fig_caption:`Sida khariidad kastaa u kala qaybiso dadka Airdrie. Khariidadda inta badan waxay magaalada siisaa laba riding, labaduba inta badan Airdrie. Khariidadda inta yar waxay siisaa hal, Airdrie East, oo leh 54.7% magaalada. Inta badan inta hadhay waxay gelisaa laba riding oo inta badan Calgary ah.`,intro:`Shanta xubnood ee guddidu waxay ka shaqeeyeen isla xeerarka sharciga, isla juquraafiga gobolka, isla kaydka 1,345 soo gudbin dadweyne, iyo isla xogta tirakoobka dadka. Labadooda qabyo-qoraal ee isku tartamaya waxay isku raacsan yihiin inta badan Alberta. Halka qabyo-qoraalladu ku kala tagaan, waxay ku kala tagaan doorashooyin uu qof qolka ku jiray ahaa inuu sameeyo. Saddex ka mid ah doorashooyinkaas waxay mudan yihiin in loo arko doorashooyin. Ma aha tirooyin.`,airdrie_p:`<strong>Waxay Magaalada Airdrie u kala qaybisaa afar qaybood.</strong> Sharcigu wuxuu qayb doorasho kasta u xaddidaa hal-iyo-rubuc jeer celceliska gobolka, sidaa darteed Airdrie waxay u baahan tahay ugu yaraan laba qaybood. Khariidadda inta badan waxay siisaa laba. Inta yar waxay siisaa afar: woqooyi ilaa Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury, bari ilaa Airdrie East, galbeed ilaa Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West, bartamaha-koonfur ilaa Calgary-Airdrie. Qaybta woqooyi waxay haysaa qiyaastii 350 qof, sidaa darteed afarta saddex ka mid ah waxay haystaan ugu yaraan 2% magaalada. Airdrie East keligeed ayaa inta badan Airdrie ah; qayb kasta oo kale waxa lagu tolay degmo cidhifka Calgary ah ama miyi ah. Deggane Airdrie ah oo su'aal u haysa MLA-deeda waa inay ogaato qaybta magaalada ay ku nooshahay ka hor inta aanay wicin xafiiska saxda ah. Deriskeeda laba bloog u jira waxay siin doonaan saddex jawaabood oo kala duwan. Ururka waalidiinta iyo macallimiinta (PTA) ee dugsiga ilmaheeda ma diri karo hal wafdi oo hal MLA u taga su'aal ku saabsan maalgelinta dugsiyada. Waa inuu isku duwaa afar wafdi oo afar xafiis u taga, MLA-yadaas saddex ka mid ahna marka hore waxay u jawaabaan codbixiyayaal ka baxsan Airdrie. Ururka hockey-ga carruurta, bangiga cuntada, Rugta Ganacsiga: urur kasta oo magaalada oo dhan ka shaqeeya hadda wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa afar riding oo gobol.`,airdrie_callout_label:`SABABTA AIRDRIE AY MUHIIM U TAHAY`,airdrie_callout_p1:`Airdrie waxay leedahay 85,805 qof (tirakoobka dawladda hoose ee 2024). Hal gole, hal biil canshuur, hal qayb dugsiyeed: nidaam kasta oo madani ah wuxuu u arkaa hal unug.`,airdrie_callout_p2:`U kala qaybi afar qaybood oo gobol — Calgary-Airdrie, Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West, Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury iyo Airdrie East — saddex ka mid ahna waxa inta badan lagu aqoonsadaa maamul deris ah. Magaaladu waxay leedahay 85,805 deggane, iyo hal kursi oo golaha sharci-dejinta ah oo ay codbixiyayaasha intooda badani meesha ugu yeedhaan gurigooda. Khariidadda inta badan waxay siisaa laba.`,airdrie_callout_p3:`Kala-qaybin afar-jiho ah uma muuqato tijaabo kasta oo caddaaladda xisbiyeed marka laga reebo tan weydiinaysa: codbixiye ma heli karaa MLA-giisa?`,airdrie_callout_summary:`Labada khariidadoodba waa sharci. Kala-qaybinta afar-jiho ah waa doorasho.`,airdrie_btn:`Tus degmooyinka la calaamadeeyay khariidadda`,anchoring_p:`<strong>Meesha ay ka leexato khadadka dawladda hoose, waxay ka leexataa meelo istiraatiiji ahaan muhiim ah.</strong> Marka khariidad doorasho ay raacdo cidhifka magaalo weyn ama magaalo yar, codbixiyayaashu way garan karaan halka qaybtoodu ka bilaabato iyo halka ay ku dhammaato: khadka canshuurta hantida, khadka waaxda doorashada hoose iyo khadka doorashada gobolka dhammaantood isku meel ayay ku dhacaan, badanaana khadka qaybta dugsiyadu sidoo kale. Statistics Canada xudduudahan bilaash ayay u daabacdaa. Faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, labada khariidadood waxay khadadka dawladda hoose u raacaan heerar guud oo isu dhow — inta badan 80%, inta yar 72% — labaduba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada ee 70–85% (Quebec: 78%, Ontario: 82%, BC: 71%; guddiyada la isbarbar dhigay waxa lagu diiwaangeliyay buugga cilmiga). (Falanqayntii ugu horreysay ee ku-meel-gaadhka ahayd ee hubinta waxay muujisay in inta yar ay xajinayso 15% keliya; tiradaasi kama badbaadin dib-u-xisaabinta lagu sameeyay faylasha rasmiga ah — eeg qoraalka sixidda ee hoose.) Waxa soo jeeda ma aha heerka guud. Waa halka ay leexashooyinka inta yar isku urursadaan. Saddexda xuduud ee ay inta badan ee guddidu laftoodu, guddoomiyuhu ku jiro, ku calaamadeeyeen kuwo aan caadi ahayn — fidinta Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Rocky Mountain House-Banff Park">tus ↗</button> ee dhulka beerta qaranka ee aan la degin, marinka lasso-ga u eg ee Nolan Hill–Cochrane <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Calgary-Nolan Hill-Cochrane">tus ↗</button>, iyo gaadhitaanka Olds–North Airdrie <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury">tus ↗</button> — mid kastaa wuxuu ka go'aa juquraafiga madani ee hore u jiray, isla aagagga cidhifka magaalada halkaas oo isku-lammaynta codbixiyayaasha magaalada iyo miyiga ay sida ugu tooska ah u saamayso xisbiga ku guuleysta kursiga.`,anchoring_followup:`Xubnaha inta yar sabab ayay u sheegeen mid kasta oo ka mid ah saddexda xuduud ee la calaamadeeyay. Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park, waxay soo qaateen baaxadda juquraafi, marinka Highway 22, iyo sida ay dhulalka kaydka ah ee First Nations ugu dhow yihiin Rocky Mountain House. Guddoomiyaha guddidu wuxuu fidinta dhulka beerta qaranka ee aan la degin ku tilmaamay "isku day niyad xun" oo loogu talagalay buuxinta shuruudda baaxadda, odhaahdaasina waxay ku jirtaa warbixinta kama dambaysta ah ee rasmiga ah ee guddida. Nolan Hill–Cochrane, waxay soo qaateen xidhiidhada gaadiidka iyo shaqada ee ay wadaagaan waqooyi-galbeed Calgary iyo Cochrane. Xogta safarka-shaqada ee Statistics Canada waxay muujinaysaa in 35.8% keliya oo shaqaalaha Cochrane ay gabi ahaanba u safraan Calgary; intooda badani waxay ka shaqeeyaan Cochrane gudaheeda. Gaadhitaanka Olds–North Airdrie, waxay soo qaateen sii-socodka marinka Highway 2. Hubintu waxay ogaatay in fidinta gaarka ah ee Airdrie ay ku dhacdo xagga tirada dadka. Marka si madax-bannaan loogu hubiyo xogta asalka ah, lixda sababood-hoosaad ee inta yar daabacday shan ka mid ah way dhacaan ama qayb ahaan uun bay run yihiin.`,packing_p:`<strong>Hal aag oo Calgary ah ayaa loo jeexjeexay si codbixiyayaasha NDP loogu urursado qaybo ka weyn celceliska.</strong> Degmooyinka woqooyi, bari iyo bartamaha Calgary <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Calgary-North West-Bearspaw">tus ↗</button>, qaybaha khariidadda inta yar waxay celcelis ahaan celceliska gobolka ka badan yihiin 11.5%. Khariidadda inta badan, 2.8%. Isla aagga juquraafi, oo ay sawirtay isla guddida iyadoo isla xaddidaadyada ku jirta, wuxuu soo saaraa degmooyin qiyaastii 8.4% ka weyn hal khariidad marka loo eego tan kale. Taasi waxay ku habboon tahay calaamadda qaab-dhismeed ee <em>urursiga</em>: in codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi lagu cidhiidhiyo degmooyin ka tiro yar oo ka weyn, si cod kasta oo ay dhiibtaan uu miisaan yar u yeesho. Urursiga iyo <em>jeexitaanka</em> (codbixiyayaasha xisbi oo si khafiif ah loogu kala firdhiyo degmooyin uu farqi yar ku waayo) waa labada tallaabo ee caadiga ah ee qaybsiga siyaasadeed. Labaduba waxay tirada kursiyada xisbi ka dhigaan wax ka yar saamigiisa codka.`,chair_p:`Guddoomiyaha guddida — oo lagu magacaabay isla Sharciga, kana shaqeynayay isla soo gudbinnada — wuxuu khariidadda inta yar ku calaamadeeyay afar xuduud oo juquraafi ahaan aan caadi ahayn, waxaana ka mid ah saddexdan: fidinta Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park ee dhulka beerta qaranka ee aan la degin; marinka Calgary-Nolan Hill–Cochrane ee u qaabaysan lasso; iyo gaadhitaanka Olds–Three Hills–Didsbury ee woqooyiga Airdrie. Isla guddoomiyahaas wuxuu khariidadda inta badan siiyay eber calaamadood oo noocaas ah. (Guud ahaan, dhaleeceynta guddoomiyuhu daabacay waxay daboolaysaa toddoba qaab xuduudeed: afarta calaamadood ee joomatari, iyo saddex meelood oo lagu magacaabay oo keliya sheegashada warbixinta inta badan ee ah in isbeddellada inta yar aanay helin taageero dadweyne. Hubintani si madax-bannaan ayay u xaqiijisay joomatari aan caadi ahayn saddex ka mid ah afarta calaamadood ee joomatari. Tan afraad, Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West">tus ↗</button>, ma gaadhin xadka xaqiijinta ee hubinta.) Calaamadaha joomatari ee guddoomiyaha wixii ka baxsan, imtixaanka calaamadda jeexitaanka ee hubinta laftigeeda (cilmiyeed §5.3.2) ma calaamadeeyo kala-qaybinta afarta-geesoodka ah ee Airdrie. Waa kala-qaybin bulsho oo dadka Airdrie ka dhigaysa kuwa laga badan yahay afarta riding saddex ka mid ah, kuwaas oo wadajir u haysta ku dhowaad kala badh magaalada, laakiin imtixaanku wuxuu u baahan yahay in laga badnaado afartaba, Airdrie East-na inta badan waa Airdrie. Chestermere waxay u soo baxdaa mid u dhow jeexitaan; Cochrane, oo la ilaaliyay iyadoo dhan oo ah qiyaastii saddex meelood laba meel riding-keeda, ma aha. Qaar ka mid ah waxa xisaabta hubintu calaamadeyso, guddoomiyuhu ma calaamadeyn. Hubintu waxay cabbirtaa saamaynta qaab-dhismeed. Ma aha ujeeddada.`},litmus:{heading:`3: Imtixaanka Caddaynta ee 1,010,000-Khariidad`,fig_alt:`Histogram-ka farqiga waxtarka ee 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray. Sagaal ka mid ah toban waxay ku dhacaan qiyaastii −1% iyo +4% dhexdooda. Khariidadda inta yar (xariiqda guduudka-buluugga ah) waxay joogtaa +4.0%, boqolleyda 94.5aad, waxyar ka hor xariiqda go'go'an ee uu ka bilaabmo cidhifka midig ee hadhka leh. Khariidadda inta badan (xariiqda teal-ka ah) waxay joogtaa +0.1%, si fiican gudaha xadka caadiga ah.`,fig_caption:`Sida <button class="vocab-term" data-def="inta si aan siman codadku ugu beddelmaan kursiyo; qiimayaasha togan waxay doorbidaan UCP, kuwa tabanna NDP" aria-expanded="false">farqiga waxtarku</button> ugu kala firidhsan yahay 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah oo kombuyuutar ka sawiray isla aagagga codbixinta, warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023. Sagaal ka mid ah toban waxay ku dhacaan qiyaastii −1% iyo +4% dhexdooda. Cidhifka midig ee hadhka lihi wuxuu calaamadeeyaa 5%-ka ugu sarreeya. +4.0%-ka khariidadda inta yar wuxuu joogaa <button class="vocab-term" data-def="halka khariidad kaga jirto khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray: boqolleyda 94aad macnaheedu waa 94 ka mid ah 100 ay xagga UCP uga janjeeraan wax ka yar" aria-expanded="false">boqolleyda</button> 94.5aad: wax ka yar 6 ka mid ah 100 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray ayaa gaadha intaas. +0.1%-ka khariidadda inta badan wuxuu u eg yahay waxa hab dhexdhexaad ahi inta badan soo saaro.`,table_intro:`Shaxdu waxay labada khariidadood dhigtaa is dhinac. Shanta saf ee ugu horreeya ma adeegsadaan natiijooyin doorasho; waa sifooyinka khadadka laftooda. Saddexda ugu dambeeya waxay ku xidhan yihiin sida codadka loogu qaybiyay degmo kasta.`,table_col_measured:`Waxa la cabbiray`,table_col_majority:`Khariidadda inta badan`,table_col_minority:`Khariidadda inta yar`,table_col_direction:`Jiho / Ka faa'iidayste`,table_r1_a:`Faafinta dadka degmooyinka (sii dhow sii fiican)`,table_r1_b:`3,180`,table_r1_c:`4,707 — 48% ka ballaadhan`,table_r1_d:`Qaab-dhismeed (Wuxuu yareeyaa sinaanta codka)`,table_r2_a:`Dheeraadka dadka woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary oo ka sarreeya celceliska`,table_r2_b:`2.8%`,table_r2_c:`11.5%`,table_r2_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu urursaa codadka NDP magaalada)`,table_r3_a:`Kala-qaybinta Airdrie`,table_r3_b:`2 qaybood`,table_r3_c:`4 dhul ahaan; 3 dad ahaan (≥2%)`,table_r3_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu jeexaa awooda magaalada/xaafadaha)`,table_r4_a:`Xudduudaha raacaya khadadka dawladda hoose ee jira`,table_r4_b:`80% — gudaha caadi`,table_r4_c:`72% — gudaha caadi`,table_r4_d:`M/J — labada ku jira caadiga Kanada (70–85%)`,table_r5_a:`Xudduudaha uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyaha guddida`,table_r5_b:`0`,table_r5_c:`3`,table_r5_d:`M/J`,table_r6_a:`Kursiyo codka 50/50 (centile-ka jilitaanka 1,010,000-ka khariidadood)`,table_r6_b:`46.1% — p78 (kala-duwanaanta caadi)`,table_r6_c:`51.7% — p99.99 (in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 ayaa gaadha)`,table_r6_d:`<strong>UCP</strong>`,table_r7_a:`Farqiga Waxtarka (centile-ka jilitaanka 1,010,000-ka khariidadood)`,table_r7_b:`+0.1% — p16.5 (xadka caadiga ah)`,table_r7_c:`+4.0% — p94.5`,table_r7_d:`<strong>UCP</strong>`,table_r8_a:`Qaabka urursi-jeexitaan ee deriska`,table_r8_b:`2 calaamado silsilad isku xidhan`,table_r8_c:`1 (GUUL horay loo diiwaan-geliyay)`,table_r8_d:`Dhexdhexaad — inta yar waxay gaartaa saamayn xisbiyeed iyada oo loo marayo hybridization, ma aha miirid is-deris (§5.3.5)`,vocab_label:`EREYBIXIN`,vocab_eg:`<strong>Farqiga waxtarka.</strong> Hal tiro oo muujinaysa sida aan dheelitirnayn ee codadka xisbi loogu beddelo kursiyo. Tirooyinka togani waxay doorbidaan UCP; kuwa tabanna, NDP. Hubintu xariiqda qiimaha ka baxsan ee Alberta waxay dhigtaa ~4.1%: qiimaha ay dhaafaan 5% keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka jilitaan ee dhexdhexaadka ah ee Alberta u gaarka ah. Xadkaas lagama soo amaahan suugaanta Maraykanka ama tan guud. Xad loo habeeyay maamul kale halkan wuu ku khaldanaan lahaa, sababtoo ah juquraafiga dabiiciga ah ee Alberta wuxuu soo saaraa xad dhexdhexaad oo ka duwan.`,vocab_mm:`<strong>Farqiga dhexe-dhexdhexaadka.</strong> Farqiga u dhexeeya saamiga codka degmada dhexe (median) ee xisbi iyo celceliska saamiga codka degmooyinkiisa. Marka hal xisbi ku guuleysto tartamo badan oo dhow, median-ku wuxuu ka sarreeyaa celceliska: codadkaas si waxtar leh ayaa loo kala firdhiyay. Marka xisbi ku guuleysto tartamo badan farqi weyn, celceliska ayaa ka sarreeya median-ka: codad ayaa khasaaraya. Farqi dhexe-dhexdhexaad oo weyn oo hal jiho u janjeedha wuxuu calaamadeeyaa waxtar-darro qaab-dhismeed oo ku jirta sida codadka hal dhinac loogu kala firdhiyay degmooyinka.`,vocab_percentile:`<strong>Darajada centile-ka.</strong> Hubintan, "centile" waa darajo ku dhex jirta 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee dhexdhexaadka ah ee la jilay. "p94" macnaheedu waa 94% khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa ka dhibco hooseeya: khariidadda dhabta ahi way ka daran tahay 94% sawirrada dhexdhexaadka ah. "p99.99" macnaheedu waa wax ka yar 1 ka mid ah 10,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha heerkaas.`,vocab_anchoring:`<strong>Xajin.</strong> Saamiga xuduud doorasho ee ku taal khad maamul oo hore u jiray — xadka magaalada, xuduudda qaybta dugsiyada, xariiqda tirakoobka ee Statistics Canada.`,closing_p1:`Safafka hoose waxay ku xidhan yihiin natiijooyinka doorashada. Imtixaanka <em>seats@50/50</em> wuxuu codbixiyayaasha ku hayaa sinnaan buuxda — UCP iyo NDP mid kastaa wuxuu helayaa si sax ah kala badh codadka gobolka oo dhan — wuxuuna weydiiyaa inta kursi ee khariidaddu siinayso UCP. Khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ee Alberta waxay soo saaraan median qiyaastii 44.8% kursiyada UCP. Juquraafiga Alberta, oo codbixiyayaasha NDP ay ku urursan yihiin bartamaha magaalooyinka, codbixiyayaasha UCP-na ay ku kala firirsan yihiin riding-yada miyiga, wuxuu NDP siiyaa faa'iido waxtar oo yar marka la sinnaado. Khariidadda inta badan, oo ah 46.1%, waxay ku jirtaa centile-ka 78 ee jilitaanka 1,010,000-ka khariidadood: si fiican gudaha xadka caadiga ah. Khariidadda inta yar, oo ah 51.7%, waxay ku jirtaa centile-ka 99.99. Wax ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 sawir oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha qiimahaas. <em>Farqiga waxtarka</em> wuxuu cabbiraa sida aan dheelitirnayn ee codadka xisbi kasta loogu beddelo kursiyo. Faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, farqiga waxtarka ee inta yar waa +4.0%, centile-ka 94.5: waxyar ka hooseeya xariiqda qiimaha ka baxsan ee hubinta ee centile-ka 95. Su'aalaha furitaanka ee bogga sare ayaa sharxaya cawaaqibta.`,closing_p2:`Safka ugu dambeeya dhinaca kale ayuu u jeedaa. Imtixaanka miirista-deriska, khariidadda inta yar waxay leedahay calaamado silsilad isku-xidhan oo ka yar kuwa inta badan: 1 marka loo eego 2-da inta badan (iyo 5-ta khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019). Hubintu imtixaankan way diiwaangelisay ka hor inta aanay cabbirin, tirada yar ee inta yarna waa GUUL dhab ah oo hore loo diiwaangeliyay. Inta yar ma muujiso qaabka caadiga ah ee isku-dhowaanshaha urursi-iyo-miirid. Waa imtixaanka keliya ee inta yar ay tiro ahaan kaga fiican tahay inta badan. §5.3.5 ee warbixinta cilmiyeed ayaa sharxaya sababta. Inta yar waxay saamaynteeda xisbiyeed ku gaadhaa isku-darid (hybridization) — kala-qaybin magaalo oo urursiga iyo jeexitaanka gudaha u gelisa qaybo doorasho oo gaar ah (ED-yada) — imtixaanka silsiladda isku-dhowaanshahana, oo cabbira oo keliya sida degmooyinka la urursay ugu urursan yihiin agagaarka kuwa la jeexay, ma arki karo.`},commission_split:{heading:`2: Sida Guddidu u Kala Qaybsantay`,intro:`Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada ee Alberta waxay shaqadeeda dhammaysay Maaris 23, 2026, mana heshiin karin. Saddex xubnood ayaa soo saaray hal khariidad; labada kale waxay soo saareen mid kale. Guddoomiyaha Guddida, Garsoore Dallas K. Miller, iyo laba xubnood oo mucaaradku magacaabay ayaa qoray warbixinta inta badan; laba xubnood oo dawladdu magacawday — Dr. Julian Martin iyo John D. Evans — ayaa qoray warbixinta inta yar. Kala-qaybsanaantu waxay ku saabsanayd sida loo sawiro xudduudaha bulshooyinka cidhifka magaalooyinka ee si degdeg ah u koraya. Inta badan waxay Airdrie siisay laba degmo; inta yar afar. Inta badan waxay qaybaha woqooyi/bari/bartamaha Calgary ka dhigtay kuwo u dhow celceliska gobolka; inta yar waxay ka dhigtay 11.5% ka sarreeya. Labada khariidadood waxay raacaan isla sharciga. Labaduba waa sharci sida uu dhigayo <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>. Khilaafku wuxuu ku saabsanaa qaababka juquraafi ee gaarka ah ee sida ugu fiican ugu adeegaya bulshooyinka la sawirayay. Xisbiga xukuma Alberta waa United Conservative Party (UCP); mucaaradkiisa ugu weyn waa New Democratic Party (NDP). Xisbiyo ka yar — Alberta Party, Liberal Party of Alberta, iyo kuwo kale — sidoo kale kursiyo ayay u tartamaan, laakiin saamigooda codka gobolka ee la isku daray wuxuu doorashooyinkii dhowaa ahaa mid aad u yar oo aan si la taaban karo u saamayn xisaabaha caddaaladda xisbiyeed ee hubinta, kuwaas oo ku dhisan kala-qaybsanaanta UCP–NDP ee 2023. Hubintani waxay labada khariidadood ku cabbirtay isla hababka, oo si isku mid ah loo dabaqay. Afar natiijo ayaa soo jeeda.`,finding1:`<strong>Labada khariidadood waxay ku kala duwanaadaan lix wax oo aad cabbiri karto iyada oo aanad fiirinin natiijooyin doorasho:</strong> sida dadku si siman loogu faafiyay degmooyinka, in codbixiyayaashu ay urursan yihiin, sida magaalooyinka aad loogu kala gooyay, in xudduuduhu raacaan xudduudaha magaalada, qaabka degmooyinka, iyo immisa xuduud ay inta badan ee guddidu, guddoomiyuhu ku jiro, qoraal ahaan ku calaamadeeyeen inay yihiin kuwo aan caadi ahayn (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, b. 62–63). Khariidadda inta yari way ka duwantahay inta badan mid kasta oo kaas ka mid ah.`,finding2:`<strong>Farqi kasta oo la cabbiray wuxuu doorbidaa isla xisbiga.</strong> Meel kasta oo labada khariidadood ay ku kala duwanaadaan — woqooyi iyo bari Calgary, Airdrie, aagagga magaalada ee leh xudduudaha cad ee magaalada — khariidadda inta yar waxay sawirtaa xudduudo si khafiif ah u kala firdhiya codadka NDP oo u oggolaada codadka UCP inay si waxtar leh u tirsanaadaan. Bulshooyinka ay khariidadda inta yari sida ugu weyn u beddesho waa isla bulshooyinka halka NDP ay ugu xoog badan tahay. Hubintu ma go'aamin karto niyad. Waxay cabbiri kartaa saamayn.`,finding3:`<strong>Habraaca beddelay guddida wuxuu lahaa hal tusaale oo hore oo ka mid ah wareegyada dib-u-qaybinta Kanada ee hubintani dib u eegtay: kii Alberta laftigeeda, 1992.</strong> Gobollada la dib u eegay midkoodna uma dhiibo dib-u-qaybinta, iyadoo wareeggu socdo, guddi uu xisbiga xukunka hayaa maamulo. Badankoodu waxay ku waajibiyaan golaha sharci-dejinta inuu marka hore ka doodo khariidadda guddida, ama waxay khariidaddaas siiyaan saamayn toos ah haddii aanu goluhu ka adkaan. Alberta midna ma samayso. Halkan warbixinta guddidu waxba ma beddesho ilaa goluhu ansixiyo <em>Sharciga Degmooyinka Doorashada</em> oo gaar ah, sidaa darteed xisbiga xukunka haya ayaa go'aamiya in khariidad guddi ay sharci noqoto iyo in kale. Abriil 21 Goluhu awooddaas ayuu adeegsaday: Mooshinka Dawladda 37, oo lagu ansixiyay 44 cod oo taageero ah iyo 36 diidmo ah, wuxuu dhinac iska dhigay labada khariidadood ee guddida, shaqadana wuxuu u dhiibay guddi MLA ah oo UCP aqlabiyad ku leedahay. Sababta ay dawladdu sheegtay waxay ahayd Talada 5 ee guddoomiyaha. Waxa taladaasi dhab ahaan weydiisanayso ayaa xiga.`,finding4:`<strong>Natiijada tirakoobku way ka badbaadaysaa beddelaad madax-bannaan oo qalabka jilitaanka ah.</strong> Forest-ReCom Wajiga A (100 k) wuxuu bixiyaa darajooyin boqolley oo ku jira ±5 pp ReCom-ka rasmiga ah cabbir xisbiyeed kasta — hubinta adkaysiga ee horay loo diiwaangeliyay (OSF <a href="https://osf.io/he53s/" rel="noopener">he53s</a>, la fuliyay 2026-07-10; cabbir kastaa wuxuu dhaqaaqay wax ka yar hal dhibic boqolley). Faahfaahin Natiijada 9.`,closing:`<strong>Habraacu waa natiijada laftiisa, oo ka gooni ah khariidadaha.</strong>`},november:{heading:`Guddiga Lunty`,context_label:`MACNAHA`,context_body:` — Qaybtan waxay sharraxaysaa habraaca beddelay guddida iyo qaab-dhismeedka sharci ee khuseeya. Kama mid aha natiijooyinka tirakoobka. Natiijooyinku waxay ku jiraan shan iyo tobanka natiijo ee kor ku xusan.`,intro:`Khariidadaha guddida midkoodna ma dhaqan galin. Abriil 21, 2026 Golaha Sharci-dejintu wuxuu ansixiyay Mooshinka Dawladda 37, oo labadaba dhinac iska dhigay, dib-u-qaybintana u gudbiyay Guddi Gaar ah oo Xulan oo ka kooban lix MLA — afar UCP, laba NDP — oo uu guddoomiyo Brandon Lunty (UCP, Leduc-Beaumont). Guddiga laftiisu ma sawiro khariidadda. Wuxuu kormeeraa Guddida Talo-bixinta Madax-bannaan oo gooni ah, oo lagu sameeyay isla mooshinkaas, loona xilsaaray inay soo saarto soo jeedin xudduudeed oo 91 kursi ah.`,intro_b:`Mooshinka 37 wuxuu ka fikiray shan xubnood oo guddida talo-bixinta ah — guddoomiye (madaxweyne jaamacadeed, garsoore ama garsoore hawlgab ah, ama qof heer la mid ah leh), laba xubnood oo uu soo jeediyay Ra'iisul Wasaaraha, iyo laba uu soo jeediyay Hoggaamiyaha Mucaaradka — laakiin guddoomiyaha garsoorka ee ku-meel-gaadhka ah ee Alberta wuu diiday inuu garsoore u soo jeediyo guddoomiyenimada. Guddida talo-bixintu waxay ku shaqaysaa afarta xubnood ee guddigu xaqiijiyay — Sharafta leh Monte Solberg iyo Darwin Durnie (kuwa Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu soo jeediyay) iyo Dr. Gerard Kennedy iyo Brent Robinson (kuwa Mucaaradku soo jeediyay) — iyadoo uu hoggaaminayo guddoomiye markii dambe la magacaabay: Brian O'Ferrall, garsoore hawlgab ah oo ka tirsanaa Maxkamadda Rafcaanka (ilaha waxay ku jiraan Natiijada 13 ee kor). Guddigu waa inuu warbixintiisa u gudbiyaa Golaha Sharci-dejinta ugu dambayn 2 Noofembar 2026. Si ka duwan guddidii asalka ahayd, guddiga iyo guddida talo-bixinta midna laguma waajibin inay qabtaan dhageysiyo dadweyne; guddida talo-bixintu waxay ka faa'iidaysataa soo gudbinnadii ay guddidii asalka ahayd ururisay. Marka khariidadda guddiga la sii daayo, hubintani waxay ku dabaqi doontaa isla habka si loo qiimeeyo.`,r5_h:`Talada 5: qiyaasta ay dawladdu dooratay`,r5_p1:`Dawladdu waxay u cudurdaaratay qaadashada qalinka iyadoo tilmaamaysa hal talo oo ku jirta warbixinta guddida. Taasi waxay ka dhigaysaa waxa ugu horreeya ee la hubiyo marka khariidadda guddigu soo baxdo, oo la filayo 2 Noofembar. Talada 5 waxa qoray hal xubin guddi, guddoomiyaha, Garsoore Dallas Miller, isagoo ku daray lifaaq warbixinta inta badan: “Asxaabtayda inta badan igama aqbalaan qodobkan. Taasi waa sababta aan keligay u bixinayo taladan” (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, b. 66). Wuxuu kaloo sheegay ujeeddadeeda. Waxay “u diyaarsan tahay ujeeddo cad oo ah in Golaha Sharci-dejinta laga waaniyo inuu aqbalo warbixinta inta yar.”`,r5_p2:`Waa beddel kayd ah, waana mid gaar ah. Haddii Golaha Sharci-dejintu aanu aqbalin doorashada inta badan ee ahayd in laga saaro laba qaybood oo ka baxsan Edmonton iyo Calgary, guddoomiyuhu wuxuu ka codsaday inuu wax ka beddelo <em>Electoral Divisions Act</em> oo 89 kursi ka dhigo 91, soo celiyo labadaas qaybood, oo ilaaliyo “inta kale ee gobolka sida aan soo jeedinno” (khariidadda inta badan) “ilaa inta suurtagal ah.” Guddi ay xisbiyada oo dhammi ku jiraan ayaa daraasayn lahaa. Soo celinta labada qaybood waa inay:`,r5_a:`<strong>(a) Ka tagto Airdrie iyo koonfurta.</strong> Isbeddel kuma yimaado qayb kasta oo Airdrie ku jirta, ama leh dhul kasta oo ka koonfureeya xadka koonfureed ee magaalada Airdrie, marka laga reebo Drumheller-Stettler. Khariidadda inta badan taasi waa 41 qaybood: labada kursi ee Airdrie, dhammaan 28-ka kursi ee Calgary, iyo 11-ka qaybood ee ku wareegsan iyo ka koonfureeya Calgary.`,r5_b:`<strong>(b) Ka tagto waqooyiga Edmonton.</strong> Isbeddel kuma yimaado qayb kasta oo Edmonton ah oo ka waqooyi xigta Webiga North Saskatchewan: 11 qaybood khariidadda inta badan.`,r5_c:`<strong>(c) Dib u celiso koonfurta Edmonton.</strong> Qayb kasta oo Edmonton ah oo ka koonfureysa webiga waxay ku noqonaysaa khariidadda qabyada ah ee guddida ee Oktoobar 2025, qabyadii ay u daabacday faallo dadweyne ka hor kala-qaybsanaantii ugu dambaysay. Guddigu wuxuu Nisku ku dari karaa Edmonton-South East haddii uu doonayo in Leduc iyo Beaumont dib loogu celiyo hal qayb. Taasi waa 10 qaybood khariidadda inta badan.`,r5_d:`<strong>(d) Tixgeliso kursi Clearwater.</strong> Tixgeli soo celinta qayb inteeda badan ka kooban Clearwater County iyo galbeedka Mountain View County, oo leh xaaladda s. 15(2). Kani waa kursiga keliya ee la soo celiyay ee taladu meel u qorto. Meel uma magacawdo kan labaad.`,r5_p3:`Haddii la wada akhriyo, shuruudahu waxay xidhayaan inta badan dhulkii guddidu isku khilaafday. Airdrie, Calgary, Cochrane iyo Chestermere, halka ay ku yaalaan kala-qaybinta afarta-jiho ee Airdrie iyo degmooyinka isku-dhafka ah ee cidhifka Calgary, dhammaantood waxay ku jiraan shuruudda (a). Red Deer iyo St. Albert waxa daboolaya oo keliya qodobka jilicsan: ilaali khariidadda inta badan “ilaa inta suurtagal ah.” Khariidad dib u furta Airdrie ama Calgary weli way noqon kartaa sharci. Ma aha khariidadda Talada 5 qeexdo. <a href="__BASE__/explorer">Baadhaha khariidadda</a> wuxuu afartaba ku xariiqaa <em>EBC ’26 Annotations</em>; aag kasta biinkiisu wuxuu sheegayaa in Talada 5 beddesho iyo in ay ka tagto.`,r5_test:`<strong>Sida loo qiimeeyo.</strong> Liiska hubinta Noofembar ee hubintu wuxuu tan u qaadaa sidii imtixaanka X1 (warbixinta cilmiyeed §5.5): khariidadda guddigu waa inay buuxisaa afarta shuruudood oo dhan. Ku dhicista mid uun waxay ka dhigan tahay in Mooshinka Dawladda 37 aanu hirgelin soo jeedinta ay dawladdu tixraacday.`,h_anomalous:`Sababta Guddiga Uu Yahay Midkaan Caadi Ahayn`,anomalous_p1:`Dhaqanka dib-u-qaybinta Kanada, tan iyo 1960-meeyadii, wuxuu ku degay hal qaab: guddi madax-bannaan, oo laga ilaaliyay amarka dawladda, ayaa soo saara talooyinka xudduudaha; golaha sharci-dejintu waa ka doodi karaa, laakiin si fudud kama adkaan karo iyadoo aan cod sharci-dejin oo rasmi ah la qaadin. Habraaca sharciga ee Alberta ee hoos yimaada <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> wuxuu raacaa qaabkan — laakiin hal farqi qaab-dhismeed ayuu kala leeyahay maamullada qaarkood: warbixinta guddida Alberta ma laha saamayn sharci oo toos ah. Sharciga hoostiisa, Sharci Degmooyinka Doorashada oo gaar ah waa in goluhu ansixiyaa si khariidad guddi kasta ay u yeelato awood sharci. Taas macnaheedu waa in dawladda xilligaas jirtaa ay maamusho ma aha oo keliya in khariidadda guddida laga doodo, balse inay waligeed sharci noqoto iyo in kale. Maamullada kale ee Kanada waxay qaataan qaabka caadiga ah ee lidka ku ah: talooyinka guddidu way dhaqan galaan haddii aanu goluhu si cad ugu codeyn inuu ka adkaado.`,anomalous_p2:`Waxa dawladdu samaysay Abriil 2026 wuxuu tusaale hore ku lahaa Alberta laftigeeda: 1992, shaqadii guddi ku xayirmay waxa loo gudbiyay guddi MLA ah. Markan waxay u oggolaatay habraac guddi oo dhammaystiran oo la daabacay inuu dhammaado — warbixinta inta badan iyo tan inta yar labadaba waa la gudbiyay — kadibna hawsha dib-u-qaybinta waxay u gudbisay guddi lix xubnood ah oo MLA ah, oo aqlabiyaddiisa (afar ka mid ah lix) xisbiga xukunka hayaa leeyahay, iyadoo aan warbixinnada guddida midkoodna cod loo qaadin. Guddiga Lunty ma aha guddi madax-bannaan (commission). Ma laha madax-bannaani sharci oo ka xor ah amarka sharci-dejineed ee dawladda. Aqlabiyaddiisa afarta xubnood ee UCP waxay u dhigantaa maamulka dawladda ee golaha sharci-dejinta. Ma jiro gobol kale oo Kanada ah oo awoodda dib-u-qaybinta, iyadoo wareeggu socdo, u wareejiyay guddi sharci-dejineed oo dawladdu maamusho ka dib markii guddi madax-bannaan uu dhammaystay shaqadiisa.`,h_framework:`Qaab-dhismeedka Dastuuriga ah`,framework_p1:`Qaybta 3 ee <em>Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha</em> — "Muwaadin kasta oo Kanada wuxuu leeyahay xaqa u codaynta doorashada xubnaha Golaha Guud ama golaha sharci dejinta" — Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay u tarjumeen ma aha oo kaliya ficilka samaynta cod balse <em>matalaad waxtar leh</em>. Xukun-hogaanka ugu muhiimsani waa <em>Tixraaca Xudduudaha Doorashada Gobolka (Saskatchewan)</em> [1991] 2 SCR 158, oo McLachlin J. (sida ay markaas ahayd) uu ugu qoray aqlabiyadda in ujeedada §3 "ma aha sinaanta awoodda codku nafteeda, balse xaqa matalaad waxtar leh." Sinnaanta dadka waa ujeedada ugu muhiimsanka ah; ka leexashada waa la oggolyahay marka uu ku salaysan yahay danta bulshada, juquraafiga, taariikhda, ama ujeedooyinka matalaadda dadka tirada yar.`,framework_p2:`Qaab-dhismeedka Saskatchewan si buuxda uma mamnuucayo tixgelinta xisbiyeed ee dib-u-qaybinta. Waxa uu dejinayaa waa in khariidadaha xudduuduhu, guud ahaan, ay codbixiyayaasha siiyaan matalaad waxtar leh: sinnaanta qaraabo ee awoodda codbixintu waa shardi koowaad oo matalaadda waxtarka leh, ka leexashada sinnaantaasna waxay yeelan kartaa qiil halka ay siinayso matalaad ka waxtar badan, iyadoo la tixgelinayo arrimo ay ka mid yihiin juquraafiga, taariikhda bulshada, danaha bulshada iyo matalaadda dadka laga tirada badan yahay. Natiijooyinka tirakoobka iyo qaab-dhismeedka ee hubinta — booska khariidadda inta yar ee 99.99-aad centile ee 1,010,000 sawir oo dhexdhexaad ah, dhaafitaankeeda afar ka mid ah shanta xad ee qaab-dhismeedka (kan shanaad, xajinta, waa dhexdhexaad labada khariidadoodba), iyo bulshooyinka la aqoonsaday ee ay saamaysay — waa diiwaanka caddaynta ee uu dacwoode §3 u baahan lahaa inuu uruuriyo. Dhinaca danta bulshada ee diiwaankaas, go'aanka Maxkamadda Federaalka ee <em>Raîche v. Canada</em> (2004 FC 679) waa xukunka hoggaanka u ah Kanada: maxkamaddu halkaas waxay ku qasbatay Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada ee Federaalka inay dib u eegto xudduudo indha-tiray danta bulshada Acadian ee New Brunswick. Cabbirrada xajinta dawladda hoose ee hubinta iyo natiijooyinkeeda bulsho ee gaarka ah — Airdrie oo loo kala qaybiyay afar degmo, iyo waxyaabaha aan caadiga ahayn ee cidhifka magaalada ee waqooyi-galbeed Calgary ee guddoomiyuhu calaamadeeyay — waa isla nooca caddaynta ee Maxkamadda Federaalku u aqoonsatay mid sharci ahaan la tixgelin karo. In diiwaankaasi gaadho xadka dastuuriga ah waa su'aal sharci oo aanay hubintani go'aamin; hubintu waxay soo sheegtaa cabbirka.`,framework_p3:`Sharcinimada guddiga ahaan habraac waa su'aal gooni ah. <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta si cad uma mamnuucayo in golaha sharci-dejintu dhiso hay'ad dib-u-qaybin oo barbar socota, maxaa yeelay Sharcigu wuxuu filayaa in golaha sharci-dejintu xudduudaha kama dambaysta ah ku dhaqan-geliyo sharci caadi ah si kastaba. In habraaca guddigu, haddii uu soo saaro khariidad leh muuqaalka qaab-dhismeed iyo tirakoob ee soo jeedinta inta yar, uu ka badbaadi karo dacwad ku saleysan §3 ee Axdiga waxay ku xidhan tahay in matalaad waxtar leh lagu gaadhi karo xudduudaha ka dhasha — isla tijaabada lagu dabaqi lahaa khariidad kasta oo guddi soo saaro.`,h_quebec:`Isbarbardhigga Quebec`,quebec_p1:`Quebec waxay bixisaa isbarbardhigga ugu khuseeya xaalada Alberta. Commission de la représentation électorale (CRE) ee Quebec waa hay'ad xudduudo doorasho oo joogto ah oo madax-bannaan, ma aha guddi ad hoc oo la aasaasay kii dib-u-qaybinta. CRE waxay si joogto ah u shaqeysaa mana la baabbi'in karto ama la ka gudbi karo amar golaha wasiirada. Hoos <em>Loi électorale</em> ee Quebec, CRE lafteeda ayaa dejisa khariidadda doorashada ee kama-dambaysta ah: Golaha Qaran wuxuu ka dooda warbixinta guddida wuxuuna dhegeystaa ra'yi-celin, laakiin uma codeeyo inuu ansixiyo ama ka noqdo — toban maalmood gudahood ee doodaas guddidu waxay dejisaa xudduudaha, kuwaas oo lagu daabaco Gazette officielle. Saamaynta waxtar leh waa in xisbi xukunka, isaga oo awood laftiisa ku shaqaynaya, aanu bedeli karin khariidadda uu dooray meesha khariidadda guddida; xadaynta lafteeda, hay'adda madax-bannaan ayaa leh erayga ugu dambeeya.`,quebec_p2:`Qaabka Quebec wuxuu qayb ahaan ka soo baxay casharro laga bartay waxa dhaca marka dib-u-qaybintu aanay ka ilaalinayn maamulka xisbiyeed. Isbarbardhigga habraaca hadda ee Alberta — halkaas oo guddi ay aqlabiyaddu maamusho uu beddelay shaqadii guddida ka hor intaanu golaha sharci-dejintu u codayn labada warbixinood ee guddida midkoodna — wuxuu muujinayaa farqiga qaab-dhismeed ee u dhexeeya nidaamyada dib-u-qaybinta ee filaya cadaadis xisbiyeed oo loo naqshadeeyay inay ka hortagaan, iyo nidaamyada uu cadaadiskaasi jid cad ugu leeyahay natiijada.`,closing:`Hubintu waxay ku dabaqi doontaa isla tijaabaha khariidadda guddiga Lunty marka la sii daayo. Indho-indhaynta dastuuriga ah iyo isbarbardhigga kor ku xusan waa macnaha; habka loo tijaabiyo isma beddelo.`,process_scorecard:`Khariidaddu waa kala badh oo keliya waxa la qiimeeyo Noofembar. Habraacu wuxuu leeyahay qalab u gaar ah: kaar dhibco oo sagaal astaamood ah — dhageysiyo, qabyooyin la daabacay, qoris gacan-ka-fog ah, iyo inta kale ee caadadii lixdanka sano ahayd dammaanad qaadday — oo qabyo ahaan loogu daabacay <a href="__BASE__/norms#measurable">bogga heerarka</a>. Afar ka mid ah unugyada guddigu ku dhacayo waa astaamo uu weli ku dari karo ka hor intaanu warbixin soo gudbin.`},casings:{frame_h:`Caddayn, ma aha xaqiijin`,frame_p1:`Waxaa laga yaabaa inaad halkan u timid adigoo raadinaya xaqiijin muujinaysa in khariidad la khiyaameeyay. Warbixintani ma haysato. Ma yeelan karto — sababta aanay u yeelan karinna waa waxa ugu muhiimsan ee aan helnay.`,frame_cast:`Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta ee 2025–26 waxay shaqadeeda dhammaysay 23 Maarso 2026, wayna heshiin kari wayday. Saddex xubnood ayaa saxeexay hal khariidad. Labada kale — labada ay dawladdu soo jeedisay — waxay saxeexeen mid kale. Labada khariidadoodba waa sharci sida uu qabo <em>Electoral Boundaries Commission Act</em>. Afar toddobaad ka dib, 21 Abriil, Golaha Sharci-dejintu labada khariidadoodba dhinac ayuu iska dhigay oo qalinka u dhiibay guddi lix MLA ah: afar ka mid ah xisbiga talada haya ee United Conservative Party (UCP), iyadoo xubin UCP ah ay guddoomiye tahay. Khariidadda guddigaas waxa la filayaa 2 Noofembar 2026.`,frame_p2:`Labada khariidadood ee guddida, iyo habraaca ku xeeran, waxaan ku cabbirnay hab kasta oo aan aqoonnay. Waxa aan helnay waa shan iyo toban natiijo, mid kastaa waa dhab, mid kastaa waa la cabbiray, mid kastaana wax buu ka tari lahaa maxkamad dhexdeed — midkoodna, keligiis ama wadajir, sharci ahaan ma caddayn karo gunaanadka ay ku casuumaan. Caddaynta ah in khariidad leedahay saamayn xisbiyeed ma aha caddayn muujinaysa cidda ula jeedday, ama sababta. Farqigaas u dhexeeya caddaynta iyo xaqiijintu ma aha god aan ku guuldarraysannay inaan xidhno. Kanada, waa nidaamka sida loo qoray. Taasina waa natiijo.`,frame_p3:`Sidaa darteed warbixintan waxa loo dhisay sida diiwaan caddayneed. Natiijo kastaa waxay helaysaa isla shanta su'aalood, isla siday u kala horreeyaan, mar kasta:`,beat_found:`Waxa aan helnay`,beat_found_d:`caddaynta, iyo tiradeeda.`,beat_show:`Waxa ay muujin karto`,beat_show_d:`gunaanadka lagugu jiidan doono inaad gaadho, oo lagu sheegay xooggiisa oo dhan.`,beat_experts:`Waxa khubaraadu yidhaahdaan`,beat_experts_d:`sida caddaynta noocan ah loola dhaqmo meelaha ay maxkamad dhab ahaan ku murmaan.`,beat_canada:`Waxa dhaqanka Kanada filayo`,beat_canada_d:`caadada.`,beat_gun:`Sababta aanay u ahayn xaqiijin`,beat_gun_d:`sababta gaarka ah, sharciga Kanada hoostiisa, ee caddayntani u caddaynayso wax ka yar inta ay u muuqato.`,frame_p4:`Siddeedda sababood ee sharci mid kastaa wuu ka duwan yahay. Marka aad gaadho natiijada shan iyo tobnaad waxaad baran doontaa, qayb qayb, sida sharciga xudduudaha Kanada dhab ahaan u shaqeeyo — iyo sababta natiijo kasta oo diiwaankan ku jirtaa isku si ugu dhammaato.`,frame_p5:`Laba natiijo oo diiwaanka ku jira waxay u tilmaamayaan jihada khaldan sheekadeenna, labadoodaba si buuxda ayaa loo soo sheegay: hal imtixaan oo joojiyay kala-saarka khariidadaha markii xog ka wanaagsan timid, iyo hal waddo oo khariidadda inta yar ay kaga fiicnaatay inta badan. Warbixin aan weligeed dood kula lumin nafteeda ma hubinayso. Imtixaannada la dhacay iyo kuwa natiijo la'aanta ahi waa qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka.`,frame_coi:`Hal shay oo kale ayaa diiwaanka galaya ka hor natiijada koowaad: aragtida hore ee qoraaga laftiisa. Wuxuu u codeeyay oo deeq siiyay xisbiyada gobolka ee muxaafidka iyo horusocodka labadaba Alberta. Qiyaastii 27 sano wuxuu kaloo u shaqeeyay sidii sarkaal doorasho oo qandaraas ah Elections Alberta, doorasho doorasho, isagoo maamulaya codbixinta maalinta doorashada; waxba oo hubintan ku jira kama yimaadaan shaqadaas. Saddex natiijo oo ka soo horjeeday filashadiisa ayaa si kastaba diiwaankan loogu hayaa, tiro kastana waxa dib looga soo saari karaa koodh dadweyne, xog dadweyne, iyo abuurro bakhtiyaanasiib ah oo si dadweyne horay loogu xidhay ka hor intaan falanqayntu socon.`,frame_lenses:`Dhacdadan waxay leedahay saddex muraayadood, mid kastaana wuxuu leeyahay bog wehel u ah: <a href="__BASE__/law">waxa sharcigu weydiiyo</a>, <a href="__BASE__/norms">waxa caadooyinku weydiiyaan</a>, iyo <a href="__BASE__/methods">sida khariidadaha loo tijaabiyay</a>. Diiwaanka hoose wuxuu ka faa'iidaysanayaa saddexdaba.`,frame_p1b:`Ama waxaa laga yaabaa inaad u timid wax ka fudud. Waxaad maqashay in Alberta ay ku dagaallamayso khariidaddeeda doorashada, waxaadna rabtaa inaad ogaato waxa dagaalku ku saabsan yahay. Nooca gaaban: halka khadadka degmadu ku dhacaan ayaa go'aamiya codadka cidda isu geeya kursi iyo kuwa cidda kala firdha. Alberta waxay dib u sawiraysay riding-yadeeda, degmooyinka mid kastaa doorto MLA. Guddida madax-bannaan ee shaqada qabanaysay waxay u kala qaybsantay laba kooxood waxayna soo gudbisay laba khariidadood oo iska tartamaya 23 Maarso 2026 — labaduba sharci sida uu Sharcigu qabo, labaduba la saxeexay. Afar toddobaad ka dib dawladdu labadaba dhinac ayay iska dhigtay oo qalinka u dhiibtay guddi uu xisbigeedu maamulo, tallaabo ay Alberta u dambaysay 1992. Dagaalku wuxuu ku saabsan yahay waxa guddigaasi sawiri doono Noofembartan, iyo in qof uun ogaan karo haddii si aan caddaalad ahayn loo sawiro. Hubintani waxay u jirtaa si qof uun u ogaan karo.`,frame_routes:`Haddaba, laba waddo oo laga soo galo. Haddii aad u timid inaad barato dagaalka, ka bilow sawirka hoos yaal, ka dibna khariidadda daboolka; nasashada badhtamaha bogga ayaa keenta waddadaada. Dhacdada saddexdeeda muraayadood mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay bog luqad fudud ah: <a href="__BASE__/law">sharciga</a>, <a href="__BASE__/norms">caadooyinka</a>, <a href="__BASE__/methods">tirakoobka</a>. Haddii aad u timid caddaynta, diiwaanku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa Natiijada 1: shan iyo toban natiijo, mid kastaa shan su'aalood, dhammaantood isku si ku dhammaanaya.`,refrain:`Caddayn, ma aha xaqiijin.`,refrain_not_even:`Xitaa caddayn ka dhan ah khariidadda ma aha. Si kastaba waan diiwaangelinnay.`,c2_refrain:`Eedeyn ku jirta diiwaanka rasmiga ah, ma aha go'aan maxkamad kasta.`,c3_refrain:`Hadda laba natiijo, weli xaqiijin ma jirto.`,c4_refrain:`Hadda saddex natiijo, weli xaqiijin ma jirto.`,c6_refrain:`Lix iyo lixdan ka mid ah 1,010,000 — caddayn, ma aha xaqiijin.`,c8_refrain:`Hal ka mid ah 568,000 — caddayn, ma aha xukun.`,c11_refrain:`Sababo xun oo loo bixiyay khad sharci ah weli waa khad sharci ah.`,c13_refrain:`Sharci, tallaabo kasta.`,know_more:`Wax badan ka ogow`,act1_h:`Fasalka I: Waxa Khariidaddu Sameyso`,act1_intro:`Fasalka I wuxuu dul socdaa khadadka laftooda. Natiijooyin doorasho ma jiraan, jilitaan ma jiro: joomatari keliya oo qof kastaa ku hubin karo khariidad warqad ah. Labada qabyo waxa lagu sawiray isla qolka, shan xubnood oo guddi ah oo ka shaqaynayay isla xeerarka sharciga, isla juquraafiga gobolka, isla kaydka 1,345 soo gudbin dadweyne iyo isla xogta dadka. Waxay ku heshiiyaan inta badan Alberta. Halka ay ku kala tagaan, waxay ku kala tagaan doorashooyin uu qof qolka ku jiray ahaa inuu sameeyo.`,act1_table_h:`Fasalka I hal sawir`,act1_table_close:`Imtixaannada Fasalka I, inta badan waxay dhaaftaa eber ka mid ah xadadka qaab-dhismeedka ee kala-saara, kuwa khariidadaha kala garta. Inta yar waxay dhaaftaa mid kasta oo kala-saara: afar ka mid ah afar, iyadoo kan shanaad, oo aan khariidadaha kala garanayn, la muujiyay halkii la qarin lahaa. Cabbirradani waa joomatari. Uma baahna muunad-qaade tirakoob iyo xog cod midna. Shantoodaba waxaan horay u diiwaangelinnay 24 Abriil 2026, annagoo qoraal ku xidhnay ka hor intaan la isu keenin natiijooyinka kama dambaysta ah ee jilitaanka.`,c1_title:`Natiijada 1 — Magaalo 85,805 qof ah oo leh hal kursi oo u gaar ah`,c1_found:`Khariidadda inta yar waxay Magaalada Airdrie u qaybisaa afar qaybood. Airdrie waxay leedahay 85,805 qof (tirakoobka degmada 2024). Waxay leedahay hal golaha, hal biil cashuureed iyo hal koox adeegyo magaalo. Sharcigu riding kasta wuxuu ku xaddidaa hal iyo rubuc jeer celceliska gobolka, sidaa darteed Airdrie waxay u baahan tahay ugu yaraan laba riding. Khariidadda inta badan waxay siisaa laba. Khariidadda inta yar waxay siisaa afar. Qayb waqooyiga ah, qiyaastii 350 qof, waxay u tagtaa Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury. Bariga wuxuu u tagaa Airdrie East, oo qaadata in ka badan kala badh magaalada; sagaal ka mid ah toban dadkeeda ah waxay ku nool yihiin Airdrie. Galbeedku wuxuu u tagaa Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West, badhtamaha-koonfurna Calgary-Airdrie. Labadaas riding, dadka Calgary waxay ka tiro badan yihiin kuwa Airdrie. Kala-qaybinta waxaan u tijaabiyay jeexitaan: bulsho si khafiif ah loo kala jeexo ilaa aanay waxba go'aamin (warbixinta akadeemiga §5.3.2). Xeerarka imtixaankaas waxaan ku qoray isla fadhigii aan markii ugu horreysay socodsiiyay, sidaa darteed waxa loo tiriyaa mid goor dambe lagu daray. Imtixaanku wuxuu leeyahay laba shuruud. Midda hore waa qaybo ka badan inta cabbirka magaaladu u baahan yahay. Kala-qaybinta inta yar way gudubtaa. Midda labaad waa in dadka Airdrie laga tiro badnaado qayb kasta. Kala-qaybintu way ku dhacdaa taas, Airdrie East darteed. Xeerka imtixaanka laftiisa, taasi ma aha jeexitaan. Kala-qaybinta labada-dhinac ee inta badan labada shuruudoodba way ku dhacdaa.`,c1_show:`Airdrie East marka laga reebo, kala-qaybinta inta yar waa jeexitaan sida buuggu u qeexo. Ka fikir qof Airdrie ku nool oo su'aal u haya MLA-geeda. Waa inay ogaato qaybta magaalada ay ku nooshahay ka hor intaanay wici karin xafiiska saxda ah. Kooxda waalidiinta ee dugsiga ilmaheedu ma diri karto hal wafdi oo u taga hal MLA. Waa inay dirtaa afar, afar xafiis, saddex ka mid ah MLA-yadaasna marka hore waxay u jawaabaan codbixiyayaal ka baxsan Airdrie. Haddii aad rabtay inaad daciifiso codka magaalo si degdeg ah u koraysa oo tartan adag leh, sidan ayay u ekaan lahayd.`,c1_experts:`Kala-jeexidda bulshadu waa mid ka mid ah calaamadaha khatarta ah ee ugu muhiimsan ee qoraallada dib-u-qaybinta, maxaa yeelay waa mid ka mid ah labada dhaqaaq ee farsameed ee khadadku codadka ugu beddelaan kursiyo ka yar. Ka kale waa urursi, muraayaddeeda. Kala-qaybin afar-jiho ah lagama arki karo tirakoob kasta oo caddaalad xisbiyeed marka laga reebo kan weydiinaya: codbixiye ma heli karaa MLA-giisa?`,c1_canada:`Guddiyada Kanadu waxay magaalo isku haynteeda u arkaan qayb asaasi ah oo bulshada danta wadaagta: xidhiidhada la wadaago ee sharcigu ka codsado sawirayaasha xudduudaha inay miisaamaan. Magaalo cabbirkan leh oo laba loo kala qaybiyo waa caadi. In afar loo kala qaybiyo, si ku dhowaad kala badh dadkeeda laga tiro badnaado, ma aha. Isla guddidaas khariidaddeeda inta badan waxay muujisaa in kala-qaybin labada-dhinac ah ay suurtagal ahayd isla dhulkaas.`,c1_gun:`<em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> wuxuu oggol yahay in magaalo la kala qaybiyo. Bulshada danta wadaagtu waa hal arrin oo ka mid ah dhowr ay Sharcigu taxo, mana xidhna. Kiiska ugu weyn ee matalaadda waxtarka leh, <em>Saskatchewan Reference</em> ee Maxkamadda Sare, wuxuu maxkamadaha u sheegaa inay u hoggaansamaan sida sawirayaasha xudduuduhu u miisaamaan arrimahaas. Ma helin go'aan Kanadiyan ah oo buriyay khariidad sabab ah inay magaalo kala qaybisay. Labada khariidadoodba waa sharci. Kala-qaybinta afarta-dhinac waa doorasho. Sharciga Kanada hoostiisa, doorashooyinka ku jira xadka ballaadhan ee Sharciga waxa iska leh cidda sawirta khariidadda. <em>(Casharka sharciga 1: arrimaha Sharciga waxa loo daayaa garaadka, maxkamaduhuna way u hoggaansamaan.)</em>`,c1_app:`waxa “jeexitaanku” dhab ahaan ku sameeyo cod`,c2_title:`Natiijada 2 — Saddexda xudduudood ee guddoomiyuhu tilmaamay`,c2_found:`Inta badan ee guddidu waa guddoomiyaha iyo laba xubnood. Waxa lagu magacaabay isla Sharcigii inta yar waxayna ka shaqeeyeen isla gudbinnadii. Warbixintooda, warbixinta kama dambaysta ah ee rasmiga ah ee guddida, waxay afar ka mid ah xudduudaha khariidadda inta yar u calaamadeysaa kuwo aan caadi ahayn khariidadda. Saddex ka mid ahi waa fidinta riding-ka Rocky Mountain House-Banff Park ee dhulka beerta qaranka ee madhan, marinka qaabka xadhig-qabsiga leh ee Calgary-Nolan Hill-Cochrane, iyo fidinta Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury ee waqooyiga Airdrie. Warbixintu waxay fidinta beerta ugu yeedhaa “dadaal niyad xun” oo lagu sheeganayo ka-reebis dad oo loo qoray bulshooyin fog oo dad dhab ahi ku nool yihiin. Inta badani calaamado sidaas oo kale ah kama soo qaadin khariidaddeeda. Keligeed, taasi wax yar ayay caddaysaa: waxaad filan lahayd in dhaleeceeyntu u socoto oo keliya dhinaca kale. Waxa calaamadahaas miisaan siiya waa imtixaannadayda qaabka, oo labada khariidadoodba ku dhibceeya isla xeerar. Waxay xaqiijiyeen qaabab aan caadi ahayn saddex ka mid ah afarta calaamadood ee inta badan. Ta afraad, Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West, ma gaadhin heerkayga. (Dhaleeceeynta la daabacay ee warbixintu waxay daboolaysaa toddoba habayn xudduudeed guud ahaan.)`,c2_show:`Inta badan ee guddida, guddoomiyuhu ku jiro, waxay warbixinta rasmiga ah ku eedeeyeen asxaabtooda inay ka-reebista riding-yada fog, s.15(2), u isticmaaleen niyad xun. Hubintaydu waxay daciifisaa eedda: riding-ku wuu u qalmaa beerta la'aanteed. Eeddu waxay muujisaa inta ay kala qaybsanaantu qoto dheerayd. Ma muujiso in ka-reebista la khiyaaneeyay.`,c2_experts:`Aqoonsiga gerrymander-ka, khadad loo sawiray si xisbi faa'iido loo siiyo, wuxuu ka bilaabmay qaabab yaab leh. Marinnada iyo fidinta dhul madhan waa calaamadaha caadiga ah. Caddaalad ahaan, habaynta Banff waxay ka dambaysaa juquraafi macquul ah inkastoo magaceeda iyo qaabkeedu yaab leeyihiin. Magaalada Banff waxay ku dhex taal beer federaal ah oo aanay ku kori karin, in lala kooxeeyo Canmore-na bulsho ahaan macne ayay samaynaysaa. Falanqaynteyda Banff dhinacaas sheekada si buuxda ayay u aqoonsataa. Waxay sidoo kale tijaabisaa eedda laftigeeda, wayna daciifisaa. Dhulka beerta ee madhan la'aantiis, riding-ku weli wuxuu buuxiyaa afar ka mid ah shanta imtixaan ee ka-reebista riding-yada fog (s.15(2) ee Sharciga), sidaa darteed marna uma baahnayn beerta. Waxa meelaynta magaaladu sharxi karin waa sababta xariiqdu u gasho beerta gabi ahaanba.`,c2_banff_link:`Ka eeg Banff khariidadda`,c2_canada:`Guddi-xubnuhu warbixinnadooda way ku khilaafaan mar walba. In inta badan ee guddi ay asxaabteeda ku eedeyso niyad xun warbixinta kama dambaysta ah ee rasmiga ah waa dhif. Ma aqaan kiis kale, inkastoo aanan warbixinnadii hore mid-mid u baadhin.`,c2_gun:`Erayada inta badani waa ra'yi, oo ku jira warbixin aan awood sharci lahayn. “Niyad xun” oo ku jirta warbixin guddi waa eedeyn, ma aha xukun: maxkamad marna ma miisaamin. Sharciga hoostiisa, labada warbixinoodba waxay ahaayeen talo, oo keliya talo, laga bilaabo markii la gudbiyay. Golaha Sharci-dejintu labadaba dhinac ayuu iska dhigi karay. Wuu sameeyay. <em>(Casharka sharciga 2: warbixinnada guddiyadu cidna kuma xidhna. Golaha Sharci-dejinta ayaa qalinka haya.)</em>`,c2_app:`falanqaynta qaabka iyo waxa ilaalinta s.15(2) loogu talagalay`,c3_title:`Natiijada 3 — Hal aag oo Calgary ah, oo loo sawiray 11.5% aad u weyn`,c3_found:`Qaado hal aag oo Calgary ah: waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha magaalada. Isla guddidii, isla xeerarkii. Khariidadda inta yar, toddoba iyo tobanka riding ee aaggu celcelis ahaan waxay hayaan 11.5% dad ka badan celceliska gobolka. Khariidadda inta badan waxay hayaan 2.8% ka badan. Sidaa darteed hal khariidad waxay ku soo baxaan qiyaastii 8.4% ka weyn tan kale. Liisaska riding-yada aagga waxa markii hore la qoray, 22 Abriil, sidii riding-yo ay NDP ku tartami karto iyo riding-yo UCP xukunto. Markii dambe waxa lagu sharraxay juquraafi, isla riding-yadii liis kasta. Akhris erey-ereyeed ah oo xeerkaas juquraafiga ah, tirooyinku waa 8.5% ilaa 8.9% inta yar iyo 1.3% ilaa 1.6% inta badan. Taasi waa natiijo ku saabsan sinnaanta dadka. Ma aha urursi. Urursi macnaheedu waa codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi oo lagu cufo riding-yo yar oo uu ku guulaysto farqi ballaadhan. Imtixaankayga urursiga (warbixinta akadeemiga §5.3.1) wuxuu u baahan yahay in riding-yada NDP ku guulaysato ee aagga lagu guulaysto farqi ballaadhan, ugu yaraan 15 dhibcood ka sarreeya celceliska gobolka. Codadka 2023, NDP waxay ku guulaysataa siddeed ka mid ah toddoba iyo tobanka khariidadda inta yar, celcelis ahaan 15.0 dhibcood. Taasi waa 12.6 ka hooseeya celceliska gobolka ee 27.6. Sidaa darteed imtixaanku wuu ku dhacaa, mana helo urursi. Xeerarkiisa waxaan ku qoray isla fadhigii aan markii ugu horreysay socodsiiyay, sidaa darteed bilowgiiba wuxuu ahaa imtixaan goor dambe lagu daray.`,c3_show:`Riding weyni wuxuu ka dhigan yahay in warqad codbixineed kasta oo ku jirta ay wax yar ka miisaan yar tahay, cid kasta oo dhiibta. Codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi oo lagu cufo riding-yo ka yar oo ka weyn waxa loo yaqaan urursi. Jeexitaan (natiijada 1) waxay la yihiin labada tallaabo ee caadiga ah ee gerrymandering. Halkan farqiga cabbirku waa dhab. Farqiyada guulaha ballaadhan ee calaamadeyn lahaa urursiga halkan ma joogaan.`,c3_experts:`Urursiga iyo jeexitaanku waa farsamada ka dambaysa ku dhawaad kiis kasta oo gerrymandering xisbiyeed ah oo weligiis lagu dooday maxkamad Maraykan ah. Degmooyin aad u weyn oo si sax ah ugu yaal halka codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi ku urursan yihiin: taasi waa qaabka cilmi-baadhista ogaanshaha loo dhisay inay hesho.`,c3_canada:`Kala fogaansho celceliska ka yimaada waa caadi xadka sharciga gudihiisa. Laakiin guddiyada Kanadu waxay ku taageeraan sababo bulshada danta wadaagta ah. Sababaha la daabacay ee inta yar ee aaggan waxay ka mid yihiin kuwa lagu hubiyay natiijada 11.`,c3_gun:`Mid kasta oo riding-yadaas ka mid ah wuxuu ku jiraa xadka Sharciga ee 25% ka sarreeya ama ka hooseeya celceliska. Sharciga Kanada ma bixiyo sabab lagu dacweeyo saamaynta khariidaddu ku leedahay xisbiyada. Qodobka 3 ee Charter-ku wuxuu ilaaliyaa matalaadda waxtarka leh ee muwaadin kasta: cod dhab ah, ma aha oo keliya tirooyin isku le'eg. Xisbiyada uma ballanqaado in codadku si saami ah ugu beddelmi doonaan kursiyo, maxkamad Kanadiyan ahna sidaas uma akhrin. <em>(Casharka sharciga 3: xadka gudihiisa, farqi cabbir waa doorasho sharci ah. Waxyeello xisbi soo gaadhay ma aha waxyeello uu sharcigu aqoonsado.)</em>`,c3_app:`urursiga oo lagu sharraxay tusaale saddex degmo ah`,c4_title:`Natiijada 4 — Ka liidata waxa keliya ee sharcigu dhab ahaan cabbiro`,c4_found:`Riding kasta qaado oo cabbir inta dadkiisu ka fog yihiin qayb siman. Kadib celcelis u samee farqiyadaas. Celceliskaas waxa loo yaqaan leexashada dhexe ee buuxda, ama MAD. Shaxaha dadka ee guddida laftigeeda, riding-yada khariidadda inta yar way ka sii fog yihiin sinnaanta kuwa inta badan. MAD-keedu waa 4,707 qof, marka loo eego 3,180: 48% ka ballaadhan. Tirooyinka tirakoobka 2021 farqigu wuu yar yahay. Halkaas, celceliska farqiyada labada khariidadood ku dhowaad waa isku mid. Laakiin farqiga dhexe ee inta yar, farqiga riding-ka ku jira badhtamaha kooxda, weli wuu ballaadhan yahay: 3,938 marka loo eego 2,827. Taas waxaan barbar dhigay khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray isagoon marna cod arkin, iyadoo riding kasta lagu hayo 12.5% gudahood celceliska. Marka loo eego, farqiga dhexe ee inta yar wuxuu joogaa boqolleyda 99aad: ka ballaadhan 99 ka mid ah 100. Marka loo eego khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray ee loo oggolaaday 25%-ka buuxa ee Sharciga, labada khariidadood ee guddidu waxay joogaan cidhifka hoose ee xadka, halka farqiyadu ugu yar yihiin.`,c4_show:`Codad siman, mid kastaa isku miisaan, waa qiimaha keliya ee Sharcigu ku cabbiro riding kasta. Tirooyinka guddida laftigeeda, khariidadda inta yar waxay ka tanaasushaa wax ka badan khariidadda inta badan ee dhinaceeda lagu sawiray. Difaaca caadiga ah ee khadadka aan caadiga ahayn waa in loo baahnaa si dadka loo isku dheellitiro. Halkan taasi gadaal ayay u socotaa. Khariidadda inta yar ayaa ah tan labada ka sinnaan yar.`,c4_experts:`Nooc kasta oo rasmi ah oo dib-u-qaybinta ah, dadka oo simani waa xaddidaadda ugu horraysa. Kala-fid intan le'eg, khariidad la sawiray isla waqtiga mid ka cidhiidhi badan, waa calaamad kharash: caddayn in yoolal kale ay ka sarreeyeen qiimaha udub-dhexaadka u ah sharciga.`,c4_canada:`Guddiyada Kanadu kala fogaanshaha la oggol yahay waxay u arkaan xad, ma aha miisaaniyad la kharashgareeyo. Alberta, guddida laftigeedu waxay aragtaa “janjeer taariikhi ah oo cad” “oo ku wajahan in culays badan la saaro sinnaanta codbixiyayaasha”, taas oo ah codad siman (warbixinta kama dambaysta, b. 24).`,c4_gun:`Xeerka keliya ee dadka ee Sharcigu waa xadka 25% ka sarreeya ama ka hooseeya celceliska. Ilaa afar riding oo fog ayaa ka hoosayn kara celceliska ilaa 50% (s.15(2)). Khariidad kastaa waxay isticmaashaa saddex ka mid ah afartaas. Riding kasta oo labada khariidadood midkood ku jira ma jebiyo xeerka. Xadka gudihiisa, sharcigu ma kala darajeeyo khariidadaha. Kala fogaansho ballaadhan iyo mid cidhiidhi ahi sharci ahaan waa isku mid. <em>(Casharka sharciga 4: Sharcigu wuxuu leeyahay hal xeer dadka, khariidadda inta yarna way raacdaa.)</em>`,c4_app:`waxa MAD cabbiro iyo sababta xadku u jiro`,c5_title:`Natiijada 5 — Natiijadii dhalaashay markii aan qaadnay`,c5_found:`Intee jeer ayay xariiqda riding-ku raacdaa xudduud magaalo ama degmo? Khariidadda inta badan, 80% waqtiga. Khariidadda inta yar, 72%. Khariidadda 2019, oo ay sawirtay guddidii u dambaysay oo weli la isticmaalo, waxay sidaas samaysaa 75% waqtiga. Imtixaankani ma kala saaro labada khariidadood.`,c5_show:`Marka xariiqda riding-ku raacdo xariiqda magaalo ama degmo, xariiqda cashuurta hantida iyo xariiqda doorashadu way isku mid noqdaan, inta badanna xariiqda qaybta dugsiyada sidoo kale. Codbixiyayaashu way garan karaan halka riding-koodu ka bilaabmo iyo halka uu ku dhammaado. Cabbirkaas, labada khariidadood way isu eg yihiin.`,c5_experts:`Sidan ayuu u eg yahay wax farsamo ka dhashay: calaamad ay qalabku sameeyeen, ma aha khariidadda. Xariiqyo ku-meel-gaadh ah ayaa soo saaray, faylasha khariidadda dhabta ahina way tirtireen. Casharkaas habka ah ayaa ah sababta aan wax kasta dib ugu socodsiinnay shapefile-yada rasmiga ah maalintii Elections Alberta sii daysay.`,c5_canada:`Waxba. Ma jiro sharci ama hage dhaqan oo Kanadiyan ah oo dalbanaya heer xajin gaar ah. Caadada 70–85% waxay qeexaysaa waxa guddiyadu sameeyaan; ma dejiso waxa ay qasab ku tahay inay sameeyaan.`,c5_gun:`Waxba ma go'aamiyo dhinacna. Labada khariidadoodba waxay u dhow yihiin khariidadda 2019, Sharciguna ugu yaraan uma dejiyo tan.`,c5_app:`waxa xajinta dawladda hoose cabbirto, iyo waxa aanay muujin karin`,act2_h:`Fasalka II: Waxa Jilitaanku Arko`,act2_intro_p1:`Fasalka I wax kale uma baahnayn khadadka mooyaane. Fasalka II wuxuu weydiinayaa su'aal ka adag: intee in le'eg ayay khariidadahani caadi uga duwan yihiin, marka la barbar dhigo waxa habraac aan ajande lahayni sawiri lahaa? Si aan uga jawaabno, waxaan kombuyuutar ka dhignay inuu sawiro 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah oo xisaab ahaan dhexdhexaad ah (4 silsiladood oo madax-bannaan × 252,500 tallaabo, abuurka saldhigga ah wuxuu ka yimid calaamadda bakhtiyaanasiibka dadweyne ee Cloudflare drand, horay looga diiwaangeliyay OSF ka hor fulinta). Wuxuu isticmaalay shapefile-yada rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta wuxuuna raacay isla xeerarka sharciga iyo xudduudaha juquraafi ee guddidu isticmaashay. Jilitaanka u qaado sidii “mashiinka haddii-maxaa”: sidee ayay khariidadaha Alberta u ekaan lahaayeen haddii aanay cidina isku dayayn inay wax samayso? Khariidad dhab ah dhex dhig dadkaas badan, boqolleydeeduna — meesheeda safka — waxay kuu sheegaysaa inta ay ugu fog tahay dabada, dhinaca naadirka ah.`,act2_intro_p2:`Hal xaqiiqo oo ku saabsan Alberta ayaa tiro kasta oo hoose ka dhigta mid la akhriyi karo. Gobolkan, dhexdhexaad macnihiisu maaha 50/50. Codka gobolka oo dhan si sax ah u kala qaybi, median-ka 1,010,000 khariidadood ee dhexdhexaadka ah — badhtamaha safka — wuxuu UCP siinayaa 44.8% kursiyada oo keliya. Sababtu? Codbixiyayaasha UCP ee miyiga waxay riding-yadooda ku guulaystaan farqi ballaadhan oo celcelis ahaan qiyaastii 70-30 ah, iyagoo khasaariya codad badan oo “dheeraad” ah, halka codbixiyayaasha NDP ee magaaladu ay kuwooda ku guulaystaan farqi ka dhow oo qiyaastii 60-40 ah oo ay khasaariyaan wax ka yar. Haddii loo daayo, juquraafiga siyaasadeed ee dabiiciga ah ee Alberta wuxuu wax yar u janjeedhaa waxtarka kursiyada NDP. Saldhiggaas maskaxda ku hay. Waa waxa khariidadaha hoose lagu cabbiro.`,c6_title:`Natiijada 6 — Wax ka yar 100 khariidadood 1,010,000 dhexdood`,c6_found:`Ka fikir in codka gobolka oo dhan si sax ah badh loogu kala qaybiyo. Imisa kursi ayay khariidad kastaa siin lahayd UCP? Isla su'aashaas waxaan weydiiyay 1,010,000 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray isagoon marna cod arkin. Khariidadahaas kombuyuutarku sawiray waxay leeyihiin 87 riding, tirada khariidadda 2019. Ta dhexe waxay UCP siisaa 44.8% kursiyada. Ta ugu sarreysa ee midkood gaadho waa 51.72%, taas oo ah 45 ka mid ah 87 kursi. Khariidadda 2019, oo weli maanta la isticmaalo, waxay UCP siisaa 46.0%. Taasi waa boqolleyda 65aad, ama 78aad haddii khariidad kasta oo la siman loo tiriyo inay ka hoosayso. Khariidadda inta badan ee guddidu waxay bixisaa 46.1%. Taasi waa boqolleyda 78aad, natiijo caadi ah. Khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu waxay bixisaa 51.69%, taas oo ah 46 ka mid ah 89-keeda kursi. Oo keliya 69 ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray ayaa UCP siiya wax ka badan, dhammaan 69-kuna waxay ku jiraan isla qiimaha, 51.72%. Taasi waxay khariidadda inta yar dhigaysaa boqolleyda 99.99aad: ka fog dhammaan marka laga reebo qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 10,000. Laba cabbir oo kale oo caddaalad ah oo horay loo dejiyay ayaa isla jihada tilmaamaya, xagga UCP. Farqiga celceliska-dhexe, khariidadda inta yar way ka fog tahay 99.97% khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Declination, way ka fog tahay 98.8%. Maxay taasi ka dhigan tahay kursiyo ahaan? Dib u ciyaar doorashadii 2023 adigoo adeegsanaya oo keliya warqadaha codbixinta ee la dhiibay maalinta doorashada. Khariidadda inta yar waxay UCP siisaa 60 ka mid ah 89 kursi, khariidadda inta badanna 55. Tiri dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta ee 2023, kuwaas oo imtixaan kasta oo cod ku salaysan ee boggan adeegsado, tirinta la diiwaangeliyayna waxay bixisaa 55 iyo 48. Tirintaasi qayb ahaan waa qiyaas. Qiyaastii kala badh warqadaha codbixinta ee 2023 waxa la dhiibay ka hor maalinta doorashada, Elections Alberta-na waxay u soo sheegtaa oo keliya riding kasta oo hore. Sidaa darteed waa inaan riding-yada cusub gudahooda ku dhigaa xeer. Xeer cusub, xeerka P, wuxuu dhigaa oo keliya dadka aan codeynin maalinta doorashada dhexdooda, isagoo adeegsanaya xogta Alberta oo keliya. Wuxuu bixiyaa 57 iyo 48. Isbeddelka oo dhammi waa laba kursi oo Calgary ah oo khariidadda inta yar ah, Calgary-Edgemont iyo Calgary-Glenmore, kuwaas oo UCP ku guulaysato farqi ah 401 iyo 68 cod oo la moodeelay. Kursina ma dhaqaaqo xadka janjeerka codbixiyayaasha hore ee xogta Alberta oggolaato, laakiin xadkaasi wuxuu daboolaa oo keliya janjeerka, sidaa darteed wuxuu yareeyaa hubaal la'aanta dhabta ah. Xeerka P wuxuu ku jiraa Wax-ka-beddelka 14 qabyada ah, oo aanan saxeexin. Waxa la doortay ka dib markii saamayntiisa khariidadaha la ogaaday, sidaa darteed waa sahamin, mana aha mid indha la'.`,c6_found2:`Intee ayuu “ujeedin” gaadhi karaa? Si aan u ogaanno, waxaan kaloo socodsiinnay raadin hill-climbing ah oo bartilmaameed leh — qalabka caadiga ah ee lagu sahamiyo khariidado eex leh laakiin sharci ah, kaas oo khariidad tallaabo tallaabo ugu riixa xisbi la doortay — labada jihoba, 40,000 tallaabo mid kasta, isla xaddidaadaha, isla joomatariga. 51.7%-ka khariidadda inta yar wuxuu uga dhow yahay saqafka UCP ee si ula kac ah loo beegsaday (52.9%) median-ka dhexdhexaadka ah (44.8%). 46.1%-ka khariidadda inta badan aad ayuu ugu dhow yahay median-ka dhexdhexaadka ah, boqolleyda 78aad. Agagaarka 50/50, dheellitir-la'aantu way ka sii cad tahay tirada keligeed. Baadhis sax ah ayaa ogaatay in khariidadda inta yar ay UCP ku haysato ama ka sarreysiiso xadka aqlabiyadda 45-ka kursi ilaa qiyaastii 49.2% codka labada xisbi: UCP way ku waayi kartaa qiyaastii 1.6 dhibcood oo weli dawlad samayn kartaa. Khariidadda inta badan, UCP waxay u baahan lahayd inay ku guulaysato qiyaastii 9 dhibcood si ay u gaadho isla xadkaas. Isla juquraafi, isla xeerar. Farqiga u dhexeeya labada khariidadood waa qaab-dhismeed, ma aha buuq.`,c6_show:`Sawir dhexdhexaad ahi ku dhowaad marna ma soo saaro khariidad la mid ah tan inta yar. Khariidadda inta badan waa nooca uu hab dhexdhexaad ahi soo saaro mar walba. Khariidadda inta yar waa nooca ay tahay inaad ujeeddo u leedahay si aad u sawirto.`,c6_experts:`Falanqaynta qiimaha ka baxsan ee ensemble-ka — in khariidad dhab ah lagu tijaabiyo dad badan oo khariidado dhexdhexaad ah — waa heerka ugu horumarsan ee tirakoobka dib-u-qaybinta. Waa habka ay maxkamadaha Maraykanku ku qanceen kiisaskii gobollada ee khariidado buriyay. Saddex ka mid ah afar cabbir oo horay loo diiwaangeliyay oo ku jira dabada xad-dhaafka ah, afartaba isla jihada u janjeedha: taasi waa muuqaal qiime ka baxsan oo xoog leh. Difaaca “waa juquraafiga dabiiciga ah ee Alberta oo keliya” waxa horeba looga jawaabay habka dhexdiisa, maxaa yeelay jilitaanku wuxuu ku socdaa juquraafiga dabiiciga ah ee Alberta. Faa'iidada saldhigga ah ee juquraafigaasi waxay ku egtahay halka ay fadhiyaan khariidadda 2019 iyo inta badan ee 2026: boqolleyda 78aad, iyadoo meesha ugu sarreysa ee khariidadda 2019 ay ka gaadho cabbir xisbiyeed kasta ay tahay wax yar ka sarreeya boqolleyda 90aad. Marka loo eego saldhigga dabiiciga ah ee janjeedha ee Alberta, inta yar waxay fadhidaa boqolleyda 99.99aad.`,c6_canada:`Guddi Kanadiyan ah marna kuma qasbanayn inuu khariidaddiisa ku tijaabiyo khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray oo kuwan oo kale ah. Habraaca waxaan ku qiimaynayaa heer aanu marna ku qasbanayn inuu gaadho. Taasi waa sababta natiijadu wax kuu sheegto, iyo sababta aanay cidna ku xidhin.`,c6_gun:`Waxa jira laba xad, mid sharci iyo mid tirakoob. Xadka sharciga: inta aan ogaaday, maxkamad Kanadiyan ahi weli ma miisaamin caddayn sidan oo kale ah. Maraykanka, Maxkamadda Sare waxay ku go'aamisay <em>Rucho v. Common Cause</em> (2019) in xitaa caddayn tirakoob oo xoog leh oo gerrymandering xisbiyeed aanay ahayn wax maxkamadaha federaalku ilaaliyaan. Boqolleydu waxay sharraxdaa halka khariidadi joogto. Ma aha xariiq khariidadi ka gudubto. Xadka tirakoobka: khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray riding kasta waxay ku hayaan tiro dad isku dhow iyo hal xabbo. Ma raacaan xeer kasta oo guddidu miisaamtay: ka-reebista s.15(2) ee riding-yada fog, bulshada danta wadaagta, iyo raacidda khadadka degmooyinka iyo magaalooyinka. Sidaa darteed boqolleyadu waxay cabbiraan inta khariidadi ka fog tahay khariidadahan, ma aha khariidad kasta oo guddi sharci ahi sawiri lahayd. Waxay sidoo kale leeyihiin 87 riding, ma aha 89-ka guddida. Socod sawira 89 riding, oo riding-yada s.15(2) ku haya meeshii guddidu dhigtay, weli wuxuu khariidadda inta yar dhigaa meel ka sarraysa boqolleyda 98aad saddexda cabbir ee ay cidhifka fog ku jirto. Isbarbardhiggaas isku cabbirka ahi weli waa ku-meel-gaadh. Waa hubin dibadeed oo xoog leh, ma aha mid kaamil ah. Xad kale: doorashooyinka dhabta ahi uma kala qaybsamaan 50-50. Isbeddel cod oo weyn oo ku filan ayaa ka miisaan culayn kara janjeerka khariidad kasta. Imtixaanka 50-50 wuxuu muujiyaa waxa khariidaddu keligeed ku darto, ma aha cidda guulaysan lahayd. <em>(Casharka sharciga 5: nooca caddaynta ugu fiican ee goobtan guri sharci ah kuma laha Kanada.)</em>`,c6_app:`sida mashiinka haddii-maxaa u shaqeeyo iyo sida boqolley loo akhriyo`,c7_title:`Natiijada 7 — Imtixaanka aan gaadhin`,c7_found:`Taasi waxay ka tagaysaa cabbirka caddaaladda ee afraad, farqiga waxtarka. Waa hal tiro oo muujisa inta si aan siman codadka xisbi kastaa ugu beddelmaan kursiyo. Wuxuu tiriyaa codadka khasaaray: cod kasta oo la siiyay qof guuldarraystay, iyo codadka guuleystaha ee ka badan intii uu u baahnaa. Farqi togan wuxuu doorbidaa UCP. Warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada, farqiga khariidadda inta yar waa +4.0%, boqolleyda 94.5aad. Xariiqda aan horay u dejiyay waa boqolleyda 95aad, qiyaastii +4.1% khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray dhexdooda. Sidaa darteed khariidadda inta yar ma gaadhin. Waxay u janjeertaa xagga UCP, laakiin way ka gaabatay xariiqda, shax kasta oo boggan ku jirtana sidaas ayay u muujisaa. Farqiga khariidadda inta badan waa +0.1%, boqolleyda 16.5aad.`,c7_show:`Keligeed, ku dhowaad waxba. Taasi waa sababta ay diiwaanka ugu jirto.`,c7_experts:`Kuwa ku dhawaad gaadhay waa waxa koox imtixaanno daacad ah si dabiici ah u soo saarto. Haddii imtixaan kasta oo warbixin ku jira uu digniin bixiyo, akhristuhu waa inuu ka sii shakiyaa hubiyaha intii uu ka shakin lahaa khariidadda. Kani ma gaadhin, wuxuuna sii ahaanayaa mid aan gaadhin. (Xadka Maraykanka ee loo soo jeediyay farqiga waxtarka, qiyaastii 7%, waa soo jeedin cilmiyeed oo aanay maxkamadi qaadan.)`,c7_canada:`Waxba. Ma jirto hay'ad Kanadiyan ah oo isticmaasha farqiga waxtarka gabi ahaanba.`,c7_gun:`Caddayn ahaan gabi ahaanba uma sheegto. Halkan waxay u joogtaa inay muujiso in diiwaanka si daacad ah loo tiriyay. Xariiqda oo horay loo dejiyaa labada dhinac ayay wax ka goysaa. Isla xariiqda go'an ee cabbirrada kale siisa xooggooda ayaa kan ka dhigaysa mid aan gaadhin. Mid aan gaadhinna wuu sii ahaanayaa. <em>(7 Noofembar 2026, waxaan diiwaangeliyay isbeddel u wareejiyay imtixaan kasta oo cod ku salaysan dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta ee 2023. Isbeddelkaas waxaan qoray ka dib markii aan arkay natiijooyinka dhammaan warqadaha, oo ay ku jirto tan khariidadda inta yar, sidaa darteed ma ahayn mid indha la'. Dhammaan warqadaha, xariiqdu waa +1.39%, farqiga inta yarna waa +2.55%, oo ka sarreeya. Tiradaasi waxay ku xidhan tahay sida codadka hore loogu dhigo riding kasta gudihiisa. Xeerka cusub ee P, oo aan weli la qaadan, farqigu waa +5.64%. Boqolley looma xisaabin xeerka P, xariiqda +1.39%-na way la dhaqaaqi lahayd. Natiijada warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee halkan dib looma furayo; eeg <a href="#november">khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, bogga ugu weyn</a>.)</em> <em>(Casharka caddaynta: xariiqda waxa la dejiyay ka hor intaan jawaabta la ogaan, sidaa darteed jawaabta waa loo oggol yahay inay noqoto “maya.”)</em>`,c7_refrain:`Caddayn, ma aha xaqiijin — kanna xitaa ma sheeganno.`,c7_app:`farqiga waxtarka oo lagu sharraxay hal tusaale oo xisaabsan`,c8_title:`Natiijada 8 — Hal ka mid ah 568,000, iyo waxa aanay tiradaasi ahayn`,c8_found:`Ka fikir hab khariidado lagu sawiro oo aan ujeeddo lahayn. Intee in le'eg ayay u badan tahay inuu soo saaro khariidad la mid ah tan inta yar, afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda oo hal mar ah? Inta u dhexeysa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 20,000 iyo qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 570,000, iyadoo ku xidhan sida tirada loo xisaabiyo. Tiro kastaa waa qiyaas moodel, ma aha xad, warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada. Afarta cabbir waxa lagu daraa hal dhibco ka hor inta aan suurtagalnimo la xisaabin, sidaa darteed waxa loo tiriyaa hal eegid, ma aha afar. Dhibcahaas la isku daray, 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray midna sidaas uma fog sida tan inta yar, sidaa darteed suurtagalnimada lagama tirin karo iyaga. Waxay ka timaadaa qalooc lagu habeeyay. Meesha qaloocu la hubin karo, khariidadaha fog waxay ka badan yihiin 1.2 ilaa 3 jeer inta qaloocu saadaaliyo, sidaa darteed fursadda dhabta ahi waxay u badan tahay inay ka sarrayso inta moodelku sheego. Moodelka la daabacay wuxuu bixiyaa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 570,000 (p ≈ 8.84×10⁻⁷, oo la labanlaabay ≈ 1.77×10⁻⁶). Labanlaabka waxa la dejiyay markii hubintu lahayd imtixaan labaad oo noocan ah, Swing-Zone Allocation Test (natiijada 10). Imtixaankaas tan iyo markaas waa la hawlgab dhigay, sidaa darteed labanlaabku wuxuu u taagan yahay oggolaansho taxaddar leh, ma aha saxid loogu talagalay koox imtixaanno ah oo la sheegay. Doorashooyin kale oo caddaalad ah waxay bixiyaan qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 449,000 qalooc ka taxaddar badan; 1 ka mid ah 238,000 nooc darajo ku salaysan; 1 ka mid ah 97,000 ka dib marka la tuuro mid ka mid ah laba cabbir oo ku dhowaad laba jeer tiriya isla wax; iyo 1 ka mid ah 20,000 socod labaad oo ka yar oo leh matoor sawir oo kala duwan. Dhibcaha darajada ku salaysan, 7 ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray ayaa gaadha fogaanta khariidadda inta yar. Ma jiro nooc dhammaan warqadaha ah, maxaa yeelay dhibcaha dhammaan warqadaha ee khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray kuma jiraan kaydka.`,c8_show:`Waxaad rabi doontaa in tiradani macneheedu noqdo “fursadda ay khariidaddu dambi la'aan tahay.” Waa tiradayda keliya ee ugu xoogga badan, jiidashada in sidaas loo akhriyona way xoog badan tahay.`,c8_experts:`Tiradu si fiican ayay u qeexan tahay. Waa fursadda ah in khariidad leh astaantan ay soo baxdo marka khariidado la sawiro iyadoo aan ujeeddo lahayn. Tirakoobka, isku qasidda “fursadda caddayntan haddii dambi la'aan la yahay” iyo “fursadda dambi la'aanta marka caddayntan la helo” magac ayay leedahay: khaladka xeer-ilaaliyaha (prosecutor’s fallacy). Wuxuu dad aan dambi lahayn u diray xabsi. Diiwaankani wuu diidaa beddelkaas. Inta ay khariidaddu dhif ka tahay khariidadaha aan ujeeddo lagu sawirin ma aha fursadda khalad la sameeyay. Si taas loo helo, waxaad u baahan lahayd waxyaabo aanay cidina haysan, sida inta jeer ee sawirayaal daacad ahi soo saaraan khariidado aan caadi ahayn.`,c8_canada:`Ma jiro heer sharci oo Kanadiyan ah oo isticmaala tiro sidan oo kale ah. Ma jirto xariiq ay ka gudubto, maxaa yeelay sharcigu marna ma dejin.`,c8_gun:`Khariidad intaas dhif ahi weli, mabda' ahaan, waxay ka iman kartaa garaad aan caadi ahayn laakiin daacad ah. Tiradu waxay cabbirtaa inta ay khariidaddu ka baxsan tahay sawirka dhexdhexaadka ah. Ma arki karto ujeeddada, mana iska yeelyeeli doono inay arki karto. Waxa aan sheeganayaa waa bayaanka ka daciifsan, si fiicanna waa loo taageeray: sawir xeerarka raaca oo aan marna codad eegin ku dhowaad marna ma soo saaro astaantan. Sharraxaadda, adiga ayaan kuu daayaa. <em>(Casharka sharciga iyo caddaynta: suurtagalnimada khariidad ma aha suurtagalnimada ujeeddo.)</em>`,c8_app:`khaladka xeer-ilaaliyaha oo luqad fudud ah`,c9_title:`Natiijada 9 — Waxaan isku daynay inaan ridno natiijadeenna`,c9_found:`Saddex isku day ayaan sameeyay si aan u burburiyo natiijadayda ugu weyn: meesha khariidadda inta yar kaga jirto cidhifka fog ee khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Natiijooyinku way isku dhafnaayeen, dhammaantoodna waa la soo sheegay. Marka hore, matoorka sawirka, habka sameeya khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray, waxaan ku beddelay nooc kale (spanning-forest sampler, oo OSF lagu diiwaangeliyay sida he53s oo la socodsiiyay 2026-07-10). Boqolleyda cabbir kastaa waxay dhaqaaqday wax ka yar hal dhibic. Taasi waxay buuxisaa xeerka la diiwaangeliyay ee natiijo “adag” afartaba. Laakiin socodku aad buu uga gaabtay cabbirka muunadda ee uu diiwaangeliyay, sidaa darteed waxaan u akhriyaa mid aan go'aan lahayn cabbirkan socodka, ma aha natiijo ah in natiijadu adag tahay. Cidhifka intaas u fog, jajab dhibic ah ayaa muhiim ah: matoorka cusub, khariidado ka badan toban jeer ayaa gaadha qiimaha kursiyada inta yar marka loo eego socodka ugu weyn. Sidaa darteed wuxuu muujiyaa in khariidaddu fog tahay, ma aha si sax ah inta ay le'eg tahay. Marka labaad, barnaamijka ayaan beddelay. Barnaamij madax-bannaan (xidhmada R redist) ayaa sawiray 5,000 khariidadood, midna ma gaadhin qiimaha inta yar. Socodkaas ka yar, khariidadda inta badan waxay joogtaa waxyar ka sarreysa boqolleyda 95aad; socodka ugu weyn, 78aad. Marka saddexaad, imtixaanka habka lama socodsiin karin. Waxaan qorsheeyay inaan tijaabiyo in qaababka aan caadiga ahayn (marinnada, fidinta beerta) ay yihiin waxa keena faa'iidada kursiyada. Haddii ay ahaayeen, khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray ee UCP siiya kursiyo la mid ah inta khariidadda inta yar siiso waa inay ka cufnaan yar yihiin inta kale. Laakiin 5,000-ka khariidadood midna ma gaadho qiimaha kursiyada inta yar, sidaa darteed waxba lama barbar dhigi karo. Xadka hoose ee aan markii hore isticmaalay, oo keliya 3 khariidadood ayaa u qalma, waxayna waxyar ka yihiin <em>kuwo ka cufnaan yar</em> inta kale (qiyaastii 0.227 marka loo eego 0.232 dhibco cufnaan oo caadi ah). Taasi aad bay u yar tahay si ay wax u muujiso. Labada nooc ee caddaynta waxay tilmaamayaan isla khariidadda, isla jihadana way u janjeeraan. In qaababku sababta yihiin lama tijaabin.`,c9_show:`Natiijada fog waxa iska leh khariidadda, ma aha qalabkayga.`,c9_experts:`Adkaysiga muunad-qaadayaasha iyo hirgelinnada kala duwan ayaa kala saara natiijo iyo wax farsamo ka dhashay. Soo sheegidda waxa aadan tijaabin karin ayaa kala saara hubin iyo u-doodid.`,c9_canada:`Cidna ma dalbato waxyaabahan midkood. Annaga ayaa nafteenna ku soo rogay, qoraal ahaan, ka hor intaanan socodsiin.`,c9_gun:`In la meesha ka saaro khalad qalabka ma aha in la caddeeyo naqshad. Beddelka matoorka iyo barnaamijku ma helin calaamad muujinaysa in meesha fog ee khariidaddu ka timid qalabka, inkastoo socodka matoorku aad u yaraa si uu go'aan u noqdo. Waxba kama sheegaan sababta khariidaddu sidaas u tahay. <em>(Casharka caddaynta: hubinnada noocan ahi waxay xoojiyaan sharraxaadda, marna eedeynta.)</em>`,c9_app:`waxa muunad-qaaduhu yahay iyo sababta beddelkiisu muhiim u yahay`,c10_title:`Natiijada 10 — Calaamadaha jihada kale tilmaamay`,c10_found:`Saddex qodob oo diiwaanka ku jira ma caawiyaan kiiskayga. Saddexdaba waa la soo sheegay. Mid ayay inta yar gudubtay. Imtixaanka miirida deriska wuxuu raadiyaa qaab caadi ah: riding-yo la cufay oo si toos ah u ag fadhiya riding-yo lagu guulaystay farqi khafiif ah. Khariidadda inta yar waxay muujisaa 1 calaamad oo isku xidhan oo noocaas ah, marka loo eego 2 khariidadda inta badan iyo 5 khariidadda 2019. Taasi waa gudbid, waana mid ka mid ah imtixaannada yar ee inta yar ay tirooyinka kaga fiicnaato inta badan. Imtixaanka waxaan qeexay 24 Abriil waxaana OSF ku diiwaangeliyay 6 Maajo, ka dib gudbid ku-meel-gaadh ah oo lagu sameeyay xudduudo qiyaas ah, sidaa darteed waxa loo tiriyaa mid goor dambe lagu daray. Gudbiddu waa dhab laakiin way daciif tahay: iyadoo calaamadaha riding-yada si bakhtiyaanasiib ah la isugu qasay, natiijadii oo kale waxay soo baxdaa qiyaastii 91% waqtiga. Saadaasha labaad ee imtixaanka, in labada khariidadood ay u ekaan doonaan kuwo caadi ah, way ku dhacday: saddexda khariidadoodba dhibco aan caadi ahayn oo hoose ayay keenaan. Gudbiddu waxay u taagan tahay gudbid. Laba waan hawlgab dhigay. Swing-Zone Allocation Test wuxuu weydiiyay in aagagga codbixinta ee aagagga isbeddelka loo qoondeeyay riding-yo qaab xisbiyeed. Wuxuu u muuqday mid muhiim ah (p = 0.0024) ilaa aan saxay saldhigiisa urursanaanta. Aagagga codbixinta ee is-ag yaal si isku mid ah ayay u codeeyaan, taas oo jebisa malaynta imtixaanka ah in aag kastaa madax-bannaan yahay. Saxitaanka ka dib wuxuu bixiyaa p ≈ 0.19, ma aha muhiim. 2026-06-13 waxaan u wareejiyay liiska sahaminta, halkaas oo aanu mar dambe u tirsanayn imtixaan horay loo dejiyay. Ka kale waa habka Fisher ee imtixaankaas lagu daro kan ugu weyn. Wuxuu u qaataa in labadu madax-bannaan yihiin, mana aha, sidaa darteed ma isticmaalo.`,c10_show:`Sidii markii hore loo xisaabiyay, imtixaannada la hawlgab dhigay waxay tilmaamayeen in doorashooyinka khadadka gaarka ah, ma aha oo keliya khariidadda guud ahaan, ay hal xisbi u janjeereen. Saxitaanka ka dib, waxba ma tilmaamaan.`,c10_experts:`Is-xidhiidhka meeleed (spatial autocorrelation) — dariska oo darisku u eg yahay — waa habka caadiga ah ee tirakoobka dib-u-qaybintu ugu khiyaameeyo kuwa sameeyay, saxiddiisuna waa habka oo u shaqaynaya sidii loogu talagalay. Gudbis imtixaanka drain-ka ah oo ay la socdaan natiijooyin dabada ah meelo kale ma aha is-burin. Waa faro-raad: wuxuu kuu sheegaa farsamada aanay khariidaddani isticmaalin.`,c10_canada:`Ma khuseyso. Kuwani waa qalabkeenna.`,c10_gun:`Laba ka mid ahi waxay ahaayeen qalabkayga oo fashilmay, ma aha khariidadda. Ka saddexaad wuxuu tilmaamaa khariidadda xaggeeda. Saddexdaba waxay ku jiraan diiwaanka, maxaa yeelay diiwaan haya oo keliya qodobada ku habboon ma aha diiwaan. <em>(Casharka caddaynta, oo boggan laba jeer si ula kac ah loogu sheegay: jawaabta “halkan waxba ma jiraan” way guulaysan kartaa.)</em>`,c10_refrain:`Laba hawlgab ah, hal gudbis dhinaca kale. Si kastaba waan diiwaangelinnay.`,c10_app:`sababta dariska isku si u codeeyaa u jebiyo tirakoobka fudud`,act3_h:`Fasalka III: Waxa Dadku Sameeyeen`,act3_intro:`Fasallada I iyo II waxay cabbireen warqad. Fasalka III wuxuu akhriyaa dhaqanka: waxa dadka habraaca ku dhex jiray iyo kuwa ku xeernaa qoreen, sheegteen oo doorteen. Maxkamad dhexdeed, dhaqanku badanaa waa halka su'aalaha ujeeddada looga jawaabo. Daawo waxa halkan ku dhaca.`,c11_title:`Natiijada 11 — Lix sababood, la hubiyay`,c11_found:`Khadadka waa la cabbiri karaa. Sidoo kale sababaha dadku u bixiyaan. Guddi-xubnaha inta yar waxay daabaceen sababaha khadadkooda lagu murmay. Lix ayaan hubiyay, tiriskuna wuxuu ku xidhan yahay xeerka. Haddii la tiriyo oo keliya sababaha inta yar dhab ahaan sheegtay, midna lagama hor iman, afarna qayb ahaan oo keliya ayaa la taageeray. Haddii la tiriyo xisaabtayda ku saabsan in dadku xariiqda qasbay, afar ka mid ah khadadka lama qasbin. Inta yar ma sheegan inay ahaayeen. Ujeeddadu ma aha in inta yar ay sababaheeda been abuurtay. Inta badan xaaladahan sheegashada guud waa run, xariiq ixtiraamaysana waa la sawiri kari lahaa. Waxa xogtu gaadhi waydo waa xariiqda gaarka ah ee inta yar sawirtay. Qaado Calgary-Nolan Hill-Cochrane. Inta yar waxay ku difaacdaa fikradda ah in dadka Cochrane ay “si fudud ugu dhex socdaan” Calgary. Xogta socdaalka shaqada ee 2021 ee Statistics Canada waxay muujisaa in qiyaastii 71% dadka Cochrane ee magaalada dibadda uga shaqo taga ay meel Calgary ah ka shaqeeyaan. Taasi waa saddex meelood meel dhammaan shaqaalaheeda. Qiyaastii kala badh shaqaalaheedu waxay joogaan Cochrane. Taasi waa xidhiidh dhab ah oo u dhexeeya laba meelood, laakiin waxba kama sheegayso Nolan Hill, xaafadda Calgary ee marinku gaadho. Socdaalka Airdrie ee Calgary (qiyaastii 76% kuwa dibadda u socdaala) iyo koritaankeeda degdega ahi labaduba waa dhab. Waxay taageeri kari lahaayeen kursi cusub oo aagga Airdrie ah. Midkoodna uma baahna in magaalada afar loo kala qaybiyo. Chestermere waxay 86% dadkeeda dibadda u socdaala u dirtaa Calgary. Waxay Calgary la wadaagtaa qaybta dugsiyada Katooliga, laakiin ma aha mid dadweyne, mana aha nidaam gaadiid dadweyne oo la wadaagto riding-ka Calgary ee inta yar qayb ka mid ah geliso. Isku-lammaanaynta Red Deer iyo Sylvan Lake qayb ahaan way adkaysataa. 54% dadka Sylvan Lake ee dibadda u socdaala waxay ka shaqeeyaan Red Deer, hal qayb dugsiyo Katooliga ahna labadaba way u adeegtaa, inkastoo qaybahooda dadweynuhu kala duwan yihiin.`,c11_note:`Waxa lagu hubiyay oo keliya inta yar, maxaa yeelay inta yar waa khariidadda dib-u-sawiridaheeda lagu murmay ay dadweyne yihiin. Inta badan ma daabicin liis sababo ah oo dib-u-sawiridaha lagu murmay, sidaa darteed hubinta laguma dabaqi karo labada dhinac si isku mid ah; waxa loo soo sheegay sidii calaamad keliya.`,c11_show:`Sababaha ku dhaca hubin waxay u eg yihiin sababo la helay ka dib markii xariiqda la sawiray, ma aha ka hor. Meesha xisaabtaydu muujiso in xariiq aan la qasbin, dadku waxay tilmaameen xariiq inta yar sawiri kari lahayd. Xariiqda ay sawirtay waa mid kale.`,c11_experts:`In sabab la sheegay la dhinac dhigo waxa caddayntu taageerto waa falanqaynta cudurdaarka, imtixaan lagu ogaado in sababtu daboolid tahay. Si sax ah ayay sidaas u tahay sida maxkamadaha Maraykanku u baadhaan ujeeddada kiisaska gerrymandering ee ay dhageystaan. Sababaha ku dhaca xogta dadweynaha waa calaamadda caadiga ah.`,c11_canada:`Guddiyadu waxay daabacaan sababo si dadweynuhu u miisaamo. Sababaha aan gaadhin xariiqda dhab ahaan la sawiray waxay dadweynaha ka dhigaan kuwo aan miisaami karin xariiqdaas.`,c11_gun:`Ma jiro sharci Kanadiyan ah oo u baahan in sababaha guddi-xubintu ay gudbaan hubin dibadeed, sabab ku dhacdayna waxay si la mid ah ugu habboon tahay daryeel la'aan iyo sheeko qarin. Maxkamadaha dib u eega xudduudaha waxay weydiiyaan in natiijadu diiddo matalaad waxtar leh, ma aha in sababaha diiwaanka ku jira ay nidaamsanaayeen. <em>(Casharka sharciga 6: sababo xun oo loo bixiyo xariiq sharci ah weli waa xariiq sharci ah.)</em>`,c11_app:`sida sabab la sheegay loogu hubiyo xogta dadweynaha`,c12_title:`Natiijada 12 — Guddida aan saxeexi karin hal khariidad`,c12_found:`Guddidu way kala qaybsantay. Waxay gudbisay laba warbixinood oo kama dambays ah iyo laba khariidadood oo 89-kursi ah oo kala duwan isla maalintaas. Inta badan ee saddexda ahi waxay ku jireen guddoomiyaha. Inta yar ee labada ahi, xubnaha ay dawladdu soo jeedisay (<a href="https://www.assembly.ab.ca/about/news-and-announcements/2025/03/28/electoral-boundaries-commission-to-soon-begin-consultations" rel="noopener">Legislative Assembly of Alberta, 28 Maarso 2025</a>; <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/evidence/legislature/assembly_news_ebc_appointed_2025-03-28.html" rel="noopener">nuqul kayd ah</a>), waxay sawireen khariidadda ay natiijooyinkii hore sharxayaan. Hubinnadaydu labada dhinac ayay wax ka goyaan kala qaybsanaantaas. Warbixinta inta badan waxay sheegtay in isbeddellada inta yar ee shan meelood aanay taageero dadweyne ku lahayn 1,345-ka gudbin (warbixinta kama dambaysta, bb. 59 iyo 62). Shanta waa Airdrie, Cochrane, Chestermere, Red Deer iyo St. Albert. Si loo hubiyo, diiwaan kasta oo dadweyne oo la dhigay si buuxda ayaa loo akhriyay: 1,339 gudbin qoraal ah iyo 349 bandhig dhegaysi, 1,688 guud ahaan. Akhristayaashu waxay ahaayeen wakiillo AI ah oo ka shaqaynayay hagitaankayga. Tirintu waa diiwaanno, ma aha dad: warqad olole oo 20 jeer la diray waxa loo tiriyaa 20 jeer. Dadku waxay wax qoreen ka hor intaan labada khariidadood ee kama dambaysta ah midkoodna jirin, sidaa darteed is-waafaq macnaheedu waa in codsi la mid yahay waxa khariidadi sameyso, ma aha in qof taageeray khariidaddaas. Inta badan way saxan tahay Cochrane iyo St. Albert: diiwaan ma codsado waxa inta yar halkaas ku sawirtay. Way khaldan tahay hal ilaa saddex diiwaan saddexda meelood ee kale. Airdrie, 1 diiwaan ayaa codsada waxa oo keliya inta yar sawirtay, marka loo eego 10 waxa oo keliya inta badan sawirtay. Red Deer waa 1 marka loo eego 20, Chestermere-na 3 marka loo eego 6. Sidaa darteed sheegashadu way dhow dahay, laakiin ma aha mid sax ah, saddex ka mid ah shan meelood. Taasi waxay ka hor imanaysaa inta badan, ma aha inta yar, waana sababta ay diiwaankan ugu jirto. Dhaleeceeyntu sidoo kale dhinaca kale ayay u socotay, diiwaankuna taas wuu hayaa. Warbixinta inta yar waxay inta badan ku eedaysaa “janjeer ah in la tirtiro ama la burburiyo qaybaha doorashada miyiga, oo dhab ahaan la yareeyo matalaadda waxtarka leh ee miyiga” (warbixinta inta yar, b. 356). Imtixaankayga keliya ee illaa hadda loogu talagalay khariidadda inta badan wuxuu weydiiyay in riding-yadeeda miyigu yihiin marinno loo dhisay in lagu go'doomiyo codbixiyayaasha miyiga. Wuxuu soo noqday isagoo taageeraya sharraxaadda juquraafiga ah ee dambi la'aanta (goor dambe lagu daray; naqshadda iyo xadkeeda waa la daabacay). Kadib, isla maalintii eeddu soo baxday, waxaan tiriyay riding-yada miyiga laftooda (goor dambe lagu daray; mala-awaallada waxa lagu go'aamiyay qoraalka ka hor intaanu socon, magac kasta oo uu kala saarayna waa la daabacay). Tirintu way rogtaa eedda. Khariidadda 2019 waxay leedahay 31 riding oo miyi ku salaysan. Khariidadda inta badan waxay leedahay 28: saddex ayay ku dartaa riding-yo magaalo magacooda leh, lix ayay ku midaysaa saddex, saddex cusubna way ku dartaa. Khariidadda inta yar waxay leedahay 23: toddoba ayay ku dartaa, labana hal ayay ku midaysaa. Nooc ka adag oo kala-saarka ah ayaa bixiya isla kala horraynta. Labada khariidadoodba waxay yareeyaan matalaadda miyiga marka loo eego 2019, taasina waa xudunta runta ah ee eedda. Laakiin cabbirka ay eeddu laftigeedu magacawdo, khariidadda inta yar ayaa samaysa wax ka badan waxa ay inta badan ku eedayso. Isla boggu wuxuu sameeyaa eedeyn labaad oo la cabbiri karo: in inta badani diiday inay adeegsato dabacsanaanta 25% ee Sharciga ee miyiga Alberta. Inta yar waxay dabacsanaantaas ugu yeedhaa “ma aha oggolaansho aan waxyeello lahayn oo loogu talagalay khaladaadka sawirka khariidadda” ee waa “tilmaan ula kac ah”. Eeddaasi way adkaysataa. Riding-yada miyiga ee inta badan celcelis ahaan waxay 6% ka hooseeyaan celceliska gobolka, oo keliya afar ayaa ka hooseeya in ka badan 10%. Kuwa inta yar celcelis ahaan waxay ka hooseeyaan 12%, kow iyo tobanna waxay ka hooseeyaan in ka badan 10%. Marka la wada eego, labada eedood waxay sharxayaan laba hab oo khariidad loo naqshadeeyo, ma aha hal khalad: riding-yo miyi ah oo badan laakiin buuxa khariidadda inta badan, kuwo yar laakiin yaryar khariidadda inta yar. Labada jiho ee hubin kastaa waxay ku jiraan diiwaanka.`,c12_show:`Habraac loo dhisay in lagu gaadho heshiis ayaa soo saaray laba jawaab, khariidadda fogna waxay ka timid xubnaha ay dawladdu soo jeedisay.`,c12_experts:`Cidda cidda magacawday waa caddayn caadi ah oo ku jirta falanqaynta qabsashada hay'adaha. Miisaan ayay leedahay oo keliya marka qalabka labada dhinac si isku mid ah loogu dabaqo, taasina waa sababta saxitaankeenna inta badan uu ugu muhiimsan yahay sida natiijooyinkeenna ka dhanka ah inta yar.`,c12_canada:`Hal khariidad guddi kasta waa caadada, xitaa marka xubini diido. Sharcigu wuu u qorsheeyaa kala qaybsanaan, laakiin oo keliya si uu u sheego warbixinta la tiriyo: marka ay ka badan yihiin mid, tan inta badan ayaa ah warbixinta guddida (s.9). Waxba kama sheego kala qaybsanaan intan le'eg, iyadoo inta badani asxaabteeda ku eedaynayso niyad xun warbixinta laftigeeda.`,c12_gun:`In la soo jeediyo ma aha in la amro. Ma helin caddayn isku-dubbarid oo u dhexeysa dawladda iyo xubnaha ay soo jeedisay, midna lagama soo saari karo magacaabista oo keliya. Guddi-xubnaha, cid kasta oo magacawday, horay ayay jidkooda u maray. <em>(Casharka caddaynta: cidda qof magacawday waxay kicisaa su'aasha; kama jawaabi karto.)</em>`,c12_app:`sida xubnaha guddida loo magacaabo iyo waxa soo jeedintu tilmaanto iyo waxa aanay tilmaamin`,ledger_h:`Labada dhinacba, oo la tijaabiyay — diiwaanka eedeymaha`,ledger_intro:`Eedeyn kasta oo dhinac kastaa qoraal ku dhigay, oo la mariyay isla imtixaannada, natiijo kastaana waxa lagu soo sheegay halka ay ku dhacday. Diiwaankani ma aha kaar dhibco. Waxba oo ku jira isku lama daro: safafka qaarkood waxay ku dhacaan inta yar, qaarna inta badan. Dhibcaha keliya ee warbixintan ku jira waa shanta imtixaan ee xidhan ee kor ku xusan. Hubinnadan midna looma dejin waqti hore sida shantaas, sidaa darteed miisaankoodu wuu ka yar yahay. Tiro iyo magac kasta oo ka dambeeya waa dadweyne.`,ledger_col_a:`Eedeynta`,ledger_col_b:`Cidda sameysay`,ledger_col_c:`Halka ay ku dhacday`,ledger_r1_a:`Saddex ka mid ah xudduudaha inta yar waa kuwo joomatari ahaan aan caadi ahayn`,ledger_r1_b:`Inta badan (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, b. 62–63)`,ledger_r1_c:`Inta badan waa la xaqiijiyay — imtixaannada indha-la'aanta ah ee hubintu waxay si madax-bannaan u xaqiijiyeen saddex ka mid ah afarta calaamadood ee joomatariga ee inta badan; kan afraad wuxuu ka hooseeyay xadka`,ledger_r2_a:`Isbeddellada inta yar ee shan meelood “ma lahayn taageero dadweyne”`,ledger_r2_b:`Inta badan (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, bb. 59, 62)`,ledger_r2_c:`Aad u ballaadhan — sax saddex ka mid ah shan, khalad mid, qayb ahaan khalad mid`,ledger_r3_a:`Fidinta beerta waxay ahayd “isku day niyad xun” oo lagu sheeganayo ilaalinta s.15(2)`,ledger_r3_b:`Inta badan (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, b. 10)`,ledger_r3_c:`Waa la wiiqay — qaybtu waxay u qalantaa s.15(2) xitaa iyadoon fidinta la calaamadeeyay jirin`,ledger_r4_a:`Inta badan “waxay tirtirtaa ama burburisaa qaybaha doorashada miyiga”`,ledger_r4_b:`Inta yar (b. 356)`,ledger_r4_c:`Waa lid — inta yar ayaa haysa qaybo ka yar oo miyi ku xajisan (23 iyo 28, marka loo eego 31-kii 2019) waxayna ku dartaa qaar ka badan degmooyin magaalo magacooda wata (7 iyo 3)`,ledger_r5_a:`Inta badan “way diidday inay isticmaasho” dabacsanaanta ±25% ee Alberta miyiga`,ledger_r5_b:`Inta yar (b. 356)`,ledger_r5_c:`Waa la taageeray — qaybaha miyiga ee inta badan celcelis ahaan leexashadoodu waa −6.0% (4 ka hooseeya −10%); kuwa inta yar celcelis ahaan −12.2% (11 ka hooseeya −10%)`,ledger_r6_a:`“Markhaati badan oo joogto ah” oo loogu talagalay degmooyinka isku-dhafka ah waa la iska indha tiray`,ledger_r6_b:`Inta yar (b. 356)`,ledger_r6_c:`Aad u ballaadhan — taageeradu waxay ku xidhnayd qaab gaar ah: waxa lagu diiwaangeliyay saddex ka mid ah toddoba qaab oo isku-dhafan, waana ka maqnayd saddex`,ledger_r7_a:`Degmooyinka miyiga ee inta badan waa marinno go'doomin oo si ula kac ah loo qorsheeyay`,ledger_r7_b:`Mala-awaalka lidka ah ee hubinta laftigeeda (T3.2)`,ledger_r7_c:`Lama taageerin — sharraxaadda juquraafigu way adkaysatay; inta badan way ka gudubtay`,ledger_close:`Midkoodna eedeymihiisu si dhammaystiran uma badbaadin, midkoodna khariidaddiisu kama baxsan dhaawac. Golaha sharci-dejinta dhexdiisa, cidna gabi ahaanba ma dhaleecaynin warbixinta inta badan. Dawladdu mooshinkeeda waxay ku duudduubtay talada guddoomiyaha inta badan laftiisa; mucaaradku wuxuu dalbaday in warbixinta la qaato. Eedeymaha qoran ee ka dhanka ah inta badan waxay ku jiraan oo keliya bogagga inta yar laftigeeda. Taasi waa sababta ay nagu khasabtay inaan annagu tijaabinno.`,c13_title:`Natiijada 13 — Markii habraacu jawaabi lahaa, waa la beddelay`,c13_found:`Guddidu waxay dhegaysiyo ku qabatay lix iyo toban bulshadood waxayna heshay 1,345 gudbin qoraal ah. Ka dib qaar badan oo ka mid ah (warbixinta inta yar waxay tirisaa ugu yaraan 56), waxay ka tagtay qorshaheedii ahaa in la meesha ka saaro Lesser Slave Lake. Taasi waa nidaam si muuqata ugu jawaabaya dadweynaha. Afar toddobaad ka dib markii warbixinnadeeda kala qaybsan yimaadeen, nidaamkaas waa la beddelay. Mooshinka Dawladda 37 ayaa labada warbixinoodba dhinac iska dhigay. Ogeysiis ayaa la bixiyay 16 Abriil, waxaana la soo jeediyay, laga dooday oo la ansixiyay 21 Abriil 2026. Wuxuu abuuray guddiga: Guddiga Gaarka ah ee Xudduudaha Doorashada, lix MLA, afar UCP iyo laba NDP, oo uu guddoominayo MLA-ga UCP Brandon Lunty (<a href="https://www.assembly.ab.ca/assembly-business/committees/ceb" rel="noopener">bogga guddiga</a>). Guddigu wuxuu ahaa inuu kormeero khariidad 91-kursi ah oo u diro Golaha ka hor 2 Noofembar 2026. Laguma qasbin inuu qabto dhegaysiyo dadweyne. Sida <a href="https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/edmonton/alberta-boundaries-committee-motion-9.7172743" rel="noopener">CBC u sheegtay</a> inuu yeeli doono, midna kama qabanin khariidadda, qabyona lama soo saarin si dadweynuhu uga hor yimaado. Khariidadda waxa sawirtay guddida talo-bixinta, Guddida Madax-bannaan ee Talo-bixinta, <a href="https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/edmonton/alberta-boundaries-panel-legislative-committee-elections-9.7187435" rel="noopener">oo uu guddoominayo garsoorihii hawlgabka ahaa ee Maxkamadda Rafcaanka Brian O’Ferrall</a> (oo lagu magacaabay soo jeedinta Ra'iisul Wasaaraha; warbixinta guddiga, b. 9). Guddida talo-bixintu waxay warbixinteeda keentay 22 Oktoobar, iyaduna way kala qaybsantay. 28 Oktoobar guddigu wuxuu u codeeyay 3 iyo 2 inuu dib-u-eegistiisa joojiyo isagoon ku darin faallo isaga u gaar ah. Golaha ayaa go'aamiya in khariidaddu sharci noqoto. Golaha dhexdiisa, dawladdu wareejinta waxay u soo bandhigtay mid daacad u ah guddida: “Waxaan qaadanaynaa talooyinka warbixinta” (Hoggaamiyaha Golaha ee Dawladda, Hansard, 16 Abriil 2026). Mucaaradku isla mooshinkaas wuxuu ugu yeedhay “warbixinta inta yar oo si tartiib ah loo socodsiinayo.” Marka la barbar dhigo warbixinta inta badan laftigeeda, sheegashada daacadnimadu way cidhiidhi tahay. Inta badani waxay tidhi laba kursi oo dheeraad ahi waxay bixin lahaayeen matalaad waxtar badan (b. 58), Talada 5 laftigeeduna waxay ku baaqaysaa guddi gaar ah oo xisbiyada oo dhan ka kooban (b. 66). Laakiin inta badani waxay Golaha Sharci-dejinta ka codsatay inuu qaato khariidaddeeda 89-kursi ah. Xalkeeda tirada kursiyada waxa loogu talagalay guddiyada mustaqbalka. Talada keliya ee soo jeedisay 91 kursi wareeggan waxay ahayd tan guddoomiyaha oo keliya: “Asxaabtayda inta badan igama oggola qodobkan.”`,c13_show:`Markii waddada madax-bannaani aanay keenin jawaab la isticmaali karo, dawladdu qalinka ayay qaadatay. Waddada ay doorataynna waxay meesha ka saartay hab kasta oo dadweynuhu kaga hor iman karo waxa ay qorto ka hor intaanu sharci noqon.`,c13_experts:`Naqshaddu waxay ka tanaasushaa laba astaamood oo cilmi-baadhista dib-u-qaybinta degmooyinku u aragto kuwo ilaalin ah: qabyooyin la daabacay iyo dhegaysiyo dadweyne. Guddideeda talo-bixintu waxay u dhisan tahay sida guddida, laba xubnood oo dhinac kasta laga soo jeediyay iyo garsoore hawlgab ah oo guddoomiye ah (oo lagu magacaabay soo jeedinta Ra'iisul Wasaaraha). Laakiin guddi ay dawladdu inta badan ku leedahay ayaa kormeera, MLA-yaduna natiijada waxay u diraan Golaha. Kormeerayaasha xorriyaadka madaniga ah (<a href="https://ccla.org/press-release/ccla-sounds-the-alarm-over-the-politicization-of-albertas-electoral-map/" rel="noopener">CCLA</a>) ayaa kiciyay walaaca ah in siyaasaddu soo galayso habraaca, si ka madax-bannaan hubintan.`,c13_canada:`Tani waa caadada ugu qoto dheer ee dib-u-qaybinta degmooyinka Kanada ee casriga ah: siyaasiyiintu ma sawiraan riding-yadooda. Markii ugu dambaysay ee MLA-yadu sawireen khariidadda Alberta, 1992, maxkamaduhu way u oggolaadeen inay sii jirto, 1995-na Sharciga waa la beddelay si loo beddelo sida guddiyada loo magacaabo (natiijada 14; sheekada buuxda waxay ku jirtaa bogga sharciga). Imtixaannadayda khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta (bogga ugu weyn) waxay habraaca guddiga ku cabbiraan si sax ah astaamaha aan lagu waajibin inuu bixiyo.`,c13_gun:`Sida aan Sharciga u akhriyo, waxba kuma jiraan oo mamnuucaya tallaabooyinkan midkood, maxkamadna go'aan kama gaadhin. Sharcigu warbixinnada guddida wuxuu ka dhigaa talo oo keliya. Ma dejiyo waqti ugu yar oo ogeysiis ama faallo ah, uma baahna dhegaysiyo iyo qabyo waxa xiga. Akhriskayga, awoodda Golaha Sharci-dejinta ee ah inuu u sameeyo sharci sida uu u arko (madax-bannaanida baarlamaanka) waxay u oggolaanaysaa inuu sameeyo wixii uu sameeyay. <em>(Casharka sharciga 7: habraacii abuuri lahaa xisaabtan waa ikhtiyaari, akhriskayguna, ka-bixiddu waa sharci.)</em>`,c13_app:`habraaca Sharciga laga bilaabo guddida ilaa guddiga, bilow ilaa dhammaad`,c14_title:`Natiijada 14 — Caadadii lixdanka sano, oo galab keliya dhinac la iska dhigay`,c14_found:`Kanadu waxay ku bixisay qiyaastii lixdan sano dhisidda guddiyo xudduudeed oo madax-bannaan. Tan iyo dib-u-habaynta federaalka ee 1960-yadii, waxay ahaayeen jawaabta caado hore: xisbiyada xukunka haya oo sawira riding-yadooda. Maajo, Duane Bratt, Borofisar Cilmiga Siyaasadda ee Mount Royal University, ayaa habraacan iigu sharxay, wada-xidhiidh gaar ah, mid aan taariikh hore ku lahayn Kanada. Markii dambe waxaan helay guddigii Alberta ee 1992. Kala-saarka soo socda waa mid aan anigu leeyahay, ma aha Borofisar Bratt. Alberta mar hore ayay khariidad u dhiibtay MLA-yo, 1992, laakiin guddidaas way xayirantay: shan guddi-xubnood, shan warbixinood, inta badan ma jirin. 2026 guddidu kuma xayirmin. Inta badan ayaa saxeexday warbixin, taas oo Sharcigu u arko warbixinta guddida, haddana dhinac ayaa la iska dhigay. Quebec, khariidadda guddi waxay dhaqan gashaa iyadoo aan loo baahnayn oggolaanshaha kama dambaysta ah ee Golaha Qaranka. Alberta, sida gobollada intooda badan, waxay u baahan tahay hindise sharci (<em>Lalande</em>, diidmada, faqradda 31).`,c14_show:`Mucaaradku tallaabada wuxuu Golaha ugu magacaabay: “aargoosi ka dhan ah [Guddida Xudduudaha] Doorashada ee madax-bannaan.” Waxyeelladu ma aha hal khariidad. Waa caddaynta go'an ee ah in ilaalintu ahayd caado, dhaqan ee aanay ahayn sharci. Caadooyinku waxay xidhaan oo keliya dawladaha oggol inay ku xidhnaadaan. Waxba ma joojinayaan dawladda xigta, xisbi kasta ha ahaatee, inay wareeggan u soo qaadato tusaale hore.`,c14_experts:`Cilmi-baadhista is barbar dhigta maamullada waxay guddiyada madax-bannaan u aragtaa astaanta hay'adeed ee keliya ee ugu ilaalinta badan ee ka dhanka ah gerrymandering. Meesha ka saaridda hay'adda ayaa ka muhiimsan xudduud kasta oo ay sawiri lahayd.`,c14_canada:`Habraaca federaalka iyo gobolladu waxay adeegsadaan guddiyo ka fog siyaasiyiinta, iyadoo ay jiraan ka-reebisyo: Alberta 1992, iyo Quebec. Golaha Qaranka ee Quebec wuxuu ansixiyay khariidaddiisa 127-kursi ah Juun 2026, ka dib markii Maxkamadda Sare ay buriisay hakintiisii guddida. Wareegga 2026 ee Alberta wuxuu ka tagay heerkaas cod inta badan fudud ah.`,c14_gun:`Caadooyinka dastuuriga ahi siyaasad ahaan way xidhaan, laakiin maxkamaduhu ma dhaqan geliyaan. Maxkamadda Sare ayaa sidaas ku sheegtay Patriation Reference ee 1981. Taasi habraaca kama dhigto mid ka baxsan gaadhka maxkamadaha. 2017 Maxkamadda Rafcaanka ee Nova Scotia waxay ogaatay in khariidad ahayd mid aan dastuuri ahayn maxaa yeelay dawladdu waxay cabudhisay aragtida madax-bannaan ee guddideeda. 2026 Maxkamadda Sare waxay buriisay sharciga Quebec ee hakiyay guddideeda (<em>Quebec (AG) v. Lalande</em>, 2026 SCC 13). Waxa maxkamaddu dib u eegto waa khariidadda marka ay sharci noqoto, qodobka 3 ee Charter-ka. <em>(Casharka sharciga 8: caadooyinku ma aha sharci, laakiin sida khariidad loo sameeyo weli way muhiim noqon kartaa maxkamadda.)</em>`,c14_app:`caadooyinka iyo sharciga, iyo sida caadooyinku u nabaad-guuraan`,c15_title:`Natiijada 15 — Sababaha guddida talo-bixinta, oo lagu hubiyay khariidaddeeda`,c15_note:`<em>Khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta weli looma soo saarin fayl khariidadeed oo rasmi ah. Meesha natiijadani adeegsato khadadka khariidadda, waxay adeegsataa dib-u-dhiskayga: khadadka laga dib u dhisay warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta. Qaybahaasi waa ku-meel-gaadh. Tirooyinka dadka iyo xigashooyinku waa kuwa guddida talo-bixinta laftigeeda.</em>`,c15_found:`Guddida talo-bixintu waxay daabacday sababaha isbeddelladeeda ee khariidadda inta badan ee guddida. Sababahaas waxaan u hubiyay sidii natiijada 11 u hubisay kuwa inta yar ee guddida. Guddida talo-bixintu sabab kasta ma u dabaqdaa si isku mid ah meelaha isu eg? Tirooyinkeeda laftigeedu ma taageeraan? Meesha isbeddel aanu kursi dhaqaajin, sababuhu inta badan way adkaystaan. Calgary-West-Springbank dhab ahaan waa “qaabka geeso-badan ee aad u nidaamsan” ee guddida talo-bixintu ballanqaadday. Laakiin labada isbeddel ee kursi dhaqaajiya warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada, Lethbridge iyo Banff, sababaha aan hubin karay ma adkaystaan. (Tirinta la diiwaangeliyay ee dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, oo keliya isbeddelka Banff ayaa kursi dhaqaajiya. Tirintaasi waxay ku xidhan tahay sida codadka hore loo dhigo. Xeerka cusub ee P, oo aan weli la qaadan, kursina ma dhaqaaqo dhammaan warqadaha; eeg <a href="#november">khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, bogga ugu weyn</a>.)`,c15_p1:`<strong>Lethbridge, “dad dheeraad ah.”</strong> Sababta ugu weyn ee guddida talo-bixintu u bixiso isbeddelladeeda koonfurta waa “matalaad gobol oo ka wanaagsan oo dadka koonfurta Alberta ah”. Magaalooyinka ku wareegsan Lethbridge aad bay ugu yar yihiin riding-yo iyaga u gaar ah, ayay tidhi, halka “Lethbridge horeba dad dheeraad ah ay leedahay.” Guddida talo-bixinta laftigeedu waxay isku lammaanaysaa laba magaalo. Oo keliya laba magaalo oo Alberta ah ayaan lahayn riding gaadha xadkooda wixii ka dambeeya, ayay xustay, “Labadaas magaalo waa Lethbridge iyo Red Deer.” Qiyaasaha 2024 ee gobolka, Red Deer waxay leedahay 113,145 qof, Lethbridge-na 111,776. Mid kastaa waxay boos u leedahay qiyaastii laba riding, Red Deer waxyar ka badan. Guddida talo-bixintu waxay u wareejisaa oo keliya cidhif yar oo Red Deer ah riding miyi ah: qiyaastii 1,300 qof oo loo wareejiyay Blackfalds-Innisfail. Inta kale ee magaalada waxay ku haysaa laba riding oo magaalo ah. Lethbridge waxay u kala qaybisaa afar riding: hal riding magaalo ah iyo saddex isku dara codbixiyayaal magaalo iyo miyi.`,c15_p2:`<strong>Lethbridge, imtixaanka guddida talo-bixinta laftigeeda.</strong> Guddida talo-bixintu waxay sheegtaa in riding isku-dhaf ah oo magaalo iyo miyi ah uu xaq yahay haddii uu “ka tarjumayo bulsho danta wadaagta dhab ah ama loo baahan yahay si loo gaadho u hoggaansanaanta dadka.” Dadku uma baahnayn. Khariidadda guddida waxay buuxisay xadka sharciga ee koonfurta iyadoo aan codbixiyayaasha Lethbridge lagu darin riding-yo miyi ah. Labadeeda riding ee Lethbridge waxay ka sarreeyeen 7.0% iyo 1.0% celceliska guddida talo-bixinta laftigeeda ee 53,722. Riding-yada miyiga ee ku wareegsan magaalada waxay u dhexeeyeen 6.7% ka hooseeya iyo 2.3% ka sarreeya. Warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta laftigeedu waxay riding-yo miyi ah oo ka weyn u magacawdaa habka kale ee lagu buuxin karo xadka. Sidaa darteed kala-qaybintu waxa loo baahan yahay oo keliya marka guddida talo-bixintu doorato riding-yo miyi ah oo ka yar. Taasi waxay ka tagaysaa bulshada danta wadaagta. Guddida talo-bixintu way ku doodaysaa, inta yar ee guddida talo-bixintuna way ku murmaysaa: “Dadkeeda iyo hoggaamiyayaasheedu si cad ayay u rabaan laba MLA.”`,c15_p3:`<strong>Lethbridge, kursi iyada u gaar ah.</strong> Meelo kale xeerka guddida talo-bixintu waa in meelaha dhexdhexaadka ah ee koraya ay mudan yihiin “matalaad u gaar ah”. Xeerkaas waxay u adeegsataa inay Cochrane iyo Okotoks siiso riding-yo iyaga u gaar ah. Lethbridge, magaalo ka weyn, waxay ka gudubtaa laba riding oo iyada u gaar ah una gudubtaa hal.`,c15_p4:`<strong>Banff, “dadka loo baahan yahay.”</strong> Guddida talo-bixintu isbeddelkeeda Banff waxay ugu yeedhaa “isbeddel yar ... si loo qabsado dadka loo baahan yahay”. Sharcigu wuxuu mamnuucaa riding caadi ah oo ka hooseeya celceliska in ka badan 25%. Canmore-Banff ee guddida waxay ka gaabnayd dabakhaas 331 qof. Ka dib wareejin yar oo ay guddida talo-bixinta oo dhammi ku heshiisay, waxay ugu badnaan ka gaabnayd qiyaastii 1,300. Guddida talo-bixintu waxay ku dartay 8,901. Waxay bixisaa sababo kale oo aanan tijaabin: in Bow Valley, Kananaskis Country iyo buuraha hoose la isku hayo sidii hal bulsho oo buuro iyo buuraha hoose ah, iyo in Okotoks la siiyo MLA u gaar ah.`,c15_p5:`<strong>Springbank, “magaalo iyo magaalo.”</strong> Guddida talo-bixintu waxay sheegtaa in riding-yadeeda Springbank ay isku daraan “dadka magaalada iyo dadka magaalada.” 2021, qaybaha Springbank waxay haysteen qiyaastii 40 ilaa 70 qof halkii kiiloomitir oo laba jibbaaran. Qaybaha Calgary ee isla riding-yadaas waxay haysteen qiyaastii 1,500 ilaa 1,900.`,c15_show:`Sabab hal meel lagu isticmaalo laakiin aan lagu isticmaalin meel la mid ah waxa laga yaabaa inaanay ahayn sababta dhabta ah. Lethbridge iyo Banff, labada isbeddel ee kursi dhaqaajiya warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada, sababaha dadka ee guddida talo-bixintu kuma habboona tirooyinkeeda. Sababaheeda kale ee halkaas, matalaadda gobolka iyo bulshada danta wadaagta, waa lagu murmaa, mana tijaabin. Marka loo eego khariidadda beddelka ah ee inta yar ee guddida talo-bixinta, isbeddelladaasi waxay NDP ka qaadaan laba kursi warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023. Dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta waxay ka qaadaan hal tirinta la diiwaangeliyay, waxbana xeerka cusub ee P ee codadka hore, oo aan weli la qaadan. Kursi kasta oo kala duwan waa mid aad u dhow oo aan la go'aamin karin. Oo eeg codadka NDP ee isbeddellada guddida talo-bixintu dhaqaajiyaan. Qiyaastii afar iyo badh jeer inta ka badan ayaa ka baxa kursi ay NDP ku guulaysato ama ku dhowaad ku guulaysato oo gala mid ay ku waydo 10 dhibcood ama ka badan, marka loo eego kuwa dhinaca kale u socda (14,199 marka loo eego 3,152).`,c15_experts:`Hubinta in sababaha la sheegay si siman loo dabaqo waa udub-dhexaadka falanqaynta cudurdaarka, isla habka lagu sharraxay Natiijada 11. Sabab ku adkaysata meel kasta oo lagu adeegsado waa caddayn mabda'. Sabab ku adkaysata oo keliya halka ay dhinac caawiso waa calaamadda caadiga ah ee cudurdaar la helay ka dib markii khadka la sawiray.`,c15_canada:`Guddiyada iyo guddiyada talo-bixintu waxay daabacaan sababo si dadweynaha iyo Golaha Sharci-dejintu u miisaamaan. Sababaha waxa loogu talagalay in si isku mid ah loogu dabaqo khariidadda oo dhan. Halkan waxa lagu hubin karaa tirooyinka guddida talo-bixinta laftigeeda.`,c15_gun:`Riding-yada waxa lagu sawiraa doorasho ula kac ah, sabab aan sinnayna waxay ku habboon tahay dhowr sharraxaadood. Garaadku waxa laga yaabaa inuu isbeddelay qaybaha warbixinta dhexdooda. Waxa laga yaabaa inuu jiro xidhiidh bulsho oo aanay tirooyinku arki karin. Ama waxa laga yaabaa inay jirto ujeeddo xisbiyeed. Tirakoobku wuxuu sheegi karaa in kala-qaybinta Lethbridge ay dhif tahay khariidadaha ixtiraama xadka magaalooyinka: qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 100. Laakiin taasi waa mid ka mid ah 12 calaamadood oo noocaas ah 132 barbardhig dhexdooda, midna ma adkaysto ka dib marka la saxo tirada imtixaannada. Halka kala-qaybintu dhigto codbixiyayaasha magaalada ma aha xad-dhaaf xeerka aan horay u dejiyay. Tirakoobku wuxuu sidoo kale sheegi karaa in kala-qaybintu aanay xad-dhaaf ahayn marka loo eego isbeddello yaryar oo lagu sameeyo khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta laftigeeda. Dib-u-sawirrada kombuyuutarka ee gobolka koonfurta iyo badhtamuhuna waxay ogaadaan in habaynta guddida talo-bixinta ee halkaas ay caadi tahay. Inta badan socodka afar iyo badh-ilaa-hal ee kor ku xusan waa ka-guurid habaynta inta badan ee guddida, taas oo dib-u-sawirradaasi u arkaan mid aan caadi ahayn, qayb ahaan maxaa yeelay ma sawiri karaan riding u yar sida Canmore-Banff-keeda (<a href="#newer-checks">hubinnada cusub, hoos</a>). Tirakoobku ma sheegi karo sababta xariiqda loo sawiray. Maxkamaddu waxay weydiin lahayd in natiijadu diiddo matalaad waxtar leh, ma aha in sababuhu nidaamsanaayeen. <em>(Casharka sharciga 6 mar kale: sababo xun oo loo bixiyo xariiq sharci ah weli waa xariiq sharci ah. Laakiin waa meesha saxda ah ee la eego.)</em>`,c15_app:`sida sabab la sheegay loogu hubiyo xog dadweyne`,rev_h:`Kaarka Dhibcaha, Mar Kale`,rev_p1:`Shan iyo toban natiijo. Xaqiijin ma jirto. Hadda ku noqo sawirka bogga sare — hadda waad akhriyi kartaa.`,rev_p2:`Dhidibka jiifa waa mid ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda ee Fasalka II: farqiga waxtarka, oo sii u janjeedha UCP inta aad midig u sii socoto. Dhidibka taagan waa tirada Fasalka I ee imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedka ee kala-saara ee la dhacay, imtixaannada khariidadaha kala garta. Khariidadda 2019 iyo inta badan ee 2026 waxay fadhiyaan geeska xasilloon: janjeer ku dhow eber, eber calaamadood oo qaab-dhismeed. Inta yar keligeed ayay fadhidaa. Afar ka mid ah afar calaamadood oo qaab-dhismeed. Farqi waxtar oo wax yar ka hooseeya xadka aan horay u dejinnay. Iyo, meel ka baxsan dhidibbada shaxdan, tiro kursiyo marka codku siman yahay oo ay dhaafaan 69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah, iyo natiijo 60 ka mid ah 89 kursi oo ku saleysan qaababka codbixinta dhawaan. Labada fasal waxay isugu yimaadaan isla khariidadda iyo isla bulshooyinka. In joomatarigu yahay farsamadu lagama tijaabin karin xogta kama dambaysta ah (Natiijada 9), haddana labada fasalba waxay ku heshiiyaan cidda ka faa'iidaysata.`,rev_litany_intro:`Hadda qalabkan laftiisa mari isla shanta su'aalood, mar ugu dambaysa.`,rev_found:`Kaar dhibco: qalabka ugu fiican ee aan dhisi karay si aan afar iyo tobanka natiijo ee ugu horreeya isugu keeno wax la sheegi karo, la hubin karo, oo la beenin karo. Shan imtixaan oo qaab-dhismeed oo horay loo diiwaangeliyay: inta yar waxay ku dhacdaa mid kasta oo kala-saara (xadkiisa way dhaaftaa), inta badanna midna kuma dhacdo, kan shanaad, oo aan kala garanayn, waa muuqdaa. Afar cabbir oo caddaalad xisbiyeed marka loo eego 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah: saddex dabada xad-dhaafka ah, hal mid aan gaadhin oo la soo sheegay.`,rev_show:`Waxa ugu dhow calaamad gerrymandering oo jiri karta sharciga Alberta iyo caadooyinka Kanada hoostooda: hab la hubin karo oo lagu yidhaahdo “khariidaddani waa nooca khariidad ee ujeedintu soo saarto,” iyadoo xad kasta la dejiyay ka hor intaan jawaab la ogaan.`,rev_experts:`Marka ujeeddada la arki waayo, goobtu waxay khariidadaha ku akhridaa kooxo isku-dhafan oo imtixaannada qiimaha ka baxsan ah. Horay-u-diiwaangelintu waa waxa ka dhiga kuwo daacad ah.`,rev_canada:`Waxba. Ma jirto hay'ad Kanadiyan ah oo khariidadaha sidan u qiimeysa. Taasi waa sababta sax ah ee aan ugu baahannay inaan mid dhisno.`,rev_gun:`Xadadkiisu waa hagaajinnadeenna, ma aha khadad sharci. Alberta waa hal gobol oo leh hal guddi oo kala qaybsan: cabbir muunadeed oo hal ah. Natiijooyin urursan weligood xaqiijin ma noqdaan, maxaa yeelay farqiga u dhexeeya “xad-dhaaf” iyo “ula kac” ma aha tirakoob. Waa farqiga uu sharcigu doortay inuu furan uga tago.`,rev_refrain:`Kaarkan dhibcaha ayaa mar kale la socodsiiyay Noofembar, khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta. Natiijadu waxay ku jirtaa <a href="#november">Noofembar: khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, oo la hubiyay</a>.`,playbook_h:`Sida dib u ciyaaridda ciyaarta ay u ekaan lahayd`,playbook_p1:`Warbixintani ma caddayn karto gerrymander; ereygu guri sharci ah kuma laha halkan. Waxa ay samayn karto waa inay sheegto, horay iyo si dadweyne, si sax ah sida calaamaddu u eg tahay, ka dibna sheegto in khariidadda Noofembar ay wado iyo in kale. Imtixaannadayada Noofembar waxa la diiwaangeliyay (OSF, diiwaangelinta qsgy8) ka hor intaanay khariidadda guddigu jirin. Magaca ay diiwaangelintu laftigeedu siisay hubinta waa imtixaanka Lunty, waana dhiggiisa xaqiijinta ee wax kasta oo kor ku xusan. Calaamaddu waxay leedahay laba qaybood. Habraaca: ma la qabtay dhageysiyo dadweyne; qabyo ma la sii daayay; xubnaha guddida talo-bixinta iyo shuruudaha shaqadooda ma la daabacay; khariidaddu ma ixtiraamaysaa talada ay dawladdu tixraacday markii ay qalinka qaadatay? Natiijada: halka khariidaddu uga dhacdo cabbir kasta oo warbixintan ku jira, marka loo eego isla qaybinta malyuunka khariidadood, iyo isla xadadka horay loo diiwaangeliyay.`,playbook_p2:`Ka soo qaad in khariidadda guddigu ku celiso calaamadda inta yar, inkastoo ay sawireen dad kale, xaddidaado kale, jadwal kale. Markaas natiijada qaab-dhismeed ee kor ku xusan waxay kasbanaysaa xaalad xaqiijin. Haddii ay ku dhacdo gudaha xadadka dhexdhexaadka ah, natiijadu waxay sii ahaanaysaa indho-indhayn go'doon ah oo ku saabsan hal khariidad oo aan weligeed la dhaqan gelin, warbixintanina si sax ah ayay taas u sheegi doontaa. Qiimayntu waxay socon doontaa 72 saacadood gudahood marka khariidadda la sii daayo, jihaday doontaba ha u tilmaantee. Ballanqaadkaas waxa la diiwaangeliyay ka hor intaanay cidi jawaabta ogaan. Gudub ama dhac, uma baahnaan doontid inaad aamino go'aankayaga. Xisaabtayada oo keliya, oo dadweyne ah, laga abuuray calaamad dadweyne, oo qof kastaa dib u soo saari karo.`,appendices_note:`Natiijo kasta oo kor ku xusan waxay ku xidhan tahay sharraxaad xaraf leh — mid kastaa hal fikrad, laga bilaabo “tani way jahwareerinaysaa” ilaa “hadda waan fahmay” — oo ku taal bogga wehelka ah:`,appendices_link:`Afar iyo tobanka sharraxaad (Lifaaqyada A–N)`},authors_view:{heading:`Aragtida Qoraaga`,heading_aria:`Xidhiidhiye aragtida qoraaga`,preamble:`Wax kasta oo kale oo boggan ku jira waa hubinta. Imtixaanno horay loo diiwaangeliyay. Saxitaanno la diiwaangeliyay. Caddayn aad hubin karto adigoon i aaminin. Qaybtan tirtir, hal tiro oo keliya ma beddelmayso. Qaybtani ma aha natiijo. Waa ra'yi — la saxeexay, la kala saari karo, oo aniga ii gaar ah.`,p1:`Hubintu ma caddayn karto ujeeddo. Anshaxaas waxaan ku ilaaliyay bog kasta oo kor ku xusan. Boggani waa halka aan anshaxaas dhinac iska dhigo.`,p2:`Ka bilow labada xaqiiqo ee aanan dambi la'aan ka dhigi karin. Xubno guddi oo dawladdu soo jeedisay ayaa sawiray khariidad uu sawirista dhexdhexaadka ahi ku dhawaad weligii soo saarin — wax ka yar boqol u dhigma malyuun sawir. Markii guddidu kala qaybsantay halkii ay taageeri lahayd, dawladdu ma weydiin sababta. Qalinka ayay qaadatay.`,p3:`Xaqiiqo kastaa waxay leedahay akhrin dambi la'aan ah. Xubin guddi ayaa noqon karta mid gaar ah oo niyad wanaagsan. Gole sharci-dejin ayaa dulqaadkiisa ku waayi kara xayirid. Laakiin xaqiiqooyinka isku xigxig u dhig, akhrinnada dambi la'aantuna way culaabanayaan. Dawlad ayaa doonaysay nooc gaar ah oo khariidad ah. Jidka madax-bannaan ma keenin. Jid ayaa la helay oo keeni lahaa.`,p4:`Waa kan waxa i baqdin geliya. Ma aha in sharci la jebiyay. Sharci lama jebin — waan hubiyay, hubintaasina waa inta badan waxa hubintani tahay. Sharcigu warbixinta guddida wuxuu ka dhigaa talo. Ma dejiyo muddo ogeysiis. Uma baahna qabyo, dhageysiyo, la-tashi midna. Tallaabo kasta oo la-wareegiddu waxay ahayd sharci. Taasi waa digniinta. Ilaaliyuhu weligii sharci ma ahayn. Wuxuu ahaa caado — caadooyinkuna waxay xidhaan oo keliya dawladaha doorta inay ilaaliyaan.`,p5:`Eeg waxa caadadu hore u iibsan jirtay. Guddidu waxay dhageysiyo ku qabatay lix iyo toban bulshood. Waxay akhriday 1,345 soo gudbin qoraal ah. Fikirkeeda ayay si dadweyne u beddeshay, maxaa yeelay dadweynaha ayaa sababo siiyay. Guddiga beddelay waa lix MLA: afar dawlad, laba mucaarad, guddoomiye dawladeed. Ma jirin xeer u baahan cod madax-bannaan miiskaas, midna ma fadhiyo. Waxa jira guddi talo-bixin — oo, si loogu bogaadiyo, uu guddoomiyo garsoore hawlgab ah. Laakiin la-taliyayaashu talo ayay bixiyaan. Codadka waxa leh MLA-yada, khariidadda ay sawiraanna waa khariidadda ay ku tartami doonaan. Ma wajihi doonto dhageysi dadweyne. Qabyo looma sii deyn doono dadweynaha si ay u diidaan. Waxay imanaysaa iyadoo dhammaystiran.`,p6:`Dawladdanina hore ayay halkan u timid. Sharcigeedii ugu horreeyay, sidii loo qoray, wuxuu golaha wasiirrada u oggolaan lahaa inay dib u qoraan sharciyo iyadoon golaha sharci-dejinta la marin. Awooddaas waa laga xayuubiyay — cabashada ka dib, ma aha ka hor. Guddoomiyaha anshaxa ee ay iyadu leedahay wuxuu ogaaday in Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu jebisay sharciga isku-dhaca danaha markii ay ku cadaadisay xeer-ilaaliyeheeda guud kiis dembi ku saabsan, wuxuuna faragelinta maamulka caddaaladda ugu yeedhay “khatar ku ah dimuqraadiyadda.” Waxay meel marisay sharci u oggolaanaya golaha wasiirrada inay buriyaan xeerarka maxalliga ah oo ay bilaabaan xil ka qaadista xubno gole oo la doortay. Markii maxkamadi hakisay mid ka mid ah sharciyadeeda Disembar 2025, waxay adeegsatay qodobka notwithstanding; toddobaad gudihiis amarkii hakinta wuu baxay. Tallaabooyinkaas mid kastaa wuxuu ahaa sharci. Mid kastaa wuxuu ku kharash gareeyay caado si looga gudbo hubin madax-bannaan. Dib-u-sawirka khariidadda doorashada iyadoo la marayo guddi ay dawladdu maamusho ma aha ka leexasho. Waa qaabkii, oo lagu dabaqay doorashooyinka.`,p7:`Cilmi-yaqaannada siyaasaddu waxay magacyo u leeyihiin dawladaha ilaaliya xarafka sharciga iyagoo qoda caadooyinka ka hooseeya. Kan ugu jilicsan waa <em>dib-u-dhaca dimuqraadiyadda</em>. Qoraalladu si cad ayay u sheegaan sida uu u shaqeeyo. Dimuqraadiyaduhu hadda naadir bay ugu dhintaan afgambi. Waxay u dhintaan tan — hal tallaabo oo sharci ah oo caado jebisa mar kasta, mid kastaa sabab la rumaysan karo leh, midkoodna sharci-darro ma aha.`,p8:`Kanada waxay lixdan sano ku bixisay dhisidda hal caado oo ka sarreysa kuwa kale: siyaasiyiintu ma sawiraan degmooyinkooda. Codbixiyayaasha ayaa doorta wakiilladooda. Ma aha lidkeeda. Abriil 2026, Alberta waxay caadadaas dhinac iska dhigtay galab keliya, cod 44 iyo 36 ah.`,p9:`Waxaan ka walwalaa waxa khariidaddu iibsato. Qaababka codbixinta dhawaan, joomatariga khariidadda inta yar wuxuu bixiyaa lixdan kursi oo ka mid ah sagaal iyo siddeetan. Taasi ma aha amar-siin shacab (mandate). Waa gaashaan — ka dhan ah xubno dhinac u wareega, guddiyo, iyo mucaarad kasta oo ku filan inuu sii wado kormeerka. Gaashaankaas waan ka walwali lahaa gacan kasta oo uu ku jiro. Waxaan aad uga walwalaa gacanta dawlad hadda i tustay, faylkan laftiisa dhexdiisa, waxa ay ku samayso xakamaynta habraaca marka habraac uu ku hanjabo inuu ka jawaabo.`,p10:`Waan qaldami karaa. Si ka duwan ra'yiyada badan ee ku saabsan dawladdan, kayga wuxuu la socdaa shuruudaha burburkiisa. Khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta waxa Golaha loo diray 2 Noofembar. Imtixaannada waa la xidhay ka hor intaanay jirin. Ma la qabtay dhageysiyo. La-taliyayaasha ma la magacaabay, shuruudaha shaqadooda ma la daabacay. Khariidaddu ma ixtiraamaysaa talada loo adeegsaday cudurdaarka la-wareegidda. Halkee ayay uga dhacdaa malyuun khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah. Haddii ay ku dhacdo gudaha xadadka dhexdhexaadka ah, shakigaygu wuxuu qaatay dhaawac dhab ah — goobtanina way sheegi doontaa laba iyo toddobaatan saacadood gudahood, maxaa yeelay taas waan u ballanqaaday ka hor intaanan jawaabta ogaan. Taasi waa farqiga u dhexeeya ra'yi iyo eedeyn. Ra'yigu wuxuu kuu sheegaa waxa beddeli lahaa.`,signed:`— Will Conner`,sources:`<em>Ilaha qaybtan.</em> Natiijada anshaxa waxay ka timid warbixinta Guddoomiyaha Anshaxa, <a href="https://www.ethicscommissioner.ab.ca/media/3124/allegations-involving-premier-danielle-smith-may-17-2023.pdf" rel="noopener">Allegations Involving Premier Danielle Smith (17 Maajo 2023)</a>: “In my opinion, Premier Smith contravened s.3 of the Conflicts of Interest Act in her interaction with the Minister of Justice and Attorney General.” Awoodihii asalka ahaa ee golaha wasiirrada ee Sovereignty Act iyo ka saariddooda: <a href="https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/edmonton/alberta-sovereignty-act-1.6678407" rel="noopener">CBC, Disembar 2022</a>. Awoodaha golaha wasiirrada ee Bill 20 ee ku saabsan xubnaha golaha iyo xeerarka maxalliga ah: <a href="https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/edmonton/alberta-bill-gives-cabinet-power-to-remove-municipal-councillors-change-or-repeal-bylaws-1.7185346" rel="noopener">CBC, Abriil 2024</a> iyo <a href="https://rmalberta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Bill-20-Member-Resource-Branded.pdf" rel="noopener">falanqaynta RMA ee sharciga sidii loo meel mariyay</a>. Adeegsiga qodobka notwithstanding iyo dhammaadka amarka hakinta: <a href="https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/edmonton/alberta-government-notwithstanding-clause-bills-9.6983786" rel="noopener">CBC, Disembar 2025</a> iyo <a href="https://egale.ca/awareness/egale-v-alberta-healthcare/" rel="noopener">jadwalka kiiska Egale Canada</a>. Qaab-dhismeedka guddiga, guddida talo-bixinta, iyo guddoomiyaheeda garsoore: <a href="https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/edmonton/alberta-boundaries-committee-motion-9.7172743" rel="noopener">CBC, Abriil 2026</a> iyo <a href="https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/edmonton/alberta-boundaries-panel-legislative-committee-elections-9.7187435" rel="noopener">CBC, Maajo 2026</a>; dhageysiyada guddida ee lix iyo tobanka bulshood iyo 1,345-ka soo gudbin qoraal ah waxay ka yimaadeen warbixinteeda kama dambaysta ah (b. 14). Abuuritaanka guddiga (Mooshinka Dawladda 37, la meel mariyay 21 Abriil 2026) iyo lixdiisa xubnood: <a href="https://www.assembly.ab.ca/assembly-business/committees/ceb" rel="noopener">bogga guddiga ee Golaha Sharci-dejinta</a>. Diidmada guddoomiyaha garsoorka ee ku-meel-gaadhka ah: <a href="https://bowislandcommentator.com/news/2026/05/28/chief-justice-cites-integrity-issues-refuses-to-suggest-electoral-boundaries-chair/" rel="noopener">Southern Alberta Newspapers, Maajo 2026</a>. Guddigii 1992 iyo wax-ka-beddelkii 1995: <a href="https://albertaviews.ca/knowing-draw-line/" rel="noopener">Alberta Views</a> iyo <a href="https://docs.assembly.ab.ca/LADDAR_files/docs/bills/bill/legislature_23/session_3/19950213_bill-020.pdf" rel="noopener">Bill 20 (1995)</a>. Tirooyinka ensemble-ka iyo kursiyadu waa kuwa hubintan laftigeeda, oo ilahooda lagu sheegay warbixinta kor ku xusan oo dhan.`},references:{heading:`Tixraacyada iyo Habka`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye tixraacyada`,intro:`Habku wuxuu ku tiirsan yahay suugaan la aqoonsan yahay oo ku saabsan cilmiga siyaasadda, tirakoobka iyo sharciga. Tixraacyada oo dhammaystiran waxay raacaan qaabka American Political Science Association (APSA); kiisaska maxkamaduhu waxay raacaan heshiiska sharciga Kanada. Liiska tixraacyada oo dhammaystiran wuxuu ku jiraa <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">warbixinta farsamada</a>. Ilaha muhiimka ahi waa kuwan.`,h_academic:`Suugaanta akadeemiga`,h_cases:`Kiisaska maxkamadeed`,h_statutes:`Sharciyada`},resources:{heading:`Warbixinnada iyo koodhka`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye farsamo`,tag_plain:`Luuqad Fudud`,plain_label:`Warbixinta dadweynaha oo buuxda`,plain_desc:`Dhaadheer, oo leh khariidado, loogu talagalay akhristayaasha guud`,tag_summary:`Soo koobid`,summary_label:`Soo koobida natiijooyinka`,summary_desc:`Guudmar luuqad fudud ah oo fikrad kasta eber ka sharxaya`,tag_academic:`Akadeemi`,academic_label:`Warbixinta farsamada`,academic_desc:`Habab buuxa iyo tixraacyo loogu talagalay cilmibaadhayaasha`,tag_notebook:`Buug-Xisaab`,notebook_label:`Buug-xisaab is-dhexgal ah`,notebook_desc:`Shaxaha adigu ku socodsii, biraawsarkaaga dhexdiisa, adigoon waxba rakibin`,tag_code:`Kood`},about_me:{heading:`Ku saabsan aniga`,p1:`Waxaan ahay arday ka tirsan Mount Royal University. Cilmi-baadhistan keligay ayaan sameeyay. Ma ahayn shaqo koorso, jaamacadduna ma amrin. Aragtiyadaydu waa kuwayga, ma aha kuwa jaamacadda. Qiyaastii 27 sano waxaan u shaqeeyay Elections Alberta sidii sarkaal doorasho oo qandaraas ah, doorasho walba, anigoo maamulaya codbixinta maalinta doorashada. Hadda qandaraas kuma jiro; waxaan u dambeeyay doorasho dhowaan dhacday. Shaqo kale lama lihi Elections Alberta, waxbana kama aqaan shaqadeeda wixii ka baxsan hawlahaas. Waxba oo hubintan ku jira kama yimaadaan shaqadaas. Elections Alberta waxay codsi ku bixisay faylasha xudduudaha ee khariidadaha guddida, waxaana dib loogu daabacay kaydka mashruuca. Wax kasta oo kale oo la galiyay waa soo-dejin dadweyne. Cilmi-baadhistani waa tayda, ma aha tan Elections Alberta, mana ku hadasho magaceeda. Xidhiidh lama lihi guddida. Qof weyn ahaan waxaan u codeeyay oo deeq siiyay xisbiyada gobolka ee muxaafidka iyo horusocodkaba ee Alberta.`,p2:`Taariikhdayda siyaasadeed waxay saamayn kartaa sida aan arrintan u eego, ilaalinta ugu weyn ee taas ka dhanka ahna waa habka. Labada khariidadood si isku mid ah ayaan u tijaabiyay, imtixaannadayda ayaan si dadweyne ah u diiwaangeliyay, diiwaanno waqti lagu dhejiyay ayaan sameeyay, natiijo kasta waxaan ku calaamadeeyay mid hore loo diiwaangeliyay ama mid baadhitaan bilow ah, wax walbana internetka ayaan saaray si qof kastaa u hubin karo shaqadayda. Cilmi-baadhistan lacagteeda anigaa iska bixiyay. Haddii aad hesho wax aan ku khaldamay, waan rabaa inaan ogaado.`,p3:`Diiwaannada: <a href="https://osf.io/6pt83" rel="noopener">OSF:6pt83</a>, AsPredicted #289,469 iyo AsPredicted #289,451. Abuurrada bakhtiyaanasiibka waxay ka yimaadaan beacon dadweyne. Abuurka jilitaanka ugu weyn waxa koodhka lagu go'aamiyay 27 Abriil 2026, ka hor intaan faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidaddu imanin; diiwaanku waa commit kayd, ma aha diiwaangelin OSF. Abuurka imtixaanka swing-zone waxa la dhiibay 6 Maajo iyadoo la socota natiijooyinkii ugu horreeyay ee imtixaankaas, sidaa darteed ma jiro diiwaan go'aamiyay ka hor intaan natiijo jirin. Imtixaanka miirida deriska (#289,451) waxa la qoray 24 Abriil waxaana OSF lagu diiwaangeliyay 6 Maajo, ka dib gudbid ku-meel-gaadh ah oo lagu sameeyay xudduudo qiyaas ah. Kuwa kale waxa la gudbiyay iyadoo la socota falanqayn sahamin ah.`,p4:`Su'aalo ama saxitaanno: `},translation_about:{heading:`Ku saabsan turjumaaddaan`,p1:`Waxaad akhrinaysaa tarjumaad mashiin, oo lagu sameeyay AI. Weli dib uma eegin qof luuqaddu hooyo u tahay. Nooca Ingiriisiga ayaa ah qoraalka sharafta leh: haddii wax tarjumaaddan ku jira aanay caddayn ama u muuqdaan khalad, asalka Ingiriisiga ayaa go'aamiya.`,p2:`Tayada turjumaaddu halkan way muhiim tahay, si aanay ugu ahayn inta badan mareegaha. Hubintani waxay sheegtaa sheegashooyin tirakoob oo ku saabsan caddaaladda doorashada, tiro si khaldan loo turjumay ama jumlad digniinteeda si khaldan loo dhigay waxay u marin habaabin kartaa siyaabo uu akhristuhu ku adkaan doono inuu ogaado. Turjumaadda mashiinka ee qoraalka tirakoobka-madaniga ah runtii way adag tahay. Khaladaad way dhici karaan.`,p3:`Haddii aad tahay qof afka u leh oo aad aragto khalad — ama aad jeclaan lahayd inaad si fiican dib ugu eegto qayb — fadlan %s. Si aad u qiyaasto cabbirka: qoraalka Ingiriisiga ahi waa qiyaastii {count} eray. Waad qaadan kartaa dhammaantii, ama qayb keliya. Inta badan shaqadu waa saxidda khaladaad yaryar oo mashiinku sameeyay, ma aha turjumaad eber laga bilaabo, xitaa dib-u-eegista hal qayb ayaa caawisa.`,p3_link:`nala soo xidhiidh`},retractions:{heading:`Ka-noqoshooyinka iyo Saxitaannada`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye ka-noqoshooyinka`,conditions_label:`SHURUUDAHA KA NOQOSHO`,conditions_intro:`Natiijo kasta waxa horay loogu go'aamiyay shuruud beenin oo gaar ah (xaalad lagu beenin lahaa). Haddii shuruud kasta oo hoose dhacdo, natiijada ay magacawdo waxa si dadweyne looga noqonayaa 30 maalmood gudahood. Gunaanadka jiho-guud ee oo dhan — in khariidadda inta yar ay ku taallo meel ka baxsan kala-duwanaanta dhexdhexaadka ah tijaabooyin badan oo madax-bannaan — waxa looga noqonayaa marka la gaadho shuruudda isku-dhafan ee habka horay loogu ballanqaaday: ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah lixda cabbir qaab-dhismeed ee madax-bannaan oo jihadoodu rogmato.`,c1_title:`Shuruudda 1 — Waxa la caddeeyaa in kala-doorashadu qasab tahay`,c1_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Natiijada qaab-dhismeedka ah ee ah in kala-qaybinta afar-jiho ah ee Airdrie iyo saddexda xuduud ee guddoomiyaha calaamadeeyay aanay ku sharxi karin sababta danta bulshada ee inta yar u sheegtay.`,c1_cond:`Shuruudda: qof ayaa muujiya in aanay jirin khariidad Alberta oo sharci ah oo buuxin karta sababaha inta yar laftigeedu sheegtay — Airdrie, Cochrane, Nolan Hill, Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park — iyadoo isla markaas ku xajinaysa khadadka dawladda hoose heerar la mid ah kuwa inta badan. Khariidad ka-hor-imaad ah oo labadaba samaysa waxay taa beddelkeeda xoojin lahayd natiijada (Wax-ka-beddelka 5, Qaybta 22). Xudduudaha rasmiga ah, shuruuddani ma khusayso: labada khariidadoodba hore ayay khadadka dawladda hoose ugu xajinayaan heer ka sarreeya xadkeeda 60% (inta yar 71.8%, inta badan 80.0%). Caqabadda furan waxay ku taal <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/issues/14" rel="noopener">Arrinta #14</a>.`,c2_title:`Shuruudda 2 — Gudbitaanka horay loo diiwaangeliyay ee Neighbour-Drain waa la rogaa`,c2_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Qoraalka Natiijada 10 ee khariidadda inta yar u diiwaangeliya GUUL hore loo diiwaangeliyay oo ku saabsan imtixaanka isku-dhowaanshaha miirista-deriska.`,c2_cond:`Shuruudda: dhibcaha miirista joogtada ah ee v2 waxay ku dhacaan dabada sare ee xad-dhaafka ah (p &lt; 0.05) ee isbeddellada bakhtiyaanasiibka ah (random permutations) ee lagu sameeyo garaafka isku-xidhnaanta ee go'an, taas oo macnaheedu yahay in gudbitaanku ahaa wax ka dhashay habka cabbirka laba-qiimeedka (binary) ee v1, halkii uu ka ahaan lahaa natiijo null dhab ah.`,c3_title:`Shuruudda 3 — Dukumeenti guddi oo ka hor 2026 ayaa muuqday`,c3_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Istidlaalkii ah in doorashooyinka xudduudaha inta yar ay ahaayeen go'aamada sawirka halkii ay ka noqon lahaayeen jawaabaha soo gudbinnada bulshada ee la diiwaangeliyay.`,c3_cond:`Shuruudda: dukumeenti guddi oo gudaha ah, oo taariikhdiisu ka horrayso doorashooyinka xudduudeed ee kama dambaysta ah ee inta yar, ayaa muujiya in doorashooyinkaas ay si cad u wadeen soo gudbinno bulsho oo aanay hubintu arkin — ma aha lixda sababood-hoosaad ee la daabacay ee hubintu tijaabisay.`,c4_title:`Shuruudda 4 — Natiijada doorashada 2027 waxay beenisaa jilitaanka`,c4_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Natiijada jilitaanka — in marka codku siman yahay khariidadda inta yar ay bixiso saami kursiyo oo ay dhaafaan 69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000 sawir oo dhexdhexaad ah.`,c4_cond:`Shuruudda: haddii doorashada gobolka 2027 lagu galo mid ka mid ah labada khariidadood ee guddida, kala-qaybinta kursiyada xisbiyeed ee dhabta ahina ay beenisa saadaasha jihada ee laga sameeyay codadka 2023, natiijooyinka boqolleyda ee jilitaanka ayaa dib loogu eegayaa natiijooyinka dhabta ah.`,c5_title:`Shuruudda 5 — Maxkamad Alberta ah ayaa u aragta in xukunka SCC ee Quebec uusan khusayn kiiska Alberta`,c5_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqonayo:</em> Doodda habraaca ee qaybta Guddiga Lunty ee ah in Mooshinka Dawladda 37, oo guddida ku beddelay guddiga Lunty, uu ku jiro isla fasalka dastuuriga ah ee barafaynta dib-u-qaybinta Quebec ee 2024.`,c5_cond:`Asalka: 22 Abriil 2026 — maalin ka dib markii Alberta meel marisay Mooshinka Dawladda 37 — Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay, 7–2 oo go'aanka isla fadhiga lagu dhawaaqay, ansixisay xukun Maxkamadda Rafcaanka ee Quebec oo sheegay in barafaynta sharci-dejineed ee dawladda Legault ku samaysay guddideeda dib-u-qaybinta ay jebisay dammaanadda matalaadda dimuqraadiga ee §3 ee Axdiga. Shuruudda: maxkamad dib u eegaysa mooshinka Alberta ayaa u aragta inuu dastuur ahaan ka duwan yahay — tusaale ahaan, maxaa yeelay u wareejinta shaqada guddi MLA ah waxay qaab-dhismeed ahaan ka duwan tahay barafayn sharci-dejineed, ama maxaa yeelay falanqaynta matalaadda waxtarka leh ee §3 ee Alberta waxay u soo baxdaa si ka duwan tan Quebec.`,corr_label:`SAXITAANNADA LA DIIWAANGELIYAY (dib-u-xisaabinta canonical-ka, 2026-05-11)`,corr_light_label:`SAXITAANNO`,corr_light_intro:`Hubintani si dadweyne ayay wax u saxdaa waxbana ma tirtirto. Imtixaanka qaab-dhismeed ee isbeddelay xudduudaha rasmiga ah waxa si buuxda loogu sheegay Natiijada 5; labada imtixaan ee tirakoob ee aan adkaysan, Natiijooyinka 8 iyo 10. Diiwaanka dhammaystiran ee sax kasta — waxa isbeddelay, goorta, iyo sababta — waxa lagu hayaa <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">qaybta SAXITAANNADA LA DIIWAANGELIYAY ee warbixinta cilmiyeed</a>.`,corr_intro:`Natiijadan hore ee soo socota kama badbaadin dib-u-falanqaynta lagu sameeyay faylasha khariidadaha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta (la helay 2026-05-06). Halkan waa lagu hayaa iyadoo la raacayo siyaasadda hubinta ee horay loo go'aamiyay ee ah in natiijooyinka dhacay aan weligood la tirtirin.`,corr_municipal:`<strong>Xajinta dawladda hoose.</strong> Falanqayntii qabyada ahayd ee hore, oo adeegsatay xudduudo khariidadeed oo ku-meel-gaadh ah, waxay muujisay in khariidadda inta yar ay khadadka dawladda hoose u raacdo 15% oo keliya — 4.9&times; ka hooseysa caadiga Kanada ee 70–85%. Tiradani waxay ahayd wax ka dhashay dib-u-dhiska xudduudaha ku-meel-gaadhka ah (xilligii DPG). Faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, labada khariidadood waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada: inta badan 80%, inta yar 72%. <em>Kala-duwanaanshaha</em> xajinta dawladda hoose ee u dhexeeya labada khariidadood ma aha calaamad ka badbaadda dib-u-xisaabinta faylasha rasmiga ah. Saddexda xuduud ee aan caadiga ahayn ee guddoomiyaha guddidu calaamadeeyay (Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park, Nolan Hill–Cochrane, Olds–North Airdrie) way sii jiraan, saxitaankanina ma saamaynayo.`},suggestions:{heading:`Talooyin`,heading_aria:`Xidhiidhka talooyinka`,resume:`Ra'yigu waa dhammaaday; diiwaanku wuu sii socdaa. Saddex arrimood oo nadaafadeed ayaa hadhay: waxa ka dhigi lahaa hubinta xigta mid ka fudud, shuruudaha ay hubintani ku noqonayso ka-noqosho nafteeda, iyo raadka warqadaha.`,intro:`Hubintani waxay la kulantay laba dhibaato xogeed. Midkoodna kuma saabsana shaqada guddida. Labaduba waxay ka yimaadaan sida nidaamka doorashada Alberta loo dejiyay, labadaba waa la hagaajin karaa.`,advance_p1:`<strong>Qiyaastii kala badh codadka Alberta hadda waxa la dhiibaa ka hor maalinta doorashada</strong>, goobaha codbixinta hore, goobaha guurguura iyo warqad gaar ah. Elections Alberta waxay codadkan u soo sheegtaa oo keliya wadarta riding kasta, ma aha aag codbixineed kasta, aagagga yaryar ee riding-ku ka kooban yahay. Sidaa darteed qiyaastii 810,000 cod oo NDP iyo UCP ah oo la dhiibay 2023 laguma xidhi karo xaafad khariidad ku taal. Waa la tiriyaa. Oo keliya meel laguma dhigi karo. Codbixiye kasta oo hore waxa lagu hubiyaa liiska codbixiyayaasha ka hor intaan warqad la siin, liiskaasna codbixiye kasta wuxuu ku xidhaa aag codbixineed. Si codadka hore loogu soo sheego aag codbixineed, tirintu waxay warqadaha codbixinta hore u kala soocaysaa aag, iyadoo aagagga yaryar la isku darayo si cod kasta qarsoodi ugu ahaado. Taasi waxay beddelaysaa sida codadka loo tiriyo, ma aha sida dadku u codeeyaan.`,advance_p2:`Tani waxay ugu muhiimsan tahay dadka hubiya khariidad. Guddiyadu way saxan yihiin markay ka sawiraan dadka, ma aha codadka, tirakoobkuna horeba wuxuu u sheegaa halka dadku ku nool yihiin. Laakiin ka-qaybgalka aag kasta wuxuu muujin lahaa bulshooyinka ay riding-yada khariidaddu dhab ahaan gaadhaan. Inta diiwaanka dadweynuhu muujinayo, guddi-xubnuhu waxay arkaan isla natiijooyinka la daabacay ee qof kasta oo kale arko.`,lesser_slave_p1:`Ugu yaraan hal bulsho oo waqooyiga Alberta ah, farqigu waa mid buuxa. Qaybta waqooyi ee riding-ka Lesser Slave Lake <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Lesser Slave Lake">tus ↗</button> waxa ku yaal aag codbixineed oo 4,832 km&#178; ah, oo ka weyn afar-meelood-shan cabbirka Prince Edward Island. Waxa ku noolaa 844 qof tirakoobkii 2021. 2023, hal cod lagama dhiibin goob codbixineed oo maalinta doorashada ah. Cod kasta wuxuu galay wadarta riding-ka oo dhan ee codadka hore, kuwa guurguura iyo warqadaha gaarka ah. Codadkaasi waxay ka tirsan yihiin wadarta riding-ka, laakiin khariidad laguma dhigi karo. Natiijooyinka la daabacay, bulshadu gabi ahaanba ma muuqato.`,lesser_slave_p2:`Markii guddidu markii ugu horreysay qorshaysay inay meesha ka saarto riding-ka Lesser Slave Lake oo ku darto mid ka weyn, ma haysan xog cod oo meel ku salaysan oo bulshooyinkaas ah. Ugu dambayn way haysay riding-ka. Taasi waxay timid ka dib markii ugu yaraan 56 gudbin dadweyne, tirinta warbixinta inta yar, ay sheegeen in gobolku yahay hal bulsho oo danta wadaagta. Qaar, sida gudbinta EBC-2025-2-0028, waxay wax ka qoreen bulshooyinka yaryar ee Asaliga ah ee waqooyiga riding-ka. Guddidu waxay riding-ka ku haysay s. 15(2) ee <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>, ka-reebista riding-yada fog ee hoos lagu sharraxay. Bulshooyinku way gaadheen. Laakiin natiijooyinka la daabacay ma muujin karin inta dadkooda ka mid ah ee codeeyay.`,ebca_label:`QAYBTA 15(2) EBCA`,ebca_body:`Qodobka 15(2) ee <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta wuxuu guddi u oggolaadaa inay ilaaliso riding yar, mid leh in ka badan 25% dad ka yar celceliska gobolka. Riding-ku waa inuu buuxiyaa ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah shan imtixaan: (a) bed ka badan 20,000 km², ama bed la sahamiyay oo ka badan 15,000 km²; (b) in ka badan 150 km laga bilaabo Dhismaha Golaha Sharci-dejinta ilaa xudduudda riding-ka ugu dhow, waddada jidka weyn ee ugu tooska ah; (c) magaalo aan lahayn in ka badan 8,000 qof; (d) dhul-keyd Hindi ah (Indian reserve) ama degsiimo Métis ah oo riding-ka ku jira; iyo (e) qayb ka mid ah xudduudda riding-ka oo ku teedsan xadka Alberta. Ilaa afar riding ayaa sidan loo ilaalin karaa, ilaa 50% ka hooseeya celceliska. Ilaalintu si toos ah uma timaado. Guddidu waa inay go'aamiso in imtixaannada la buuxiyay, waxayna dooran kartaa inaanay isticmaalin.`,rationale_p1:`Qorshihii ugu horreeyay ee guddida wuxuu riding-ka meesha uga saaray dadkiisa darteed. Qiyaastii 27,000 qof, Lesser Slave Lake waxay lahayd qiyaastii kala badh celceliska gobolka: si sax ah dabakha sharciga. Taasi waxay u egtahay adeegsi caadi ah oo xeerarka. Ma aha. Sharcigu wuxuu guddi halkan u oggolaadaa inay doorato, Lesser Slave Lake-na waxay buuxisaa saddex ka mid ah shanta imtixaan, tirada uu Sharcigu codsado. Bedkeedu waa 69,566 km² (imtixaanka a: ka badan 20,000 km²). Magaalo ku jirta midna ma laha in ka badan 8,000 qof (imtixaanka c). Waxayna ku jiraan dhul-keydyo Hindi ah iyo degsiimooyin M&#233;tis ah (imtixaanka d). Bulshooyinkaasi waxay wadaagaan juquraafi waqooyi iyo dan guud oo ah MLA inta badan u jawaaba waqooyiga Alberta. Imtixaanka b, in ka badan 150 km laga bilaabo Golaha Sharci-dejinta ilaa xudduudda riding-ka ugu dhow jidka weyn, laguma buuxin moodelkayga waddooyinka. Moodelku wuxuu bixiyaa 134 km riding-ka sida labada khariidadood ee kama dambaysta ahiba u sawiraan.`,rationale_p2:`Qorshihii ugu horreeyay wuxuu Lesser Slave Lake iyo Peace River ku midayn lahaa hal riding oo la yidhaahdo Mackenzie. Taasi waxay codka la wadaago ee bulshooyinkaas ku dari lahayd riding-ka ugu weyn gobolka. Bulshooyinku isma beddelin. Khadadka ku wareegsan ayaa isbeddelay. Marka la isku daro, saddexda imtixaan ee ay buuxiso waxay sharxayaan riding weyn oo dad yari ku nool yihiin, oo ay deggan yihiin bulshooyin aan danahooda matalaaddu ka muuqan tirinta dadka ee ceeriin. Warbixinta kama dambaysta ah ee guddidu waxay tirisay afar imtixaan oo la buuxiyay. Moodelkayga waddooyinka waa saddex, taas oo weli ku filan. Dadka yari ma qasbin in riding-ka meesha laga saaro. Qodobka 15(2) wuxuu guddida u oggolaaday inay haysato marka ay dad ku darto. Warbixinta kama dambaysta ah waxay ku dartay Big Lakes County, Swan Hills iyo qayb ka mid ah Woodlands County, taas oo riding-ka ka dhigtay 45% ka hooseeya celceliska. Erayada guddida laftigeeda ee ku saabsan qorshaheedii ugu horreeyay: "waan qaldannay."`,banff_p:`Sheekadan dhinac kale ayay leedahay. Shanta guddi-xubnood oo dhammi waxay ku heshiiyeen qorshihii ugu horreeyay, kaas oo meesha ka saaray Lesser Slave Lake. Labada khariidadood ee kama dambaysta ah kadib waxay ku ilaaliyeen s.&#x2009;15(2). Inta yar waxay sidoo kale s.&#x2009;15(2) u adeegsatay Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park, oo ay ku fidisay qaybta madhan ee Banff National Park. Inta badan ee guddida, guddoomiyeheedu ku jiro, waxay warbixinta kama dambaysta ah ee rasmiga ah ugu yeedheen "dadaal niyad xun". Hubintaydu waxay daciifisaa eeddooda: riding-ku wuu u qalmaa s.&#x2009;15(2) xitaa dhulka beerta la'aanteed. Weli, khariidadda inta yar, ka-reebis loogu talagalay meelo fog oo dad ku nool yihiin ayaa lagu fidiyay dhul beereed oo madhan. Khariidadda 91-kursi ah ee xigtay waxa sawiray guddi talo-bixineed, oo uu kormeerayay guddi MLA-yo ah. Qodobka&#x2009;15(2) wuxuu xidhaa guddida. Sida aan u akhriyo Mooshinka Dawladda 37, wuxuu guddida talo-bixinta siiyay isla ka-reebistaas. Ma jirin sharci u baahnaa dhegaysiyo dadweyne oo ku saabsan khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta, midna lama qabanin.`,census_p1:`<strong>Dhibaatada kale waa waqtiga. Alberta waa inay sugto tirakoobka 2026 ka hor inta aanay sawirin khariidadda xigta.</strong> Kanadu waxay dadkeeda tirisaa shantii sanaba mar. Tirakoobka 2026 waxa la qaaday Maajo 2026, natiijooyinkiisa ugu horreeyana waxa la filayaa Febraayo 2027. Guddidii ay hubintani khariidadaheeda hubiso waxay ku qasbanayd inay ka bilowdo tirakoobkii 2021, oo lagu keenay Luulyo 2024 qiyaas gobol. Tirintaasi horeba waxay ahayd afar sano jir markii khariidadaha la sawiray. Alberta si degdeg ah ayay u koraysaa, mana aha si siman. Qiyaasaha dadka ee hubinta, riding-kii 2019 ee Airdrie-East wuxuu koray qiyaastii 30% inta u dhexeysa tirakoobka 2021 iyo badhtamaha 2025, halka Athabasca-Barrhead-Westlock uu koray qiyaastii 6%. Sidaa darteed khariidad laga sawiray tirinno hore waa mid duugoobay maalinta ugu horreysa ee la isticmaalo. Isbeddel fudud oo lagu sameeyo <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ayaa taas hagaajin kara. Wuxuu ku waajibin karaa in guddi cusub la magacaabo oo keliya ka dib marka Statistics Canada ay soo saarto xogta aagagga yaryar ee ugu cusub ee tirakoobkii ugu dambeeyay. Natiijadu waxay noqon lahayd khariidado muujinaya halka dadka Alberta hadda ku nool yihiin, ma aha halkii ay ku noolaayeen sannado ka hor.`,census_p2:`Guddigu wuxuu ka shaqeeyay sharciga jira, kaas oo aan dejin xeer ku saabsan waqtiga tirakoobka. Keligiis uma dib dhigi karin waqtigiisa kama dambaysta ah ee 2 Noofembar 2026. Soo jeedintani waxay u tahay isbeddel mustaqbal oo lagu sameeyo <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>, ma aha habraaca hadda socda. Xiisaddu waa dhab. Khariidadda 91-kursi ah waxa laga sawiray tirakoob shan sano jir ahaa markii khariidadda la keenay. In xadkaas la magacaabo ayaa ka faa'iido badan in laga dhigo sidii aanu jirin.`,closing:`Labada dhibaato xogeed midna ma aha natiijo ku saabsan khariidadaha guddida. Labaduba waxay ku saabsan yihiin nidaam ka dhiga hubinta khariidad mid ka adag inta loo baahan yahay. Waxaan u soo bandhigayaa talooyin wax ku ool ah, ma aha gunaanad. Labadaba waa la hagaajin karaa, hagaajintooduna waxay siin lahayd guddi kasta oo mustaqbalka ah, iyo hubin kasta oo mustaqbalka ah, dhul ka adag.`}},editorial_canada:{heading:`Macnaha: Kanada Way Kala Duwan Tahay — Iyo Isku Mid`,p1:`Kanada waxay ka mid tahay isla qoyska Mareykanka, Boqortooyada Midowday, iyo Australiya. Waxaan degmooyin juquraafi ah ka dooranaa xubin keliya, iyadoo la raacayo nidaamka "kii codka ugu badan hela ayaa guuleysta" (first-past-the-post). Khadadka si xilliyeed ayaan dib ugu sawirnaa — heer federaal ka dib tirakoob kasta oo tobankii sanaba mar ah, heer gobolna jadwallo kala duwan. Mishiinka aasaasiga ah waxaan ka dhaxalnay isla xididdada Westminster. Ilaa hadda, wax lala yaabo ma jiraan.`,p2:`Waxa Kanada ka gooniya waa tijaabada ay tahay in khadadku ka gudbaan.`,p3:`Sharciga dastuuriga ah ee Mareykanka, xeerka waajibka ah waa <em>hal qof, hal cod</em> — degmooyinku waa inay yeeshaan tiro dad oo u siman sida ugu macquulsan, ka leexashooyinka waaweynna waxay u baahan yihiin cudurdaar adag. Sharciga dastuuriga ah ee Kanada, xeerka waajibka ahi waa ka duwan yahay. Qaybta 3 ee <em>Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha Kanada</em> waxay muwaadin kasta u dammaanad qaadaysaa xaqa codbixinta. Kiiska <em>Tixraaca Xudduudaha Doorashada Gobolka (Sask.)</em> — Tixraacii Saskatchewan ee 1991, kiiska hoggaanka u ah — Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay xaqaas u fasirtay inuu yahay xaq loo leeyahay <em>matalaad waxtar leh</em>, ma aha xaq loo leeyahay sinnaan xisaabeed oo tirada dadka degmooyinka ah.`,p4:`Farqigaasi wuu muhiim yahay. Matalaadda waxtarka lihi waxay u oggolaataa in tirada dadka degmooyinku kala duwanaato, mararka qaarkood si weyn, marka ay jiraan sababo wanaagsan: juquraafi miyi oo ballaadhan oo aanu hal MLA si macquul ah ugu adeegi karin haddii cufnaanta dadku caadi tahay, bulshooyin danaha wadaaga oo ay habboon tahay in la isku hayo, iyo matalaadda dadka laga tirada badan yahay oo sinnaanta xisaabeedku khafiifin lahayd. Tixraacii Saskatchewan wuxuu dabacsanaantaas ka dhigay mid dastuuri ah. Kala-duwanaanshaha 25% ee tirada dadka ee EBCA — xeerka ilaaliya kursiyada miyiga ee Alberta — si toos ah ayuu uga soo farcamay.`,p5:`Dhibaatadu waxay tahay in dabacsanaantu labada dhinac u goyso. Haddii guddi si sharci ah uga leexan karo sinnaanta tirada dadka sababo sax ah awgood, sidoo kale wuu uga leexan karaa sababo khaldan awgood. Sharciga Kanada ma laha sagxad xisaabeed oo nooca Mareykanka ah oo dib loogu noqon karo. Wuxuu leeyahay imtixaanka matalaadda waxtarka leh, oo garsoorayaashu dabaqaan, wixii dhacay ka dib, dacwadaha dhexdooda. Maamullada intooda badani waxay sababaha khaldan kaga hortagaan ilaalin qaab-dhismeed: heer federaal, guddiyada dib-u-qaybinta madax-bannaanidooda waxa ilaaliya sharci, xudduudahooduna waxay ku dhaqan galaan amar matalaad (representation order), iyadoo aan loo baahnayn cod baarlamaan oo lagu ansixiyo. Quebec ayaa ugu fog — guddigeeda joogtada ah ee madax-bannaan ayaa laftigeedu dejisa khariidadda kama dambaysta ah, iyadoo aan Goluhu u codayn inuu ansixiyo ama ka adkaado. Xitaa British Columbia, oo Golaheeda Sharci-dejintu u codeeyo ansixinta soo jeedinnada guddida oo sharci ku dhaqan geliyo, waxay caado ka dhigataa inay qaadato shaqada guddida madax-bannaan halkii ay khariidad u gaar ah ku beddeli lahayd.`,p6:`Alberta waa ka reebban. <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> hoostiisa, warbixinta guddidu waa talo oo keliya — golaha sharci-dejintu waa inuu u codeeyo si uu u dhaqan geliyo. Ansixintu caadi ahaan waa rasmiyad uun. Wareegga 2026, guddidu waxay u kala qaybsantay 3–2 waxayna soo saartay laba soo jeedin oo iska tartamaya; golaha sharci-dejintu wuxuu abuuray guddi MLA ah oo gooni ah, oo uu guddoomiyo MLA UCP ah, si uu labadooda kala doorto. Sharciga dastuuriga ah ee Kanada waxba kuma qasbin in guddigaasi jiro. Waxna kuma qasbayaan in doorashadiisu raacdo habraaca guddida. Kani waa godka qaab-dhismeed ee ay hubintani baadhayso.`,p7:`Sidaa darteed marka maxkamadaha Kanada ay yidhaahdaan "gerrymander" ma aha eraybixintooda sharci, ma odhanayaan fikradda hoose halkan kuma khusayso. Waxay odhanayaan imtixaanku waa ka duwan yahay — matalaad waxtar leh, ma aha sinnaan xisaabeed. In soo jeedinta inta yar ay buuxiso imtixaankaas waa si sax ah su'aasha ay hubintani joomatariga ku cabbirtay, iyo si sax ah su'aasha uu garsoore keliya si kama dambays ah uga jawaabi karo. Sababaynta <em>Tixraacii Saskatchewan</em> oo dhammaystiran, isbarbardhigga gobollada kale, su'aasha xaqa dacwad-gelinta (standing), iyo jidadka dib-u-habaynta ee la heli karo waxa lagu sharraxay <a href="#references">qaybta tixraacyada ee hoose</a>.`},chrome:{back_to_top:`Ku noqo sare`,license_title:`Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0`,license_alt:`CC BY-NC-SA 4.0`,license_aria:`Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0`,back_to_stakes:`↑ Ku noqo Khataraha`,back_to_picture:`↑ Ku noqo sawirka`,lightbox:{fig_aria:`Sawirka weynaaday oo la balaariyay`,fig_close_aria:`Xidh sawirka weynaaday (Esc)`,map_aria:`Daawade kharito-soo-dhoweyste`,map_close_aria:`Xidh daawadaha khariidadda`,close_title:`Xidh (Esc)`},participation:{heading:`Naga caawi in aan horumarinno MapExplorer`,body:`Inta aad baadhineyso, waxaan raadineynaa khariidadaha iyo degmooyinka aad booqato oo si joogto ah u dirno xogta saldhiggeenna cilmibaadha. Wadaagida muuqaal sidoo kale waxay keydinaysaa halka aad ku dhammaatay. Ujeedada: fahmida waxa waxtar u yahay oo aaladda ka wanaajinta.`,no_collect:`Marna ma ururino magacaaga, cinwaanka IP-gaaga, ama goobtaada saxda ah. Wax kasta waxa magac-la'aan looga dhigaa browser-kaaga ka hor intaanu ka bixin. Xogta kuma aqoonsan karno xitaa haddii nalagu amro.`,dnt:`Browser-kaagu wuxuu shiday Do Not Track. Maya ayaa horay laguugu doortay. Weli waxaad dooran kartaa Haa.`,no_thanks:`Maya, mahadsanid`,yes_help:`Haa, waan caawin doonaa`,privacy_policy:`Siyaasadda asturnaanta`},share:{button:`Wadaag`,button_title:`Wadaag ama soo geli dejinta khariidadda`,dialog_aria:`Wadaag dejinta khariidadda`,close_aria:`Xidh baraha wadaagga`,share_label:`Wadaag dejintan`,share_hint:`Koodhkaan ku qor browser kasta oo socodsiinaya hubinta si aad u geliso dejintan. Koodhku marna laguma dhejin URL.`,load_label:`Geli dejin`,load_btn:`Geli`,load_placeholder:`alpine-eagle-banff`,copy:`Nuqul`,copied:`La nuqlay!`,copy_failed:`Guuldarro`,unrecognised:`Koodh aan la garanayn — hubso higaanka.`},map:{minority:`Inta yar`,majority:`Inta badan`,current:`Hadda`,wasted:`La khasaariyay`,wasted_title:`Tabarucida farqiga waxtarka ee degmo kasta`,partisan:`Xisbiyeed`,partisan_title:`Midab kasta oo degmo ah sida natiijada xisbiyeed (UCP buluug / NDP oranje)`,borders:`Xudduudaha`,flagged:`La calaamadeeyay`,flagged_title:`Dhammaan 7-da qaab ee uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyaha guddida Garsoore Miller — si toos ah ayay ugu wareegtaa khariidadda inta yar`,help_aria:`Caawimada khariidadda`,help_title:`Sida loo isticmaalo khariidadda`,pin_aria:`Xidh Khariidadda`,pin_title:`Xidh Khariidadda — ka hortag auto-pan marka la gujin degmada`,search_aria:`Hel degmo doorasho`,search_placeholder:`Raadi degmo…`,zoom_aria:`Zooming khariidadda`,clear_aria:`Nadiifi xulashada degmada`,clear_title:`Nadiifi xulashada`,va_hint:`Guji gudaha degmadaan si aad u aragto natiijooyinka xarunta codbixinta`,va_close_aria:`Xidh faahfaahinta xarunta codbixinta`,va_close_title:`Xidh`,object_title:`Khariidadda degmooyinka doorashada Alberta — tayada ugu sarreysa`,ea_credit:`Xogta khariidadda:`,cc_title:`Waxa qoraalka ah: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0`,cc_alt:`Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0`,votes_suffix:`codo`,total_votes_suffix:`wadarta codadka`,pop_prefix:`Dad.`,voting_areas_suffix:`aagagga codbixinta`,other_maps:`Khariidadaha kale`,unique_boundary:`Xuduud u gaar ah khariidaddaan`,in_person_votes:`codad shakhsi ahaan (baaqida Vote Anywhere kama jiraan)`,load_error_generic:`Ma soo geli karin khariidadda xudduudaha. Isku day in aad dib u soo rareyso bogga.`,load_error_map:`Ma soo geli karin khariidadda {key} — hubso xiriirkaaga.`,context_minority:`Soo jeedinta inta yar 2026 · natiijooyinka doorashada 2023`,context_majority:`Soo jeedinta inta badan 2026 · natiijooyinka doorashada 2023`,context_2019:`Xudduudaha la dhaqan-geliyay 2019 · natiijooyinka doorashada 2023`,tag_min:`Yar`,tag_maj:`Badan`,tag_2019:`2019`,dev_notice:`Map Explorer wuxuu ku jiraa horumarinno tooska ah oo joogta ah oo mararka qaarkood jabi kara. Haddii wax khaldan muuqato, dhawr maalmood ka dib soo noqo — dhibaatooyinku sida caadiga ah waxay xalloobi doonaan. Soo jeedinnadu waa la soo dhawaynayaa: %s.`,dev_notice_email_label:`ii soo emayl`,dev_notice_dismiss:`Iska dhaaf ogeysiiska horumarinta`,skel_1:`Soo gelin Map Explorer…`,skel_2:`sawirida Alberta…`,skel_3:`xisaabaynta tirooyinka…`,skel_4:`tirinaynta codad kasta…`,skel_5:`sawirida xudduudaha…`,skel_6:`ku dhow dhammaadka…`},map_intro:{heading:`Sida loo isticmaalo khariidadda`,click_district:`Guji degmo kasta`,click_district_desc:`arag natiijooyinka doorashada 2023 oo uga bood`,click_within:`Guji gudaha degmada la doortay`,click_within_desc:`arag natiijooyinka xarunta codbixinta ee gaar ah (midab = kala-qaybinta codka)`,dblclick:`Laba jeer guji degmo`,dblclick_desc:`zoom si ay shaashadda u buuxiso; laba jeer guji meel bannaan si aad u fogeyso (zoom out)`,layers_primary:`Inta yar / Inta badan / Hadda`,layers_primary_desc:`bedel khariidadda xudduudaha firfircoon`,layers_data:`Xisbiyeed / La khasaariyay / Xudduudaha`,layers_data_desc:`bedel lakabada xogta`,search:`Raadi degmo`,search_desc:`magac ku u bood; furayaasha falaadhuhu khariidadda way dhaqaajiyaan, + / − zoom`,escape:`Bax`,escape_desc:`xidh daawadahaan`,s4_tip:`§4, guji <em>Muuji degmooyinka la calaamadeeyay khariidadda</em> si aad u iftiimiso kala-qaybinta Airdrie iyo aagga woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary.`,got_it:`Si fiican ayaan u fahmay`},footer:{title:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta — Noofembar 2026`,copyright:`© Will Conner 2026 —`,text_label:`Qoraal:`,code_label:`Kood:`,translation_label:`Turjumaadaha:`,translation_credit:`Anthropic Fable 5 (AI) — sugaysa dib-u-eegis qof afka hooyo u ah`,data_credit:`Xogta khariidadda: waddooyinka labaad ee laga keenay National Road Network, © Statistics Canada (Open Government Licence – Canada); waddooyinka kale & biyaha © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL); xudduudaha & natiijooyinka © Elections Alberta.`}},explorer:{controls:{panel_title:`Xakamayaha khariidadda`,close_aria:`Xidh khariidadda`,map_version_hdr:`Nooca khariidadda`,map_version_hint:`· guji si aad u beddesho`,map_toggle_title:`Beddel khariidaddan dami/shidid`,map_minority:`Inta yar`,map_majority:`Inta badan`,map_2019:`Rasmi`,map_minority_short:`Yar`,map_majority_short:`Badan`,map_2019_short:`Rasmi`,search_placeholder:`Raadi degmo…`,search_aria:`Raadi degmooyinka`,search_clear_aria:`Nadiifi raadinta`,search_in:`gudaha {ed}`,zoom_aria:`Zooming`,res_prefix:`1 pixel ≈`,zoom_official:`(Rasmi)`,zoom_computed:`(La xisaabiyay)`,overlays_hdr:`Dul-saarrada Danta Bulshada`,layer_highways:`Waddooyinka waaweyn`,layer_water:`Webiyada & harooyinka`,layer_annotations:`EBC '26 Annotations`,mobile_map_version_aria:`Nooca khariidadda`,mobile_search_aria:`Raadi degmooyinka`,mobile_layers_aria:`Lakabyada khariidadda`,mobile_info_aria:`Ku saabsan khadadka xudduudaha`,mobile_share_aria:`La wadaag aragtidan`,mobile_close_aria:`Xidh khariidadda`,lang_aria:`Beddel luuqadda`,lang_hdr:`Luuqad`,lines_note_title:`Akhrinta khadadka`,lines_note_lead:`Qaab kasta oo cajiib ah ama khad kala-qaybin ah waa`,lines_note_emphasis:`doorasho ula kac ah oo guddi samaysay`,lines_note_tail:`— ma aha khalad xog. Khadadku waxay raacaan cidhifyada aagagga codbixinta; halka laba khariidadood isku raacaan waxay ku saaran yihiin isla khadka, halka ay kala tagaanna soo jeedimuhu dhab ahaan way kala duwan yihiin.`},share:{button:`La wadaag aragtidan`,heading:`La wadaag aragtidan`,copy:`Koobi link-ga`,copied:`La koobiyay`,help:`Link-gani wuxuu qabsadaa khariidaddaada hadda, dul-saarrada, iyo aragtida.`,open_heading:`Fur link la wadaagay`,open_placeholder:`Ku dhaji link la wadaagay…`,open_btn:`Fur`,err_empty:`Ku dhaji link la wadaagay`,err_invalid:`Ma aha link la wadaagay oo sax ah`},tip:{total_votes:`wadarta codadka`,inperson_votes:`codad qof-ahaaneed`,ed_total:`Wadarta degmada: {n} codad`,ed_total_eday:`Wadarta degmada: {n} (maalinta doorashada)`,poll:`Goob #{id}`,ucp_pct:`UCP {u}%`,ndp_pct:`NDP {n}%`,unassigned:`(aan loo qoondayn)`,where_in:`gudaha {community}`,where_near:`agagaarka {community}`,note_sparse:`Aag dad yar ku nool — codad yar oo halkan laga dhiibtay awgood, midabku wuxuu u dhowaadaa saldhigga dhexdhexaadka ah ee khariidadda.`,note_no_votes:`Cod lama diiwaan-gelin halkan, sidaa darteed aaggani wuxuu muujiyaa midabka dhexdhexaadka ah ee khariidadda.`,no_one_title:`Halkan qofna kuma codeeyo`,no_one_body:`Qaybin codbixin ma daboosho meeshan — qofna lama diiwaan-gelin inuu halkan ku nool yahay ama ku codeeyo, sidaa darteed waxay sii ahaanaysaa midabka dhexdhexaadka ah ee khariidadda.`,flag_link:`Guji si aad u soo dhoweyso`},miller:{locked_hint:`Waxba oo ku jira xariiqdan gudaheeda ma dhaqaaqaan Talada 5 hoosteeda.`,title:`Talada 5(d): kursiga miyiga ee dib loo soo celinayo`,body:`Garsoore Dallas Miller, guddoomiyaha guddida, wuxuu qoray in haddii Golaha Sharci-dejintu aanu aqbalin luminta laba riding oo miyi ah, ay tahay inuu 89 kursi ka dhigo 91 oo uu dib u soo celiyo. Tani waa meesha keliya ee uu u magacaabay kursi dib loo soo celiyay: riding inta badan ka kooban Clearwater County iyo galbeedka Mountain View County, oo leh xaaladda q. 15(2) (xeerka u oggolaanaya riding ballaadhan oo fog inuu yeesho dad aad uga yar celceliska). Wuxuu codsaday in laga fiirsado, ma aha in la waajibiyo. Muuqaalku waa qiyaas: Clearwater County iyo qaybta Mountain View County ee ku jirtay riding-ka Rimbey-Rocky Mountain House-Sundre ee 2019. Wuxuu gebi ahaanba ku yaal woqooyiga Airdrie, mana qaato dhul ka mid ah riding ay ilaaliyaan shuruudaha (a) ama (b). Meel uma magacaabin kursiga labaad.`,a:{title:`Talada 5(a): isbeddel ma jiro Airdrie ilaa koonfurta`,body:`Talada 5 ee guddoomiyuhu waxay leedahay soo celinta labada kursi ee miyiga waa inaanay taaban riding kasta oo Airdrie ku jira, ama leh dhul ka koonfureeya xadka koonfureed ee magaalada Airdrie, marka laga reebo Drumheller-Stettler. Taasi waa {n} riding, oo kursi kasta oo Calgary ah ku jiro, oo ay tahay inay khariidadda inta badan la mid noqdaan khad khad. Airdrie iyo Calgary waa halka guddidu ugu kala qaybsanaanta badnayd; shuruuddani waxay u haysaa sidii inta badan u sawirtay.`},b:{title:`Talada 5(b): isbeddel ma jiro waqooyiga Edmonton`,body:`Talada 5 waxay leedahay soo celinta labada kursi ee miyiga waa inaanay taaban riding kasta oo Edmonton ah oo ka waqooyi xiga Webiga North Saskatchewan. Taasi waa {n} riding oo ay tahay inay khariidadda inta badan la mid noqdaan. Beverly-Clareview waxay ka gudubtaa webiga; qiyaastii saddex meelood laba meel waxay ku taal xeebta waqooyi, sidaa darteed halkan ayaa lagu tiriyay.`},c:{title:`Talada 5(c): koonfurta Edmonton waxay ku noqonaysaa qabyada`,body:`Talada 5 waxay leedahay riding kasta oo Edmonton ah oo ka koonfureeya Webiga North Saskatchewan waa inuu ku noqdaa khariidadda qabyada ah ee guddida ee Oktoobar 2025, qabyadii ay faallo u daabacday ka hor kala-qaybsanaantii ugu dambaysay. Hal doorasho ayaa la oggol yahay: in Nisku lagu daro Edmonton-South East, si Leduc iyo Beaumont dib loogu celiyo hal riding. Xariiqdani waxay calaamadaynaysaa {n}-ka riding ee khariidadda inta badan ee isbeddeli lahaa. Ma muujinayso khadadka ku-meel-gaadhka ah laftooda.`}},flags:{"banff-town":{title:`Banff — magaalada laga gooyay beerta qaranka`,body:`Banff waxay ku taal gudaha beer qaran oo federaal ah, sida jasiirad yar oo dawlad hoose. Inta yar waxay magaalada la kooxaysaa Canmore — magaalada xigta ee Bow Valley — gudaha "Canmore-Kananaskis," waxayna beerta aan la degganayn uga tagtaa riding-ka sita magaca Banff. Xuduuddu waxay ku dhegtaa magaalada maxaa yeelay waa meesha keliya ee dad ku nool yihiin mayl badan. Waxay u egtahay khalad, laakiin waxay raacdaa juquraafi dhab ah.`},"banff-park":{title:`Waqooyiga Banff — "Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park"`,body:`“Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park” waa mid ka mid ah riding-yada ay inta yar ee guddidu soo jeedisay. Inta badan waa beer qaran oo dad yari ku nool yihiin; magaalada Banff waxay ku jirtaa riding-ka koonfurta. Inta yar waxay adeegsatay ka-reebista riding-yada fog ee Sharciga, qodobka 15(2), kaas oo u oggolaanaya ilaa afar riding inay yeeshaan dad aad uga yar celceliska. Inta badan ee guddidu waxay tan ugu yeedheen “dadaal niyad xun” warbixinta kama dambaysta ah. Hubintu way daciifisaa eeddaas: riding-ku wuu u qalmaa ka-reebista xitaa beerta la'aanteed. Akhris buuxa oo lagu sameeyay gudbinnada dadweynaha, 13 diiwaan ayaa codsada in beertu ku biirto riding-ka Rocky Mountain House, sidii inta yar u sawirtay, 2-na waxay codsadaan riding-ka Bow Valley ee inta badan. Xudunta riding-ka, Clearwater County, Rocky Mountain House iyo Sundre oo la isku daray, 36 ayaa codsada waxa inta yar sawirtay, midna waxa oo keliya inta badan sawirtay.`},"airdrie-split":{title:`Airdrie — afar loo kala qaybiyay`,body:`Koritaanka Airdrie iyo socdaalkeeda Calgary (qiyaastii 76% kuwa dibadda u socdaala) waxay saldhig u noqon kari lahaayeen hal kursi oo cusub oo aagga Airdrie ah. Inta yar ee guddidu taa beddelkeeda waxay magaalada u qaybisaa afar riding. Dadkeedu uma baahna taas. Akhris buuxa oo lagu sameeyay gudbinnada dadweynaha, 1 diiwaan ayaa codsada wax u eg kala-qaybinta inta yar, 10-na waxay codsadaan waxa inta badan sawirtay. Jeexitaan macnaheedu waa bulsho si khafiif ah loo kala jeexo ilaa aanay go'aamin karin kursiyadeeda midkood. Imtixaanka jeexitaanka ee hubinta, kala-qaybintani way gaadhi weysaa. Airdrie East marka laga reebo, oo haysa in ka badan kala badh magaalada, dadka Airdrie waa laga tiro badan yahay, laakiin imtixaanku wuxuu u baahan yahay in laga tiro badnaado qayb kasta. Imtixaannada caddaaladda ee codadka adeegsadaa ma arki karaan kala-qaybin sidan oo kale ah. Hubintu waxay cabbirtaa waxa ay sameyso, ma aha sababta loo sawiray. (Warbixinta farsamada, qaybta 5.3.2.)`},"nolan-hill-cochrane":{title:`Calgary-Nolan Hill–Cochrane`,body:`Socdaalka Cochrane ee Calgary wuxuu caddayn kari lahaa in lala lammaaneeyo magaalada. Laakiin xogta socdaalka shaqada ee 2021 waxay socdaalkaas ku kala firdhisaa magaalada oo dhan (qiyaastii saddex meelood meel shaqaalaha; kala badh waxay ka shaqeeyaan Cochrane gudaheeda), ma aha xagga Nolan Hill. Marinka cidhiidhiga ah ee inta yar ee guddida u gaadha xaafadda Nolan Hill wuxuu gaadhaa meel ka fog xogta. Wuxuu ku jiraa mid ka mid ah laba riding oo ay inta badan ee guddidu tidhi “waxay u muuqdaan kuwo yaab leh”. Akhris buuxa oo lagu sameeyay gudbinnada dadweynaha, diiwaan ma codsado in Cochrane lagu daro waqooyi-galbeedka Calgary, 7-na waxay codsadaan waxa inta badan sawirtay. Imtixaanka jeexitaanka ee hubintu ma calaamadeeyo: Cochrane way dhammaystiran tahay oo waxay ka dhigan tahay qiyaastii saddex meelood laba riding-ka, qiyaastii 34,000 qofna aad bay ugu yar tahay kursi iyada u gaar ah. (Warbixinta farsamada, qaybta 5.3.2.)`},"olds-airdrie-reach":{title:`Olds–Three Hills–Didsbury — gaadhitaanka Airdrie`,body:`Riding miyi ah oo isku haya Olds, Didsbury iyo Three Hills, iyo Crossfield, Irricana iyo Beiseker, wuxuu leeyahay taageero dadweyne. Akhris buuxa oo lagu sameeyay gudbinnada, 29 diiwaan ayaa codsada riding-kaas sidii inta yar ee guddidu u sawirtay, 6-na nooca inta badan. Wuxuu ku sii jiri kari lahaa bulshooyinkaas gudahooda. Nooca inta yar taa beddelkeeda wuxuu koonfur u gaadhaa cidhifka waqooyi ee Airdrie, taas oo aanay dadku u baahnayn. Diiwaan ma xuso gaadhistaas. Waa qayb ka mid ah sida kala-qaybinta afarta-dhinac ee Airdrie u shaqayso: xariijin dad yari ku nool yihiin oo magaalada ah, qiyaastii 350 qof, ayaa gala riding miyi ah oo weyn. Imtixaanka jeexitaanka ee hubinta laftiisa, kala-qaybinta Airdrie ma aha jeexitaan. (Warbixinta farsamada, qaybta 5.3.2.)`},chestermere:{title:`Chestermere — u kala qaybsan laba riding`,body:`Socdaalka culus ee Chestermere ee Calgary (86% kuwa dibadda u socdaala) wuxuu taageeri kari lahaa in magaalada la isku hayo oo loo dhowaado Calgary. Inta yar ee guddidu taa beddelkeeda waxay jeex koonfureed gelisaa riding Calgary ah oo aanay la wadaagin dugsiyo ama gaadiid dadweyne, jeexaasina wuu ku dhacaa imtixaanka dadka. Akhris buuxa oo lagu sameeyay gudbinnada dadweynaha, 3 diiwaan ayaa codsada xidhiidh Calgary ah, sidii inta yar u sawirtay, 6-na waxay codsadaan waxa inta badan sawirtay. Hubintu jeexa waxay u tirisaa kala-qaybin bulsho oo khafiifisa codka Chestermere. Kuma dhibcayn imtixaanka jeexitaanka. (Warbixinta farsamada, qaybta 5.8.4; hubinta sababaha, imtixaanka 5.)`},"red-deer":{title:`Red Deer — riding-yada hybrid-ka ah`,body:`Xidhiidhada Red Deer ee Blackfalds, Sylvan Lake, Lacombe iyo Innisfail waxay kooxayn kari lahaayeen magaalooyinkaas. Inta yar ee guddidu taa beddelkeeda waxay qaybo magaalada laftigeeda ah ku dartaa riding-yo ay magaalooyinkaasi hoggaamiyaan, taas oo khafiifisa codka magaalada Red Deer. Akhris buuxa oo lagu sameeyay gudbinnada dadweynaha, 1 diiwaan ayaa codsada wax sidaas u eg: warqad codsanaysa in magaalada loo kala qaybiyo “3-4 riding oo kala gooni ah” oo leh magaalooyin u dhow. 20 ayaa codsada laba riding oo magaalada gudaheeda ah, sidii inta badan u sawirtay.`},"st-albert":{title:`St. Albert — qaabab iska tartamaya`,body:`Nooca St. Albert ee khariidad kastaa wuxuu ku salaysnaan karaa sabab macquul ah. Akhris buuxa oo lagu sameeyay gudbinnada dadweynaha, diiwaan ma codsado isbeddelka inta yar ee guddida (qayb magaalada ah oo gasha Lac Ste. Anne-Parkland), midna ma codsado isbeddelka inta badan. 22 ayaa codsada in la hayo qaabka labada khariidadoodba hayaan: hal riding oo magaalada gudaheeda ah iyo mid lala wadaago Sturgeon County. Gudbinnadu calaamad cad uma bixiyaan labada khariidadood midkood halkan.`},"calgary-zone-a-packing":{title:`Waqooyi & bari Calgary — degmooyin ka weyn, calaamad urursi ma jirto`,body:`Inta badan ee guddidu tan erayo ayay ku kicisay (warbixinta kama dambaysta, bb. 10 iyo 63); hubintu tiro ayay ku dhejisay. Waqooyiga iyo bariga Calgary (“Aagga A” ee hubinta, waqooyi iyo bari ka xiga Webiga Bow), riding-yada khariidadda inta yar celcelis ahaan waxay leeyihiin qiyaastii 11.5% dad ka badan celceliska gobolka, marka loo eego 2.8% khariidadda inta badan. Sidaa darteed warqad codbixineed kasta oo halkaas ah wax yar ayay ka miisaan yar tahay. Taasi waa natiijo ku saabsan sinnaanta dadka. Ma buuxiso imtixaanka urursiga ee hubinta. Urursi macnaheedu waa codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi oo lagu cufo riding-yo yar oo uu ku guulaysto farqi aad u weyn. Codadka 2023 NDP waxay ku guulaysan lahayd 8 ka mid ah 17-ka riding ee aagga, laakiin farqi ka hooseeya celceliska gobolka, imtixaankuna wuxuu u baahan yahay farqi aad uga sarreeya. Hubintu waxay cabbirtaa waxa khariidaddu sameyso, ma aha sababta. (Warbixinta farsamada, qaybta 5.3.1.)`}},text:{page_title:`Nooca qoraal ah — khariidadda Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,intro:`Kani waa nooca qoraalka ah ee baadhaha khariidadda ee hubinta. Wuxuu hayaa isla macluumaadka khariidadda muuqaalka ah, oo loo qoray akhristayaasha shaashadda. Wuxuu ka bilaabmaa xudduudaha ay hubintu calaamadeysay, kadibna wuxuu taxaa riding kasta iyo khariidadda saddexda ka mid ah ee leh. Khariidadda cusub ee 91-riding ah ee guddida talo-bixintu weli halkan kuma jirto, maxaa yeelay faylasheeda rasmiga ah ee khariidaddu dadweynaha looma bandhigin.`,link_map:`Fur khariidadda firfircoon`,link_report:`Akhri warbixinta oo dhan`,link_to_text:`Fur nooca qoraal ee la heli karo ee khariidaddan`,toc_heading:`Boggan`,toc_summary:`Soo-koobid gaaban`,toc_flagged:`Xudduudaha la calaamadeeyay`,toc_r5:`Aagagga Talada 5`,toc_directory:`Tusaha degmooyinka`,summary_heading:`Soo-koobid gaaban`,summary_p1:`Baadhuhu wuxuu muujiyaa saddex khariidadood oo riding-yada Alberta ah: khariidadda inta yar ee guddida, khariidaddeeda inta badan, iyo khariidadda 2019, oo maanta la isticmaalo. Ma muujiyo khariidadda 91-riding ah ee guddida talo-bixinta, tan hor taal Golaha Sharci-dejinta. Natiijooyinka ku-meel-gaadhka ah ee hubinta ee khariidaddaas waxay ku jiraan bogga ugu weyn.`,summary_p2:`Shan imtixaan oo qaab-dhismeed ayaa eega oo keliya khadadka, natiijooyin doorasho la'aan. Waxa la qoray 24 iyo 25 Abriil, ka dib socodsiinno tijaabo ah oo lagu sameeyay xudduudo qiyaas ah laakiin ka hor intaan faylasha rasmiga ahi imanin. Afar ka mid ah shanta waxay khariidadda inta yar barbar dhigaan khariidadda inta badan, sidaa darteed waxay sharxaan sida ay labaduba u kala duwan yihiin. Ma aha gudbid ama ku-dhac khariidadda inta badan. Khariidadda inta yar waxay khariidadda inta badan kaga duwan tahay afar ka mid ah shan barbardhig. Imtixaanno gooni ah ayaa adeegsada codad oo khariidad kasta barbar dhiga 1,010,000 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray isagoon cod arkin.`,summary_p3:`Hoos, sagaal xudduudood oo ay hubintu calaamadeysay ayaa lagu sharxay, kadibna riding kasta ayaa la taxay. Boggani wuxuu sharxaa waxa cabbirraadu muujiyaan. Ma gaadho gunaanad sharci oo ku saabsan khariidad kasta.`,flagged_heading:`Xudduudaha la calaamadeeyay`,flagged_lead:`Hubintu waxay calaamadeysay sagaal xudduudood. Qaar waxay u muuqdaan kuwo yaab leh laakiin waxay raacaan juquraafi dhab ah. Kuwo kale ayaa ka dhex muuqda cabbirrada hubinta laftigeeda, inkastoo midkoodna aanu buuxin imtixaankeeda rasmiga ah ee urursi ama jeexitaan. Mid kasta hoos ayaa lagu sharxay, iyadoo la raacinayo qayb ka mid ah warbixinta farsamada meesha ay khusayso. Tirinta gudbinnada dadweynaha waxay ka timaadaa akhris buuxa oo lagu sameeyay dhammaan 1,688-ka diiwaan ee dadweynaha: 1,339 gudbin qoraal ah iyo 349 bandhig dhegaysi. Wakiillo AI ah ayaa akhriyay iyagoo ka shaqaynaya hagitaanka qoraaga. Tirintu waa diiwaanno, ma aha dad, warqad olole ahna waxa la tiriyaa mar kasta oo la diray.`,r5_heading:`Aagagga Talada 5`,r5_lead:`Markii dawladdu khariidadda u dhiibtay guddi MLA-yo ah, waxay soo xigatay Talada 5 ee guddoomiyaha guddida. Taladaasi waxay u dejisaa afar shuruudood khariidad 91-kursi ah. Saddex ka mid ahi waxay magacaabaan riding-yo ku jira khariidadda inta badan. Aag kasta hoos ayaa lagu sharxay, iyadoo la raacinayo riding-yada khariidadda inta badan ee uu daboolo.`,r5_districts:`Degmooyinka khariidadda inta badan ee aaggan:`,directory_heading:`Tusaha degmooyinka`,directory_lead:`Shaxdani waxay taxdaa magac kasta oo riding ah oo ku jira saddexda khariidadood midkood, sida alifbeetada. Magac kasta waxay muujisaa inuu ku jiro khariidadda inta yar, khariidadda inta badan iyo khariidadda 2019. Magacyadu way ku kala duwan yihiin khariidadaha, sidaa darteed safaf qaar waxay ka muuqdaan oo keliya hal ama laba. Shaxdu waxay bixisaa magac kasta, khariidadaha leh, iyo wadarta codadka 2023 ee riding-ka iyadoo la tirinayo dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta. Tirooyinka dadka iyo natiijooyinka imtixaannada, eeg warbixinta buuxda.`,directory_totals_note:`Tiro kastaa waa wadarta codadka 2023 ee riding-ka ee khariidaddaas, iyadoo la tirinayo dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta. Elections Alberta waxay warqadaha codbixinta hore, kuwa guurguura iyo kuwa gaarka ah u soo sheegtaa oo keliya riding kasta oo 2023 ah. Sidaa darteed hubintu waxay ku kala firdhisaa aagagga codbixinta ee riding-kaas iyadoo la raacayo saamiga codadka maalinta doorashada ee aag kastaa dhiibtay. Wadarta riding kasta oo hore sidaa darteed waxay la mid tahay natiijada rasmiga ah, laakiin sida ay ugu kala qaybsanto riding-yada cusub waa qiyaas. Xeer cusub, xeerka P, oo aan weli la qaadan, qaar ka mid ah si kale ayuu u kala qaybin lahaa; diiwaanka buuxa ayaa bixiya natiijooyinkiisa. Xariiq (—) macnaheedu waa in magaca riding-ku aanu ku jirin khariidaddaas.`,col_district:`Degmo`,col_minority:`Soo jeedinta inta-yar`,col_majority:`Soo jeedinta inta-badan`,col_2019:`Khariidadda rasmiga ah`,present_yes:`Haa`,present_no:`Maya`,methodology_note:`Boggani waa u dhigma khariidadda firfircoon oo go’an oo qoraal-kaliya ah. Waxaa laga dhisay isla xogta degmooyinka iyo isla calaamadaynta xudduudaha.`,skip_to_main:`U bood nuxurka ugu weyn`,back_to_map:`Ku noqo khariidadda firfircoon`}},feedback:{nav_link:`Dir jawaab-celin`,page_title:`Dir jawaab-celin`,meta_description:`La wadaag sax, su’aal, ama soo jeedin ku saabsan Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta.`,heading:`Dir jawaab-celin`,intro:`Ma aragtay khalad, su’aal ma qabtaa, ama ma rabtaa inaad soo jeediso hagaajin? Tani waxay si toos ah u gaadhaysaa qoraaga. Magaca iyo iimaylka waa ikhtiyaari — kaliya ka tag iimayl haddii aad jeclaan lahayd jawaab.`,name_label:`Magaca`,name_optional:`ikhtiyaari`,name_placeholder:`Magacaaga`,email_label:`Iimayl`,email_optional:`ikhtiyaari`,email_placeholder:`you@example.com`,email_hint:`Kaliya waxaa loo isticmaalaa in laguugu jawaabo. Marna lama wadaago, marnana lagama daro liis kasta.`,message_label:`Fariin`,message_required:`loo baahan yahay`,message_placeholder:`Maxaad noo sheegi lahayd?`,submit:`Dir jawaab-celin`,submitting:`Waa la dirayaa…`,success_title:`Mahadsanid`,success_body:`Jawaab-celintaada waa la helay. Haddii aad ka tagtay cinwaan iimayl ah oo fariintaaduna u baahan tahay jawaab, waad maqli doontaa.`,send_another:`Mid kale dir`,error_empty:`Fadlan geli fariin ka hor inta aanad dirin.`,error_rate:`Waxaad dhawaan dirtay fariimo dhowr ah. Fadlan isku day mar kale wax yar ka dib.`,error_generic:`Wax baa qaldamay markii la dirayay jawaab-celintaada. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqad gudaheed.`,privacy_note:`Fariintaada si ammaan ah ayaa loogu kaydiyaa Canada waxaana loo isticmaalaa kaliya in lagu hagaajiyo hubintan. Eeg {privacy} faahfaahin.`,privacy_link_text:`siyaasadda asturnaanta`,back_to_report:`Ku noqo warbixinta`,back_to_map:`Ku noqo baadhaha khariidadda`},pages:{explainers:{head_title:`Afar iyo Tobanka Sharraxaad · Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,head_description:`Afar iyo toban sharraxaad oo gaagaaban, mid natiijo kasta oo ka mid ah Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada ee Alberta, erayo fudud: jeexitaan, urursi, khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray, khaladka xeer-ilaaliyaha, caadooyinka iyo sharciga, iyo wax kale.`,back:`← Ku noqo hubinta`,site_label:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,h1:`Afar iyo Tobanka Sharraxaad`,meta:`Lifaaqyada A ilaa N · fikrad kasta hal`,standfirst:`Natiijo kasta oo hubinta ku jirta waxay ku xidhan tahay hal sharraxaad oo halkan ah. Sharraxaad kastaa waxay qaadataa hal fikrad. Waxay ka bilaabataa su'aal caddaalad ah oo akhriste weydiin karo. Fikradda waxay ku dhistaa hal tusaale oo fudud. Kadib waxay kugu celisaa natiijada, si aad tiradeeda keligaa u akhrido. Waxay ku dhammaataa waxa fikraddu <em>aanay</em> kuu sheegi karin. Ku akhri si kasta oo aad doonto.`,appendix_a:{heading:`Lifaaqa A — Waxa "jeexitaanku" ku sameeyo cod`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Codbixiyayaasha Airdrie weli way codeeyaan. Cidna kama qaadin warqadahooda. Sidee khad sawiriddiisu wax u 'khafiifin' kartaa?"`,p1:`Ka fikir magaalo 40,000 ah oo inta badan u codeysa Liin-dhanaan. Gobolka ku wareegsan inta badan wuxuu u codeeyaa Buluug. Magaalada sii riding iyada u gaar ah, aagga doorta hal MLA, waxayna doorataa MLA Liin-dhanaan ah. Taasi waa 40,000 qof, hal kursi, hal cod. Hadda magaalada u jar afar qaybood. Qayb kasta ku xidh jeex baadiye Buluug ah. Riding kasta oo cusub, 10,000 codbixiye oo magaalo ah waxay la kulmaan 30,000 codbixiye oo miyi ah. Liin-dhanaanku afartaba wuu waayaa. Isla codbixiyayaashii, isla warqadihii, kursi la'aan. Codbixiye keliya waxba ma waayin. Waxa <em>magaaladu</em> waysay waa awoodda ay cid ku doorato. Taasi waa jeexitaan. Ka soo horjeedkiisu waa urursi (Lifaaqa C): koox ku cuf riding-yo inta ugu yar ee aad karto, si ay kuwaas ugu guulaysato farqi aad u weyn oo aanay waxba kale helin.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 1. Airdrie waxay leedahay 85,805 qof. Khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu waxay u qaybisaa afar riding, dadka Airdrie-na waa laga tiro badan yahay saddex ka mid ah. Ta afraad, Airdrie East, waxay isku haysaa in ka badan kala badh magaalada. Sidaa darteed imtixaankayga jeexitaanka, oo aan u tiriyo mid goor dambe lagu daray halkii horay loo dejin lahaa, tani ma aha qaabka jeexitaanka. Airdrie East marka laga reebo, qaybuhu waxay sameeyaan wixii qaybaha magaaladu kor ku sameeyeen. Khariidadda kale ee isla guddidaas waxay muujisaa in laba riding ku filnaayeen in sharciga la buuxiyo.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> jeexitaanku wuxuu sharraxaa saamayn, ma aha ujeeddo. Qof ayaa laga yaabaa inuu rabay inuu daciifiyo codka magaalo. Ama xeerar kale ayaa laga yaabaa inay khariidadda cidhiidhiyeen. Khadadka keligood ma sheegi karaan kee.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-1">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 1 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_b:{heading:`Lifaaqa B — Qaabab yaab leh, iyo waxa ka-reebista riding-yada fog loogu talagalay`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Riding-yada oo dhammi way yaab badan yihiin. Maxay saddexdan qaab muhiim u yihiin?"`,p1:`Riding-yadu waxay raacaan webiyada, waddooyinka iyo khadadka magaalooyinka, sidaa darteed qaabab aan sinnayn waa caadi. Waxa aan raadiyaa waa xariiq qabanaysa shaqo aanu xeer caadi ahi sharxin. Xariijin cidhiidhi ah oo xaafad u jiidda riding fog. Gacan gaadha cidhifka magaalo. Xariiq lagu fidiyay dhul aanay ku dhowaad cidi ku noolayn. Sharciga Alberta wuxuu leeyahay xeer gaar ah, qodobka 15(2), ka-reebista riding-yada fog. Wuxuu u oggolaadaa ilaa afar riding inay yeeshaan dad aad uga yar sida caadiga ah. Guddiyadii hore waxay ku sharraxeen inuu u yahay riding-yo aad u waaweyn, dad yari ku nool yihiin, oo fog, inta badankood waqooyiga. Khariidadda inta yar waxay xariiqda hal riding ku fidisaa beer qaran. Inta badan ee guddida, guddoomiyuhu ku jiro, waxay ku eedeeyeen in tan loo sameeyay niyad xun, si riding-ku u qalmo: xeer loo qoray dad kala fog, oo loo adeegsaday in lagu ilaaliyo xariiq meel aanay ku dhowaad cidi ku noolayn. Hubintaydu waxay daciifisaa eeddaas. Riding-ku wuu u qalmaa xitaa fidinta la'aanteed.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 2. Inta badan ee guddida laftigeedu waxay calaamadeysay saddex qaab. Imtixaanno aan dan ku lahayn dagaalkaas ayaa xaqiijiya in qaababku yaab leeyihiin. Waxay sidoo kale daciifiyaan ujeeddada ay inta badani ku eedeysay.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> qaab yaab lihi waa su'aal, ma aha jawaab. Mid ka mid ah qaababkan wuxuu ka dambeeyaa macquul dhab ah oo mudan in la aqoonsado: goobta magaalada Banff waxa lala dhigay Canmore. Diidmada inta badan weli way taagan tahay. Waxa loo jeediyay xariiqda dhex marta beerta madhan, meelaynta goobta magaaladuna taas ma taabato.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-2">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 2 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_c:{heading:`Lifaaqa C — Urursi, tusaale saddex riding ah`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Riding-yada waaweyni codbixiyayaal badan ayay leeyihiin. Haddaba? Qof kastaa weli hal cod ayuu leeyahay."`,p1:`Qof kastaa wuu leeyahay. Laakiin cabbirka riding-ku waa tilmaan sida codadka loo kooxeeyay. Qaado 12,000 codbixiye: 7,000 Liin-dhanaan iyo 5,000 Buluug. U kala qaybi saddex riding oo 4,000 ah. Si siman u isku qas, Liin-dhanaanku saddexdaba wuu ku guulaystaa. Hadda dib u sawir. 4,000 codbixiye oo Liin-dhanaan ah geli hal riding, Liin-dhanaanku wuxuu ku guulaystaa 100 iyo 0. 3,000-ka codbixiye ee Liin-dhanaanka ah ee kale ku kala firdhi labada riding ee hadhay. 5,000-ka codbixiye ee Buluugga hadda labadaba way ku guulaystaan. Isla 12,000 codbixiye. Liin-dhanaanku weli ayuu ka badan yahay. Laakiin hadda Liin-dhanaanku wuxuu hayaa hal kursi, Buluuggu laba. Taasi waa urursi. Codadka hal dhinac waxa lagu tuulaa meel ay ku guulaystaan wax aad uga badan inta ay u baahan yihiin, codadka dheeraadka ahina way khasaaraan. Calaamadda la raadiyaa waa <em>cabbirka iyo qotada</em>. Riding-yada hal dhinac way waaweyn yihiin oo nabad bay yihiin. Kuwa dhinaca kale way khafiif yihiin oo dhow yihiin.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 3. Hal aag oo waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary ah, khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu waxay leedahay toddoba iyo toban riding. Celcelis ahaan waxay leeyihiin 11.5% dad ka badan celceliska gobolka. Riding-yada inta badan ee halkaas, oo lagu sawiray isla qolkii, celcelis ahaan waxay leeyihiin 2.8% ka badan. Taasi waa badhka cabbirka ee qaabka. Badhka kale waa maqan yahay. Codadka 2023 NDP waxay ku guulaysataa siddeed ka mid ah toddoba iyo tobanka, farqi ka hooseeya celceliska gobolka. Sidaa darteed imtixaankayga urursiga ma helo urursi.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> riding-yo waaweyni waxay sidoo kale ka iman karaan qiyaaso daacad ah oo ku saabsan koritaanka, ama bulsho isku haynteeda. Urursigu wuxuu ka tagaa riding-yo cabbir aan sinnayn leh. Sidoo kale dhowr doorasho oo aan dambi lahayn.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-3">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 3 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_d:{heading:`Lifaaqa D — Waxa MAD cabbiro, iyo sababta sharcigu u oggol yahay xad`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Leexashada dhexe ee buuxda ee dadka? Ma taasi waa hab qurux badan oo lagu yidhaahdo riding-yadu isku mid ma aha?"`,p1:`Ku dhowaad. Riding-yada oo dhammi ma hayn karaan tiro dad ah oo isku mid ah, maxaa yeelay bulshooyinku waxay yimaadaan cabbirro aan habboonayn. Leexashada dhexe ee buuxda, ama MAD, waxay weydiisaa hal su'aal oo fudud: celcelis ahaan, intee ayuu riding kastaa ka fog yahay qayb siman? Shaxaha dadka ee guddida laftigeeda, MAD-ka khariidadda inta badan waa 3,180. Taasi macnaheedu waa in riding-yadeedu celcelis ahaan qayb siman ka maqan yihiin qiyaastii 3,180 qof. MAD-ka khariidadda inta yar waa 4,707, sidaa darteed ka-maqnaanshaheedu waa qiyaastii hal iyo badh jeer. Sharcigu wuxuu u oggol yahay riding-yada inay kala duwanaadaan, xad gudihiis: ilaa 25% ka sarreeya ama ka hooseeya celceliska. Taasi waa sababta oo ah in bulshooyinka dhabta ah la isku hayo ay mudan tahay xoogaa sinnaan la'aan ah. U qaado sidii miisaaniyad. Qayb ka mid ah qaybta siman ayaad ku bixisaa si aad magaalooyinka u isku hayso oo khadadku macquul u ahaadaan. Taasi waa ujeeddada natiijada 4. Khariidadda inta yar waxay ku bixisaa 48% ka badan miisaaniyaddaas inta badan. Tirinta tirakoobka 2021, celceliska ka-maqnaanshaha labada khariidadood ku dhowaad waa isku mid. Natiijada 1-na waxay muujisaa in khariidadda inta yar <em>aanay</em> ku bixin in Airdrie la isku hayo.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 4. Labada khariidadood, riding-yada inta yar ayaa ka sii fog qayb siman. Taasi waa waxa keliya ee Sharcigu tiro ku dhejiyo. Khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray qaar waxa lagu xaddiday 12.5% ka sarreeya ama ka hooseeya celceliska. Khariidadahaas waxa la sawiray iyadoo aan hal cod la arkin (Lifaaqa F). Marka lagu cabbiro riding-ka dhexe, kala firdhinta inta yar way ka ballaadhan tahay 99 ka mid ah 100 kasta. Marka loo eego khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray ee loo oggolaaday 25%-ka buuxa ee sharciga, labada khariidadood ee guddidu way ka sinnaan badan yihiin ku dhowaad dhammaantood.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> sharcigu waxba kuma darajeeyo xadka gudihiisa. "Wax badan oo miisaaniyadda ka bixiyay" waa xusuus ku saabsan mudnaanta, ma aha jebin. Riding kasta oo labada khariidadoodba ku jira wuxuu ku jiraa sharciga gudihiisa.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-4">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 4 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_e:{heading:`Lifaaqa E — Raacidda khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka, iyo waxa aanay muujin karin`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Maxaa loo tiriyaa inta jeer ee xariiqda riding-ku raacdo xariiq magaalo ama degmo?"`,p1:`Maxaa yeelay kuwaasi waa khadadka dadku horeba u yaqaanaan. Marka xariiqda riding-ku ku teedsan tahay xariiqda magaalo, xariiqda cashuurta, xariiqda xaafadda iyo xariiqda doorashadu dhammaantood way isku mid noqdaan. Inta badan xariiqda dugsigana sidaas oo kale. Codbixiye wuu garan karaa riding-ka uu ku jiro khariidad la'aan. Imtixaanku wuxuu cabbiraa inta khadadka riding-yada khariidad kasta ah ee ku jira 500 mitir gudahood xariiq magaalo ama degmo, isagoo adeegsanaya xudduudaha Statistics Canada. Khariidadda 2019, oo ay sawirtay guddidii u dambaysay oo maanta la isticmaalo, waxay dhalisaa 75%. Khariidadda inta badan ee guddidu waxay dhalisaa 80%. Khariidadda inta yar waxay dhalisaa 72%. Labaduba waxay u dhow yihiin khariidadda 2019.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 5. Labada khariidadoodba waxay raacaan khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka heer caadi ah, oo u dhow ka khariidadda 2019. Imtixaankan, labada khariidadood lama kala garan karo.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> raacidda khadadka magaalooyinku waa caado, ma aha xeer. Sharcigu ugu yaraan ma dejiyo. Riding sidoo kale wuu ka tagi karaa xariiq magaalo sabab wanaagsan, sida xaafad dibadeed oo koray oo dhaafay xadka magaalada.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-5">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 5 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_f:{heading:`Lifaaqa F — Khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray, iyo sida boqolleyda loo akhriyo`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Malyuun khariidadood oo kombuyuutar ah? Boqolleyda jilitaan? Taasi maxay xitaa macnaheedu tahay?"`,p1:`Ma garan kartid in khariidadi caadi tahay iyo in kale adigoon ogayn sida caadigu u eg yahay. Khariidadaha doorashada, cidna marna ma aragto khariidadaha kale ee la sawiri lahaa. Sidaa darteed anigu waan sameeyay. Barnaamij kombuyuutar ayaa ka bilaabma khariidad sax ah. Kadib wuxuu sameeyaa silsilad dheer oo isbeddello yaryar oo bakhtiyaanasiib ah, mid kastaa sax yahay. Wuxuu isku daraa laba riding oo is-ag yaal, kadibna mar kale si kale u kala qaybiyaa. Taas wuxuu ku celiyaa 252,500 jeer, afar silsiladood oo kala gooni ah, 1,010,000 khariidadood guud ahaan. Barnaamijku marna ma arko cod inta uu sawirayo. Cidna ma doorbidi karo maxaa yeelay cidna ma arki karo. Taas oo keliya ayay "dhexdhexaad" halkan ka tidhaahdaa. Kadib waxaan qaataa khariidadda dhabta ah, dhibceeyaa, oo weydiiyaa: imisa ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray ayaa dhibcahan gaadha? Haddii 500,000 gaadhaan, khariidadda dhabta ahi waa caadi. Haddii 69 gaadhaan, khariidadda dhabta ahi waa nooca sawirkan oo kale soo saaro 69 jeer 1,010,000 isku day. Taasi waa boqolley: halka khariidadi kaga jirto khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Hal digniin. Khariidad kasta oo silsilad ku jirtaa waa isbeddel yar oo ka mid ah tii ka horreysay, sidaa darteed khariidadaha is-ag yaal ku dhowaad waa nuqullo. 1,010,000-ka khariidadood waxay u dhigmaan qiyaastii 1,000 khariidadood oo dhab ahaan kala gooni ah (qiyaas ahaan 900 ilaa 1,300, iyadoo ku xidhan cabbirka). Sidaa darteed darajada saxda ahi way ka saxnaan yar tahay sida ay u muuqato.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 6. Codka si sax ah 50-50 u kala qaybi, adigoo tirinaya warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023, oo tiri kursiyada UCP. Khariidadda inta badan ee guddidu waxay joogtaa boqolleyda 78aad: caadi. Khariidadda inta yar waxay joogtaa boqolleyda 99.99aad, ka fog dhammaan marka laga reebo qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 10,000. Oo keliya 69 ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ayaa UCP siiya kursiyo ka badan.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray riding kasta waxay ku hayaan tiro dad isku dhow iyo hal xabbo. Ma miisaamaan qodob kasta oo yar oo Sharciga ah oo guddi dhab ahi miisaamto. Sidaa darteed boqolleydu waxay cabbirtaa inta khariidadi ka fog tahay <em>sawir dhexdhexaad ah</em>, ma aha <em>khariidad kasta oo guddi sharci ahi sawiri karto</em>. Boqolleydu waa fogaan, ma aha xukun. Mana sheegto in riding-yada dhabta ah si bakhtiyaanasiib ah loo sawiro. Khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray waa oo keliya waxa khariidad dhab ah lagu barbar dhigo.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-6">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 6 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_g:{heading:`Lifaaqa G — Farqiga waxtarka, oo lagu sharraxay hal tusaale oo xisaabsan`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Hal tiro oo qabanaysa gerrymandering? Taasi aad bay u fududahay."`,p1:`Waa, xoogaa. Taasi waa sababta hubintan loogu dejiyay xariiq horay loo go'aamiyay, iyo sababta gaadhi waayiddeeda loo soo sheegay. Fikraddu: cod aan caawin in kursi lagu guulaysto waa "khasaaray". Taasi macnaheedu waa cod kasta oo la siiyay qof guuldarraystay, iyo codadka guuleystaha ee ka badan 50% iyo hal ee uu u baahnaa. Khariidad caddaalad ah labada xisbiba waxay khasaariyaan qiyaastii isla tiro. Farqiga waxtarku waa farqiga u dhexeeya codadka khasaaray ee labada xisbi, sidii saami ka mid ah dhammaan codadka. Ka soo qaad Liin-dhanaanku inuu ku guulaysto riding 100-cod ah 90 iyo 10. Liin-dhanaanku wuxuu u baahnaa 51, sidaa darteed wuxuu khasaariyay 39. Buluuggu wuxuu khasaariyay dhammaan 10-ka, maxaa yeelay mid kastaa wuxuu u tagay guuldarraystaha. Khariidadaha la urursaday iyo kuwa la jeexay waxay ka dhigaan hal xisbi inuu khasaariyo wax badan, riding ka dib riding. Boggan, farqi togan wuxuu doorbidaa UCP. Xariiqdayda Alberta waa qiyaastii +4.1%. Oo keliya 5% 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray ayaa dhaafa.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 7. Iyadoo la tirinayo warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023, khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu waxay leedahay farqi +4.0% ah, boqolleyda 94.5aad. Taasi way ka hoosaysaa xariiqdayda, boqolleyda 95aad, xeer aan horay u qoray. Sidaa darteed waxa loo soo sheegaa mid aan gaadhin. Dhibcaha dhammaan warqadaha waxa lagu bixiyaa natiijada 7.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> farqiga waxtarku khariidad dhan wuxuu ku cufaa hal tiro. Hal tiro ma kala sooci karto gerrymander iyo juquraafi aan sinnayn. Taasi waa sababta hubintani u adeegsato afar cabbir iyo xariiq horay loo go'aamiyay. Gaadhi waayiddana diiwaanka ayay ku haysaa.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-7">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 7 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_h:{heading:`Lifaaqa H — Khaladka xeer-ilaaliyaha, erayo fudud`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Fursad hal ka mid ah 570,000 ah oo ah in khariidaddani dambi la'aan tahay. Taasi waa natiijada, sax?"`,p1:`Maya. Farqigu aad buu muhiim u yahay oo magac ayuu leeyahay. Waa kan waxa tiradu sheegto. <em>Haddii</em> sawir dhexdhexaad ahi sameeyay khariidadda Alberta, khariidad la mid ah khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu waxay soo bixi lahayd meel u dhexeysa qiyaastii hal mar 20,000 isku day iyo hal mar 570,000. Xadku wuxuu ku xidhan yahay sida moodelka tirakoobka loo dejiyo. Wuxuu tiriyaa warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023. Waa qiyaas moodel, ma aha xad. Khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray si dhif ah ama marna ma gaadhaan intaas fog, sidaa darteed tiradu waxay ka timaadaa moodel tirakoob, ma aha tirin. Waana fursadda caddaynta haddii khariidaddu dambi la'aan tahay. Ma aha fursadda ay khariidaddu dambi la'aan tahay, marka caddaynta la helo. Isku qasidda labadaas waa khaladka xeer-ilaaliyaha. Tusaale caadi ah: tuhmane ayaa la mid ah astaan DNA oo laga helay goob dambi. Hal qof oo ka mid ah malyuun ayaa leh astaantaas. Ma jirtaa fursad hal ka mid ah malyuun ah oo ah inuu dambi la'aan yahay? Maya. Magaalo toban milyan ah, qiyaastii toban qof ayaa la mid ah. DNA-da oo keliya, tuhmanuhu waa mid ka mid ah toban. Taasi waa fursad 90% ah oo ah in <em>qof kale</em> yahay isha. Inta caddayntu dhif tahay, haddii uu dambi la'aan yahay, ma aha fursadda uu dambi la'aan yahay. Waxaad sidoo kale u baahan tahay inaad ogaato inta hab oo dambi la'aan ah ee caddayntu ku iman karto.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 8. Hubintu waxay sheegtaa tirada ay difaaci karto: inta ay khariidaddu dhif ka tahay sawir dhexdhexaad ah. Way diiddaa beddelka tiradaas ka dhigi lahaa xukun.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> diidmada khaladkaas waxay hubinta ka qaadaysaa jumladdeeda ugu la xigan karo, kharashkaasina waa ula kac. Dhifnaantu waa caddayn. Ma aha caddayn go'an oo ujeeddo ah, marnana ma noqoto caddayn go'an.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-8">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 8 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_i:{heading:`Lifaaqa I — Waxa muunad-qaaduhu yahay, iyo sababta beddelkiisu muhiim u yahay`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Jilitaankaagii waxaad ku hubisay jilitaan kale? Sidee taasi hubin u tahay?"`,p1:`Maxaa yeelay labada barnaamij si kala duwan ayaa loo dhisay. Natiijo ka timaadda dabeecadaha gaarka ah ee barnaamij, halkii ay ka iman lahayd khariidadda, inta badan kama badbaado beddelka barnaamijka. Barnaamij kasta oo khariidado sawira wuxuu leeyahay dabeecado gaar ah. Barnaamijka khariidadaha u sawira daraasad sidan oo kale ah waxa loo yaqaan sampler. Kan caadiga ah, ReCom, waxa la og yahay inuu u janjeero riding-yo cufan oo nidaamsan. Aragti ahaan, taasi waxay khariidad dhab ah oo kala fidsan ka dhigi kartaa mid u muuqata mid ka xad-dhaaf badan sida ay tahay. Sidaa darteed matoorka ayaan beddelay. Kan cusubi riding-yada si kale ayuu u koriyaa, "kaymo" bakhtiyaanasiib ah halkii uu ka korin lahaa "geedo", gudahana si kale ayuu u dhaqmaa. Si dadweyne ah ayaan u diiwaangeliyay (OSF he53s) ka hor intaanu sawirin khariidad ka mid ah socodka la tiriyo. Oo keliya imtixaan barnaamij oo 500 tallaabo ah ayaa ka horreeyay. Tirooyinkiisa bilowga ee bakhtiyaanasiibka ahi waxay ka yimaadeen il dadweyne oo qof kasta hubin karo. Haddii meesha fog ee khariidadda inta yar ay ka timid dabeecadaha matoorka hore, matoorka labaad ayaa dhaqaajin lahaa. Wuxuu dhaqaaqay wax ka yar hal dhibic boqolley cabbir kasta. Taasi waxay buuxisaa xeerka aan horay u dejiyay ee natiijada loogu yeedho adag. Laakiin socodku wuxuu sawiray khariidado la isticmaali karo oo aad uga yar intii aan qorsheeyay. Sidaa darteed waxaan u akhriyaa mid aan go'aan lahayn cabbirkan socodka. Intaas fog, jajab dhibic ah waa isbeddel weyn. Hubintu waxay muujisaa in khariidaddu fog tahay, ma aha si sax ah inta ay le'eg tahay. Waxaan sidoo kale soo sheegayaa hubin aan la socodsiin karin. Waxay tijaabin lahayd in qaababka aan caadiga ahayn ee Act I ay yihiin waxa keena kursiyada dheeraadka ah. Taasi waxay u baahan tahay khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray oo gaadha tirada kursiyada khariidadda inta yar, socodka gooni ah ee 5,000-ka khariidadoodna midna ma laha. Sidaa darteed sheegashadaas lama tijaabin, mana sheegto.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 9. Saddex hab ayaan isku dayay si aan natiijadayda laftayda u burburiyo. Mid wuxuu tilmaamay isla jihada laakiin aad buu u yaraa si uu go'aan u gaadho. Mid wuu adkaystay. Mid lama socodsiin karin.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> hubinnada noocan ahi waxay meesha ka saari karaan natiijo uu qalabku sameeyay. Ma muujin karaan in qof naqshadeeyay khariidadda. Khariidad dhab ahaan xad-dhaaf ahi dhab ahaan waa xad-dhaaf, wax kasta oo soo saaray ha ahaadeen.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-9">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 9 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_j:{heading:`Lifaaqa J — Sababta derisyada isku si u codeeyaa u khiyaanayn karaan tirakoobka fudud`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Imtixaan ayaa bixiyay p = 0.0024 oo adigu waad tuurtay? Taasi waxay u egtahay qarin natiijo."`,p1:`Ka soo horjeedka: waxay saxdaa mid. Qiimaha p wuxuu sheegaa inta jeer ee nasiib keligii bixin lahaa natiijo intaas xoog leh. Yar macnaheedu waa dhif. Imtixaanno badan waxay u qaataan in xabbad kasta oo xog ahi gooni tahay, sida tuurista lacag birta ah. Aagagga codbixintu ma aha. Aagagga is-ag yaal waxay wadaagaan dakhli, taariikh iyo hab nololeed, isku si ayayna u codeeyaan. In 100 aag oo noocaas ah loo qaato 100 tuuris oo kala gooni ah waxay la mid tahay in 20 xabbadood oo macluumaad dhab ah mid kasta 5 jeer la tiriyo. Waxay ka dhigtaa isku-beegan mid u muuqda wax aan suurtagal ahayn marka uu yahay oo keliya wax aan caadi ahayn. Xalku waa saldhig ka caddaalad badan, sawir ah waxa nasiib keligii bixin lahaa, oo derisyada isku haya. Waxaad isku qastaa <em>baloogyo</em> aagag is-ag yaal ah, ma aha aag kasta keligii, oo mar kale su'aasha weydiisaa. Imtixaankayga swing-zone wuxuu weydiiyay in aagagga codbixinta ee tartanka adag leh la geliyay riding-yo qaab xisbiyeed. Wuxuu u muuqday muhiim saldhigga fudud (p = 0.0024). Kan ka caddaaladda badan wuxuu u muuqday caadi (p ≈ 0.19). Imtixaanka ka caddaaladda badani waa mid ceeriin: ku dhowaad dhammaan aagagga isbeddelku waxay ku dhacaan hal balooq, sidaa darteed wax yar ayuu sheegi karaa dhinac kasta. Laakiin marka la ogaado in saldhigga fudud uu ku dhisan yahay malayn been ah, jawaabtiisu ma taagnaan karto. Sidaa darteed natiijada waan hawlgab dhigay.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 10. Waxay leedahay saddex qodob oo aan caawin sheekada hubinta: laba ka mid ah qalabkayga oo la hawlgab dhigay, iyo hal imtixaan, oo goor dambe lagu daray, oo khariidadda inta yar gudubtay.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> saxitaanku wuxuu muujiyaa in calaamadda ku saabsan doorashooyinka khadadka gaarka ah aan lagu kalsoonaan karin. Waxba kama sheego natiijooyinka khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Kuwaasi marna uma qaadan in aag codbixineed kastaa gooni yahay.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-10">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 10 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_k:{heading:`Lifaaqa K — Sida sabab la sheegay loogu hubiyo xogta dadweynaha`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Guddi-xubnuhu waa khubarrada. Yaa ah hubin si ay u qiimeyso sababahooda?"`,p1:`Cid gaar ah ma aha, taasina waa ujeeddada. Hubintu uma baahna gelitaan gaar ah. Warbixinta inta yar ee guddidu waxay sheegtaa in dadka Cochrane ay "si fudud ugu dhex socdaan" Calgary. Shaxaha bilaashka ah ee socdaalka shaqada ee Statistics Canada waxay muujiyaan in qiyaastii saddex meelood meel shaqaalaha Cochrane ay u socdaalaan Calgary, halka qiyaastii kala badh ay ka shaqeeyaan Cochrane. Taasi waa xidhiidh dhab ah. Laakiin waxba kama sheegayso xariijinta Nolan Hill ee Calgary ee riding-ka loo sawiray inuu qaato. Warbixintu waxay sheegtaa in dadka miyigu ay "dugsi u tagaan" magaalada. Red Deer iyo Sylvan Lake taasi qayb ahaan way adkaysataa. Labadu waxay leeyihiin qaybo dugsiyo dadweyne oo kala duwan, laakiin hal qayb Katoolig ah ayaa labadaba u adeegta. 54% shaqaalaha Sylvan Lake ee magaalada uga baxa shaqo waxay u tagaan Red Deer. Hubin kastaa waxay raacdaa isla habka. Qaado sababta la sheegay. Hel xogta dadweynaha ee muujin lahayd. Kadib weydii in <em>xariiqda gaarka ah ee la sawiray</em> ay tahay xariiqda xogtu taageerto. Lix sababood ayaan hubiyay, tiriskuna wuxuu ku xidhan yahay xeerka. Marka lagu qiimeeyo sababaha inta yar sheegtay, midna lagama hor iman, afarna qayb ahaan oo keliya ayaa la taageeray. Imtixaan gooni ah oo ah in dadku xariiqda qasbay, afar ka mid ah khadadka lama qasbin. Xidhiidhku waa dhab. Xariiqdu ma aha tan xidhiidhku tilmaamayo.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> sabab ku dhacda hubinta waxay muujisaa in sababta <em>la sheegay</em> aanay ku habboonayn. Ma muujin karto tan dhabta ah. Daryeel la'aan iyo marmarsiiyo waxay ka tagaan isla waraaqo.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-11">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 11 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_l:{heading:`Lifaaqa L — Sida guddi-xubnaha loo doorto, iyo waxa soo jeedintu kuu sheegto`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Guddi-xubnaha ay dawladdu soo jeedisay ayaa sawiray khariidadda doorbidaysa dawladda. Kiisku waa xidhan yahay, sax?"`,p1:`Ma xidhna. Ka bilow cidda qolka fadhida. Guddida Alberta waxa laga dhisaa soo jeedinno: guddoomiye, iyo xubno ay soo jeediyeen dhinaca dawladda iyo dhinaca mucaaradka. Markan Ra'iisul Wasaaruhu wuxuu soo jeediyay labada xubnood ee qoray warbixinta inta yar (Legislative Assembly of Alberta, ogeysiiska 28 Maarso 2025). Naqshaddu waxay filaysaa aragtiyo xisbiyeed wayna isu dheellitirtaa. Waxay ku khamaaraysaa in qol isku dhafan uu ku heshiin doono hal khariidad oo uu difaaci karo. 1995 ilaa 2017 khamaarkii wuu shaqeeyay. Xitaa markii xubini diiday, guddi kastaa wuxuu Golaha u diray hal khariidad. Markan qolku wuxuu u kala qaybsamay sida ay u kala soo jeediyeen. Xubnaha dawladdu soo jeedisay ayaa sawiray khariidadda aad uga baxsan xadka khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Xidhiidhkaasi waa dhab waana mudan yahay in la diiwaangeliyo. Waxa kale oo uu si sax ah u yahay meesha ay tahay in fekerku ku joogsado. Xubin la soo jeediyay ma aha wakiil. Waxba oo diiwaanka hubintan ku jira ma muujiyaan in dawladdu amartay xubnaheeda, la shaqaysay, ama xitaa ogayd qaabka khariidaddooda ka hor intaan la gudbin. Kulankii 28 Oktoobar ee guddiga, MLA-yada kormeeray khariidadda cusub, Hoggaamiyaha Mucaaradku wuxuu ku eedeeyay in khariidadaha lagu soo bandhigay dhegaysiyada guddida ay "dawladdu samaysay" oo ay la mid ahaayeen qaabka khariidadaha inta yar (qoraalka kulanka guddiga, b. CEB-71). Taasi waa eedeyn, mana hubin. Taariikhdu waxay ka buuxdaa xubno la soo jeediyay oo niyad jabiyay dadkii soo jeediyay. Xidhiidhku wuxuu kiciyaa su'aal. Kama jawaabi karo. Imtixaannadayduna waxay ka hor yimaadeen inta badan sidoo kale, meesha xogtu u socotay. Taasi waa waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in labada dhinac si isku mid ah loo cabbiro.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 12. Kala qaybsanaanta ayaa ah waxa ka dhex muuqda. Cidda cid soo jeedisay waa calaamad su'aal, ma aha jawaabta.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> cidda magacaabis samaysay waa xaalad, marna ma aha caddayn go'an. In loo qaato caddayn go'an waa isla khaladkii Lifaaqa H, oo dhar siyaasadeed la xidhay.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-12">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 12 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_m:{heading:`Lifaaqa M — Sida Sharcigu u shaqeeyo, laga bilaabo guddida ilaa guddiga`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Sidee Golaha Sharci-dejintu u qabsan karaa dib-u-sawirka? Khariidadda guddidu miyaanay ahayn khariidadda?"`,p1:`Maya. Tani waa yaabka ay sheekada oo dhammi ku dhisan tahay. <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta hoostiisa, guddidu way soo jeedisaa, oo keliya Golaha, MLA-yada la doortay ee Alberta, ayaa go'aamiya. Warbixinta kama dambaysta ah ee guddidu waa talo, dhegaysiyo iyo wax walba. Saamayn sharci ma laha ilaa Goluhu khariidad sharci ka dhigo. Sharciguna xad kuma sameeyo waxa Goluhu taa beddelkeeda sameeyo. Ma jiro dood ugu yar iyo muddo ogeysiis. Ma jirto waajib ah in shaqada guddida la doorbido, iyo waajib ah in dhegaysiyo lagu qabto habraac kasta oo xiga. Waxba oo Sharciga ku jira kama joojiyaan Golaha inuu shaqada meel kale u diro. Taasi waa waxa Mooshinka Dawladda 37 sameeyay 21 Abriil 2026. Wuxuu abuuray guddiga: lix MLA, afar UCP iyo laba NDP. Talada 5 laftigeedu waxay soo jeedisay guddi MLA-yo ah oo xisbiyada oo dhan ka kooban, si loo hagaajiyo laba kursi. Mooshinka 37 wuxuu guddi noocaas ah u adeegsaday dib-u-sawir aad u ballaadhan. Maxaa yeelay guddigu wuxuu ka kooban yahay MLA-yo, go'aanku mar dambe kuma jirin gacmo madax-bannaan. Guddida talo-bixinta, guddi talo-bixineed oo uu guddigu magacaabay, ayaa sawiray khariidadda cusub. Guddigu wuxuu u diray Golaha 2 Noofembar 2026, MLA-yaduna waxay go'aamiyaan in ay sharci noqoto. Sida aan Sharciga u akhriyo, waxba kuma jiraan oo mamnuucaya waxan, maxkamadna go'aan kama gaadhin. Wareeg kasta tan iyo 1995, Goluhu wuu ka tagay khadadka guddiyada, isagoo beddelay ugu badnaan magacyo yar. Is-celintaas, ma aha Sharciga, ayaa gacmaha siyaasiyiinta ka fogaysay qalinka. Sharciga laftiisu wuxuu Golaha u oggolaadaa inuu ansixiyo khariidad "wax-ka-beddel leh". 1992 ma jirin hal warbixin guddi oo la sharfo: guddidu way xayirantay, shan xubnood oo gudbiyay shan warbixinood, guddi MLA-yo ahna ayaa sawiray khariidadda. Bogga Sharciga ayaa sheekadaas sheega.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 13. Guddidu waxay dhegaysiyo ku qabatay lix iyo toban bulshadood. Hay'addii beddeshay kuma qasbanayn inay qabato midna, midna kama qabanin khariidadda. Sida aan Sharciga u akhriyo, midkood lama mamnuucin.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> sharraxaaddani waxay sheegtaa waxa sharcigu oggol yahay. In dadka Alberta ay aqbalaan waxa sharcigu oggol yahay iyo in kale waa su'aal siyaasadeed. Imtixaannada Noofembar ee bogga ugu weyn waxa loo dhisay inay wargeliyaan.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-13">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 13 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},appendix_n:{heading:`Lifaaqa N — Caadooyinka iyo sharciga, iyo sida caado u baabbaqdo`,confusion:`<em>Su'aasha:</em> "Haddii siyaasiyiinta oo sawira riding-yadooda ay jebiso caadadeena doorasho ee ugu qoto dheer, sidee ay sharci u noqon kartaa?"`,p1:`Maxaa yeelay dastuurka Kanadu wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa laba nooc oo xeerar ah. Mid waa sharci. Waa qoran yahay, maxkamad ayaa go'aan ka gaadhi karta, garsoorayaashuna way dhaqan geliyaan. Ka kale waa caado: xeerar aan qornayn oo dhaqanka siyaasadeed ah. Dhab ahaan way xidhaan, laakiin maxkamad ma dhaqan geliso. Maxkamadda Sare waxay farqiga ku sharraxday Patriation Reference ee 1981. Maxkamad waxay <em>aqoonsan</em> kartaa caado haddana way diidi kartaa inay <em>dhaqan geliso</em>. Caadooyinka waxa ilaaliya siyaasadda: mucaaradka, saxaafadda iyo codbixiyayaasha, ma aha garsoorayaasha. Alberta, khariidadda guddi madax-bannaan waxay ku jirtaa dhinaca caadada. Qiyaastii lixdan sano oo dhaqan ah, marka hore federaal ahaan kadibna gobol-gobol, ayaa dhisay xeerka ah in siyaasiyiintu aanay sawirin riding-yadooda. Quebec, khariidadda guddi waxay dhaqan gashaa iyadoo aan loo baahnayn oggolaanshaha kama dambaysta ah ee Golaha Qaranka. Alberta, sida gobollada intooda badan, waxay u baahan tahay hindise sharci. Sharciga Alberta xeerka kama dhigo mid waajib ah. Sidaa darteed halkan xoogga xeerka oo dhammi wuxuu ahaa in dawladuhu sii doortaan inay raacaan. Caado mar dhinac la iska dhigay, kharash la'aan, way ka sii daciifaysaa dawlad kasta oo xigta. Xisbi kasta.`,p2:`Hadda ku noqo natiijada 14. Waxay hal mar ogaataa saddex arrimood. Waxa jira jebin la diiwaangeliyay oo dhaqan dheer ah, taas oo mucaaradku ugu yeedho xadgudub. Ma jirto caado maxkamad dhaqan gelin doonto. Maxkamadduna weli dib bay u eegi kartaa khariidadda habraacu soo saaro, marka ay sharci noqoto.`,limit:`<em>Waxa aanay kuu sheegi karin:</em> "maxkamad ma dhaqan gelin doonto" waa bayaan ku saabsan maxkamadaha, ma aha cawaaqibta. Caadooyinka waxa lagu dhaqan geliyaa doorashooyinka, dad garanaya waxa la sameeyay. Warbixinno kan oo kale ah waxay u jiraan si ay u ogaadaan.`,back_anchor:`<a href="__BASE__/evidence#casing-14">↩ Ku noqo natiijada 14 ee diiwaanka buuxa</a>`},footer_note:`Sharraxaaddan waxay u dhigmaan lifaaqyada <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/public/report_public.md" rel="noopener">warbixinta dadweyne ee buuxda</a>.`},methods:{head_title:`Sida Khariidadaha Loo Tijaabiyay · Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,head_description:`Imtixaan kasta iyo tiro kasta oo hubinta ku jirta, oo erayo fudud lagu sharxay: 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray, imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedka, afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda, suurtagalnimada, imtixaannadii fashilmay, iyo erayada boggan lagu isticmaalo.`,back:`← Ku noqo hubinta`,site_label:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,h1:`Sida Aan U Hubiyay Khariidadaha`,meta:`Imtixaan kasta iyo tiro kasta, erayo fudud · Tiro kasta dib ayaa looga socodsiin karaa kaydka dadweynaha`,standfirst:`Boggani wuxuu sharxaa imtixaan kasta oo ka dambeeya hubinta, erayo fudud. Fikradda ku hoos jirta dhammaantood waa fudud. Si aan u ogaado in khariidadi caadi tahay iyo in kale, waxaan barbar dhigaa 1,010,000 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray isagoon marna cod arkin. Kadib waxaan hubiyaa halka khariidadaha dhabta ahi ku dhacaan dhexdooda. Halkan qaaciidooyin kuma jiraan. Haddii aad akhrin karto saadaasha cimilada, waad akhrin kartaa tan.`,toc:{aria:`Waxa bogga ku jira`,what_if:`Khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray`,percentile:`Sida boqolley loo akhriyo`,structural:`Shanta imtixaan ee qaab-dhismeedka`,fairness:`Afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda`,odds:`Waxa fursaduhu ka dhigan yihiin`,died:`Imtixaannadii fashilmay`,break:`Isku dayga inaan natiijadayda laftayda burburiyo`,prereg:`Ballanqaadyo horay loo sameeyay`,reproduce:`Adigu socodsii`,ballots:`Warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada iyo dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta`,november:`Imtixaannada khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta`,words:`Erayada boggan lagu isticmaalo`},what_if:{heading:`1,010,000 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray`,p1:`Kombuyuutar ayaa sawiray <strong>1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah</strong>, mid kastaa 87 riding, tirada khariidadda 2019. Wuxuu ka dhisay isla 4,765-ta aag codbixineed ee khariidadaha dhabta ahi adeegsadaan. Khariidad kastaa waxay raacdaa labada xeer ee adag ee guddidu raacday. Riding kastaa wuxuu hayaa tiro dad ah oo ku dhow isla tirada: 25% gudahood celceliska, tallaabo sawir kastaana waxay higsataa 12.5%. Riding kastaana waa hal xabbo oo isku xidhan.`,p2:`Kombuyuutarku wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa hal tallaabo yar mar kasta. Wuxuu qaataa laba riding oo xudduud wadaaga oo isku daraa hal. Kadib aaggaas wuxuu u kala qaybiyaa laba riding oo sharci ah oo cusub, si bakhtiyaanasiib ah. Taas wuxuu ku celiyaa 1,010,000 jeer wuxuuna kaydiyaa khariidadda tallaabo kasta ka dib. Habka waxa la yidhaahdaa ReCom. Waa qalabka caadiga ah ee goobtan.`,p3:`Xaqiiqada muhiimka ah: <strong>kombuyuutarku marna ma arko cod.</strong> Ma oga halka codbixiyayaasha UCP ama NDP ku nool yihiin. Taasi waa macnaha keliya ee boggani khariidadahan ugu yeedho dhexdhexaad. Sidaa darteed haddii khariidad kombuyuutar sawiray weli hal dhinac u janjeerto, janjeerku wuxuu ka yimaadaa halka dadka Alberta ku nool yihiin iyo labada xeer. Haddii khariidad dhab ahi aad uga sii janjeerto ku dhowaad dhammaantood, juquraafiga iyo xeerarka keligood waxay noqdaan sharraxaad liidata.`,p4:`Afar arrimood oo ay tahay inaad ka ogaato khariidadahan:`,li1:`<strong>Tirooyinka bakhtiyaanasiibka ahi waxay ka yimaadeen il dadweyne.</strong> Doorasho kasta oo bakhtiyaanasiib ahi waxay ka bilaabataa abuur, tiro bilow ah. Abuurku wuxuu isku daraa qiime la daabacay oo ka yimid beacon dadweyne oo bakhtiyaanasiib ah (drand, oo ay maamusho League of Entropy, koox ay ku jirto Cloudflare) iyo calaamad go'an. Qiimaha beacon-ka (wareegga 5,500,000) wuxuu ahaa dadweyne Oktoobar 2025, sidaa darteed ma taariikhayn karo abuurka. Calaamadda waxaan koodhka ku go'aamiyay 27 Abriil 2026, ka hor intaan faylasha rasmiga ah ee khariidaddu imanin 6 Maajo. Diiwaanka taasi waa commit ku jira kaydka mashruuca, ma aha diiwaangelin OSF. Qof kastaa dib ayuu u xisaabin karaa abuurka.`,li2:`<strong>Afar socod oo kala gooni ah ayaa isku raacsan.</strong> Khariidaduhu waxay ka yimaadeen afar socod, mid kastaa leh bilow u gaar ah. Afartaba waxay ku degeen isla sawir. Khariidad kastaa waa oo keliya hal tallaabo yar oo ka mid ah tii ka horreysay, sidaa darteed khariidaduhu dhammaantood iskama madax-bannaana. Marka la isku daro waxay u dhigmaan qiyaastii 1,000 khariidadood oo madax-bannaan (qiyaas ahaan 900 ilaa 1,300, iyadoo ku xidhan cabbirka).`,li3:`<strong>Xusuus ku saabsan tirada kursiyada.</strong> Labada khariidadood ee guddidu mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay 89 riding. Khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray waxay leeyihiin 87, cabbirka khariidadda 2019, tii ugu dambaysay ee sharci noqotay. Khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waxay leedahay 91. Sidaa darteed boggani kursiyada wuxuu u bixiyaa <em>saamiyo</em>, taas oo u oggolaanaysa saddexda cabbir inay dhinac-dhinac u fadhiistaan. Is-waafaqu waa dhow yahay, ma aha sax. Barbardhiggan cabbirrada ka gudba waan calaamadeeyaa, waxaana ku hubiyaa khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray oo isku cabbir ah. Natiijooyinkaas isku cabbirka ahi waa ku-meel-gaadh.`,li4:`<strong>Khariidaduhu ma aha garsoore kaamil ah.</strong> Waxay raacaan labada xeer ee adag, laakiin ma aha xeer kasta oo jilicsan oo guddi dhab ahi miisaamto, sida bulshooyinka la isku hayo. Khariidadaha guddiyada dhabta ahi way ka nidaamsan yihiin inta badan khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Xadkan waan magacaabaa meel kasta oo tirooyinka khariidadahan ka muuqdaan.`},percentile:{heading:`Sida boqolley loo akhriyo`,p1:`Saf u dhig dhammaan 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray, laga bilaabo tan ugu yar ee xagga UCP u janjeerta ilaa tan ugu badan. Kadib khariidad dhab ah geli safka. <strong>Boqolleydeedu</strong> waa meesha ay safkaas kaga jirto. Boqolleyda 78aad macnaheedu waa inay uga sii janjeerto 78 ka mid ah 100 kasta oo khariidad kombuyuutar sawiray. Taasi waa caadi: waxyar ka sarreysa badhtamaha.`,p2:`Boqolleyda 99.99aad way ka duwan tahay. Macnaheedu waa in khariidaddu uga sii janjeerto dhammaan marka laga reebo qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 10,000 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray. Codka 50-50 u kala qaybi, khariidadda inta yar ee guddiduna waxay UCP siisaa kursiyo ka badan dhammaan marka laga reebo <strong>69 ka mid ah 1,010,000</strong>.`},structural:{heading:`Shanta imtixaan ee qaab-dhismeedka (codad looma baahna)`,p1:`Imtixaan kastaa uma baahna codad ama khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Waxaan sidoo kale cabbiray khadadka laftooda, shan imtixaan oo qaab-dhismeed. Mid kastaa si toos ah ayuu isu barbar dhigaa labada khariidadood ee guddida.`,li1:`<strong>1. Kala firdhinta dadka.</strong> Intee ayay riding-yadu ka maqan yihiin cabbirka ku habboon? Shaxaha guddida laftigeeda, riding-yada khariidadda inta badan celcelis ahaan waxay ka maqan yihiin 3,180 qof. Kuwa khariidadda inta yar waxay ka maqan yihiin 4,707, qiyaastii hal iyo badh jeer. Ka-maqnaansho weyni macnaheedu waa in codadku si ka sinnaan yar u tirsan yihiin. Tirinta tirakoobka 2021, si kastaba ha ahaatee, celceliska ka-maqnaanshaha saddexda khariidadood ku dhowaad waa isku mid.`,li2:`<strong>2. Cufnaanta Calgary.</strong> Waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary, riding-yada khariidadda inta yar waxay hayaan 11.5% dad ka badan celceliska gobolka. Kuwa khariidadda inta badan waxay hayaan 2.8% ka badan. (Akhris erey-ereyeed ah oo xeerka juquraafiga ah ee aagga la sheegay, tirooyinku waa 8.5% ilaa 8.9%, iyo 1.3% ilaa 1.6%.) Riding ka weyn, cod kastaa wuu ka miisaan yar yahay. Codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi oo lagu cufo riding-yo ka yar oo ka weyn waxa loo yaqaan <em>urursi</em>. Laakiin imtixaankayga urursiga halkan ma ogaado: codadka 2023 NDP waxay ku guulaysataa siddeed ka mid ah toddoba iyo tobanka riding ee aagga, farqi ka hooseeya celceliska gobolka.`,li3:`<strong>3. Kala-qaybinta Airdrie.</strong> Sharcigu wuxuu Airdrie ka dhigaa inay hayso ugu yaraan laba riding. Khariidadda inta badan waxay adeegsataa laba. Khariidadda inta yar waxay magaalada u jartaa afar qaybood (saddex haya ugu yaraan 2% dadkeeda), mid kastaa lagu xidhay dhul kale oo ka baxsan magaalada. Bulsho si khafiif ah loo kala jeexo waxa loo yaqaan <em>jeexitaan</em>. Kala-qaybintu way ka gudubtaa xariiqda imtixaankan. Kama gudubto imtixaankayga gooni ah ee jeexitaanka, kaas oo sahamin ah: Airdrie East waxay isku haysaa in ka badan kala badh magaalada, sagaal ka mid ah toban dadkeeda ahna waxay ku nool yihiin Airdrie.`,li4:`<strong>4. Calaamadaha guddoomiyaha.</strong> Warbixinteeda, inta badan ee guddida, guddoomiyuhu ku jiro, waxay xudduudo qaar u calaamadeysay kuwo juquraafi ahaan yaab leh. Afar ka mid ah calaamadaheeda ayaa ku dhaca khariidadda inta yar, hubintayda joomateriguna waxay xaqiijisay saddex. Midna kuma dhaco khariidadda inta badan.`,li5:`<strong>5. Raacidda khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka.</strong> Labada khariidadoodba waxay raacaan qiyaastii inta khariidadda 2019 raacdo, taas oo ah 75% (inta badan 80%, inta yar 72%). Sidaa darteed imtixaankani ma kala sooci karo khariidadaha. Wuu fashilmay, boggana wuu ku sii jiraa.`,p2:`Afar ka mid ah shantan imtixaan waxay khariidadda inta yar ku cabbiraan khariidadda inta badan, sidaa darteed khariidadda inta badani kuma dhici karto. Ka kale, kala-qaybinta Airdrie, waxa lagu cabbiraa ugu yaraanta sharciga ee laba, taas oo khariidadda inta badani buuxiso. Khariidadda inta yar waxay khariidadda inta badan kaga duwan tahay afar ka mid ah shanta. Ta shanaad, khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka, midna ma kala saarto.`},fairness:{heading:`Afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda (codad lagu daray)`,p1:`Hadda ku dar codadka, oo weydii sida khariidad kastaa codadka ugu beddesho kursiyo. Waxa jira afar cabbir oo caadi ah, mid kastaana waxa lagu hubiyaa 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray. Tiro kasta oo qaybtan ku jirta waxay adeegsataa warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada ee 2023. Waa tirintii imtixaannadan markii hore lagu dejiyay, iyo tan khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray lagu dhibceeyay.`,li1:`<strong>1. Imtixaanka 50-50.</strong> Codka riding kasta isla qadar u dhaqaaji ilaa gobolku si sax ah 50-50 ugu kala qaybsamo, kadibna tiri kursiyada xisbi kasta. Alberta, khariidad caadi ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray waxay UCP siisaa 44.8% kursiyada marka codku siman yahay, maxaa yeelay guulaha miyiga ee UCP way ka ballaadhan yihiin guulaha magaalada ee NDP. Khariidadda inta badan waxay UCP siisaa 46.1%: boqolleyda 78aad, caadi. Khariidadda 2019 waxay bixisaa 46.0%: boqolleyda 65aad (ama 78aad, sidii markii hore la diiwaangeliyay, haddii khariidad kasta oo la siman loo tiriyo inay ka hoosayso). Khariidadda inta yar waxay UCP siisaa <strong>51.7%</strong> (46 ka mid ah 89 kursi), inta badan kursiyada marka codku siman yahay. Oo keliya 69 ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray ayaa UCP siiya wax ka badan. Si loo garto cabbirka, hal socod abuur leh oo hab loo sheegay inuu <em>si ula kac ah</em> UCP ugu guuleeyo kursiyo inta ugu badan ee uu karo wuxuu gaadhay 52.9% (46 ka mid ah 87 kursi). Waxba ma muujinayaan inay taasi tahay inta ugu badan ee suurtagalka ah.`,li2:`<strong>2. Farqiga waxtarka.</strong> Cod kastaa ama wuxuu caawiyaa in kursi lagu guulaysto ama waa "khasaaray": waxa la siiyay qof guuldarraystay, ama waxa lagu tuulay guuleyste wixii ka dambeeya intii guushu u baahnayd. Cabbirkani wuxuu isu barbar dhigaa codadka khasaaray ee labada xisbi. Farqi togan wuxuu doorbidaa UCP. Khariidadda inta badan waxay dhalisaa +0.1%, ku dhowaad waxba. Khariidadda inta yar waxay dhalisaa +4.0%, boqolleyda 94.5aad. Taasi waa waxyar <em>ka hooseysa</em> xariiqda aan horay u dejiyay, boqolleyda 95aad (qiyaastii +4.1%). Waa cabbirka keliya ee aan calaamadeyn, waxaana u soo sheegaa mid aan gaadhin.`,li3:`<strong>3. Farqiga celceliska-dhexe.</strong> Is barbar dhig natiijada riding-ka celceliska ah ee xisbi iyo natiijada riding-kiisa dhexe. Marka labadu kala fogaadaan, codad ayaa meel lagu urursanayaa guulo aad u ballaadhan. Farqiga khariidadda inta yar wuxuu UCP uga doorbidaa 99.97% khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Farqiga khariidadda inta badan wuxuu u janjeeraa dhinaca kale, xagga NDP, oo ka fog 99% iyaga ka mid ah. Kaas aan caadiga ahayn sidoo kale waan soo sheegaa. Sharraxaad la tijaabiyay uma hayo.`,li4:`<strong>4. Declination.</strong> Kani wuxuu akhriyaa farqiyada guulaha: khariidaddu ma u dhaqantaa guulaha labada xisbi si isku mid ah, mise way qalloocataa barta 50%? Khariidadda inta yar waxay xagga UCP uga sii qalloocataa 98.8% khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray. Khariidadda inta badan waxay akhridaa caadi.`,p2:`Dhibcaha: saddex ka mid ah afarta ayaa calaamadeeya khariidadda inta yar, dhammaantood isla jihada. Ka afraad wuxuu ku dhacaa waxyar ka hooseeya xariiqda, isagoo tilmaamaya isla jihada. Khariidadda inta badan waa caadi saddex. Ka afraad, farqiga celceliska-dhexe, waa mid aan caadi ahayn oo xagga NDP u janjeera.`},odds:{heading:`Waxa suurtagalnimadu macnaheedu tahay, iyo sababta aan u labanlaabay`,p1:`Afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda ku dar hal dhibco. Intee jeer ayay khariidado codad la'aan lagu sawiray soo saari lahaayeen natiijo u xad-dhaaf ah sida tan khariidadda inta yar? Dhibcaha la daabacay, 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee kombuyuutarku sawiray midna ma sameeyo. Sidaa darteed jawaabtu waxay ka timaadaa moodel tirakoob. Waa <strong>qiyaas moodel, ma aha xad</strong>: ma aha tirin, mana aha xad la dammaanad qaaday. Iyadoo ku xidhan doorashooyin la difaaci karo oo moodelka ah, waxay u dhexaysaa qiyaastii <strong>1 ka mid ah 20,000</strong> iyo <strong>1 ka mid ah 570,000</strong>. Nooc kasta, khariidaddu aad bay cidhifka uga fog tahay. Moodelkii markii hore la daabacay ayaa bixiya xadka sare. Nooc tixgeliya nuqullada u dhow ee khariidadaha dhexdooda wuxuu bixiyaa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 449,000. Nooc darajo ku salaysan wuxuu bixiyaa 1 ka mid ah 238,000, kaasna toddoba khariidadood oo kombuyuutar sawiray ayaa gaadha khariidadda inta yar. In la tuuro mid ka mid ah laba cabbir oo ku dhowaad is-ku-celiya wuxuu bixiyaa 1 ka mid ah 97,000. Sampler labaad oo ka yar wuxuu bixiyaa 1 ka mid ah 20,000. Dhammaantood waxay adeegsadaan warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada; ma jiro nooc dhammaan warqadaha ah, maxaa yeelay dhibcaha dhammaan warqadaha ee khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ahi kuma jiraan kaydka. Tirada la daabacay waa labanlaabka qiyaasta ceeriin ee moodelka oo ah qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 1.1 milyan. Waa kan sababta.`,p2:`Calaamad waxaan ka raadiyay laba meelood: dhibcahan la isku daray, iyo imtixaan labaad oo ku saabsan doorashooyinka xudduudaha gaarka ah. In laba meelood la eego nasiibka waxay siisaa laba fursadood. Ka fikir tigidhada bakhtiyaanasiibka: laba iibso, fursaddaada inaad hayso mid guuleysta way labanlaabantaa. Sidaa darteed ka hor intaanan sheegin suurtagalnimada, waan labanlaabay anigoo iska soo horjeeda. Sidaas "laba isku day ayaad haysatay" horeba waa la bixiyay. Imtixaanka labaad goor dambe ayaa la hawlgab dhigay, sidaa darteed labanlaabka waxa loo hayaa oggolaansho taxaddar leh, ma aha saxitaan loogu talagalay koox imtixaanno ah oo la sheegay.`,p3:`Labanlaabku wuu adkaystaa haddii labada imtixaan xidhiidh leeyihiin iyo haddii kaleba. Meesha kama saaro malaynta moodelka laftiisa. Taasi waa sababta xad loo bixiyo.`,p4:`Hal digniin oo aan meel kasta ku celiyo: suurtagalnimadani waxay cabbirtaa inta ay <em>khariidaddu</em> caadi ka tahay. Ma aha suurtagalnimada ah in qof ula jeeday inuu janjeersiiyo. Khariidad dhif ahi weli, mabda' ahaan, waxay noqon kartaa shaqo daacad ah. Suurtagalnimadu waxay sheegtaa oo keliya tan: sawir codad la'aan ah ku dhowaad marna ma soo saaro khariidaddan.`},died:{heading:`Imtixaannadii fashilmay, iyo mid u jeestay dhinaca kale`,p1:`Qaar ka mid ah imtixaannadaydu waxay soo noqdeen madhan, midna wuxuu tilmaamay dhinaca kale. Dhammaantood boggan ayay ku sii jiraan, si ula kac ah. Hubin muujisa oo keliya guulaheeda waa xayaysiis.`,li1:`<strong>Imtixaanka xadka magaalooyinka</strong>, kan ugu dambeeya imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedka, waxba ma helin oo khariidadaha kala sooca. Labaduba waxay raacaan khadadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka qiyaastii inta khariidadda 2019 raacdo (75%).`,li2:`<strong>Imtixaanka doorashooyinka xudduudaha</strong> (Swing-Zone Allocation Test) wuxuu weydiiyay in aagagga codbixinta ee aagagga isbeddelka la geliyay riding-yo qaab xisbiyeed. Wuxuu u muuqday mid xoog leh (p = 0.0024; inta p yaraato, inta ay u yar tahay in qaabku nasiib yahay) ilaa aan ku saxay xaqiiq fudud: meelaha is-ag yaal isku si ayay u codeeyaan. Saxitaanka ka dib wuxuu bixiyay p ≈ 0.19, oo aan waxba muujin. Imtixaanka la saxay isna waa ceeriin, sidaa darteed labada nooc midna laguma kalsoonaan karo. Waxaan u hawlgab dhigay xaalad sahamin 13 Juun 2026.`},break:{heading:`Isku dayga inaan natiijadayda laftayda burburiyo`,p1:`Ka hor intaanan ku kalsoonaan natiijada ugu weyn, waxaan isku dayay inaan saddex hab ku burburiyo. Natiijooyinku way isku dhafnaayeen, saddexdaba waa la soo sheegay.`,li1:`<strong>Beddel matoorka.</strong> Afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda waxaan dib ugu socodsiiyay hab kale oo khariidado lagu sawiro: spanning-forest sampler, oo horay loogu diiwaangeliyay OSF (he53s) oo la socodsiiyay 10 Luulyo 2026. Boqolley kastaa waxay dhaqaaqday wax ka yar hal dhibic. Taasi waxay buuxisaa xeerka aan u dejiyay in natiijada loogu yeedho adag. Laakiin socodku aad buu uga gaabtay cabbirkiisii la qorsheeyay, farqigiisuna waa qiyaastii laba dhibcood. Sidaa darteed waxaan u akhriyaa mid aan go'aan lahayn cabbirkan socodka, ma aha natiijo adkaysi. Wuxuu muujiyaa in khariidaddu fog tahay, ma aha si sax ah inta ay le'eg tahay. Matoorkan, suurtagalnimada la isku daray waxay noqotaa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 20,000.`,li2:`<strong>Beddel barnaamijka.</strong> Barnaamij gooni ah, xidhmada redist ee luuqadda R, ayaa sawiray 5,000 khariidadood. Midna ma gaadhin qiimaha khariidadda inta yar. Socodkaas ka yar, khariidadda inta badan waxay joogtaa waxyar ka sarreysa boqolleyda 95aad; socodka ugu weyn waxay joogtaa 78aad.`,li3:`<strong>Tijaabi sababta.</strong> Waxaan rabay inaan tijaabiyo in qaababka aan caadiga ahayn ee imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedku heleen ay yihiin waxa keena faa'iidada kursiyada. Imtixaanku wuxuu u baahan yahay khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray oo gaadha tirada kursiyada khariidadda inta yar. Socodka 5,000-ka khariidadood midna ma laha, sidaa darteed imtixaanka lama socodsiin karin. Xadka hoose ee aan markii hore isticmaalay, oo keliya 3 khariidadood ayaa u qalma. Waxay waxyar ka cufnaan yar yihiin inta kale, laakiin 3 khariidadood aad bay u yar yihiin si ay wax u muujiyaan. Qaababka iyo janjeerka kursiyadu waxay tilmaamayaan isla khariidadda. In qaababku keenaan janjeerka lama tijaabin.`},prereg:{heading:`Ballanqaadyo horay loo sameeyay`,p1:`Difaaca ugu fiican ee ka dhanka ah inaad naftaada khiyaanayso waa inaad saadaashaada qorto ka hor intaadan eegin. Imtixaannadayda, xariiqyadooda iyo jihada aan filayay waxaan ku qoray diiwaanno waqti lagu calaamadeeyay. Markii saadaal horay loo dejiyay ay gaadhi weyday, way sii ahaatay mid aan gaadhin. Diiwaangelintii 6 Maajo waxay saadaalisay in khariidadda inta yar ay doorbidi doonto NDP oo ay dadka si ka yar u kala firdhin doonto. Waxay ku dhisnayd khalad ku saabsan cidda cid soo jeedisay, labada saadaalood midna ma gaadhin. Xeerarka go'aamiya natiijada khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta waxa la qoray Juun 2026 waxaana lagu taariikhaysay kaydka, ma aha OSF. Saddex imtixaan oo dhinac ah, iyo doorashada khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray ee la barbar dhigayo, waxa lagu daray 29 ilaa 31 Oktoobar, ka dib markii MLA-yada mucaaradku ay sharxeen qaybo khariidadda ka mid ah kulankii guddiga ee 28 Oktoobar. Toddoba wax-ka-beddel ayaa xigay 2 ilaa 7 Noofembar, ka dib markii warbixinta guddida talo-bixinta la soo bandhigay. Wax-ka-beddellada 7 ilaa 10 waxay yimaadeen ka hor intaan qayb kasta oo khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta la dhibcayn; 11 ilaa 13 waxay yimaadeen ka dib markii natiijooyin la arkay. Waxaan sidoo kale sheegaa natiijooyinka <em>horay loo dejiyay</em> (pre-registered) iyo kuwa <em>goor dambe lagu daray</em> (sahamin: abuurrada waa la xidhay, laakiin isku-darka saxda ah ee imtixaannada goor dambe ayaa la doortay). Suurtagalnimada cinwaanka goor dambe ayaa lagu daray.`},reproduce:{heading:`Adigu socodsii`,p1:`Tiro kasta oo falanqayntayda ku jirta waxay ka timaadaa qoraal ku jira kaydka dadweynaha, oo lagu socodsiiyay xog la dhiibay. Habka buuxa wuxuu ku jiraa <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/docs/REPRODUCING.md" rel="noopener">REPRODUCING.md</a>. Nooca gaaban:`,p2:`Nooc buug-qoraal ah ayaa ku socda browser-kaaga <a href="https://colab.research.google.com/github/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/notebooks/alberta_audit_explorer.ipynb" rel="noopener">Google Colab</a>. Habka buuxa, oo leh saxitaan kasta oo jidka lagu sameeyay, wuxuu ku jiraa <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">warbixinta akadeemiga</a>.`,cross_ref:`Bogag la xidhiidha: <a href="__BASE__/law">Waxa sharcigu sheegayo</a> · <a href="__BASE__/norms">Waxa caadooyinku weydiinayaan</a> · <a href="__BASE__/explainers">Sharraxaadda (Lifaaqyada A ilaa N)</a>, kuwaas oo natiijooyinku ku xidhan yihiin.`},ballots:{heading:`Warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada iyo dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta`,p1:`Laba tirin oo codkii 2023 ah ayaa boggan ka muuqda, tiro kastaana waxay sheegtaa tan ay adeegsato. <strong>Warqadaha codbixinta maalinta doorashada</strong> waa kuwa lagu dhiibay goob codbixineed maalinta doorashada: 932,164 ka mid ah, 896,644 UCP ama NDP. Elections Alberta waxay u soo sheegtaa aag codbixineed kasta, sidaa darteed waan ogahay halka laga dhiibay. <strong>Dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta</strong> waxay ku daraan codadka hore: kuwa horay loo dhiibto, kuwa guurguura iyo kuwa gaarka ah, iyo Vote Anywhere. Taasi waxay noqonaysaa 1,764,915 warqadood, 1,706,304 ka mid ah UCP ama NDP. Labada tirin waxay bixin karaan natiijooyin kala duwan. Khariidadda 2019, warqadaha maalinta doorashada oo keliya waxay doortaan 57 xubnood oo UCP ah iyo 30 NDP. Dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta waxay doortaan 49 iyo 38, taas oo ah natiijadii dhabta ahayd ee 2023. Tan iyo 7 Noofembar 2026, imtixaan kasta oo cod ku salaysan wuxuu adeegsadaa dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, natiijada maalinta doorashadana dhinaceeda ayaa lagu hayaa. Isbeddelkaas <strong>ma ahayn mid indha la'</strong>: waxaan sameeyay ka dib markii aan arkay natiijooyinka dhammaan warqadaha ee khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta iyo labada khariidadood ee guddida.`,p2:`Codadka hore waa qaybta adag. 1,706,304-ka warqadood ee UCP iyo NDP, 809,660, qiyaastii 47%, lama dhiibin maalinta doorashada. Elections Alberta waxay u soo sheegtaa oo keliya wadar riding kasta oo hore. Meesha xariiq cusubi dhex marto riding hore, waa inaan qiyaasaa dhinaca uu cod hore kastaa ka tirsan yahay. Xeerka aan diiwaangeliyay (Wax-ka-beddelka 12) wuxuu ku kala firdhiyaa aagagga codbixinta ee riding-ka hore si la jaan qaadaysa codadka maalinta doorashada ee aag kasta. Sidaa darteed tirinta kursiyada dhammaan warqadaha ee khariidad cusub waa qiyaas, waxayna ku xidhan tahay sida codadka hore loo dhigo. Hal xaqiiq ayaa adkaysata xeer kasta oo meelayn: gobolka oo dhan, codadka hore waxay 6.2 dhibcood uga sii janjeereen NDP warqadaha maalinta doorashada, NDP-na u sii janjeereen 83 ka mid ah 87 riding. Xeer cusub, xeerka P, wuxuu codadka hore dhigaa oo keliya dadka liiska ku jira ee aan codeynin maalinta doorashada dhexdooda, wuxuuna aag kasta u oggolaadaa inuu hayo janjeerkiisa maalinta doorashada. Wuxuu adeegsadaa xogta Alberta oo keliya. Dhammaan warqadaha codbixinta, UCP iyo NDP, wuxuu khariidadda inta yar ee guddida ka dhaqaajiyaa 55-34 una dhaqaajiyaa 57-32 (farqiga waxtarka +2.55% ilaa +5.64%), khariidadda guddida talo-bixintana, sidii aan dib u dhisay, 51-40 ilaa 50-41. Khariidadda inta badan ee guddidu waxay ahaanaysaa 48-41 (farqiga waxtarka −2.70% ilaa −2.83%), khariidadda faqradda 167 50-41, khariidadda 2019-na 49-38. Isbeddelka inta yar waa laba kursi oo Calgary ah, Calgary-Edgemont iyo Calgary-Glenmore, kuwaas oo UCP ku guulaysato farqi ah 401 iyo 68 cod oo la moodeelay. Ka guddida talo-bixintu waa Banff-Canmore-Diamond Valley, oo NDP ku guulaysato farqi ah 1,276 cod. Kursina ma dhaqaaqo xadka janjeerka codbixiyayaasha hore ee xogta Alberta oggolaato, laakiin xadkaasi wuxuu daboolaa oo keliya janjeerka, sidaa darteed wuxuu yareeyaa hubaal la'aanta dhabta ah. Weli boqolley marka loo eego khariidadaha kombuyuutarku sawiray looma xisaabin xeerka P. Xeerka P waxa loo qoray Wax-ka-beddelka 14 qabyada ah, oo aanan saxeexin. Waxa la doortay ka dib markii saamayntiisa khariidadaha la ogaaday, sidaa darteed waa sahamin, mana aha <strong>mid indha la'</strong>. Ilaa la saxeexo, tirinta dhammaan warqadaha ee boggan waa tirinta la diiwaangeliyay, iyadoo kuwa xeerka P dhinacooda la dhigayo meesha ay ku kala duwan yihiin, tirinta maalinta doorashadana labadaba dhinacooda.`},words:{heading:`Erayada boggan lagu isticmaalo`}},norms:{head_title:`Waxa Caadooyinku Weydiiyaan · Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,head_description:`Waxa caadadu ka rabto khariidadda doorashada Alberta ee 2026: xeerka ah in MLA-yadu aanay sawirin riding-yadooda, halka uu ka yimid, kiiska ugu fiican ee dhinac loo dhigo, iyo sida habraacu u dhibcaystay.`,back:`← Ku noqo hubinta`,site_label:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,h1:`Waxa Caadooyinku ka Weydiiyaan Khariidad Doorasho`,meta:`Hage luuqad fudud ah · Ma aha xukun lagu riday cid`,standfirst:`Saddex su'aalood ayaa hubintan dhex mara. <a href="__BASE__/law">Sharcigu</a> wuxuu weydiiyaa waxa la oggol yahay. <a href="__BASE__/methods">Tirooyinku</a> waxay weydiiyaan waxa aan caadiga ahayn. Boggani wuxuu weydiiyaa waxa caadada ah: waxa Kanadu ka filanaysay sida khariidad loo sameeyo. Su'aashaas saddexaad ayaa ah tan dadku ku dagaallamaan. "Dawladdu waxay jebisay caado lixdan sano jir ah" ma aha cabbir. Waa wadnaha eedda Mucaaradka. Sidaa darteed boggani oo keliya ma taxo caadooyinka. Wuu tijaabiyaa: halka ay ka yimaadeen, waxa loogu talagalay, kiiska ugu fiican ee dhinac loo dhigo, iyo waxa hadha marka hadalka dhinac kasta la nadiifiyo.`,the_norm:{heading:`Caadada, hal sadar`,p1:`Siyaasiyiintu ma sawiraan riding-yadooda. Taasi waa caadada: xeer aan qornayn, oo dhaqan lagu hayo, ma aha sharci. Kanadu waxay ku bixisay qiyaastii lixdan sano dhisiddeeda. Laga bilaabo dib-u-habaynta federaalka ee 1960-yadii, Ottawa iyo gobolladu shaqada waxay u wareejiyeen guddiyo xudduudeed oo ka shaqeeya meel ka fog siyaasiyiinta. Waxa jiray ka-reebisyo, oo ay ku jiraan Alberta 1992 iyo Quebec 2026. Qofka ku tartami doona riding ma haysto qalinka sawira.`,p2:`Caadadu waxay u jirtaa waxa ka horreeyay darteed. Xisbiyada xukunka hayaa mar waxay sawiri jireen riding-yadooda si caadi ah. Isku-dhaca danuhu waa cad yahay. Qof ay tahay inuu ku guulaysto khariidad hoosteeda sabab kasta ayuu u leeyahay inuu u sawiro si isaga u roon. Cid daawanaysana ma kala garan karto xariiq daacad ah iyo mid is-adeegid ah. Guddi khariidadaha kaamil kama dhigo. Wuxuu kala saaraa qofka sawira khadadka iyo qofka ka faa'iideysta. Taasi waa waxa u oggolaanaya qof kasta oo kale inuu ku kalsoonaado natiijada.`},what_it_bought:{heading:`Waxa caadadu keentay markan`,p1:`Guddidii shaqaysay 2025 iyo 2026 waxay muujinaysaa caadada markay ugu fiican tahay. Waxay dhegaysiyo ku qabatay lix iyo toban bulshadood. Waxay heshay 1,345 gudbin qoraal ah, tirinteeda laftigeeda. Waxay daabacday khariidad qabyo ah, maqashay dhaleeceeynta, oo beddeshay go'aankeeda. Ka dib gudbinno badan (warbixinta inta yar waxay tirisaa ugu yaraan 56), waxay ka tagtay qorshaheedii ahaa in la meesha ka saaro riding-ka Lesser Slave Lake. Taasi waa nidaamka oo u jawaabaya dadweynaha meel qof kastaa arki karo. Wax kasta oo kale oo guddidu khaldantay, habraaca ku wareegsani wuxuu u shaqeeyay sidii loo naqshadeeyay. Wuxuu ahaa dadweyne. Wuxuu ahaa diiwaan. Wuxuuna u jawaabay waxa dadka Alberta sheegeen.`},the_departure:{heading:`Jebinta: MLA-yadu waxay la wareegaan khariidadda`,p1:`Maarso 2026 guddidu waxay u kala qaybsantay 3 iyo 2 waxayna gudbisay laba khariidadood. 21 Abriil 2026, Goluhu labadaba dhinac ayuu iska dhigay. Mooshinka Dawladda 37 wuxuu shaqada u dhiibay guddi ka kooban lix MLA: afar UCP iyo laba NDP, oo uu guddoominayo MLA-ga UCP Brandon Lunty. Guddigu wuxuu magacaabay guddi talo-bixineed oo shan ah, oo uu guddoominayo garsoore hawlgab ah oo ka tirsanaa Maxkamadda Rafcaanka, si ay u sawirto khariidad 91-riding ah. Guddiga laguma qasbin inuu qabto dhegaysiyo dadweyne, midna ma qabanin. Guddida talo-bixintu waxay warbixinteeda keentay 22 Oktoobar. Qabyo lama daabicin si dadweynuhu uga hor yimaado. Xubnaha NDP waxay sheegeen in guddida talo-bixintu aanay qaadan gudbinno dadweyne.`,p2:`Maajo, Duane Bratt, Borofisar Cilmiga Siyaasadda ee Mount Royal University, ayaa tallaabada iigu sharxay, wada-xidhiidh gaar ah, mid aan taariikh hore ku lahayn Kanada. Markii dambe waxaan helay hal kiis oo hore, kii Alberta laftigeeda, 1992. Waxaan u qaataa kiis kale, kala-saarkaasina waa mid aan anigu leeyahay, ma aha isaga. 1992 guddidu kuma heshiin karin khariidad, MLA-yaduna mid ayay sawireen; <a href="__BASE__/law#ebca">bogga sharciga</a> ayaa sheekadaas si buuxda u sheega. 2026 inta badan ee guddidu waxay saxeexday warbixin, taas oo Sharcigu u arko warbixinta guddida. Haddana dhinac ayaa la iska dhigay. Waxa taasi <em>macnaheedu tahay</em> ayaa ah halka doodu ka bilaabanto.`},steel_man:{heading:`Kiiska ugu fiican ee caadada dhinac loogu dhigo`,p1:`Hubin oo keliya ku celisa cadhada hal dhinac waxba ma hubinayso. Sidaa darteed waa kan kiiska dawladda markuu ugu xoog badan yahay, sida ugu fiican ee aan u dhigi karo, ka hor intaanan tijaabin:`,li1:`<strong>Guddidu waxay ku fashilantay shaqadeeda keliya.</strong> Guddi waxa loogu talagalay inay bixiso hal jawaab, meel ka fog. Tani waxay bixisay laba khariidadood oo aan labadaba la isticmaali karin, inta badan ee ka mid ahina waxay si dadweyne ah inta yar ugu eedeysay niyad xun. Marka waddada madax-bannaani kala qaybsanto, qof ayaa go'aamiya. Sharcigu wuxuu sheegaa cidda.`,li2:`<strong>Sharcigu Golaha Sharci-dejinta ayuu qalinka siiyaa, ula kac.</strong> Sharciga Alberta hoostiisa, warbixinta guddi awood sharci ma laha. Riding-yadu waxay isbeddelaan oo keliya marka Goluhu ansixiyo <em>Electoral Divisions Act</em>. Mooshinka 37 wuxuu adeegsaday albaab sharcigu ula kac u dhisay. Waxba si qarsoodi ah looma soo gelin.`,li3:`<strong>MLA-yadu waxay u jawaabaan codbixiyayaasha; guddi-xubnuhu cidna uma jawaabaan.</strong> Doodda ugu da'da weyn ee ah in Golaha Sharci-dejinta loo daayo inuu maamulo khariidadda waa xisaabtanka. MLA sawira khariidad is-adeegid ah waa laga codayn karaa. Guddi-xubin lagama codayn karo.`,li4:`<strong>Guddigu ma aha xisbiyeed oo keliya.</strong> Laba ka mid ah lixda xubnood waa MLA-yo NDP ah. Guddi talo-bixineed ayaa sawiray khariidadda. Guddidaas talo-bixintu waxay lahayd laba xubnood oo Mucaaradku soo jeediyay, garsoore hawlgab ah oo ka tirsanaa Maxkamadda Rafcaanka ayaana guddoominayay. Iyaduna way kala qaybsantay: warbixinteedu waxay leedahay ra'yi inta yar ah.`,li5:`<strong>Dawladdu waxay soo xigatay talada guddoomiyaha laftiisa.</strong> Sababta ay sheegtay ee ay guddiga u siisay shaqo 91-kursi ah waxay ahayd Talada 5, oo uu qoray guddoomiyaha guddida laftiisu. Taladaasi waxay sheegtaa in isbeddelkeeda “loo baahan doono in ay daraaseeyaan Guddi Gaar ah oo xisbiyada oo dhan ka kooban ama Guddi Sharci-dejin oo u dhigma” (b. 66). Dawladduna Golaha Sharci-dejinta si sax ah ayay taas ugu sheegtay: “Waxaan qaadanaynaa talooyinka warbixinta” (Hoggaamiyaha Golaha ee Dawladda, Hansard, 16 Abriil 2026).`},where_it_bends:{heading:`Halka kiiskaasi ka jabo`,p1:`Qodob kasta oo kuwaas ka mid ahi waa dhab. Diiwaanku sidoo kale mid kasta wuu ka hor yimaadaa:`,li1:`Kala qaybsanaantu waxay sharxaysaa <em>beddelka</em> khariidadaha. Ma sharxayso <em>in dadweynaha laga xidho</em>. Talada 5 waxay soo jeedisay guddi xisbiyada oo dhan ka kooban si loo daraaseeyo hagaajin laba kursi ah. Mooshinka 37 wuxuu guddi noocaas ah u adeegsaday dib-u-sawir aad u ballaadhan. Xeer u baahan dhegaysiyo, qabyo la daabacay, ama guddi talo-bixineed oo khariidaddeedu kama dambays tahay ayaa sidoo kale xallin lahaa kala qaybsanaanta. Waddada la doortay waxay ka tanaasushaa ilaalin kasta oo furfuran oo ay daraasadaha dalalka is barbar dhiga u arkaan kuwo ilaalin ah. Kala qaybsanaantu midna ma qasbin khasaarahaas.`,li2:`"Sharcigu wuu oggol yahay" waa su'aal bogga sharciga, halkaasna waa looga jawaabay: Sharcigu ma dejiyo xeer ku saabsan waxa Goluhu sameeyo haddii aanu oggolaan warbixinta guddi. Su'aasha caadooyinku way ka duwan tahay. Quebec, khariidadda guddi waxay dhaqan gashaa iyadoo aan loo baahnayn oggolaanshaha kama dambaysta ah ee Golaha Qaranka. Alberta, sida gobollada intooda badan, waxay u baahan tahay hindise sharci, sidaa darteed xisbiga xukunka hayaa mar walba wuxuu maamulaa in khariidad guddi kasta sharci noqoto. Waxa sharciga ah iyo waxa caadada ahi waa su'aalo kala duwan.`,li3:`Doodda xisaabtanku wax badan bay caddaynaysaa. Waa dood ka dhan ah guddiyada xudduudaha meel kasta. Haddana Kanada, Boqortooyada Midowday iyo Australia waxay u dhaqaaqeen dhinaca kale, iyadoo ay jiraan ka-reebisyo dhif ah sida Alberta 1992 iyo Quebec 2026. Waxay sidaas u sameeyeen maxaa yeelay doorashooyinku waa ilaalin daciif ah oo ka dhan ah khariidad loo naqshadeeyay inay qaabeyso isla doorashooyinkaas.`,li4:`Guddida talo-bixinta ayaa qorta qabyada. Guddi ay dawladdu inta badan ku leedahay ayaa dib u eega qabyada oo sii gudbiya. Inta badan ee Golaha ayaa go'aamisa. Talo labada dhinac ka timid, iyadoo go'aanku gacanta dawladda ku jiro, waa wax ka duwan guddi madax-bannaan. Farqigaasi waa caadada laga hadlayo.`,li5:`Guddoomiyuhu wuxuu Talada 5 u qoray inuu Golaha Sharci-dejinta ku qanciyo inaanu qaadan khariidadda inta yar, asxaabtiisa inta badanna ma taageerin. Sidoo kale way cidhiidhi tahay. Waxay Airdrie, Calgary iyo wax kasta oo ka koonfureeya uga tagtaa sidii inta badani u sawirtay, marka laga reebo Drumheller-Stettler. Kuwaasi waa khadadka ay guddidu isku khilaaftay, waxbana oo ku jira waajibaadka guddiga kuma xidhin. In la soo xigto talo ka soo horjeedda ujeeddada qoraageeda sheegay waxay diiwaanka uga tagaysaa xiisad. Ma xalliso.`,li6:`Dawladdu waxay sidoo kale diiwaanka ku akhrisay bogga 58 ee warbixinta inta badan. Boggaasi wuxuu ka qoomamaynayaa xadka tirada kursiyada. Laakiin daawada uu soo jeediyaa waa in Golaha Sharci-dejintu u oggolaado <em>guddiyada mustaqbalka</em> inay dejiyaan tirada kursiyada. Mooshinka 37 wuxuu xorriyaddaas ku qaatay wareeggan, guddi MLA-yo ah, isagoo diidaya codsiga dhabta ah ee warbixinta: qaado khariidadda 89-kursi ah.`},whose_accusation:{heading:`Yaa leh eedda?`,p1:`Boggani wuxuu u jiraa inuu kala saaro xaqiiqda iyo garaadka. Kuwani waa xaqiiqooyin la diiwaangeliyay. Jebintu way dhacday. Ma helin kiis hore oo warbixinta inta badan ee guddi dhinac la iska dhigay; guddigii Alberta ee 1992 wuxuu xigay guddi aan inta badan lahayn. Ilaalinta furfurnaanta waa laga tanaasulay. Warbixin dadweyne oo sharcigu u baahan yahay, inta badan ee guddidu waxay hal xudduud oo inta yar ah ugu yeedhay "dadaal niyad xun". Taasi waa eedda inta badan, taas oo hubintayda laftigeedu daciifiso (natiijada 2 ee diiwaanka buuxa). Canadian Civil Liberties Association ayaa si dadweyne ah <a href="https://ccla.org/press-release/ccla-sounds-the-alarm-over-the-politicization-of-albertas-electoral-map/" rel="noopener">u kicisay walaaca ah in khariidadda la siyaasadaynayo</a>. Mucaaradku wuxuu u codeeyay ka soo horjeedka mooshinka. Eedahuna labada dhinac ayay u socdaan. Warbixinta inta yar waxay ku eedaysaa “janjeerka Inta Badan ee ah in la tirtiro ama la burburiyo qaybaha doorashada miyiga, oo dhab ahaan la yareeyo matalaadda waxtarka leh ee miyiga”. Matalaadda miyigu, erayada inta yar laftigeeda, “ma aha oo keliya su'aal tirooyin; waa su'aal gelitaan, cod, iyo maamul suurtagal ah” (b. 356). Eeddaas waxaan tijaabiyay maalintii aan helay. Imtixaanka goor dambe ayaa lagu daray, horay looma dejin, habkiisa iyo calaamadda riding kastaa waxa lala daabacay natiijada. Natiijadu waxay u socotaa dhinaca kale. Khariidadda inta yar waxay haysaa riding-yo ka yar oo xuddun u ah aagagga miyiga marka loo eego khariidadda inta badan: 23 marka loo eego 28, halka khariidadda 2019 ay leedahay 31. Waxay sidoo kale riding-yo badan oo miyiga khariidadda 2019 ah ku dartaa riding-yo loogu magac daray magaalooyin: toddoba marka loo eego saddex. Labada khariidadoodba waxay yareeyaan matalaadda miyiga marka loo eego 2019, sidaa darteed indha-indhaynta xudunta eeddu waa dhab. Laakiin cabbirka ay eeddu magacawdo, waxay ku dhacdaa qoraageeda. Eeddeeda la socotay isla maalintaas ayaa la tijaabiyay, wayna adkaysataa. Waxay sheegtaa in inta badani aanay isticmaalin boosaska Sharciga ee u oggolaanaya riding inuu ka hoosayn ama ka sarrayn karo celceliska dadka ilaa 25%, boos siin kara riding-yada miyiga dad ka yar. Inta badani riding-yadeeda miyiga waxay ku sawirtay meel u dhow celceliska. Inta yar waxay ku sawirtay dad ka yar. Hal eedeyn way rogantay, mid waa la taageeray, labaduba waa la daabacay. Cabashooyinka inta badan ee ku saabsan khariidadda inta yar waan ka dhimaa maxaa yeelay waxay ka yimaadaan hal dhinac oo guddi kala qaybsan. Isla dhimistaas ayaa halkan khusaysa, labada jihoba.`,p2:`Waxa xiga <em>ma aha</em> xaqiiq la diiwaangeliyay. Waa garaad siyaasadeed: in jebintu ahayd mid aan xaq ahayn. Garaadkaasi wuxuu ku xidhan yahay inta ixtiraam ee caadadu mudnayd marka guddidu kala qaybsantay, dad caqli leh ayaana si kala duwan u miisaama. Waxaan diiwaangeliyaa jebinta iyo waxa ay ku kacday. Ma qaato gunaanadka Mucaaradka, waxbana oo ka mid ah tirakoobka hubintu ma qaadi karaan. Tiro waxay sheegi kartaa in khariidadi dhif tahay. Ma sheegi karto in habraac khaldanaa.`},norms_vs_law:{heading:`Caadooyinku sharci ma aha, hal gobolna caadada ayuu sharci ka dhigay`,p1:`Maxkamad ma dhaqan gelin kartaa caadada? Ma aha inta ay caado tahay. Xeerarka aan qornayn ee dhaqanka siyaasadeed, oo qareenadu ugu yeedhaan caadooyin dastuuri ah, waxay xidhaan siyaasiyiinta, ma aha maxkamadaha. Maxkamadda Sare ayaa sidaas ku sheegtay Patriation Reference ee 1981, maxkamaduhuna xariiqdaas way hayeen tan iyo markaas: maxkamad waxay magacaabi kartaa caado haddana way diidi kartaa inay dhaqan geliso. Farqigaas, oo u dhexeeya waxa caadada ah iyo waxa maxkamadi amri karto, ayaa ah halka ay dhacdadan oo dhammi ku nooshahay.`,p2:`Quebec waxay muujinaysaa doorashada kale. Caadada waxay ku qortay sharci: guddideeda xudduuduhu waa joogto oo madax-bannaan. Markii dawladda Quebec ay ansixisay sharci lagu hakinayo guddideeda, maxkamaduhu <em>way</em> dhaqaaqeen, maxaa yeelay sharci ayaa markaas jiray. 22 Abriil 2026, Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay ansixisay, 7 iyo 2 oo go'aan kursiga laga bixiyay, natiijada ah in hakintu jebisay xuquuqda codbixinta ee qodobka 3 ee Charter-ka. Sababaheeda waxay xigeen 1 Maajo (<em>Quebec (AG) v. Lalande</em>, 2026 SCC 13). Meesha caadada sharci lagu qoray, maxkamad ayaa dhaqan gelin karta. Caadada Alberta marna sharci laguma qorin, sidaa darteed maxkamadi uma dhaqan gelin karto sidii caado. Maxkamad weli dib bay u eegi kartaa sharci xudduudeed marka mid la ansixiyo. Isbarbardhiggu labada dhinac ayuu wax ka goynayaa, si kastaba ha ahaatee. Xitaa Quebec, 12 Juun 2026, Golaha Qaranku wuxuu ansixiyay sharci dejinaya khariidaddiisa 127-kursi ah.`},measurable:{heading:`Kaarka dhibcaha habraaca: su'aasha caadooyinka oo imtixaan la geliyay`,p1:`Hadalka ku saabsan caadooyinku waa raqiis labada dhinacba. Jawaabtaydu waa kaar dhibco saddexaad. Imtixaannada iyo tirakoobka meelaha kale ee boggan waxay cabbiraan khariidadaha. Kaarkan dhibcuhu wuxuu cabbiraa <em>habraaca</em>, sagaal ilaalin oo uu dhaqanka lixdanka sano bixiyay. Mid kastaa waa su'aal haa-ama-maya ah oo dukumentiyada dadweynuhu ka jawaabi karaan, isla sagaalkaasina waxay dhibceeyaan habraac kasta oo hubintani baadho.`,table:{head:{feature:`Ilaalinta`,commission:`Habraaca guddida`,committee:`Habraaca guddiga (sidii loo dejiyay)`},arms_length_drafting:{feature:`Waxa lagu sawiray meel ka fog MLA-yada`,commission:`Haa`,committee:`Qayb ahaan: guddida talo-bixinta ayaa sawirta; guddi ay dawladdu inta badan ku leedahay ayaa dib u eega khariidadda oo sii gudbiya; Golaha ayaa go'aamiya`},public_hearings_before:{feature:`Dhegaysiyo dadweyne ka hor inta aan khariidadda la qaadan`,commission:`Haa: lix iyo toban bulshadood`,committee:`Maya: midna lagama qabanin khariidadda`},draft_published_challenge:{feature:`Qabyo la daabacay si dadweynuhu uga hor yimaado`,commission:`Haa: khariidad qabyo ah, oo si dadweyne ah dib loo eegay`,committee:`Maya: midna lama daabicin`},new_public_submissions:{feature:`Soo gudbinno dadweyne oo cusub oo la aqbalay`,commission:`Haa: 1,345 la helay, tirinta guddida`,committee:`Maya: midna lama qaadan; guddida talo-bixintu waxay heli kartay kaydka guddida`},demonstrated_responsiveness:{feature:`La muujiyay inay u jawaabto dadweynaha`,commission:`Haa: way beddeshay qorsheheeda ka dib gudbinno badan (ugu yaraan 56, tirinta warbixinta inta yar)`,committee:`Maya: naqshad ahaan waa laga saaray, dhegaysiyo, qabyo iyo gudbinno cusub la'aan`},neutral_chair_deciding:{feature:`Guddoomiye dhexdhexaad ah oo hay'adda go'aamisa ah`,commission:`Haa: garsoore, oo ay golaha wasiirradu magacaabeen`,committee:`Maya: MLA dawladeed ayaa guddoomiya guddiga dib u eega khariidadda, inta badan ee Golahana ayaa go'aamisa; garsooraha hawlgabka ahi wuxuu guddoomiyaa oo keliya guddida talo-bixinta`},opposition_deciding_body:{feature:`Mucaaradka oo ku jira hay'adda go'aamisa`,commission:`Haa: laba ka mid ah shan xubnood ayaa Mucaaradku soo jeediyay`,committee:`Haa: laba ka mid ah lix xubnood waa MLA-yo NDP ah`},published_reasons_contested:{feature:`Sababo la daabacay oo loo bixiyay doorashooyinka lagu murmay`,commission:`Haa: labada warbixinoodba`,committee:`Haa: warbixinta guddida talo-bixintu waxay sababo u bixisaa isbeddel kasta`},precedent_conformity:{feature:`Wuxuu raacaa tusaalaha hore`,commission:`Haa`,committee:`Maya: ma helin kiis hore oo warbixinta inta badan ee guddi dhinac la iska dhigay; guddigii Alberta ee 1992 wuxuu xigay guddi aan heshiin karin`},count:{feature:`Wadarta`,commission:`9 ka mid ah 9 (naqshad ahaan)`,committee:`2 Haa · 1 Qayb ahaan · 6 Maya`}},p2:`Hab kale oo kaarkan dhibcaha loo arko: wuxuu ku daraa cabbir saddexaad. Jaantuska hubintu khariidad kasta wuxuu dhigaa laba: sida khadadkeeda loo sawiray, iyo sida ay codadka ugu beddesho kursiyo. Saddexda khariidadood ee jaantuskaas illaa hadda ku jira (khariidadaha inta badan iyo inta yar ee guddida iyo khariidadda 2019) waxay ka yimaadeen habraacyo guddi, kuwaas oo halkan naqshad ahaan dhaliya sagaal ka mid ah sagaal. Sidaa darteed cabbirka saddexaad waxba kama haysan inuu kala saaro. Khariidadda guddida talo-bixintu waa tan ugu horreysa ee hubinta ee ay ka dambeeyaan dhibco habraac oo kala duwan.`,p3:`Shaxda si caddaalad ah u akhri, labada jihoba. Guddidu waxay dhalisaa sagaal ka mid ah sagaal <em>naqshad ahaan</em>. Ilaalintu waxay sharxaysaa hay'adda caadadu dhistay, guddiduna waxay ahayd hay'addaas. Qaybta wax sheegaysa waxay ku xidhnayd guddiga. Afar ka mid ah jawaabihiisa Maya waxay ahaayeen ilaalin uu ku dari karay ka hor intaanu warbixinta keenin: dhegaysiyo, qabyo la daabacay, gudbinno cusub, iyo jawaabta dadweynaha ee ay kuwaasi suurtagal ka dhigaan. Midna kuma darin. Dib-u-eegistiisa wuxuu joojiyay 28 Oktoobar mana qabanin kulan kale.`,draft_note:`Inta ay tani adag tahay. Ilaalinta kaarka dhibcaha, ilaha iyo jihooyinka la filayay waxa <a href="https://osf.io/u47bq/" rel="noopener">lagu diiwaangeliyay OSF (u47bq, 14 Luulyo 2026)</a>, goob dadweyne oo taariikhaysa oo barafaysa qorshe cilmi-baadhis. Taasi waxay ahayd bilo ka hor intaan guddigu warbixinta keenin. Waxaan qoray dhacdada badhkeeda, ka dib natiijooyinka aad hadda akhrisay. Taasi waa khatar eex, <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/preregistration/lane3_process_scorecard_draft.md" rel="noopener">dukumentiga la diiwaangeliyayna</a> si furan ayuu u sheegaa. Saxitaanno la saxeexay (Wax-ka-beddelka 5, Qaybta 25, 1 Noofembar, ka hor intaan khariidad guddi la arkin) ayaa hagaajiya qaar ka mid ah xaqiiqooyinkiisa, sida cabbirka guddiga. Ma beddelaan ilaalin iyo natiijo midna, qoraalka OSF-na isma beddelin. Marka gadaal loogu dabaqo guddida, kaarka dhibcuhu wuu sharxaa; ma saadaaliyo. Iyadoo khariidadda guddida talo-bixinta la soo bandhigay, imtixaannada khariidaddu waxay u socdaan sidii lagu qoray Juun oo wax looga beddelay Noofembar, kaarkan dhibcuhuna wuxuu qiimeeyaa habraaca soo saaray khariidadda. Sidaa darteed doodda caadooyinku waxay joojinaysaa inay noqoto qaylo ku saabsan dhaqanka. Waxay noqonaysaa isbarbardhig la dhibceeyay: guddigu ma u dhaqmay sidii hay'addii uu beddelay?`},audits_standing_rule:{heading:`Xeerka joogtada ah ee hubinta`,p1:`Isla xeerku wuxuu khuseeyaa meel kasta oo boggan ah. Hubintu waxay diiwaangelisaa waxa dhacay, inta uu dhif yahay, iyo cidda waxa sheegatay. In caadadu mudnayd inay ka badbaado kala qaybsanaanta, iyo waxa ay tahay in dhinac u dhigiddeedu ku kacdo sanduuqa codbixinta, haddii ay jiraan, waxa go'aamiya akhristayaasha iyo codbixiyayaasha. Ma aha hubin tirakoob.`,cross_ref:`Bogag la xidhiidha: <a href="__BASE__/law">Waxa sharcigu sheegayo</a> · <a href="__BASE__/methods">Sida aan u hubiyay</a>`,disclaimer:`Boggani waa hage luuqad fudud ah oo ku saabsan hubinta. Ma aha talo sharci, mana aha xukun lagu riday qof ama xisbi.`}},law:{head_title:`Waxa Sharcigu Weydiiyo · Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,head_description:`Waxa sharciga Kanadu ka rabo khariidad doorasho, sida hubintani u fahantay: xaqa Charter-ka ee matalaadda waxtarka leh, Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada ee Alberta, iyo halka caddaynta hubintu ku habboon tahay.`,back:`← Ku noqo hubinta`,site_label:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,h1:`Waxa Sharcigu Ka Sheegayo Khariidad Doorasho`,meta:`Hage luuqad fudud ah · Ma aha talo sharci`,standfirst:`Khariidad doorasho waxay gobolka u qaybisaa riding-yo. Riding kastaa wuxuu doortaa hal MLA. Hubintani waxay cabbirtaa khariidadaha. Maxkamaduhu way xukumaan. Kuwaasi waa laba shaqo oo kala duwan. Boggani wuxuu dejiyaa waxa sharciga Kanadu ka rabo khariidad, sida aan u fahmay, iyo halka caddayntaydu ku habboon tahay. Hubintu laftigeedu mowqif kama qaadato gunaanad sharci oo kasta. Waxay soo sheegtaa waxa xogtu muujiso, halkaasna way ku joogsataa.`,why_not_gerrymander:{heading:`Sababta hubintu aanay marna khariidad ugu yeedhin gerrymander`,p1:`Boggan, "gerrymandering" waxay leedahay macnaheeda maalinlaha ah: khadad loo sawiro si xisbi faa'iido loo siiyo. Sida aan sharciga Kanada u fahmay, ereygu ma laha qeexid sharci. Ma jiro sharci mamnuucaya "gerrymandering" magac ahaan, imtixaan maxkamadeedna ma adeegsado ereyga. Sidaa darteed maxkamad ma ogaan karto in khariidadi ku eedaysan tahay. Taasi waa hal sabab oo hubintu aanay marna khariidad ugu yeedhin gerrymander, wax kasta oo tirooyinku muujiyaan.`,p2:`Inta badan qalabka tirakoobka ee hubintu waxay ka yimaadeen dagaallada maxkamadaha Maraykanka. Mid waa farqiga waxtarka, oo isbarbar dhiga codadka xisbi kastaa khasaariyo. Mid kale waa koox weyn oo khariidado kombuyuutar sawiray ah oo khariidad dhab ah lagu barbar dhigo. Maraykanka, gerrymandering xisbiyeed ugu yaraan waa sheegasho sharci oo la magacaabay. Laakiin <em>Rucho v. Common Cause</em>, 588 U.S. 684 (2019), Maxkamadda Sare ee Maraykanku waxay maxkamadaha federaalka uga xidhay. Waxay go'aamisay in garsoorayaasha federaalku aanay haysan heer cad oo shaqayn kara oo lagu xukumo sheegashooyinkaas. Maxkamado gobol oo Maraykan ah qaar weli way adeegsadaan isla cabbirrada. Kiiska ugu caansan waa <em>League of Women Voters v. Commonwealth</em>, 178 A.3d 737 (Pa. 2018).`,p3:`Kanadu waddo kale ayay qaadatay. Halkii imtixaan gerrymandering ah, sharciga Kanadu wuxuu weydiiyaa laba su'aalood oo maxkamadi ka jawaabi karto. Khariidaddu ma siisaa codbixiyayaasha <a href="#effective-representation">matalaad waxtar leh</a> qodobka 3 ee <em>Charter-ka</em>? Guddiduna ma raacday <a href="#ebca">sharciga xukuma</a>? Natiijooyinkaygu waa caddayn maxkamadi ku miisaami karto labadaas su'aalood. Midkoodna kama jawaabaan. Tirakoobku sidoo kale ma akhrin karo maskaxda. Khadadku waxay muujin karaan waxa khariidaddu <em>sameyso</em>, marna waxa dadkii sawiray <em>ula jeedeen</em>.`},effective_representation:{heading:`Imtixaanka Charter-ka: matalaadda waxtarka leh`,p1:`Qodobka 3 ee <em>Charter of Rights and Freedoms</em> wuxuu muwaadin kasta siiyaa xaqa codbixinta. Kiiska ugu weyn ee khariidadaha waa <em>Reference re Provincial Electoral Boundaries (Saskatchewan)</em>, [1991] 2 SCR 158. Boggani wuxuu ugu yeedhaa <em>Saskatchewan Reference</em>. Kiiskaas, Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay go'aamisay in marka riding-yada la sawirayo, qodobka 3 uu ilaaliyo <strong>matalaadda waxtarka leh</strong>. Uma baahna in riding kastaa hayo si sax ah isla tirada dadka.`,p2:`Garsoore McLachlin ayaa u qoray inta badan Maxkamadda. Awoodda codbixinta ee qiyaas ahaan siman ayaa marka hore timaadda, ayay sharraxday. Laakiin waxay meel u bannayn kartaa waxyaabo kale: juquraafiga, taariikhda bulshada, danaha maxalliga ah ee la wadaago, iyo codka kooxaha laga tirada badan yahay. Maxkamaddu ma dejin xad go'an oo ah inta riding ka fogaan karo celceliska. Riding wuxuu noqon karaa mid ka weyn ama ka yar celceliska <em>haddii sababahaas kale ay caddeeyaan</em>.`,p3:`Sida aan u akhriyo sharciga kiisaska, laba arrimood ayaa ka dhasha. Labaduba waa sababo aan tirooyinkayga wax badan looga akhriyin:`,li1:`<strong>Janjeer xagga hal xisbi ah keligiis kuma filna inuu khariidad ka dhigo mid aan dastuuri ahayn.</strong> Kiisaska lagu eegay warbixinta akadeemiga ee hubinta, janjeer waa inuu la yimaado wax kale. Taasi waxay noqon kartaa farqiyo dadka riding-yada ah oo aanay juquraafiga ama bulshadu caddayn. Ama waxay noqon kartaa caddayn ah in sababahaas loo isticmaalay dabool faa'iido xisbi, ma aha ujeeddadooda dhabta ah. Taasi waa sababta hubintu sidoo kale u tijaabiso sida khadadka khariidad loo sawiro: inta cabbirrada riding-yadu kala duwan yihiin, sida magaalooyinka loo kala qaybiyo, iyo xudduudaha ay inta badan ee guddidu calaamadeysay.`,li2:`<strong>Maxkamaduhu waxay u hoggaansamaan dadka sawira khariidadda.</strong> Waxay golayaasha sharci-dejinta iyo guddiyada siiyaan boos badan. Maxkamaddu waxay weydiisaa in dad caqli leh, oo dabaqaya mabaadi'da saxda ah, ay sawiri kari lahaayeen khadadkan. Ma raadiso khariidadda ugu fiican ee suurtagalka ah. Kiiska ugu dhow ee xidhiidhada bulshada waa <em>Raîche v. Canada (Attorney General)</em>, 2004 FC 679. Halkaas Maxkamadda Federaalku <em>ma</em> helin jebin qodobka 3. Waxay ogaatay in guddida federaalku jebisay waajibka sharciga xudduudaha federaalka ee ah in la ixtiraamo bulshooyinka danta wadaaga. Waxay dhinac iska dhigtay go'aanka guddida ee riding-yada lagu murmay oo dib u dhigtay xukunkeeda sannad, Baarlamaankuna wuxuu sameeyay hagaajinta. Taasi waxay ahayd xukun maxkamad hoose oo ku saabsan sharci federaal ah. Maxkamad Alberta ah ayaa laga yaabaa inay u aragto mid qanciya, laakiin kuma qasbana inay raacdo.`,p4:`Halkee ayay hubintu ku habboon tahay? Khariidad kasta oo dhab ah waxaan barbar dhigay 1,010,000 khariidadood oo kombuyuutar ka sawiray isla aagagga codbixinta, isagoon marna cod arkin. Maxkamad ayaa miisaami karta barbardhiggaas marka ay weydiinayso matalaadda waxtarka leh. Sidoo kale cabbirradayda kale: sida dadku u kala duwan yihiin riding ilaa riding, iyo halka khadadku uga baxaan xadka magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka. Dhibco ama isku-dar dhibco midna ma go'aamiyo imtixaanka sharciga. Marka aan soo sheego in dhowr cabbir ay isla jihada tilmaamayaan, taasi waxay sharxaysaa qaab xogta ku jira. Ma aha gunaanad sharci.`},ebca:{heading:`Sharciga Alberta: Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada`,p1:`Guddiyada Alberta waxay ka shaqeeyaan <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>, RSA 2000, c. E-3. Boggani wuxuu ugu yeedhaa Sharciga. Sharcigu riding-ka wuxuu ugu yeedhaa qaybta doorashada.`,p2:`<strong>Xadka dadka.</strong> Xeer guud ahaan, dadka riding kastaa waa inay ku jiraan 25% gudahood celceliska gobolka, kor ama hoos. Labada khariidadood ee guddida ee 2026 waxay buuxiyaan xeerkaas. Marka laga reebo saddexda riding ee khariidad kastaa ku ilaaliso ka-reebista riding-yada fog, riding kastaa wuxuu ku jiraa xadka gudihiisa. Kan ugu sarreeya celceliska, khariidadda inta yar ee guddida, waa 24.06% ka badan: hal dhibic gudaheed xadka, laakiin ma dhaafsiisna. Xadkaas ballaadhan gudihiisa, guddidu waxay leedahay xorriyad badan. Natiijooyinkayga dadku waxay sharxaan doorashooyin lagu sameeyay <em>gudaha</em> xadka sharciga. Mid waa in cabbirrada riding-yada khariidadda inta yar ay 48% uga kala firidhsan yihiin khariidadda inta badan, shaxaha guddida laftigeeda. Mid kale waa cufnaanta waqooyi-bari iyo badhtamaha Calgary. Tirinta tirakoobka 2021, celceliska farqiga cabbirka ku habboon ku dhowaad waa isku mid saddexda khariidadoodba. In khariidadi sharci tahay iyo in ay caadi tahay waa su'aalo kala duwan.`,p3:`<strong>Ka-reebista riding-yada fog, qodobka 15(2).</strong> Ilaa afar riding ayaa yeelan kara ilaa 50% dad ka yar celceliska. Guddidu waa inay ra'yi ku noqotaa in ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah shantan imtixaan la buuxiyay:`,criterion1:`bed ka badan 20,000 km² (ama bed la sahamiyay oo ka badan 15,000 km²);`,criterion2:`in ka badan 150 km laga bilaabo Dhismaha Golaha Sharci-dejinta ilaa xudduudda riding-ka ugu dhow, waddada jidka weyn ee ugu tooska ah;`,criterion3:`magaalo riding-ka ku jirta oo aan lahayn in ka badan 8,000 qof;`,criterion4:`dhul-keyd Hindi ah (Indian reserve) ama degsiimo Métis ah oo riding-ka ku jira;`,criterion5:`qayb ka mid ah xudduudda riding-ku waxay ku teedsan tahay xadka Alberta.`,p4:`Ka-reebistu waa doorasho, ma aha waajib. Buuxinta imtixaannadu riding-ka waxay ka dhigtaa mid u qalma. Marna guddida kuma qasbo inay isticmaasho ka-reebista. Mid kasta oo ka mid ah khariidadaha guddida ee 2026 waxay u isticmaashaa saddex riding. Lixdaba waxaan ku hubiyay imtixaannada Sharciga waxaanan ogaaday in mid kastaa u qalmo. Sidaa darteed khilaafku kuma saabsana u-qalmidda. Wuxuu ku saabsan yahay sida hal riding loo sawiray. Riding-ka Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park ee inta yar wuxuu buuxiyaa hal imtixaan, kan xadka gobolka, oo keliya maxaa yeelay wuxuu dhex maraa dhul beer qaran ah oo aanay cidi ku noolayn. Warbixinta kama dambaysta ah ee guddida laftigeeda (23 Maarso 2026, b. 10) waxay diiwaangelisaa waxa guddi-xubnaha inta badani ka yidhaahdeen doorashadaas:`,quote:`"Waxay soo jeedinayaan in la sii hayo qayb doorasho oo 'Rocky Mountain House-Banff Park' ah iyagoo si macmal ah ugu fidinaya xadkeeda ilaa xadka galbeed ee gobolka ee British Columbia (iyagoo qaadanaya qayb ka mid ah Banff National Park, oo aan cidi ku noolayn), taasoo ah isku day niyad xun oo lagu xaqiijinayo in lagu ilaalin karo s. 15(2) ee Sharciga."`,p5:`Erayadaas, "niyad xun" oo ka mid ah, waxa iska leh saddexda guddi-xubnood ee inta badan, guddoomiyuhu ku jiro. Waxay ku qoreen warbixin rasmi ah oo Sharcigu u baahan yahay. Ma aha erayada hubinta. Hubintayda laftigeedu waxay ogaatay in riding-ku u qalmo ka-reebista xitaa dhulka beerta la'aanteed. Xigashada warbixintu waxay diiwaangelisaa waxa ay sheegto. Ma diiwaangeliso waxa guddi-xubin kastaa ula jeeday.`,p6:`<strong>Waxa warbixin guddi samayn karto iyo waxa aanay samayn karin.</strong> Sharciga hoostiisa, warbixinta guddi keligeed sharci ma aha. Khadadku waxay isbeddelaan oo keliya marka Golaha Sharci-dejintu ansixiyo hindise sharci oo gooni ah, Electoral Divisions Act. Quebec, khariidadda guddi waxay dhaqan gashaa iyadoo aan loo baahnayn oggolaanshaha kama dambaysta ah ee Golaha Qaranka. Alberta, sida gobollada intooda badan, waxay u baahan tahay hindise sharci, sidaa darteed xisbiga xukunka haya ayaa go'aamiya in khariidad guddi kasta sharci noqoto. Xeerarka Sharciga ee dhegaysiyada, waqtiyada kama dambaysta ah iyo xadka 25% waxa loo jeediyay guddida. Sida aan u akhriyo, waxba oo Sharciga ku jira ma xukumaan waxa Goluhu taa beddelkeeda sameeyo. Ma dejiyo ogeysiis ugu yar iyo muddo faallo dadweyne.`,cross_ref:`Falanqaynta sharci ee buuxda waxay ku jirtaa warbixinta akadeemiga, qaybaha 2 iyo 5.9, <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">kaydka hubinta</a>. Waxa ku jira dib-u-eegista sharciga kiisaska, qoraallada ku saabsan sida maxkamaduhu ugu hoggaansamaan guddiyada, iyo isbarbardhig ku saabsan sida gobollada kale u sameeyaan khariidadahooda.`},audits_standing_rule:{heading:`Xeerka joogtada ah ee hubinta`,p1:`Nooc kasta oo hubintan ah wuxuu raacaa isla xeerka. Waxay soo sheegi kartaa waxa imtixaannadu muujiyaan. Waxay sheegi kartaa inta khariidadi caadi ka tahay marka la barbar dhigo khariidado uu kombuyuutar sawiray iyadoo aan ujeeddo lahayn. Khariidadna uguma yeedho gerrymander. Ma male-awaasho ujeeddo ka soo qaadashada qaabka khadadka. Go'aanna kama gaadho in khariidadi buuxiso Dastuurka ama Sharciga. Su'aalahaasi waxa iska leh maxkamadaha, guddiyada iyo akhristayaasha, iyadoo caddaynta hubintu hortooda taal.`,cross_ref:`Bogag la socda: <a href="__BASE__/methods">Sida aan u hubiyay</a> wuxuu sharxaa imtixaan kasta iyo tiro kasta erayo fudud. <a href="__BASE__/norms">Waxa caadooyinku weydiinayaan</a> wuxuu daboolaa xeerarka aan qornayn ee sida khariidadaha loo sameeyo, iyo kiiska ugu xoogga badan ee ka dhanka ah akhriskayga.`,disclaimer:`Boggani waa hage luuqad fudud ah oo ku saabsan hubinta. Ma aha talo sharci. Waxba oo halkan ku jira ha ugu tiirsanaan ra'yi sharci ahaan.`}},privacy_policy:{head_title:`Siyaasadda Arrimaha Gaarka ah · Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,head_description:`Siyaasadda arrimaha gaarka ah iyo haynta xogta ee Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta.`,back:`← Ku noqo hubinta`,site_label:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,h1:`Siyaasadda Arrimaha Gaarka ah & Haynta Xogta`,meta:`Dhaqan gal: 2026-11-03 · Waxa haya Will Conner`,overview:{heading:`Guudmar`,p1:`Qalabkani waa hubin dan guud oo ku saabsan habraaca guddida xudduudaha doorashada Alberta ee 2025–26. Ma aha alaab ganacsi, mana socodsiiyo xayeysiis. Boggani wuxuu sharraxayaa waxa falanqayntu cabbirto, waxa aanay weligeed ururin, iyo sababta midkoodna aan dib loogugu xidhi karin adiga. Wuxuu kaloo sheegaa waxa foomka jawaab-celintu hayo.`,p2:`Nooca gaaban: goobtu waxay isticmaashaa falanqayn guud oo aan cookie lahayn. Ma jiro cookie raad-raac ah, xayeysiis ma jiro, sawir-qaadis goobo kala duwan ah ma jirto, mana jiro aqoonsi ku raaca. Maadaama falanqayntu aanay kaydin wax shakhsi ah, ma jiro calan oggolaansho oo aad gujiso — ilaalinta arrimaha gaarka ahi waxay ku dhisan tahay sida cabbirku u shaqeeyo, looma dhejin sidii codsi.`},how_analytics_work:{heading:`Sida falanqayntu u shaqeyso`,p1:`Marka bog soo dego ama aad la falgasho khariidadda, goobtu waxay u dirtaa dhacdo yar oo qarsoon adeeg tirin ah oo aan maamulno. Dhacdo kastaa waa magaca waxa dhacay oo keliya — tusaale ahaan, "bog la daawaday" ama "degmo la doortay" — iyo dhowr faahfaahin oo guud oo ku saabsan ficilka. Dhacdadu ma sido magac, iimayl, akoon, ama aqoonsi lagu kaydiyay qalabkaaga.`,p2:`Si loo tiriyo immisa qof oo kala duwan ayaa booqday maalin gaar ah iyadoon cidna la aqoonsan, adeegga tirintu wuxuu isku daraa cinwaanka shabakaddaada iyo nooca browser-kaaga wuxuuna mariyaa hash qarsoodi ah oo hal jiho ah oo lala socodsiiyo sir isbeddesha maalin kasta. Natiijadu waa koodh gaaban oo noo oggolaanaya inaan kala garanno laba booqasho <em>gudaha</em> hal maalin, waxna ka badan. Cinwaanka asalka ah weligii lama kaydiyo — hash-ka oo keliya ayaa la kaydiyaa. Maadaama sirtu ay maalin kasta wareegto, isla booqdahu wuxuu berri soo saaraa koodh kale, sidaa darteed qofna ma raadin karo booqde maalmo kala duwan. Marka sirta maalin cusub la sameeyo, tii hore waa la tirtiraa. Intaas ka dib, qofna kama shaqayn karo gadaal, isagoo ka bilaabaya koodh ilaa qof.`,p3:`Waxaan xiiseyneynaa sawirka ay booqdayaashu kooxda ahaan sawiraan — natiijooyinka la akhriyo, khariidadaha la furo, degmooyinka dareenka soo jiita. Kuma xiiseyno adiga gaar ahaan, cabbirkana waxa loo dhisay in "adiga gaar ahaan" aanay ahayn wax xogtu muujin karto.`},measured:{heading:`Waxa la cabbiro`,p1:`Falanqayntu waxay diiwaangelisaa dhacdooyin guud oo qarsoon, sida:`,li1:`Daawashada bogagga`,li2:`Inta ay dadku bog hoos ugu dhaadhacaan, xadad guud ah (25%, 50%, 75%, 100%)`,li3:`Qiyaas ahaan inta waqti ee boggu si firfircoon shaashadda ugu jiray, qaybo waqti oo guud ah`,li4:`Qaybaha natiijooyinka ee muuqda marka dadku akhrinayaan`,li5:`Khariidadaha laga furo baadhaha, iyo degmooyinka la doorto`,li6:`Lakabyada khariidadda ee la shido ama la damiyo, iyo qiyaas ahaan inta ay dadku soo dhoweeyaan`,li7:`Barahyada xiisaha leh ama xidhiidhiyeyaasha warbixinta ee la furo`,li8:`Sawir guud oo ku saabsan qalabkaaga — xadka cabbirka shaashadda (sida taleefan, tablet, ama kombuyuutar miis), qaabka qalabka, iyo qoyska browser-ka (sida Chrome, Safari, ama Firefox). Falanqayntu weligeed ma kaydiso cabbirka saxda ah ee shaashaddaada ama xadhigga aqoonsiga browser-ka oo dhammaystiran.`,li9:`Sawir hal mar ah oo ku saabsan sida baadhaha khariidaddu u shaqeeyay markii ugu horreysay ee uu sawiray — tusaale ahaan, waqtiga soo degidda oo xadad guud ah iyo tiro xusuuseed oo la soo koobay. Tani waxay naga caawisaa inaan ogaanno in baadhuhu ku dhakhso badan yahay qalab dhab ah. Tirooyinka si ula kac ah ayaa loo xadeeyay, ma aha kuwo sax ah, si ay u qeexaan nooc qalab halkii ay ka qeexi lahaayeen qalab gaar ah.`,p2:`Mid kasta oo kuwan ka mid ah waxa loo kaydiyaa dhacdo gooni ah oo aan sidin wax aqoonsi ah marka laga reebo koodhka maalintaas, waxaana lagu soo sheegaa oo keliya si guud. Ma jiro muuqaal qof kasta, ma jiro dib-u-ciyaarid fadhi, mana jiro wax isku xidha booqashooyinka hal maalin iyo kuwa maalinta xigta. Waxaan aragnaa wadarro iyo qaybin, ma aha dad.`},never_collected:{heading:`Waxa aanay falanqayntu weligeed ururin`,p1:`Falanqayntu ma ururiso magac, iimayl iyo akoon. Aqoonsi xayeysiis ma jiro. Cinwaan IP oo la kaydiyay ma jiro — cinwaanka shabakaddaada waxa lagu hash-gareeyaa sir maalin kasta wareegta waxaana isla markiiba la tuuraa; koodhka maalinlaha ah oo keliya ayaa la hayaa, maalin kastana wuu isbeddelaa. Faro-raad browser oo ceeriin ah ma jiro. Aqoonsi maalmo kala duwan ama goobo kala duwan ah ma jiro. Goob sax ah ma jirto. Ma jiro cookie ama aqoonsi kaydka browser-ka ah oo kuu calaamadeeya booqde soo noqday ujeeddooyin falanqayn.`},github_pages_collects:{heading:`Waxa GitHub Pages ururiyo`,p1:`Goobtan waxa lagu martigeliyaa GitHub Pages. Server-yada GitHub waxay si toos ah u diiwaangeliyaan faahfaahinta aasaasiga ah ee codsiga marka bog kasta soo dego — cinwaankaaga IP, nooca browser-ka, bogga kaa soo gudbiyay, iyo waqtiga. Ma helno mana xakamayno diiwaannadan; waxa maamula <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bayaanka Arrimaha Gaarka ah ee GitHub</a>. Xidhiidh kale lalama lihin GitHub martigelinta mooyaane. Falanqaynta kor lagu qeexay si gooni ah ayay u socotaa weligeedna ma kaydiso cinwaankaaga IP.`},share_codes:{heading:`Xidhiidhiyeyaasha wadaagga`,p1:`Baadhaha khariidaddu wuxuu leeyahay astaan Wadaag ah. Wuxuu muuqaalka khariidaddaada hadda — khariidadaha shidan, dahaarrada muuqda, qiyaas ahaan halka daaqaddaadu taal — ku qoraa cinwaanka shabakadda ee bogga, badhanka Koobi link-ga ahna cinwaankaas wuxuu dhigaa kaydka ku-meel-gaadhka ah (clipboard) si aad qof ugu dirto. Xidhiidhiyuhu wuxuu qeexaa qaabaynta khariidad, ma aha qof. Laba qof oo si madax-bannaan u gaadha isla muuqaalka waxay helayaan isla xidhiidhiyaha; taasi waa la filayaa, waxba oo ku jirana isma xidhaan iyaga.`,p2:`Maadaama muuqaalku ku jiro cinwaanka, wuxuu tagaa meel kasta oo cinwaannada shabakaddu tagaan: taariikhda browser-kaaga, iyo server-yada GitHub marka qof furo xidhiidhiyaha. Falanqayntu weligeed ma aragto. Waxay diiwaangelisaa oo keliya bogga la eegay, ma aha muuqaalka ku jira cinwaankiisa.`,p3:`Waxba lama kaydiyo marka aad wadaagto. Xidhiidhiyuhu laftiisa ayaa sida muuqaalka oo dhan, sidaa darteed xog-kayd looma baahna si uu u shaqeeyo, mana hayno diiwaan ah cidda wax wadaagtay iyo waxa ay wadaagtay. Koobiyaynta xidhiidhiye waxba uma dirto falanqaynta.`},cookies_browser_storage:{heading:`Cookie-yada iyo kaydka browser-ka`,p1:`Falanqayntu ma isticmaasho cookie iyo aqoonsi kaydka browser-ka midna. Waxba oo cabbirka ku saabsan kuuma calaamadeeyaan booqde soo noqday.`,p2:`Goobtu waxay dhigtaa hal cookie oo yar oo <strong>shaqo</strong> ah si ay u xusuusato doorbidyadaada booqashooyinka dhexdooda. Looma isticmaalo falanqayn ama raad-raac, weligiina kama baxo browser-kaaga qaab la akhriyi karo. Wuxuu kaydiyaa:`,li1:`<strong>Midabka muuqaalka</strong> — madow ama iftiin, haddii aad beddeshay`,li2:`<strong>Hordhaca la xidhay</strong> — si hordhaca khariidaddu aanu isu soo celin`,li3:`<strong>Muuqaalka khariidadda hadda</strong> — si muuqaalkaagii ugu dambeeyay laguugu soo celiyo haddii aad ku soo noqoto toban daqiiqo gudahood`,li4:`<strong>Luqadda browser-ka</strong> — si goobtu u muujin karto luqadda aad doorbidayso`,p3:`Cookie-gani wuxuu hayaa oo keliya doorbidyada kor ku xusan — ma laha macluumaad shakhsi ah ama aqoonsi. Waxa ku jira waxa lagu qasay fure ku jira bogga gudihiisa, sidaa darteed qiimaha la kaydiyay ma aha mid qof akhrin karo; maxaa yeelay furahaasi waa dadweyne, u qaado ilaalin ka dhan ah faragelin halkii uu ka ahaan lahaa qarsoodi dhab ah. Waxa loo diraa oo keliya HTTPS, marna lalama wadaago goobo kale, wuxuuna dhacaa hal sano ka dib markii ugu dambaysay ee la kaydiyay. Waad ka saari kartaa wakhti kasta adigoo nadiifinaya cookies-kaaga. Goobta waxa loo adeegaa sidii faylal taagan, sidaa darteed waxba dhinaca server-ka kama akhriyaan. Midabka mawduucaaga waxa sidoo kale lagu koobiyeeyaa kaydka maxalliga ah ee browser-kaaga si mawduuca saxda ah loogu dabaqo isla markiiba marka bogga la furo, ka hor inta aanu waxba libdhin; qiimahaasina waa mid shaqo oo keliya marnana meelna looma diro. Haddii aad doorato luuqad, kaydka maxalliga ahi doorashadaas isla sidaas ayuu u hayaa.`},data_retention:{heading:`Haynta xogta`,p1:`Diiwaannada falanqayntu waa qarsoon yihiin dhismahooda awgii: aqoonsiga keliya ee ku jira waa koodhka maalinlaha ah ee kor lagu sharraxay. Waxa lagu kaydiyaa kaabayaal lagu martigeliyay Kanada (ca-central-1) waxaana loo hayaa xog cilmi-baadhis. Haddii aan weligeen ogaanno in diiwaan ka kooban yahay macluumaad aqoonsi — taas oo naqshaddu u dhisan tahay inay ka hortagto — waan tirtiri lahayn 30 maalmood gudahood.`},your_choices:{heading:`Doorashooyinkaaga`,p1:`Maadaama falanqayntu aanay ururin wax shakhsi ah, ma jiraan wax aad ka baxdo mana jiro codsi oggolaansho oo aad maamusho. Haddii aad weli doorbidayso inaanad dirin wax dhacdooyin falanqayn ah gabi ahaanba, xannibe nuxur (content blocker) ama browser xannibaya codsiga loo diro adeegga tirinta ayaa joojin doona, goobtuna si isku mid ah ayay u shaqayn doontaa. Waxaad kaloo nadiifin kartaa cookie-ga doorbidyada shaqada waqti kasta adigoo adeegsanaya browser-kaaga.`},contact:{heading:`Xidhiidh`,p1:`Will Conner — cilmi-baadhis madax-bannaan, aan ku xidhnayn ama aanay taageerin hay'ad kasta.`,p2:`Foomka jawaab-celintu wuu ka gooni yahay falanqaynta. Marka aad fariin dirto, boggu wuxuu diraa fariintaada, magacaaga iyo iimaylkaaga oo keliya haddii aad bixiso, luuqadda aad ku akhrinaysay, cinwaanka bogga jawaab-celinta, iyo cinwaanka bogga aad ka timid haddii browser-kaagu sheego. Sida codsi kasta oo shabakad ah, browser-kaagu wuxuu sidoo kale diraa xadhigga aqoonsigiisa iyo cinwaanka shabakaddaada. Si loo xaddido dirista soo noqnoqota, adeeggu wuxuu hubiyaa hash cinwaanka shabakaddaada oo lagu sameeyay sir maalin walba isbeddesha. Fariimaha waxa lagu hayaa isla kaabayaasha Kanada ee diiwaannada falanqaynta. Su'aalaha, saxitaannada, iyo codsiyada tirtirka, oo ay ku jirto tirtirka fariin aad dirtay: fadlan isticmaal <a href="__BASE__/feedback">foomka jawaab-celinta</a>. Codsiyada waxa looga jawaabaa 10 maalmood oo shaqo gudahood.`},policy_updates:{heading:`Cusboonaysiinta siyaasadda`,p1:`Marka siyaasaddani isbeddesho, taariikhda dhaqan-galka ee sare waa la cusboonaysiiyaa isbeddelkana waxa lagu daraa (commit) <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">kaydka git ee dadweynaha</a>. Taariikhda commit-yadu waa diiwaanka isbeddellada. Isbeddel kasta oo ballaadhiya waxa la ururiyo waxa lagu xusaa fariinta commit-ka.`}},home:{references:{academic:{commission_2026:`<strong>Alberta Electoral Boundaries Commission. 2026.</strong> <em>2025–26 Electoral Boundaries Commission Final Report (Majority and Minority)</em>. Government of Alberta.`,chen_rodden_2013:`<strong>Chen, Jowei, and Jonathan Rodden. 2013.</strong> "Unintentional Gerrymandering: Political Geography and Electoral Bias in Legislatures." <em>Quarterly Journal of Political Science</em> 8(3): 239–269.`,courtney_2001:`<strong>Courtney, John C. 2001.</strong> <em>Commissioned Ridings: Designing Canada's Electoral Districts</em>. Montreal and Kingston: McGill-Queen's University Press.`,deford_duchin_solomon_2021:`<strong>DeFord, Daryl, Moon Duchin, and Justin Solomon. 2021.</strong> "Recombination: A Family of Markov Chains for Redistricting." <em>Harvard Data Science Review</em> 3(1). (Algorithm-ka ReCom ee loo isticmaalay soo saarista ensemble-ka 1,010,000 khariidadood.)`,gelman_king_1994:`<strong>Gelman, Andrew, and Gary King. 1994.</strong> "A Unified Method of Evaluating Electoral Systems and Redistricting Plans." <em>American Journal of Political Science</em> 38(2): 514–554.`,katz_king_rosenblatt_2020:`<strong>Katz, Jonathan N., Gary King, and Elizabeth Rosenblatt. 2020.</strong> "Theoretical Foundations and Empirical Evaluations of Partisan Fairness in District-Based Democracies." <em>American Political Science Review</em> 114(1): 164–178.`,pal_2015:`<strong>Pal, Michael. 2015.</strong> "The Fractured Right to Vote." <em>McGill Law Journal</em> 61(2): 231–274. (Qaab-dhismeedka dastuuriga ah ee Kanada ee xudduudaha doorashada.)`,stephanopoulos_mcghee_2015:`<strong>Stephanopoulos, Nicholas O., and Eric M. McGhee. 2015.</strong> "Partisan Gerrymandering and the Efficiency Gap." <em>University of Chicago Law Review</em> 82(2): 831–900. (Isha cabbirka farqiga waxtarka ee meel kasta lagu isticmaalay.)`},cases:{saskatchewan_reference:`<em>Reference re Provincial Electoral Boundaries (Saskatchewan)</em>, [1991] 2 SCR 158. (Tixraaca hormoodka ah ee Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada ee heerka dastuuriga ah ee sawirista xudduudaha doorashada.)`,raiche:`<em>Raîche v. Canada (Attorney General)</em>, 2004 FC 679. (Maxkamadda Federaalka, heerka dacwadda; kiiska ugu dhow ee dib loo eegay oo ku saabsan bulshada danta wadaagta ee khilaaf xudduud doorasho.)`,rucho:`<em>Rucho v. Common Cause</em>, 139 S. Ct. 2484 (2019). (Maxkamadda Sare ee Maraykanka; waxay dejisay in dacwadaha gerrymandering xisbiyeed aan lagu xukumi karin maxkamadaha federaalka — macnaha sababta heerka matalaadda waxtarka leh ee s.3 ee Kanada u kala duwan yahay.)`},statutes:{ebca:`<em>Electoral Boundaries Commission Act</em>, RSA 2000, c E-3.`}}}}};export{e as default};